t'=>'权重','Read on'=>'读取频率','Other sites confirm this autoloaded option belongs to an uninstalled extension — likely safe to disable.'=>'其他网站确认此自动加载选项属于已卸载的扩展 — 很可能可以安全禁用。','orphan · %s site' . "\0" . 'orphan · %s sites'=>'孤立 · %s 站点','WordPress core'=>'WordPress 核心','Transient'=>'瞬态','Orphan'=>'孤立项','No installed plugin or theme, the scan or other sites claim this option. It may be left over from something uninstalled, or belong to code WPOptimizing cannot see.'=>'没有已安装的插件或主题、扫描或其他站点认领此选项。它可能是已卸载内容的残留，或属于 WPOptimizing 看不到的代码。','Unattributed'=>'未归属','Likely orphan'=>'很可能孤立','Preview'=>'预览','File (relative to uploads)'=>'文件（相对于 uploads）','Suspected owner'=>'疑似归属','Kept'=>'保留','File to keep (lowest ID)'=>'保留的文件（最小 ID）','Duplicates'=>'重复项','Reclaimable'=>'可回收','edit'=>'编辑','%s copy' . "\0" . '%s copies'=>'%s 个副本','ID'=>'ID','No matching attachments.'=>'没有匹配的附件。','Edit attachment'=>'编辑附件','Image'=>'图片','Dimensions'=>'尺寸','What would help'=>'改进建议','Est. saving'=>'预计节省','View image'=>'查看图片','No images need attention.'=>'没有需要处理的图片。','Oversized'=>'尺寸过大','No WebP'=>'无 WebP','No AVIF'=>'无 AVIF','Large file'=>'大文件','Hook'=>'钩子','Schedule'=>'计划','Next run'=>'下次运行','Status'=>'状态','No scheduled events.'=>'没有计划任务。','Run now'=>'立即运行','Resume'=>'恢复','Pause'=>'暂停','One-time'=>'一次性','in %s'=>'%s后','%s ago'=>'%s 前','Paused'=>'已暂停','Orphaned'=>'孤立','Active'=>'已启用','Engine'=>'引擎','Rows'=>'行数','Overhead'=>'开销','No tables found.'=>'未找到表。','Manage in Orphans'=>'在“孤立项”中管理','Don\'t load'=>'不加载','Handle'=>'标识符','Owner'=>'拥有者','Protected — cannot be disabled'=>'受保护——无法停用','Not resolved on this site. %d site sharing its registry attributes this handle to this extension.' . "\0" . 'Not resolved on this site. %d sites sharing their registry attribute this handle to this extension.'=>'本站点未能解析。有 %d 个共享其清单的站点将此句柄归属于此扩展。','shared data'=>'共享数据','The sites sharing their registry attribute this handle to more than one extension, so its owner cannot be established. Check what uses it before unloading it.'=>'共享清单的站点将此句柄归属于不止一个扩展，因此无法确定其所有者。卸载前请先确认哪些内容在使用它。','conflicting'=>'存在冲突','Style'=>'样式','Script'=>'脚本','Match'=>'匹配','exact'=>'精确','contains'=>'包含','Remove'=>'移除','Empty records'=>'空记录','In use'=>'使用中','Inactive'=>'未启用','To identify'=>'待识别','read-only'=>'只读','No snapshots match these filters.'=>'没有符合这些筛选条件的快照。','No backups match the current filter.'=>'没有备份符合当前筛选。','Undo this action? What it changed is put back as it was before.'=>'撤销此操作吗？它所做的更改将恢复原样。','Undo'=>'撤销','Improve attribution for your site — and everyone’s'=>'改善你站点的归因——以及所有人的归因','Data sharing is off. Turn it on and WPOptimizing contributes only attribution metadata (names, sizes and how often things are seen — never values or content) to a shared dataset, and in return your site receives it, so plugins and options are identified far more accurately. It is reciprocal: while it is off, your site does not receive the shared dataset.'=>'数据共享已关闭。开启后，WPOptimizing 只会向共享数据集贡献归因元数据（名称、大小以及出现频率——绝不包含值或内容），作为回报你的站点也会收到该数据集，从而更准确地识别插件和选项。这是互惠的：关闭期间，你的站点不会收到共享数据集。','Turn on sharing'=>'开启共享','Not now'=>'暂不','Autoload turned off for %d non-essential option (reversible).' . "\0" . 'Autoload turned off for %d non-essential options (reversible).'=>'已关闭 %d 个非必要选项的自动加载（可恢复）。','Not enough usage measured yet. WPOptimizing is learning which autoloaded options are actually read on your site; check back in a day or two, or after more visits.'=>'目前测量到的使用情况还不够。WPOptimizing 正在了解你站点上哪些自动加载选项确实被读取；请过一两天或在更多访问之后再来查看。','Autoload turned off for %1$d never-read option (%2$s off every request, reversible).' . "\0" . 'Autoload turned off for %1$d never-read options (%2$s off every request, reversible).'=>'已对 %1$d 个从不读取的选项关闭自动加载（每次请求减少 %2$s，可撤销）。','Timeline retention updated.'=>'时间线保留期限已更新。','You do not have permission to change the WP-Cron setting.'=>'你没有权限修改 WP-Cron 设置。','wp-config.php could not be located, so WP-Cron was left unchanged.'=>'无法找到 wp-config.php，因此未更改 WP-Cron。','wp-config.php is not writable. Add the constant manually using the snippet shown below.'=>'wp-config.php 不可写。请使用下方显示的代码片段手动添加该常量。','wp-config.php has an unexpected format, so it was left untouched. Add the constant manually.'=>'wp-config.php 格式异常，因此未做改动。请手动添加该常量。','Could not save wp-config.php. Check file permissions and try again.'=>'无法保存 wp-config.php。请检查文件权限后重试。','WP-Cron disabled. Now add the system-cron line shown below so scheduled tasks keep running.'=>'已禁用 WP-Cron。现在请添加下方显示的系统 cron 行，以便计划任务继续运行。','WP-Cron re-enabled — WordPress will run scheduled tasks on page loads again.'=>'已重新启用 WP-Cron — WordPress 将再次在页面加载时运行计划任务。','WP-Cron was left unchanged.'=>'未更改 WP-Cron。','No reclaimable overhead was found — nothing to optimize.'=>'未找到可回收开销 — 没有需要优化的内容。','%d table optimized — overhead reclaimed.' . "\0" . '%d tables optimized — overhead reclaimed.'=>'%d 个表已优化 — 已回收开销。','Local Google Fonts removed — the site will use the original Google-hosted fonts again.'=>'已移除本地 Google Fonts — 站点将重新使用 Google 托管的字体。','Activity log cleared. Tracking continues from now.'=>'活动日志已清除。将从现在起继续跟踪。','Thank you! Data sharing is now on — your attribution metadata helps everyone, and your site now receives the shared dataset too.'=>'谢谢！数据共享已开启——你的归因元数据将帮助所有人，你的站点现在也会收到共享数据集。','nothing to download'=>'没有可下载的内容','all %d layers'=>'全部 %d 层','%1$d of %2$d layers. Did not arrive — %3$s'=>'%2$d 层中的 %1$d 层。未收到：%3$s','Data sharing is off, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'数据共享已关闭，因此未上传任何内容。','Download: %s.'=>'下载：%s。','database'=>'数据库','files'=>'文件','assets'=>'资源','autoload'=>'自动加载','paused after repeated failures'=>'多次失败后已暂停','daily limit reached, it goes out tomorrow'=>'已达每日上限，将于明天发送','Shared dataset synced. Upload — %1$s. Download: %2$s.'=>'共享数据集已同步。上传 — %1$s。下载：%2$s。','nothing to send'=>'无内容可发送','Cleanup profile applied.'=>'清理配置已应用。','Unknown cleanup profile.'=>'未知的清理配置。','Actions executed. Run a rescan to refresh the lists.'=>'操作已执行。请重新分析以刷新列表。','You do not have sufficient permissions.'=>'你没有足够的权限。','<strong>Large installation:</strong> Results are limited to %1$d rows to prevent memory exhaustion. Add <code>define( \'%2$s\', 100000 );</code> to wp-config.php to raise the limit.'=>'<strong>大型安装：</strong>为防止内存耗尽，结果限制为 %1$d 行。在 wp-config.php 中添加 <code>define( \'%2$s\', 100000 );</code> 以提高上限。','WPOptimizing sections'=>'WPOptimizing 分区','Menu'=>'菜单','Settings'=>'设置','Collapse or expand the menu'=>'折叠或展开菜单','Collapse menu'=>'收起菜单','Database'=>'数据库','Files'=>'文件','Entries confirmed as belonging to extensions that are no longer installed. Nothing on the site uses them; delete them unless you plan to reinstall that extension and keep its settings (a backup is made first).'=>'已确认属于不再安装的扩展的条目。网站上没有任何内容使用它们；除非你打算重新安装该扩展并保留其设置，否则请删除它们（会先创建备份）。','Nothing was left behind by uninstalled extensions. If you no longer use a plugin or theme, uninstall it from the Inactive tab and re-run the analysis.'=>'已卸载的扩展没有留下任何内容。如果你不再使用某个插件或主题，请在“未启用”标签中卸载它并重新运行分析。','Files and folders confirmed as belonging to extensions that are no longer installed. Nothing on the site uses them; delete them unless you plan to reinstall that extension and keep its data (a backup is made first).'=>'已确认属于不再安装的扩展的文件和文件夹。网站上没有任何内容使用它们；除非你打算重新安装该扩展并保留其数据，否则请删除它们（会先创建备份）。','Plugins & Themes'=>'插件和主题','This section lists options, tables, user roles, data types, and taxonomies that belong to installed but currently inactive plugins or themes. These items are not required for the site to run now, though they may be needed again if those extensions are reactivated.'=>'此部分列出属于已安装但当前未启用的插件或主题的选项、表、用户角色、数据类型和分类法。这些项目对网站当前运行不是必需的，但如果这些扩展重新启用，可能会再次需要。','You can select or deselect all rows from the header checkbox, or manually mark and unmark the ones you want to keep or remove. Once you have reviewed your selection, click <strong>Delete</strong> to apply the changes.'=>'你可以通过表头复选框选择或取消选择所有行，或手动标记和取消标记要保留或移除的行。检查完选择后，点击 <strong>删除</strong> 以应用更改。','Nothing here belongs to inactive extensions. If you stopped using a plugin or theme, uninstall it from the Plugins & Themes list so WPOptimizing can flag anything it leaves behind.'=>'这里没有属于未启用扩展的内容。如果你不再使用某个插件或主题，请在“插件与主题”列表中卸载它，以便 WPOptimizing 标记它遗留的内容。','This section lists files and folders that belong to installed but currently inactive plugins or themes. These items are not required for the site to run now, though they may be needed again if those extensions are reactivated.'=>'此部分列出属于已安装但当前未启用的插件或主题的文件和文件夹。这些项目对网站当前运行不是必需的，但如果这些扩展重新启用，可能会再次需要。','This section lists installed plugins and themes that are currently inactive. You can select them to uninstall directly and, if you want, check the option to also remove all associated disposable items.'=>'此部分列出当前未启用的已安装插件和主题。你可以选择它们直接卸载，并可勾选选项同时移除所有相关的可清理项目。','No inactive plugins or themes — everything installed is in use. Check Orphans for leftovers from extensions you have already removed.'=>'没有未启用的插件或主题——已安装的都在使用中。查看“孤立项”以发现你已删除扩展的残留。','Review orphans'=>'查看孤立项','Records currently associated with active plugins or themes. You cannot delete these, but if one is attributed to the wrong extension you can select it and reassign it to the correct owner below.'=>'当前与已启用插件或主题关联的记录。你无法删除它们，但如果某条记录归属的扩展有误，可以在下方选中并将其重新归属到正确的所有者。','This informational view lists database records attributed to your active extensions; it fills in after an analysis runs.'=>'此信息视图列出归属于你已启用扩展的数据库记录；分析运行后会填充。','This section lists files and folders currently associated with active plugins or themes. It is informational and does not allow deletion.'=>'此部分列出当前与已启用插件或主题相关的文件和文件夹。仅供参考，不允许删除。','This informational view lists files attributed to your active extensions; it fills in after an analysis runs.'=>'此信息视图列出归属于你已启用扩展的文件；分析运行后会填充。','This section lists active plugins and themes. You can select items to deactivate.'=>'此部分列出已启用的插件和主题。你可以选择要停用的项目。','Home'=>'首页','Where your site stands and what to do next. Nothing on this page changes your site: each suggestion opens the screen that does it, where you confirm it.'=>'你的站点现状以及下一步该做什么。此页面上的任何内容都不会更改你的站点：每条建议都会打开执行它的页面，由你在那里确认。','What the analysis found'=>'分析发现了什么','Records and files the last analysis attributed, by state. Open one to review it.'=>'上次分析归属的记录和文件，按状态分类。打开其中一项进行查看。','Orphans'=>'孤立项','Left behind by extensions that are no longer installed. Attributed with evidence: you can delete them (a backup is made first).'=>'由已不再安装的扩展留下。已有证据归属：你可以删除它们（会先创建备份）。','No owner could be identified. They may belong to something still in use: review them one by one before deleting anything.'=>'无法识别其所有者。它们可能属于仍在使用的内容：删除任何内容前请逐一检查。','They belong to plugins or themes that are installed but deactivated. Delete them only if you will not use those extensions again.'=>'它们属于已安装但已停用的插件或主题。只有在你不会再使用这些扩展时才删除它们。','Empty'=>'空记录','Records with no value stored. The Status column says whose they are; those of active extensions or WordPress are read-only.'=>'没有存储任何值的记录。“状态”列显示它们属于谁；属于已启用扩展或 WordPress 的记录为只读。','They belong to active extensions or WordPress. Read-only: fix a wrong owner or protect a record, but nothing is deleted here.'=>'它们属于已启用的扩展或 WordPress。只读：可以更正错误的所有者或保护记录，但这里不会删除任何内容。','Filter the results by state'=>'按状态筛选结果','Diagnose'=>'诊断','Performance'=>'性能','History'=>'历史记录','Speed'=>'速度','Cache'=>'缓存','Page & browser'=>'页面与浏览器','Smart Assets'=>'智能资源','Autoload'=>'自动加载','Clean up'=>'清理','General cleanup'=>'常规清理','Tables'=>'数据表','Cron jobs'=>'Cron 任务','Media'=>'媒体','Review the analysis'=>'查看分析结果','Analysis results'=>'分析结果','History & recovery'=>'历史与恢复','Activity'=>'活动','Backups'=>'备份','Help'=>'帮助','Documentation'=>'文档','No analysis has been completed yet.'=>'尚未完成任何分析。','Analyze now'=>'立即分析','Please wait while we analyse your ecosystem.'=>'正在分析您的生态系统，请稍候。','Great news! There is nothing to display in this section.'=>'好消息！此部分没有任何内容可显示。','%1$d in the database and %2$d files, left by uninstalled plugins, can be reviewed and cleaned.'=>'数据库中有 %1$d 项、文件中有 %2$d 个，由已卸载的插件遗留，可供审查和清理。','%d file left by an uninstalled plugin can be reviewed and cleaned.' . "\0" . '%d files left by uninstalled plugins can be reviewed and cleaned.'=>'已卸载插件遗留的 %d 个文件可供审查和清理。','%d record left by an uninstalled plugin can be reviewed and cleaned.' . "\0" . '%d records left by uninstalled plugins can be reviewed and cleaned.'=>'%d 条记录由已卸载的插件遗留，可审查并清除。','Orphaned records found'=>'发现孤立记录','Analysis is out of date'=>'分析已过期','Last analysed %s ago — re-run it to refresh the findings.'=>'上次分析在 %s前——重新运行以更新结果。','Autoloaded options are heavy'=>'自动加载的选项过大','%s of options load on every page request. Review what can be disabled.'=>'每次页面请求都会加载 %s 的选项。请检查哪些可以禁用。','Review autoload'=>'查看自动加载','Reclaimable media space'=>'可回收的媒体空间','About %s in duplicate or potentially-unused attachments.'=>'约 %s 的重复或可能未使用的附件。','Review media'=>'查看媒体','Orphaned scheduled tasks'=>'孤立的计划任务','%d scheduled event left by an uninstalled plugin.' . "\0" . '%d scheduled events left by uninstalled plugins.'=>'%d 个计划事件由已卸载的插件遗留。','Review cron jobs'=>'查看 Cron 任务','Excellent'=>'优秀','Good'=>'良好','Fair'=>'一般','Needs work'=>'需要改进','Reduce autoload weight'=>'降低自动加载体积','Remove orphaned items'=>'移除孤立项','Reclaim media space'=>'回收媒体空间','Delete expired transients'=>'删除过期的 Transients','Trim the options table'=>'精简选项表','Optimization health score: %d out of 100'=>'优化健康评分：%d/100','Optimization health'=>'优化健康度','Server TTFB (avg)'=>'服务器 TTFB（平均）','Your site is in great shape. Keep it that way with a periodic analysis.'=>'你的站点状态很好。通过定期分析保持下去。','Top ways to raise your score:'=>'提升评分的最佳方式：','Optimization health — open the dashboard for details'=>'优化健康度——打开仪表板查看详情','Needs attention'=>'需要关注','Warning:'=>'警告：','Heads up:'=>'提示：','More info'=>'更多信息','Unlock this with Pro'=>'用 Pro 解锁','The free plan analyses everything and shows up to 25 records in each list. WPOptimizing Pro lets you act on them — clean orphans, disable autoload, optimise media and more. Those deletions, like the general cleanup, are backed up first and restorable.'=>'免费版会分析全部内容，并在每个列表中最多显示 25 条记录。WPOptimizing Pro 让你据此执行操作：清理孤立项、关闭自动加载、优化媒体等等。这些删除和常规清理一样，会先创建备份且可恢复。','Upgrade to Pro'=>'升级到 Pro','Delete selected'=>'删除所选','Process all'=>'处理全部','A backup is created before deletion.'=>'删除前会创建备份。','Delete the %d selected item(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'删除所选的 %d 个项目？将先创建备份。','Process ALL %d filtered item(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'处理全部 %d 个已筛选项目？将先创建备份。','WPOptimizing — Working…'=>'WPOptimizing — 处理中…','Also delete the content of orphaned custom post types and the terms of orphaned taxonomies (backed up and restorable).'=>'同时删除孤立自定义文章类型的内容和孤立分类法的条目（已备份且可还原）。','“Process all” is capped at 20,000 items per run; repeat to continue.'=>'“处理全部”每次运行上限为 20,000 个项目；重复操作以继续。','Select at least one item first.'=>'请先至少选择一个项目。','This scan was bounded, so acting on everything is not offered. Tick the items you have checked yourself.'=>'本次分析有上限，因此不提供对全部执行的操作。请勾选你自己核对过的项目。','Select the items to delete'=>'选择要删除的项目','Processing %1$s of %2$s…'=>'正在处理 %2$s 中的 %1$s…','Done — %s processed. Reloading…'=>'完成 — 已处理 %s。正在重新加载…','A batch failed. Stopping and reporting what was done…'=>'某个批次失败。正在停止并汇总已完成的内容…','One or more selected items are attributed by heuristic or are unknown — they may belong to an active plugin. Continue?'=>'一个或多个所选项目通过启发式归因或属于未知 — 它们可能属于已启用的插件。是否继续？','%d of the items to process are attributed by heuristic or are unknown — they may belong to an active plugin. Review them, or filter by confidence first. Continue anyway?'=>'待处理的项目中有 %d 项是通过启发式归属或未知的——它们可能属于某个已启用的插件。请先检查，或先按可信度筛选。仍要继续吗？','Optimizing tables'=>'正在优化数据表','Converting tables to InnoDB'=>'正在将数据表转换为 InnoDB','Deleting attachments'=>'正在删除附件','Marking as known'=>'正在标记为已知','Deleting duplicates'=>'正在删除重复项','Removing scheduled events'=>'正在移除计划事件','Updating options'=>'正在更新选项','Deleting records'=>'正在删除记录','Deleting files'=>'正在删除文件','Search'=>'搜索','When uninstalling, also remove any unnecessary files or data associated with the selected plugins or themes.'=>'卸载时，也删除与所选插件或主题相关的所有不必要文件或数据。','Deleted records are removed from the scan immediately. Low-confidence selections are confirmed first.'=>'已删除的记录会立即从扫描中移除。低置信度的选择会先要求确认。','A copy is saved to the Backups tab before deletion.'=>'删除前会将副本保存到“备份”选项卡。','Attribute selected'=>'归属所选','Protect selected'=>'保护所选','Unprotect selected'=>'取消保护所选','Select records to reassign a wrong attribution, or to protect them from future cleanups. Active records are never deleted here.'=>'选择记录以重新归属错误的归属，或保护它们免受未来清理。活动记录绝不会在此处被删除。','Delete'=>'删除','Select at least one plugin or theme first.'=>'请先至少选择一个插件或主题。','These plugins and themes will be uninstalled: their files are deleted from the server. This cannot be undone from WPOptimizing.'=>'这些插件和主题将被卸载：其文件会从服务器删除。此操作无法在 WPOptimizing 中撤销。','Their data and files found by the analysis will also be deleted (a copy is saved to Backups).'=>'分析找到的它们的数据和文件也将被删除（会在“备份”中保存一份副本）。','These plugins and themes will be deactivated. You can activate them again from the Plugins screen.'=>'这些插件和主题将被停用。你可以在“插件”页面重新启用它们。','One or more selected items are attributed by heuristic or are unknown — they may belong to an active plugin. Are you sure you want to delete them?'=>'一个或多个所选项目通过启发式归因或属于未知 — 它们可能属于已启用的插件。确定要删除吗？','Confidence:'=>'置信度：','View its content in the database'=>'在数据库中查看其内容','Full content'=>'完整内容','Query failed.'=>'查询失败。','No rows found.'=>'未找到行。','Click to view the full content'=>'点击查看完整内容','Showing first 50 rows.'=>'显示前 50 行。','Request failed.'=>'请求失败。','Test mode: apply only for logged-in administrators'=>'测试模式：仅对已登录的管理员生效','While test mode is on, only you (a logged-in user who can manage WPOptimizing) get the change; visitors get the page as before. Check your key pages, then switch test mode off to apply it to everyone.'=>'测试模式开启期间，只有你（可管理 WPOptimizing 的已登录用户）会看到更改；访客看到的页面保持不变。检查关键页面后，关闭测试模式即可对所有人生效。','Unsaved changes'=>'有未保存的更改','No related inactive extensions.'=>'没有相关的未启用扩展。','Uninstall selected'=>'卸载所选','No related active extensions.'=>'没有相关的已启用扩展。','Deactivate selected'=>'停用所选','%d attachment marked as known; it will no longer appear as unused.' . "\0" . '%d attachments marked as known; they will no longer appear as unused.'=>'已将 %d 个附件标记为已知；它将不再显示为未使用。','%d orphaned scheduled event unscheduled.' . "\0" . '%d orphaned scheduled events unscheduled.'=>'已取消 %d 个孤立计划事件的计划。','%d table optimized.' . "\0" . '%d tables optimized.'=>'已优化 %d 个表。','%d table converted to InnoDB.' . "\0" . '%d tables converted to InnoDB.'=>'已将 %d 个表转换为 InnoDB。','Images optimized: %1$d recompressed/resized, %2$d WebP and %3$d AVIF copies created.'=>'图片已优化：%1$d 张重新压缩/调整尺寸，创建了 %2$d 个 WebP 和 %3$d 个 AVIF 副本。','The action stopped before changing anything. Please try again.'=>'操作在做出任何更改之前就已停止。请重试。','The action stopped part-way because a batch failed. Part of it may have been applied: check the list, and run it again for the rest.'=>'由于某个批次失败，操作中途停止。部分内容可能已应用：请检查列表，并再次运行以处理其余部分。','Autoload turned off for %s option.' . "\0" . 'Autoload turned off for %s options.'=>'已为 %s 个选项关闭自动加载。','%s record deleted.' . "\0" . '%s records deleted.'=>'已删除 %s 条记录。','%s could not be removed and stays in the list.' . "\0" . '%s could not be removed and stay in the list.'=>'%s 项无法移除，仍保留在列表中。','%s item processed.' . "\0" . '%s items processed.'=>'已处理 %s 项。','The action stopped part-way because a batch failed.'=>'由于某个批次失败，操作中途停止。','The rest was not touched; you can run it again.'=>'其余部分未受影响；你可以再次运行。','You can undo it below, or from the Autoload tab at any time.'=>'你可以在下方撤销，或随时在 Autoload 选项卡中撤销。','A backup was made first: you can undo it below, or from Backups at any time.'=>'操作前已创建备份：你可以在下方撤销，或随时在“备份”中撤销。','That action can no longer be undone from here. Its backup, if any, is still in Backups.'=>'此操作已无法在这里撤销。它的备份（如有）仍在“备份”中。','Undone: autoload turned back on for %s option.' . "\0" . 'Undone: autoload turned back on for %s options.'=>'已撤销：已为 %s 个选项重新开启自动加载。','Undone: what that action deleted was restored from its backup. Run a new analysis to refresh the lists.'=>'已撤销：该操作删除的内容已从其备份中恢复。请运行新的分析以刷新列表。','More help'=>'更多帮助','Support'=>'支持','Read the full article in the knowledge base'=>'在知识库中阅读完整文章','Analysis'=>'分析','The analysis reads your plugins, themes, database and files and works out who owns each record and file. It runs in the background in stages, so the window can be closed, and it changes nothing on the site.'=>'分析会读取你的插件、主题、数据库和文件，并判断每条记录和每个文件的归属。它在后台分阶段运行，因此可以关闭窗口，而且不会更改站点上的任何内容。','starts a new analysis straight away, whatever the low-traffic window says; at most five per hour.'=>'立即开始新的分析，不受低流量时段限制；每小时最多五次。','View report'=>'查看报告','opens a printable summary of the last analysis in a new window.'=>'在新窗口中打开上次分析的可打印摘要。','Below the buttons, the date of the last analysis. If the database cut some of its queries short, a notice says so and the database lists keep the results of the previous analysis.'=>'按钮下方显示上次分析的日期。如果数据库中断了部分查询，会有提示说明，数据库列表将保留上一次分析的结果。','Where your site stands and what to do next. Nothing on this page changes your site: each suggestion opens the screen that does it.'=>'你的站点现状以及下一步该做什么。此页面上的任何内容都不会更改你的站点：每条建议都会打开执行该操作的界面。','Site status'=>'网站状态','three cards: the weight of the autoloaded options (healthy under 800 KB), the orphaned data the analysis found and the state of the object cache.'=>'三张卡片：自动加载选项的大小（低于 800 KB 为健康）、分析发现的孤立数据，以及对象缓存的状态。','a score out of 100 with the server response time and up to three ways to raise it.'=>'满分 100 的评分，附带服务器响应时间和最多三种提升方法。','orphaned records, an analysis older than 14 days, heavy autoload, reclaimable media space and orphaned scheduled tasks, each with a link to the screen that fixes it.'=>'孤立记录、超过 14 天的分析、过重的自动加载、可回收的媒体空间以及孤立的计划任务，每项都附有前往修复界面的链接。','the records and files of the last analysis by state, with a link to each list.'=>'按状态列出上次分析的记录和文件，并附有前往每个列表的链接。','Measures how long WordPress takes to start sending the page (the server share of TTFB) and lists what can make it faster.'=>'测量 WordPress 开始发送页面所需的时间（TTFB 中服务器所占的部分），并列出可以加快速度的措施。','Summary'=>'概览','the measured response time, its trend and the verdict.'=>'测得的响应时间、其趋势以及结论。','PageSpeed Insights'=>'PageSpeed Insights','tests a page of your site, on mobile or desktop, with the public API of Google. It sends the address of that page to Google and changes nothing on your site. With your own API key you can also load the history of real visitors (Chrome UX Report).'=>'使用 Google 的公共 API 在移动端或桌面端测试你站点的某个页面。它会将该页面的地址发送给 Google，不会更改你站点上的任何内容。使用你自己的 API 密钥，还可以加载真实访客的历史数据（Chrome UX Report）。','Server'=>'服务器','the levers the plugin can apply with one click (object cache, query deduplication, autoload, Heartbeat), the ones that need server access as guidance (system cron, PHP and OPcache) and a read-only check of the database and Redis.'=>'插件可一键应用的措施（对象缓存、查询去重、自动加载、Heartbeat），需要服务器权限、以指导形式给出的措施（系统 cron、PHP 和 OPcache），以及对数据库和 Redis 的只读检查。','Deep analysis (optional)'=>'深度分析（可选）','profiles the next few front-end requests and switches itself off. The report shows the slowest hooks and queries; "Apply index" creates a database index after asking, and "Undo" drops it.'=>'对接下来的几次前台请求进行性能分析，然后自动关闭。报告会显示最慢的钩子和查询；“应用索引”会在确认后创建数据库索引，“撤销”则删除该索引。','Where you started versus where you are now. A snapshot is taken automatically before and after every analysis and after every cleanup.'=>'你的起点与现状的对比。每次分析前后以及每次清理后都会自动拍摄快照。','Set baseline to now'=>'将基线设为当前','takes a new starting point to compare with. Earlier snapshots are kept.'=>'拍摄新的起点以供对比。之前的快照会保留。','Export CSV'=>'导出 CSV','downloads every snapshot, to open it in a spreadsheet.'=>'下载所有快照，以便在电子表格中打开。','Keep timeline data:'=>'保留时间线数据：','three months by default. Choosing a shorter period deletes the older snapshots at once; the baseline and the first snapshot are always kept.'=>'默认三个月。选择更短的期限会立即删除较旧的快照；基线和第一个快照始终保留。','Object and page cache'=>'对象缓存和页面缓存','Every cache is off until you turn it on, and turning it off puts back what was there. A drop-in that belongs to another plugin is never overwritten unless you choose to replace it, and the original is kept to give it back.'=>'所有缓存在你开启之前都处于关闭状态，关闭后会恢复原有内容。属于其他插件的 drop-in 永远不会被覆盖，除非你选择替换它，并且原文件会保留以便恢复。','keeps the results of database queries in Redis, Memcached, APCu or a SQLite file. Enabling it writes wp-content/object-cache.php.'=>'将数据库查询结果保存在 Redis、Memcached、APCu 或 SQLite 文件中。启用后会写入 wp-content/object-cache.php。','Page cache'=>'页面缓存','serves a static copy of each page to anonymous visitors for up to 10 hours, and clears what changes. Logged-in users, carts, checkout and the admin are never cached. Enabling it writes wp-content/advanced-cache.php and adds WP_CACHE to wp-config.php. It is not available on a multisite network, and it stays off while another page cache is active.'=>'向匿名访客提供每个页面的静态副本，最长 10 小时，并清除发生变化的内容。已登录用户、购物车、结账和后台永远不会被缓存。启用后会写入 wp-content/advanced-cache.php，并在 wp-config.php 中添加 WP_CACHE。它在多站点网络上不可用，并且在其他页面缓存启用期间保持关闭。','Preload'=>'预加载','rebuilds the cached pages in the background after they are cleared.'=>'在缓存页面被清除后，在后台重新生成它们。','Custom exclusions'=>'自定义排除项','paths, cookies and query parameters on top of the automatic rules, and a separate cache for mobile devices.'=>'在自动规则之外排除的路径、Cookie 和查询参数，以及面向移动设备的单独缓存。','Query deduplication'=>'查询去重','writes wp-content/db.php, which answers identical read queries of the same request from memory. Any write clears it.'=>'写入 wp-content/db.php，它会从内存中响应同一请求内相同的读取查询。任何写入都会清空它。','Analytics'=>'分析','hit rate, queries and the most duplicated queries of the last 30 days.'=>'过去 30 天的命中率、查询数以及重复最多的查询。','the backend and its connection, Heartbeat and the cached comment counts of the dashboard. Saving flushes the object cache.'=>'后端及其连接、Heartbeat 以及仪表盘缓存的评论计数。保存时会清空对象缓存。','Cloudflare'=>'Cloudflare','With the zone ID and an API token with permission to purge the cache, the plugin also clears Cloudflare: everything when it flushes the other caches, and only the affected pages when content changes. Both are on once the token is saved. Saving tests it by purging the home page.'=>'提供区域 ID 和具有清除缓存权限的 API 令牌后，插件也会清除 Cloudflare：清空其他缓存时清除全部内容，内容变化时只清除受影响的页面。保存令牌后两者都会开启。保存时会通过清除首页来测试它。','Cache the pages at Cloudflare too'=>'也在 Cloudflare 缓存页面','creates a Cache Rule in your Cloudflare zone, which needs one more permission, checks it and removes it by itself if the check fails. Turning it off deletes the rule and empties the edge.'=>'在你的 Cloudflare 区域中创建一条 Cache Rule（需要多一项权限），对其进行检查，检查失败时会自动删除。关闭后会删除该规则并清空边缘缓存。','Browser & server'=>'浏览器与服务器','Caches in front of your site'=>'网站前面的缓存','requests the home page twice as a visitor and reads the headers to see whether your host or a CDN keeps a copy. When it finds Varnish, it can purge it too, unless Proxy Cache Purge already does.'=>'以访客身份请求首页两次并读取响应头，以判断你的主机或 CDN 是否保存了副本。发现 Varnish 时也可以清除它，除非 Proxy Cache Purge 已经在做。','Browser cache & compression'=>'浏览器缓存与压缩','adds a block to .htaccess, after a copy of the file, so browsers keep your static files and the server compresses them. Not available on Nginx, and not added while another plugin handles it.'=>'在备份文件后向 .htaccess 添加一段规则，让浏览器保留你的静态文件，并让服务器压缩它们。在 Nginx 上不可用，并且在其他插件处理此事时不会添加。','CSS & JavaScript'=>'CSS 与 JavaScript','What the browser of the visitor downloads and runs. Everything is off by default, and stays off while another optimizer is active.'=>'访客浏览器下载并运行的内容。所有选项默认关闭，并且在其他优化插件启用期间保持关闭。','Minification'=>'压缩','serves minified copies of your own CSS and JavaScript; files already minified, external or excluded are left as they are. Test mode applies it only to logged-in administrators. Saving clears the minified copies.'=>'提供你自己的 CSS 和 JavaScript 的压缩副本；已压缩、外部或被排除的文件保持不变。测试模式只对已登录的管理员生效。保存时会清除压缩副本。','Delay JavaScript'=>'延迟 JavaScript','holds scripts back until the visitor moves, taps, scrolls or types, and runs them anyway after 8 seconds. By default only known third parties are delayed. Consent banners, payment providers and captchas are never delayed. Add ?wpopt_nodelay=1 to an address to load everything at once.'=>'在访客移动鼠标、点按、滚动或输入之前暂缓执行脚本，8 秒后无论如何都会运行。默认只延迟已知的第三方脚本。Cookie 同意横幅、支付服务商和验证码永远不会被延迟。在地址后添加 ?wpopt_nodelay=1 可一次加载全部内容。','Critical CSS'=>'关键 CSS','works out the CSS each template uses and inlines it. Generate shows the sizes and a preview without changing anything; "Apply to the site" turns it on, and "Delete and revert" removes it. Add ?wpopt_noccss=1 to an address to see the page without it.'=>'计算每个模板使用的 CSS 并将其内联。“生成”会显示大小和预览而不更改任何内容；“应用到站点”会启用它，“删除并还原”会将其移除。在地址后添加 ?wpopt_noccss=1 可查看不使用它的页面。','Plugins by URL'=>'按 URL 加载插件','stops a plugin from loading where it does nothing, or loads it only where it is needed. Only for visitors. Every rule is tested on real pages before it is saved, and every rule switches itself off if a visit ends in a fatal error. Saving writes a must-use plugin and clears the page cache.'=>'阻止插件在不起作用的地方加载，或只在需要的地方加载它。仅对访客生效。每条规则在保存前都会在真实页面上测试，如果某次访问以致命错误结束，每条规则都会自动关闭。保存时会写入一个必用插件并清除页面缓存。','Loading & delivery'=>'加载与交付','How the page reaches the visitor. All optional and off by default.'=>'页面如何到达访客。全部可选，默认关闭。','Speculative loading'=>'推测式加载','the browser prepares the next page on click (conservative) or on hover (eager). The admin, login, cart and checkout are left out.'=>'浏览器在点击时（保守）或悬停时（积极）预先准备下一个页面。后台、登录、购物车和结账页面除外。','Image loading'=>'图片加载','gives priority to the first image and lazy-loads the rest.'=>'优先加载第一张图片，其余图片延迟加载。','Preload key resources'=>'预加载关键资源','the featured image and any address you add.'=>'特色图片以及你添加的任何地址。','Lazy embeds'=>'延迟嵌入','iframes load when they are reached, and YouTube videos show a thumbnail until they are clicked.'=>'iframe 在滚动到其位置时才加载，YouTube 视频在点击前显示缩略图。','Server-Timing'=>'Server-Timing','a header with the time the server took, to read in the developer tools of the browser.'=>'一个记录服务器耗时的响应头，可在浏览器的开发者工具中查看。','Resource hints'=>'资源提示','automatic: preconnect for the Google Fonts origins and dns-prefetch for the other external origins whose scripts and styles the page loads.'=>'自动：对 Google Fonts 的源使用 preconnect，对页面加载的脚本和样式所在的其他外部源使用 dns-prefetch。','Google Fonts'=>'Google Fonts','downloads the fonts to your server and serves them from there.'=>'将字体下载到你的服务器并从那里提供。','CDN rewriting'=>'CDN 重写','serves the files of the chosen folders from your CDN host; with no folder ticked, all three.'=>'从你的 CDN 主机提供所选文件夹中的文件；未勾选任何文件夹时，三个文件夹都提供。','The CSS and JavaScript loaded on your public pages, with the plugin or theme each one belongs to. Every change is saved at once.'=>'你的公开页面上加载的 CSS 和 JavaScript，以及每个文件所属的插件或主题。每项更改都会立即保存。','Manual unloading'=>'手动卸载','stops loading the ticked assets on the front end. The admin is never touched, and WordPress core and jQuery cannot be ticked.'=>'在前台停止加载勾选的资源。后台永远不受影响，且无法勾选 WordPress 核心和 jQuery。','Automatic unloading'=>'自动卸载','stops loading the assets of a plugin or theme on the pages where it is not used, following the knowledge base.'=>'根据知识库，在插件或主题未被使用的页面上停止加载其资源。','Test mode'=>'测试模式','applies the unloading only to logged-in administrators, to check it before visitors see it.'=>'只对已登录的管理员应用卸载，以便在访客看到之前先进行检查。','URL exceptions'=>'URL 例外','pages that always keep every asset.'=>'始终保留所有资源的页面。','Per-rule targeting'=>'按规则定向','where each rule applies: everywhere, the front page, posts and pages, archives, one content type or some addresses.'=>'每条规则的适用范围：全站、首页、文章和页面、归档、某一内容类型或部分地址。','Rules that are not doing anything'=>'没有起任何作用的规则','rules of deactivated extensions, which are kept, and rules that match nothing, which can be removed.'=>'已停用扩展的规则（会保留），以及不匹配任何内容的规则（可以删除）。','Autoloaded options load into memory on every request; under about 800 KB in total is healthy. Disabling autoload keeps the option and stops loading it on every page, and it can be undone.'=>'自动加载的选项会在每次请求时载入内存；总量低于约 800 KB 为健康。禁用自动加载会保留该选项，只是不再在每个页面上加载它，并且可以撤销。','Disable autoload for selected'=>'对所选项目禁用自动加载','saves a backup first, then stops loading the selected options on every request.'=>'先保存备份，然后在每次请求时停止加载所选选项。','Smart Deactivation'=>'智能停用','the same for the options confidently identified as belonging to uninstalled extensions.'=>'对被确定识别为属于已卸载扩展的选项执行同样的操作。','Advanced autoload cleanup'=>'高级自动加载清理','disables autoload for the options never read, or for every non-essential one, and deletes the confirmed orphans. Deleting is the only action here that removes options, and it saves a backup first.'=>'对从未被读取的选项或所有非必要选项禁用自动加载，并删除已确认的孤立项。删除是这里唯一会移除选项的操作，并且会先保存备份。','Could be autoloaded'=>'可设为自动加载','options read on almost every request without being autoloaded. The plugin measures it by itself; Smart Activation autoloads those read on at least 90% of 50 or more requests, up to 20 KB each.'=>'几乎每次请求都会读取但未设为自动加载的选项。插件会自行测量；智能启用会对在 50 次或更多请求中至少 90% 被读取的选项启用自动加载，每个最多 20 KB。','A maintenance pass over revisions, drafts, trash, comments, transients and the other tasks chosen in Settings. Everything it deletes is backed up first and can be restored from Backups; if a backup cannot be written, the cleanup stops.'=>'对修订版本、草稿、回收站、评论、瞬态以及在“设置”中选择的其他任务进行一次维护。删除的所有内容都会先备份，并可从“备份”中还原；如果无法写入备份，清理会停止。','Preview (dry run)'=>'预览（试运行）','counts what the cleanup would remove with the current settings, without deleting anything.'=>'按当前设置统计清理将会移除的内容，不删除任何东西。','Run general cleanup now'=>'立即执行常规清理','runs it straight away, after asking. Every enabled task runs, whatever its frequency.'=>'确认后立即运行。所有已启用的任务都会运行，不论其频率如何。','Logs'=>'日志','the last run and the previous reports, to view, download or print. Event lines are included only with "Generate detailed log".'=>'上次运行和以往的报告，可查看、下载或打印。只有启用“生成详细日志”时才包含事件行。','By content type'=>'按内容类型','where the weight of your database sits by content type. Read-only.'=>'按内容类型显示数据库的大小分布。只读。','Active settings'=>'活动设置','the tasks and limits are chosen in Settings, under General cleanup options.'=>'任务和限制在“设置”的“常规清理选项”中选择。','Every table of this site with its engine, rows, size, recoverable overhead and suspected owner. Optimizing and converting never delete data, so they do not make a backup. Orphaned custom tables are deleted from Analysis results.'=>'此站点的每张表及其引擎、行数、大小、可回收的碎片空间和疑似归属。优化和转换永远不会删除数据，因此不会创建备份。孤立的自定义表在“分析结果”中删除。','Unusual table growth since the previous scan'=>'自上次扫描以来表的异常增长','tables that grew at least 5 MB and 25% between two analyses.'=>'两次分析之间增长至少 5 MB 且 25% 的表。','Tables worth a look'=>'值得关注的数据表','tables whose owner is not active, or that are very large for the database.'=>'归属未启用的表，或相对于数据库而言非常大的表。','Optimize selected'=>'优化选中项','runs OPTIMIZE TABLE. On InnoDB the reported free space may not drop, and that is normal.'=>'运行 OPTIMIZE TABLE。在 InnoDB 上报告的可用空间可能不会减少，这是正常的。','Convert selected to InnoDB'=>'将所选转换为 InnoDB','changes only the MyISAM tables and keeps all their data.'=>'只更改 MyISAM 表，并保留其全部数据。','Tables over 256 MB are not converted from the browser, because it would take minutes and as much free disk space. When optimized, they are rebuilt in the background if that recovers space, and skipped otherwise.'=>'超过 256 MB 的表不会在浏览器中转换，因为这需要几分钟和同等的可用磁盘空间。优化时，如果能回收空间，它们会在后台重建，否则会被跳过。','The scheduled tasks of WordPress. An event whose hook has no callback and no installed owner is orphaned: it will never run.'=>'WordPress 的计划任务。如果某个事件的钩子没有回调，也没有已安装的归属者，它就是孤立的：它永远不会运行。','WP-Cron trigger'=>'WP-Cron 触发器','"Disable WP-Cron" adds DISABLE_WP_CRON to wp-config.php, after a copy of the file listed in Backups, and gives the line to add to the crontab of the server. "Re-enable WP-Cron" removes it.'=>'“禁用 WP-Cron”会在备份文件（列在“备份”中）后向 wp-config.php 添加 DISABLE_WP_CRON，并给出需要添加到服务器 crontab 中的那一行。“重新启用 WP-Cron”会将其移除。','Are the tasks running?'=>'任务在运行吗？','warns when an event is more than 10 minutes late, because then nothing is firing WP-Cron.'=>'当某个事件延迟超过 10 分钟时发出警告，因为这说明没有任何东西在触发 WP-Cron。','queues the task to run in the background in a moment, after a backup of its events.'=>'在备份其事件后，将任务排入队列，稍后在后台运行。','the task stays scheduled but does nothing until you resume it. WordPress core tasks cannot be paused.'=>'任务仍保留在计划中，但在你恢复之前不执行任何操作。WordPress 核心任务无法暂停。','Unschedule selected'=>'取消计划选中项','removes orphaned events only, after a backup restorable from Backups. Active and WordPress core events are protected.'=>'只移除孤立事件，并先创建可从“备份”中还原的备份。已启用的事件和 WordPress 核心事件受到保护。','The uploads folder as the last analysis found it. Every deletion here saves a copy of the files first, restorable from Trash or Backups.'=>'上次分析时上传文件夹的状况。这里的每次删除都会先保存文件副本，可从“回收站”或“备份”中还原。','files with no record in the database, thumbnails whose original is missing and files in named folders, usually left by plugins. Review them before deleting.'=>'数据库中没有记录的文件、原图已丢失的缩略图，以及位于指定文件夹中的文件（通常由插件遗留）。删除前请先检查。','Duplicate sets'=>'重复项组','byte-identical files. The copy with the lowest ID is kept, featured images and content are pointed to it and the other copies are deleted. A set still used somewhere the plugin cannot rewrite is left alone.'=>'字节完全相同的文件。保留 ID 最小的副本，特色图片和内容会改为指向它，其他副本会被删除。如果某组文件仍在插件无法改写的地方被使用，则保持不动。','Unused attachments'=>'未使用的附件','attachments with no reference found in content, meta, galleries or parent posts. It is a heuristic: confirm each one, or mark it as known to keep it. References are checked again before deleting, and "Delete all" is refused when the search was incomplete.'=>'在内容、元数据、图库或父文章中均未找到引用的附件。这是一种启发式判断：请逐一确认，或将其标记为已知以保留它。删除前会再次检查引用，搜索不完整时会拒绝“全部删除”。','Trash'=>'回收站','the copies of the deleted media. Restore puts the files back; Delete removes the copy for good and frees its space.'=>'已删除媒体的副本。“还原”会将文件放回原处；“删除”会永久移除副本并释放其空间。','Image optimization'=>'图片优化','The weight and formats of your images and what would help each one. The analysis runs with "Analyze now".'=>'你的图片的大小和格式，以及对每张图片有帮助的措施。分析通过“立即分析”运行。','Optimize originals'=>'优化原图','recompresses the JPEG and PNG originals and resizes those larger than the maximum, after a byte-verified copy of each one; "Restore originals" puts them back.'=>'在对每张图片创建经字节校验的副本后，重新压缩 JPEG 和 PNG 原图，并调整超过最大尺寸的图片；“恢复原图”会将其放回。','Generate next-gen copies'=>'生成新一代副本','creates WebP and AVIF copies next to each image, without changing the original. Remove deletes only the copies made by the plugin.'=>'在每张图片旁边创建 WebP 和 AVIF 副本，不更改原图。“移除”只删除插件创建的副本。','quality (82 by default), maximum dimensions (2560 × 2560), folders never optimized, image sizes no longer generated for new uploads, and optimizing new uploads as they arrive. Serving WebP and AVIF as <picture> sources is on by default.'=>'质量（默认 82）、最大尺寸（2560 × 2560）、永不优化的文件夹、新上传时不再生成的图片尺寸，以及在新文件上传时立即优化。默认会以 <picture> 来源的形式提供 WebP 和 AVIF。','Serve WebP/AVIF from the server'=>'由服务器提供 WebP/AVIF','adds a rule to the .htaccess of the uploads folder, after a copy of it, and checks that it works. On Nginx it gives the configuration instead.'=>'在备份上传文件夹的 .htaccess 后向其中添加一条规则，并检查它是否生效。在 Nginx 上则改为给出相应配置。','Library audit'=>'媒体库审计','An examination of the uploads folder and the attachment records behind it, run only when you click "Run the audit". It says whose each file is and never moves anything.'=>'对上传文件夹及其背后附件记录的检查，只在你点击“运行审计”时运行。它会说明每个文件的归属，且永远不会移动任何内容。','Files that should not be downloadable'=>'不应可被下载的文件','database dumps, logs and backups left in uploads, each checked with a real request. "Protect these files" adds an .htaccess rule that blocks them; they can also be deleted, after a backup.'=>'遗留在 uploads 中的数据库转储、日志和备份，每一项都会通过真实请求进行检查。“保护这些文件”会添加一条阻止访问它们的 .htaccess 规则；也可以在备份后删除它们。','Sizes carrying an older name'=>'沿用旧名称的尺寸','regenerates the thumbnails, up to 10 attachments at a time, after a backup of their metadata. The old files are not deleted.'=>'在备份元数据后重新生成缩略图，每次最多 10 个附件。旧文件不会被删除。','Files claimed twice'=>'被两处认领的文件','files claimed at once by the metadata of an attachment and by an address the theme rewrites, which makes moving them unsafe. Report only.'=>'同时被某个附件的元数据和主题改写的地址所引用的文件，因此移动它们并不安全。仅报告。','Sizes no registered size could produce'=>'没有任何已注册尺寸能生成的尺寸','they can be deleted, after a backup.'=>'可以在备份后删除它们。','Files in the uploads root'=>'位于上传目录根部的文件','Every record and file the last analysis attributed, filtered by state. Each state has a Database and a Files view.'=>'上次分析已归属的每条记录和每个文件，按状态筛选。每种状态都有“数据库”和“文件”视图。','left behind by extensions that are no longer installed. Nothing on the site uses them; delete them unless you plan to reinstall that extension and keep its settings.'=>'由已不再安装的扩展遗留。站点上没有任何东西使用它们；除非你打算重新安装该扩展并保留其设置，否则请删除它们。','no owner could be identified. They may belong to something still in use: review them one by one, attribute them by hand or ask the attribution assistant.'=>'无法识别归属者。它们可能属于仍在使用的东西：请逐一检查、手动归属，或询问归属助手。','they belong to installed but deactivated plugins or themes. Delete them only if you will not use those extensions again. Plugins & Themes lists them to uninstall.'=>'它们属于已安装但已停用的插件或主题。只有在你不会再使用这些扩展时才删除它们。“插件和主题”中会列出它们以供卸载。','records with no value stored. Those of active extensions or of WordPress are read-only.'=>'没有存储任何值的记录。属于已启用扩展或 WordPress 的记录为只读。','they belong to active extensions or WordPress. Nothing is deleted here: fix a wrong owner, protect a record or deactivate plugins and themes.'=>'它们属于已启用的扩展或 WordPress。这里不会删除任何内容：可以纠正错误的归属、保护某条记录，或停用插件和主题。','Confidence levels'=>'置信度级别','How much is known about the owner of each record. Only Manual, Sure, Likely and Possible can be deleted; anything lower goes to To identify.'=>'对每条记录归属者的了解程度。只有“手动”“确定”“很可能”和“可能”可以删除；更低的级别归入“待识别”。','Manual'=>'手动','you attributed it yourself, and it outranks every automatic source.'=>'由你亲自归属，优先于所有自动来源。','Sure'=>'确定','captured live on this site, by a plugin whose own namespace the item belongs to.'=>'在此站点上实时捕获，由该项所属命名空间对应的插件生成。','Likely'=>'很可能','seen by comparing what the site registered before and after activating the extension.'=>'通过比较扩展启用前后站点注册的内容得出。','Possible'=>'可能','read from the code of the extension, or confirmed by several sites in the shared dataset.'=>'从扩展代码中读取，或由共享数据集中的多个站点确认。','Doubtful'=>'存疑','one claim only, outside the namespace of the claimant, or reported by few sites.'=>'只有一项声明，且不在声明者的命名空间内，或仅由少数站点报告。','Estimated'=>'推测','inferred from a prefix or a slug.'=>'根据前缀或 slug 推断。','Undetermined'=>'未确定','no owner found.'=>'未找到归属者。','Deleting and uninstalling'=>'删除与卸载','Every deletion makes a backup first, and if it cannot be made nothing is deleted. Before deleting, each record is checked again: anything now in use, part of WordPress or no longer in the last analysis is kept, and very large entries are refused with the reason, since backing them up from the browser is not possible. The content of orphaned custom post types and the terms of orphaned taxonomies are only deleted when you tick that option.'=>'每次删除都会先创建备份，如果无法创建备份则不会删除任何内容。删除前会再次检查每条记录：现在正在使用的、属于 WordPress 的或已不在上次分析中的内容都会保留，非常大的条目会被拒绝，并说明原因，因为无法在浏览器中为其创建备份。孤立的自定义文章类型的内容和孤立分类法的术语只有在你勾选该选项时才会被删除。','acts on every filtered record; once rows are ticked the button deletes only the selection. The notice that follows offers Undo for one day.'=>'作用于所有筛选出的记录；勾选行后，该按钮只删除所选内容。随后的提示会在一天内提供“撤销”。','protected records are never deleted by any cleanup until you unprotect them.'=>'受保护的记录在你取消保护之前，不会被任何清理删除。','copies the folder of each plugin or theme to Backups and then deletes it the WordPress way, which also runs its own uninstall routine; what that routine removes from the database is not in the copy. With the option ticked, the data and files the analysis found for them are deleted too, after a backup.'=>'将每个插件或主题的文件夹复制到“备份”，然后按 WordPress 的方式删除它，这也会运行其自身的卸载程序；该程序从数据库中移除的内容不在副本中。勾选该选项后，分析为它们找到的数据和文件也会在备份后被删除。','without an active license every list is analysed and the first 25 records are shown; deleting and uninstalling need the license.'=>'没有有效许可证时，每个列表都会被分析，并显示前 25 条记录；删除和卸载需要许可证。','Manual attribution'=>'手动归属','Attribute manually'=>'手动归属','tells WPOptimizing who owns an item when the automatic attribution is wrong or missing: "Contains" for a family of items, "Exact value" for one. Your rule takes priority, and the item moves to In use, Inactive or Orphans at once, without a new analysis. An item whose owner is active can no longer be deleted.'=>'在自动归属错误或缺失时，告诉 WPOptimizing 某一项的归属者：“包含”用于一类项目，“精确值”用于单个项目。你的规则优先，该项会立即移至“使用中”“未启用”或“孤立项”，无需重新分析。归属者已启用的项目将无法再删除。','Attribution assistant'=>'归属助手','suggests owners from the shared knowledge base, for To identify, or checks the owners shown, for Orphans. It needs data sharing. After each analysis the sure owners are applied on their own; the rest change only when you click Accept, one by one or all the sure ones at once, which creates a rule.'=>'针对“待识别”，从共享知识库中推荐归属者；针对“孤立项”，检查所显示的归属者。它需要启用数据共享。每次分析后，确定的归属者会自动应用；其余的只有在你点击“接受”（逐条或一次性接受所有确定的建议，会创建一条规则）后才会更改。','What changed in WordPress since WPOptimizing was installed: tables, options, meta keys, scheduled events and plugin, theme and upload folders added or removed, with the date and the extension responsible when it is known. It is recorded when plugins or themes change and after every analysis, and keeps the latest 2,000 changes.'=>'自安装 WPOptimizing 以来 WordPress 中发生的变化：新增或移除的表、选项、元键、计划事件以及插件、主题和上传文件夹，并在已知时附上日期和相关扩展。插件或主题发生变化时以及每次分析后都会记录，并保留最近的 2,000 条变化。','Clear activity log'=>'清除活动日志','empties the list; the starting point is kept, so tracking continues from now.'=>'清空列表；起点会保留，因此从现在起继续跟踪。','The copies made before deletions, cleanups, autoload changes, uninstalls and edits of .htaccess and wp-config.php. They are kept in wp-content/wpoptimizing/backups/, and how many and for how long is set in Settings.'=>'在删除、清理、自动加载更改、卸载以及编辑 .htaccess 和 wp-config.php 之前创建的副本。它们保存在 wp-content/wpoptimizing/backups/ 中，保留数量和时长在“设置”中设定。','Restore'=>'还原','puts back the database rows and the files of that operation. The backup is kept after restoring.'=>'放回该操作涉及的数据库行和文件。还原后备份仍会保留。','removes the backup for good.'=>'永久移除该备份。','Create backup now'=>'立即创建备份','saves every record and file of the last analysis, without deleting anything. It is not a full backup of the site.'=>'保存上次分析的每条记录和每个文件，不删除任何内容。它不是站点的完整备份。','A quick reference for every feature inside the plugin, in three groups: Performance, Cleanup and Tools & data. The question mark next to a section title opens the same text. The full manual, with every setting explained, is the knowledge base.'=>'插件内每项功能的快速参考，分为三组：“性能”“清理”和“工具与数据”。章节标题旁边的问号会打开相同的文本。包含所有设置说明的完整手册在知识库中。','License'=>'许可证','License key'=>'许可证密钥','enter it and click Activate. Once stored it is hidden; deactivate it to enter another one. Without an active license everything is analysed and shown, and deleting attributed records and uninstalling extensions are not available.'=>'输入后点击“启用”。保存后它会被隐藏；停用后才能输入另一个。没有有效许可证时，所有内容都会被分析和显示，但无法删除已归属的记录和卸载扩展。','Backups and notifications'=>'备份与通知','Max backups per type'=>'每种类型的最大备份数','25 by default; the oldest of each type are deleted automatically.'=>'默认 25 个；每种类型中最旧的会被自动删除。','Max age (days)'=>'最大期限（天）','backups older than this are deleted automatically; 30 by default.'=>'早于此期限的备份会被自动删除；默认 30。','Max backup size (MB)'=>'最大备份大小（MB）','when the backups would grow past it (2048 MB by default), the change stops instead of filling the disk. 0 means no limit.'=>'当备份将超过此大小（默认 2048 MB）时，更改会停止，而不是占满磁盘。0 表示不限制。','Notification email'=>'通知邮箱','where the periodic report is sent; the address of the site administrator when empty. Separate several addresses with commas.'=>'定期报告的接收地址；留空时使用站点管理员的地址。多个地址用逗号分隔。','Maintenance report'=>'维护报告','an email with the health score, the main figures and the activity, daily to monthly. Off by default. "Send a test now" sends one at once without changing the schedule.'=>'一封包含健康评分、主要数据和活动的电子邮件，频率从每天到每月。默认关闭。“立即发送测试”会立即发送一封，不改变计划。','Background sweeper'=>'后台清扫','clears expired transients a few at a time on admin requests; off by default, and idle with a persistent object cache.'=>'在后台请求时每次清除少量过期瞬态；默认关闭，使用持久对象缓存时不运行。','On uninstall'=>'卸载时','on by default: deleting the plugin deletes its settings, backups and analysis data. The drop-ins, the must-use plugins and the lines added to wp-config.php are removed in any case. Optimized images are kept.'=>'默认开启：删除插件时会删除其设置、备份和分析数据。drop-in、必用插件以及添加到 wp-config.php 的行无论如何都会被移除。优化过的图片会保留。','Quick profile'=>'快速配置方案','Apply a preset'=>'应用预设','Safe, Blog, WooCommerce, Membership or Agency (maximum), with the one that suits your site marked as recommended. Applying it sets the cleanup tasks, front-end performance, core tweaks and Heartbeat, and turns on the object cache and query deduplication. The cleanup schedule is not changed.'=>'安全、博客、WooCommerce、会员或代理机构（最高），适合你站点的那一个会被标为推荐。应用后会设置清理任务、前端性能、核心调整和 Heartbeat，并开启对象缓存和查询去重。清理计划不会改变。','Cleanup options'=>'清理选项','Revisions to keep per post'=>'每篇文章保留的修订数','2 by default; the older revisions of each post are deleted on every cleanup. A post marked "Keep all revisions" keeps all of them.'=>'默认 2 个；每次清理时都会删除每篇文章较旧的修订版本。标记为“保留所有修订版本”的文章会保留全部修订版本。','Database cleanup tasks'=>'数据库清理任务','what the general cleanup removes. Auto-drafts, trashed posts, spam and trashed comments, expired transients and table optimization are on by default; the rest are off.'=>'常规清理会移除的内容。自动草稿、已移至回收站的文章、垃圾评论和回收站中的评论、过期瞬态以及表优化默认开启；其余默认关闭。','Keep trash and spam for at least (days)'=>'回收站和垃圾评论至少保留（天）','leaves alone what was sent to the trash or marked as spam more recently, so a mistake can still be undone.'=>'不处理最近才移至回收站或标记为垃圾的内容，以便仍可撤销误操作。','Automatic analysis'=>'自动分析','daily by default, only inside the low-traffic window (02:00 to 06:00, site time). A manual analysis always runs at once.'=>'默认每天一次，只在低流量时段内进行（站点时间 02:00 至 06:00）。手动分析总是立即运行。','Automatic maintenance'=>'自动维护','runs the general cleanup on a schedule, from hourly to monthly. Manual only by default.'=>'按计划运行常规清理，频率从每小时到每月。默认仅手动。','Per-task frequency (advanced)'=>'按任务设置频率（高级）','how often each task runs on automatic runs; "Never" skips it. Manual runs always run every enabled task.'=>'自动运行时每项任务的运行频率；“从不”会跳过该任务。手动运行时总是运行所有已启用的任务。','Auto-clean on DB growth'=>'数据库增长时自动清理','runs the general cleanup when the database grows more than this many MB since the last one. 0 disables it.'=>'当数据库自上次清理以来增长超过此 MB 数时运行常规清理。0 表示禁用。','Core tweaks'=>'核心优化','Turn off WordPress features you do not use. Every option is off by default and reversible; nothing is deleted. The safe ones only remove noise from the head; the moderate ones (jQuery Migrate, Dashicons, oEmbed, remote patterns, REST links, WooCommerce cart fragments) may affect a few setups, so review each one.'=>'关闭你不使用的 WordPress 功能。每个选项默认关闭且可撤销；不会删除任何内容。安全的选项只移除 head 中的冗余内容；中等的选项（jQuery Migrate、Dashicons、oEmbed、远程区块样板、REST 链接、WooCommerce 购物车片段）可能会影响少数配置，请逐一检查。','Front-end performance'=>'前端性能','these settings are now in Speed › Page & browser.'=>'这些设置现在位于“速度 › 页面与浏览器”。','Webhooks'=>'Webhooks','Endpoint URL'=>'端点网址','receives a JSON POST when an analysis, a cleanup, a deletion or a dataset upload finishes. Leave it empty to disable webhooks.'=>'在分析、清理、删除或数据集上传完成时接收一个 JSON POST。留空则禁用 webhook。','Signing secret'=>'签名密钥','optional; each request then carries an X-WPOptimizing-Signature header with the HMAC-SHA256 of the body.'=>'可选；设置后每个请求都会带有 X-WPOptimizing-Signature 头，其值为请求正文的 HMAC-SHA256。','Events'=>'事件','which events are sent; with none selected, all of them.'=>'要发送哪些事件；未选择任何事件时发送全部。','Compatibility'=>'兼容性','The optimization plugins found on the site and what each one already does. Where doing it twice would conflict, the WPOptimizing version stays off.'=>'在站点上发现的优化插件以及每个插件已在做的事情。在重复执行会产生冲突的地方，WPOptimizing 的对应功能保持关闭。','Use WPOptimizing for this anyway'=>'仍然使用 WPOptimizing 处理此项','runs ours as well for that feature.'=>'对该功能也同时运行我们的版本。','Shared dataset'=>'共享数据集','Contribute & receive'=>'贡献并接收','off by default. When on, the names of options, meta keys, tables and files, their sizes and how often they are seen are sent with the domain of the site, and the shared dataset is received in return. Values and content are never sent.'=>'默认关闭。开启后，选项、元键、表和文件的名称、大小以及出现频率会连同站点域名一起发送，作为回报会收到共享数据集。值和内容永远不会发送。','Sync dataset now'=>'立即同步数据集','uploads and downloads at once instead of waiting for the daily sync.'=>'立即上传和下载，而不是等待每日同步。','Import / export'=>'导入 / 导出','Download settings (.json)'=>'下载设置 (.json)','a file with the configuration, to set another site up the same way. Keys, passwords, webhooks and the data-sharing consent are never included.'=>'一个包含配置的文件，用于以相同方式设置另一个站点。密钥、密码、webhook 和数据共享同意永远不会包含在内。','Import settings'=>'导入设置','overwrites the current settings with those of the file; unknown entries are ignored.'=>'用文件中的设置覆盖当前设置；未知条目会被忽略。','Replay welcome wizard'=>'重新查看欢迎向导','shows the welcome wizard again on the main screen.'=>'在主界面上再次显示欢迎向导。','Network'=>'网络','A read-only summary of every site of the network. Each site analyses and cleans its own data; open a site to manage it.'=>'网络中每个站点的只读摘要。每个站点分析并清理自己的数据；打开某个站点即可管理它。','Network quick setup'=>'网络快速设置','applies a quick profile to every site or to the ones chosen, and sets the alert thresholds of that profile. Nothing is deleted.'=>'对所有站点或所选站点应用快速配置方案，并设置该方案的警报阈值。不会删除任何内容。','Analyze all sites'=>'分析所有网站','schedules a new analysis on every site.'=>'在每个站点上安排一次新的分析。','the table, to open it in a spreadsheet; View report opens a printable version.'=>'该表格，以便在电子表格中打开；“查看报告”会打开可打印版本。','Email alerts'=>'电子邮件提醒','a daily summary to the network administrator when a site has this much orphaned data, has not been analysed in this many days or has this much autoload. 0 disables each one; the same sites are not reported again for a week.'=>'当某个站点的孤立数据达到此数量、已有这么多天未分析或自动加载达到此大小时，每天向网络管理员发送摘要。设为 0 则禁用对应项；同一站点在一周内不会被再次报告。','activates or deactivates the license of each site from its row.'=>'在每个站点所在的行中启用或停用其许可证。','Network Report'=>'网络报告','Generated:'=>'生成时间：','Sites'=>'网站','Licensed'=>'已授权','Pending'=>'待处理','Scanned size'=>'扫描大小','Site'=>'网站','Last analysis'=>'上次分析','Trend'=>'趋势','Free'=>'免费','Never'=>'从不','Generated by WPOptimizing %s'=>'由 WPOptimizing %s 生成','No change since baseline'=>'自基线以来无变化','Autoload change since this site’s baseline (lower is better)'=>'自此网站基线以来的自动加载变化（越低越好）','Apply a cleanup profile to selected sites in one step. Alert thresholds are set automatically from the chosen profile; use the Email alerts form below for manual tuning. Nothing is deleted — cleanup tasks run on each site\'s own schedule.'=>'一步将清理配置应用到所选站点。警报阈值会根据所选配置自动设定；如需手动调整，请使用下方的邮件警报表单。不会删除任何数据——清理任务按各站点自身计划执行。','Each profile sets cleanup preferences, performance options (object cache, query deduplication, heartbeat) and network alert thresholds. Nothing is deleted.'=>'每个配置包含清理偏好、性能选项（对象缓存、查询去重、心跳）及网络警报阈值。不会删除任何数据。','Profile'=>'配置方案','Sites to apply'=>'应用到的站点','"All sites" is selected by default. Deselect it to pick individual sites instead.'=>'默认选中"所有站点"。取消选中可改为选择单个站点。','All sites'=>'所有站点','Apply profile'=>'应用配置','Alert thresholds from this profile: %1$s MB reclaimable, %2$s days stale, %3$s KB autoload.'=>'此配置的警报阈值：可回收 %1$s MB，未分析 %2$s 天，自动加载 %3$s KB。','Please select a profile before applying.'=>'请先选择配置再应用。','You are not allowed to access this page.'=>'你无权访问此页面。','Read-only summary of every site in the network. Each site scans and cleans its own data independently; open a site to manage it.'=>'网络中每个网站的只读摘要。每个网站独立扫描和清理自己的数据；打开某个网站以进行管理。','Analysis scheduled on %s site(s). Results will appear as each scan finishes.'=>'已为 %s 个网站安排分析。结果将在每次扫描完成后显示。','Alert settings saved.'=>'提醒设置已保存。','Quick profile applied to %d site.' . "\0" . 'Quick profile applied to %d sites.'=>'快速配置方案已应用于 %d 个站点。','No sites were updated (no profile selected or no sites matched).'=>'没有站点被更新（未选择配置或没有匹配的站点）。','License activated for the site.'=>'已为该网站激活许可证。','License deactivated for the site.'=>'已为该网站停用许可证。','License activation failed (rejected by the license server).'=>'许可证激活失败（被许可证服务器拒绝）。','Enter a license key first.'=>'请先输入许可证密钥。','Could not process the license request.'=>'无法处理许可证请求。','Schedule a fresh analysis on every site in the network?'=>'为网络中的每个网站安排新的分析？','Network overview'=>'网络概览','Never analysed'=>'从未分析','Orphans (all sites)'=>'孤立项（所有网站）','To identify (all sites)'=>'待识别（所有网站）','Media reclaimable'=>'可回收媒体','Improving'=>'正在改善','Heavy autoload'=>'自动加载过重','Filter sites'=>'筛选站点','Filter sites by name or URL…'=>'按名称或网址筛选网站…','Recoverable media: duplicate images + orphan files'=>'可恢复媒体：重复图片 + 孤立文件','Autoload change since this site\'s baseline (lower is better)'=>'自站点基准以来的自动加载变化（越低越好）','Total size of everything scanned (database + files)'=>'所有扫描内容的总大小（数据库 + 文件）','Actions'=>'操作','Open'=>'打开','This site has an active license.'=>'此网站拥有有效的许可证。','Deactivate license'=>'停用许可证','License key:'=>'许可证密钥：','Activate license'=>'激活许可证','Alerts on'=>'提醒已开启','A daily summary is sent to %s.'=>'每日摘要会发送至 %s。','Alerts off'=>'提醒已关闭','Set a trigger below to start receiving the daily summary.'=>'在下方设置触发条件以开始接收每日摘要。','Cleanup opportunity'=>'清理机会','MB'=>'MB','Alert when a site has at least this much safely-removable (orphan) data. 0 disables.'=>'当某个网站有至少这么多可安全移除（孤立）的数据时提醒。设为 0 可禁用。','Falling behind'=>'进度滞后','days'=>'天','Alert when a site has not been analysed in this many days (never-analysed sites always count). 0 disables.'=>'当某个网站超过这么多天未分析时提醒（从未分析的网站始终计入）。设为 0 可禁用。','KB'=>'KB','Alert when a site has more than this much autoloaded data (1024 KB = 1 MB is a common limit). 0 disables.'=>'当某个网站的自动加载数据超过此数值时提醒（1024 KB = 1 MB 是常见上限）。设为 0 可禁用。','Save alert settings'=>'保存提醒设置','[%s] WPOptimizing — sites need attention'=>'[%s] WPOptimizing — 网站需要关注','%s orphans'=>'%s 个孤立项','%1$d site has at least %2$s of safely-removable data.' . "\0" . '%1$d sites have at least %2$s of safely-removable data.'=>'%1$d 个站点至少有 %2$s 可安全删除的数据。','🧹 Cleanup opportunity'=>'🧹 清理机会','never'=>'从不','%1$d site has not been analysed in over %2$d day(s).' . "\0" . '%1$d sites have not been analysed in over %2$d day(s).'=>'%1$d 个站点已超过 %2$d 天未进行分析。','⏰ Falling behind'=>'⏰ 进度滞后','%s options'=>'%s 个选项','%1$d site loads over %2$s of autoloaded data on every request.' . "\0" . '%1$d sites load over %2$s of autoloaded data on every request.'=>'%1$d 个站点每次请求加载超过 %2$s 的自动加载数据。','💾 Heavy autoload'=>'💾 自动加载过重','Daily summary for %s'=>'%s 的每日摘要','Network alert'=>'网络提醒','Open network overview'=>'打开网络概览','Sent by %s. Adjust or disable these alerts from the network overview.'=>'由 %s 发送。可在网络概览中调整或禁用这些提醒。','Follow us:'=>'关注我们：','Follow us on '=>'关注我们于 ','More plugins:'=>'更多插件：','More plugins on '=>'更多插件在 ','Contact us:'=>'联系我们：','Contact us by '=>'联系我们通过 ','Type 2 or more characters to search…'=>'输入 2 个或更多字符进行搜索…','Searching…'=>'搜索中…','No matches found'=>'未找到匹配项','Could not load the results'=>'无法加载结果','Loading more results…'=>'正在加载更多结果…','Connecting'=>'连接中','Deactivate'=>'停用','Activate'=>'启用','The license could not be verified. Pro features stay on for %d more day while the connection to the store is restored.' . "\0" . 'The license could not be verified. Pro features stay on for %d more days while the connection to the store is restored.'=>'许可证无法验证。在恢复与商店的连接期间，专业版功能还将保持启用 %d 天。','Security check failed.'=>'安全检查失败。','Welcome to WPOptimizing!'=>'欢迎使用 WPOptimizing！','Your installation is ready. Run your first analysis to discover orphaned records, files and media, see what belongs to each plugin, and safely clean your database.'=>'你的安装已就绪。运行首次分析以发现孤立记录、文件和媒体，了解每个插件的归属，并安全清理你的数据库。','Run first analysis →'=>'运行首次分析 →','Dismiss'=>'忽略','Not analyzed'=>'未分析','Run an analysis first'=>'请先运行分析','Clean'=>'干净','No orphaned data'=>'无孤立数据','Review'=>'需检查','%s recoverable'=>'可回收 %s','Action needed'=>'需要处理','Healthy'=>'健康','Could improve'=>'可改进','Heavy'=>'过重','Managed by %s'=>'由 %s 管理','Active with %s'=>'已通过 %s 启用','Not enabled'=>'未启用','Object cache is off'=>'对象缓存已关闭','Warming up'=>'预热中','Hit rate'=>'命中率','Object cache on'=>'对象缓存已启用','Autoload weight (target < 800 KB)'=>'自动加载体量（目标 < 800 KB）','View autoload'=>'查看自动加载','Open cache'=>'打开缓存','Enable cache'=>'启用缓存','Warning'=>'警告','Critical'=>'严重','Known list reset. Run an analysis to re-evaluate those attachments.'=>'已重置已知列表。请运行分析以重新评估这些附件。','You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page.'=>'你没有足够的权限访问此页面。','Analyses your plugins, themes, database and files to speed up your site and find what was left behind. Use the menu on the left: Diagnose, Speed, Clean up, and Analysis results to review what the analysis found.'=>'分析你的插件、主题、数据库和文件，以加快网站速度并找出遗留内容。使用左侧菜单：诊断、速度、清理，以及分析结果——在这里查看分析发现的内容。','Last analysis: %1$s ago (%2$s).'=>'上次分析：%1$s 前（%2$s）。','The last analysis could not read part of the database: %s query did not finish (it took too long or the server returned an error). The database lists keep the results of the previous analysis; analyse again at a quieter time.' . "\0" . 'The last analysis could not read part of the database: %s queries did not finish (they took too long or the server returned an error). The database lists keep the results of the previous analysis; analyse again at a quieter time.'=>'上次分析未能读取部分数据库：%s 个查询未完成（耗时过长或服务器返回错误）。数据库列表保留上一次分析的结果；请在较空闲时重新分析。','Data sharing is off.'=>'数据共享已关闭。','WPOptimizing is using only your local attribution — it is not receiving the shared attribution dataset that improves accuracy. Turn on sharing (opt-in and reciprocal) to give back and receive the community dataset.'=>'WPOptimizing 仅使用你的本地归因 — 它未接收可提高准确性的共享归因数据集。开启共享（需主动选择且互惠）以回馈并接收社区数据集。','Enable sharing'=>'启用共享','Welcome'=>'欢迎','Cleanup'=>'清理','Images'=>'图片','Ready'=>'完成','Welcome to WPOptimizing'=>'欢迎使用 WPOptimizing','Measure and speed up'=>'测量并提速','See where the time goes and fix it: object and page cache, CSS and JavaScript, WebP and AVIF images and delivery, each one switched on separately.'=>'找出时间花在哪里并加以解决：对象缓存与页面缓存、CSS 与 JavaScript、WebP 与 AVIF 图片，以及加载与交付，每项都可单独开启。','Smart attribution'=>'智能归因','Every option, post meta, cron job and file is traced back to its owning plugin or theme using backtrace analysis, callback reflection and a community dataset.'=>'通过回溯分析、回调反射和社区数据集，将每个选项、文章元数据、定时任务和文件追溯到其所属的插件或主题。','Safe cleanup'=>'安全清理','Attributed deletions, media cleanups and the general cleanup create a backup first, restorable from the Backups tab. Orphaned records (from uninstalled plugins) are separated from inactive ones so you always know the risk.'=>'归属删除、媒体清理和常规清理会先创建备份，可从「备份」标签页恢复。孤立记录（来自已卸载的插件）与非活动记录分开显示，让你始终了解风险。','7-level confidence'=>'7 级置信度','Each attributed record gets a confidence badge, from the Manual rules you set yourself down to Undetermined. Only Manual, Sure, Likely and Possible items are considered fully safe for automatic cleanup.'=>'每条归属记录都会获得一个可信度标记，从你自行设置的「手动」规则到「未确定」。只有「手动」、「确定」、「很可能」和「可能」的项目才被视为完全可以安全地自动清理。','Confidence levels — hover to learn more:'=>'置信度级别 — 悬停以了解更多：','Help improve attribution accuracy (recommended).'=>'帮助提高归因准确性（推荐）。','Share attribution metadata with the WPOptimizing shared dataset and receive the community dataset in return. Only the names of options, meta keys, tables and files, their sizes and how often they are seen are sent, with your site’s domain — never option values, post or user content, or any record contents. It is reciprocal (off = the plugin keeps working with your local data only, but does not exchange the shared dataset) and you can change it anytime in Settings.'=>'与 WPOptimizing 共享数据集共享归因元数据，并接收社区数据集作为回报。仅发送选项、元数据键、表和文件的名称、它们的大小及其出现频率，以及你的站点域名 — 绝不发送选项值、文章或用户内容或任何记录内容。这是互惠的（关闭 = 插件仅使用你的本地数据继续工作，但不交换共享数据集），你可以随时在“设置”中更改。','License active'=>'许可证已激活','All Pro features are unlocked on this site.'=>'本站点已解锁全部 Pro 功能。','Database cleanup'=>'数据库清理','Choose how thorough the automatic cleanup should be. You can fine-tune everything later in Settings.'=>'选择自动清理的彻底程度。之后都可以在设置中微调。','Cleanup preset'=>'清理预设','%s — recommended for your site'=>'%s — 为你的站点推荐','Pre-selected based on the plugins we detected on your site. Applied when you start the analysis below; you can change it anytime in Settings.'=>'已根据在你站点上检测到的插件预选。将在下方开始分析时应用；你可以随时在“设置”中更改。','Ongoing maintenance (optional)'=>'持续维护（可选）','Clean automatically as the database grows.'=>'随着数据库增长自动清理。','Runs the selected preset in the background once the database grows past a threshold since the last cleanup. Safe and backup-first.'=>'当数据库自上次清理以来增长超过阈值时，在后台运行所选预设。安全且先备份。','Growth threshold (MB)'=>'增长阈值（MB）','Email maintenance report'=>'通过电子邮件发送维护报告','Send report to'=>'报告发送至','For agencies: route the report to the maintainer instead of the site owner. Separate several addresses with commas; leave empty to use the site admin email.'=>'对于代理机构：将报告发送给维护者而非站点所有者。多个地址用逗号分隔；留空则使用站点管理员邮箱。','Safe, reversible speed-ups. Sensible defaults are pre-selected; uncheck anything you would rather skip.'=>'安全且可逆的提速。已预选合理默认项；不需要的可取消勾选。','Enable the object cache (recommended).'=>'启用对象缓存（推荐）。','Speeds up the admin and the front end with a safe persistent object cache — no full-page caching, so it never serves stale pages. You can disable it anytime in Speed › Cache.'=>'以安全的持久对象缓存加速后台和前台——不做整页缓存，因此绝不提供过期页面。你可以随时在“速度 › 缓存”中禁用它。','Enable query deduplication (recommended).'=>'启用查询去重（推荐）。','Stops the same database read query running twice within a request. Safe and reversible — any write clears it instantly, so results are never stale. You can disable it anytime in Speed › Cache.'=>'防止同一条数据库读取查询在一次请求内执行两次。安全且可撤销——任何写入都会立即清除它，因此结果绝不会过期。你可以随时在“速度 › 缓存”中禁用它。','Self-host Google Fonts (recommended).'=>'自托管 Google Fonts（推荐）。','Serves the font CSS and files from this site so the browser never contacts Google (faster first render, GDPR-friendly). We detect and download them when the analysis runs.'=>'从本站点提供字体 CSS 和文件，使浏览器永不联系 Google（首次渲染更快，符合 GDPR）。我们会在运行分析时检测并下载它们。','Heartbeat activity'=>'Heartbeat 活动','Default (leave as-is)'=>'默认（保持不变）','Slow it down (recommended)'=>'将其减速（推荐）','Turn it off outside the editor'=>'在编辑器之外关闭','Heartbeat is the WordPress admin auto-save/notification ping. Slowing it down cuts admin CPU with no visible downside; you can change it in Diagnose › Performance › Server.'=>'Heartbeat 是 WordPress 后台的自动保存/通知心跳。将其减速可降低后台 CPU 占用且无明显副作用；你可以在「诊断 › 性能 › 服务器」中更改。','Enable Smart Assets manual unloading.'=>'启用 Smart Assets 手动卸载。','Turns on the engine so you can stop specific CSS/JS from loading; you then choose which in the Smart Assets tab. WordPress core and jQuery are always protected, and it is fully reversible.'=>'启用引擎，以便你阻止特定 CSS/JS 加载；然后在“智能资源”标签中选择哪些。WordPress 核心和 jQuery 始终受保护，且完全可撤销。','Enable automatic asset unloading.'=>'启用资源自动卸载。','Pro'=>'Pro','Automatically stops loading a known plugin or theme\'s CSS/JS on pages where it is not used (e.g. WooCommerce off the shop, Contact Form 7 with no form). Conservative, core/jQuery protected, reversible. Test your key pages afterwards.'=>'在未使用某已知插件或主题的页面上自动停止加载其 CSS/JS（例如商店之外的 WooCommerce、没有表单的 Contact Form 7）。保守，核心/jQuery 受保护，可撤销。之后请测试你的关键页面。','Advanced (optional)'=>'高级（可选）','Not part of any preset because they change how the site behaves. Off by default — enable only if they apply to you.'=>'不属于任何预设，因为它们会改变站点行为。默认关闭——仅在适用于你时才启用。','Shrink images and serve modern formats. These feed the optimizer in the Media tab and can be changed anytime.'=>'减小图片体积并提供现代格式。这会作用于“媒体”标签中的优化器，且可随时更改。','Delivers lighter next-gen images, for every image that has a WebP or AVIF copy, with an automatic fallback to the original.'=>'为每张拥有 WebP 或 AVIF 副本的图片提供更轻量的新一代图片，并自动回退到原图。','Delivers lighter next-gen images with an automatic fallback to the original. Generate the copies later from the Image optimization sub-section.'=>'提供更轻量的新一代图片，并自动回退到原图。稍后可在“图片优化”子部分生成副本。','Serve WebP/AVIF on the front-end (recommended).'=>'在前端提供 WebP/AVIF（推荐）。','Optimize new uploads automatically.'=>'自动优化新上传。','Resizes uploads above the max size, recompresses them and strips their metadata; the full-size original is preserved.'=>'缩小超过最大尺寸的上传，重新压缩并去除其元数据；保留全尺寸原图。','Lossless mode.'=>'无损模式。','Do not reduce image quality (smaller savings, no visible change).'=>'不降低图片质量（节省较少，无可见变化）。','Quality and max size'=>'质量和最大尺寸','Conversion quality'=>'转换质量','Max width in pixels'=>'最大宽度（像素）','Max height in pixels'=>'最大高度（像素）','Quality 40–100 (82 is a good balance). 0 on an axis disables resizing.'=>'质量 40–100（82 是不错的平衡）。某一轴为 0 表示不缩放。','All set'=>'一切就绪','Start your first analysis. Your choices are saved when it begins, and everything stays adjustable in Settings.'=>'开始你的首次分析。你的选择会在开始时保存，所有项仍可在设置中调整。','Apply these settings and analyze'=>'应用这些设置并开始分析','Set up later'=>'稍后设置','Your selection is saved and the options you ticked (persistent object cache, query deduplication) are switched on when the analysis starts. You can switch them off again in Speed › Cache.'=>'你的选择已保存，所勾选的选项（持久对象缓存、查询去重）会在分析开始时开启。你可以在“速度 › 缓存”中再次关闭它们。','Back'=>'上一步','Next'=>'下一步','WPOptimizing — Analysis in progress'=>'WPOptimizing — 分析进行中','Starting…'=>'正在开始…','Cancel analysis'=>'取消分析','s remaining'=>'秒剩余','min remaining'=>'分钟剩余','h remaining'=>'小时剩余','Post revisions'=>'文章修订版本','Activity log'=>'活动日志','Everything that changed in WordPress since WPOptimizing was installed: database tables, options, post/user meta keys, scheduled events and top-level plugin/theme/upload files that other plugins add or remove — each with the date and, when the change came from a plugin or theme action, the responsible extension.'=>'自安装 WPOptimizing 以来 WordPress 中发生变化的一切：数据库表、选项、文章/用户元键、计划事件，以及其他插件在 plugins/themes/uploads 下添加或移除的顶层文件 — 每一项都带有日期，并在变更来自插件或主题操作时标注负责的扩展。','No changes recorded yet. WPOptimizing captured a baseline of your site when it was installed; from now on, changes made by plugins and themes (new tables, options, files, scheduled events…) show up here with their date and, when known, who made them.'=>'尚未记录任何变更。WPOptimizing 在安装时捕获了你站点的基线；从现在起，插件和主题所做的变更（新表、选项、文件、计划事件……）会连同日期显示在这里，并在已知时显示由谁所做。','Added'=>'已添加','Removed'=>'已移除','Unknown'=>'未知','Date'=>'日期','Change'=>'变更','Responsible'=>'负责方','All changes'=>'所有变更','Clear the whole activity log? The baseline is kept, so tracking continues from now.'=>'清除整个活动日志？基线会保留，因此将从现在起继续跟踪。','Suggestion accepted: "%1$s" attributed to %2$s. The record was re-evaluated.'=>'建议已接受：“%1$s”已归属到 %2$s。该记录已重新评估。','The suggestion could not be saved (it may already exist).'=>'无法保存该建议（可能已存在）。','The attribution assistant needs data sharing turned on (it sends only identifier names).'=>'归属助手需要开启数据共享（仅发送标识符名称）。','The assistant returned no suggestions (the service may be unreachable). Nothing was changed.'=>'助手未返回任何建议（服务可能无法访问）。未做任何更改。','Check the owner shown for these records against the shared knowledge base before you delete anything. A record whose owner does not match is flagged, and you decide: accepting a suggestion creates a manual attribution rule. Nothing is deleted here.'=>'在删除任何内容之前，请将这些记录显示的归属与共享数据集核对。归属不一致的记录会被标出，由你决定：接受建议会创建一条手动归属规则。这里不会删除任何内容。','After each analysis, the owners the shared knowledge base gives with certainty are applied on their own. Ask here about the rest: confirm a suggestion with Accept, or all the sure ones at once, and it becomes a manual attribution rule. Nothing is deleted.'=>'每次分析后，共享知识库能确定的归属者会自动应用。其余的可在此询问：用“接受”确认某条建议，或一次性接受所有确定的建议，它就会成为一条手动归属规则。不会删除任何内容。','Turn on data sharing to use the assistant (only identifier names are sent).'=>'开启数据共享即可使用该助手（仅发送标识符名称）。','Check these owners'=>'核对这些归属','Suggest owners'=>'推荐归属','It belongs to the shared library "%s", which several plugins carry inside: there is no single owner.'=>'它属于共享库「%s」，多个插件都把它打包在内：没有唯一归属。','Exact match with a single owner in the shared knowledge base.'=>'在共享数据集中与唯一归属精确匹配。','Exact match: the record is in the namespace of "%s", and the others only read it.'=>'精确匹配：该记录位于「%s」的命名空间内，其他插件只是读取它。','%d plugins use it and none is clearly its owner, so no owner is proposed. Using a record is not owning it.'=>'有 %d 个插件在使用它，没有一个明确是它的归属，因此不提出归属。使用一条记录并不等于拥有它。','No exact match, but the prefix belongs to a single owner.'=>'没有精确匹配，但该前缀属于唯一归属。','A specific prefix of a single owner. A hint to confirm, not a certainty.'=>'某个唯一归属的特定前缀。这是待确认的线索，不是定论。','Only prefixes shared by several owners: too weak to propose anyone.'=>'只有多个归属共用的前缀：太弱，无法提出任何归属。','Ambiguous'=>'有歧义','No data'=>'无数据','Record'=>'记录','Verdict'=>'判定','Shown now'=>'当前显示','Suggested owner'=>'建议的所有者','Why'=>'原因','Action'=>'操作','— does not match'=>'— 不一致','Accept'=>'接受','review manually'=>'手动检查','Autoload analyzer unavailable.'=>'自动加载分析器不可用。','Acceptable'=>'可接受','Autoloaded options'=>'自动加载的选项','Autoloaded options load into memory on every request. Keeping their total weight low keeps the site fast — under ~800 KB is healthy.'=>'自动加载选项会在每次请求时载入内存。保持它们的总权重较低可让网站保持快速 — 低于约 800 KB 即为健康。','Total weight'=>'总权重','Crowd-confirmed'=>'众包确认','Health'=>'健康状况','No autoloaded options found.'=>'未找到自动加载选项。','Autoloaded'=>'已自动加载','Disabling autoload keeps the option but stops loading it on every page (reversible). Smart Deactivation does this automatically for options confidently identified as belonging to uninstalled extensions.'=>'禁用自动加载会保留选项，但不再在每个页面加载它（可逆）。智能停用会自动对确认属于已卸载扩展的选项执行此操作。','Core'=>'核心','Attributed'=>'已归属','Search options'=>'搜索选项','Smart Deactivation will turn off autoload for every option confidently identified as belonging to an uninstalled extension. This is reversible. Continue?'=>'智能停用将对每个确认属于已卸载扩展的选项关闭自动加载。此操作可逆。是否继续？','Aggressive Deactivation turns off autoload for EVERY option that is not core and not from an installed extension — including the unidentified ones. Options the community reads on most requests are kept. Nothing is deleted and it is fully reversible. Continue?'=>'激进式停用会关闭所有既不属于核心也不属于已安装扩展的选项的自动加载，包括未识别的选项。社区在大多数请求中读取的选项会被保留。不会删除任何内容，且完全可恢复。是否继续？','Disable all non-essential'=>'关闭所有非必要项','Surgical Deactivation turns off autoload only for options that load on every request but are (almost) never read — measured on your own site and confirmed across the network. Nothing is deleted and it is fully reversible. Continue?'=>'精准停用仅对每次请求都加载却（几乎）从不读取的选项关闭自动加载——在你自己的站点上测量并在整个网络中确认。不会删除任何内容，且完全可撤销。是否继续？','De-autoload never-read (%d)'=>'取消从不读取项的自动加载 (%d)','De-autoload never-read'=>'取消从不读取项的自动加载','Delete the autoloaded options confidently identified as belonging to uninstalled extensions? Nothing installed uses them any more, but they keep that extension\'s settings if you reinstall it. A backup is created first. Continue?'=>'删除已确切识别为属于已卸载扩展的自动加载选项吗？已安装的内容都不再使用它们，但它们保存着该扩展的设置，以便你重新安装时使用。会先创建备份。是否继续？','Delete confirmed orphans (backup first)'=>'删除已确认的孤立项（先备份）','Disable all'=>'全部禁用','Disabling autoload keeps the option but stops loading it on every page (reversible). Open “Advanced autoload cleanup” for the smart, never-read, non-essential and delete-orphans helpers.'=>'停用自动加载会保留选项，但不再在每个页面上加载它（可撤销）。打开「高级自动加载清理」以使用智能、从不读取、非必要和删除孤立项等助手。','Disable autoload for the %d selected option(s)? This is reversible.'=>'对所选的 %d 个选项禁用自动加载？此操作可逆。','Disable autoload for ALL %d filtered option(s)? This is reversible.'=>'对全部 %d 个已筛选选项禁用自动加载？此操作可逆。','WPOptimizing measures how often each non-autoloaded option is actually read on each request. Options read on most requests but not autoloaded are real candidates for autoloading — no guessing.'=>'WPOptimizing 会测量每个非自动加载选项在每次请求中实际被读取的频率。在大多数请求中被读取但未设为自动加载的选项才是真正的自动加载候选项 — 无需猜测。','Measuring automatically'=>'正在自动测量','%1$s requests sampled over %2$s.'=>'在 %2$s 内采样了 %1$s 次请求。','Warming up — let normal traffic flow for a little while.'=>'正在预热 — 请让正常流量持续一段时间。','Measurement is continuous and refreshes itself roughly once a month. This data also helps improve autoload recommendations across the WPOptimizing network.'=>'测量是持续进行的，大约每月自动刷新一次。这些数据还有助于改善整个 WPOptimizing 网络的自动加载推荐。','Clear the measured data and start a fresh measurement window?'=>'清除已测量的数据并开始新的测量窗口？','Reset measurement'=>'重置测量','Measuring automatically — candidates appear once enough requests have been sampled.'=>'正在自动测量 — 采样足够的请求后将出现候选项。','No options qualify: every option read on most requests is already autoloaded. Nothing to do — that is good news.'=>'没有符合条件的选项：在大多数请求中被读取的每个选项都已自动加载。无需操作 — 这是好消息。','Smart Activation will enable autoload for every option read on almost every request and small enough to be safe. This is reversible. Continue?'=>'智能启用会为几乎每次请求都会读取且足够小、可安全处理的每个选项启用自动加载。此操作可撤销。是否继续？','Enable autoload for selected'=>'对所选项目启用自动加载','Smart Activation'=>'智能启用','Manage backups created before cleanups. You can create a manual backup, restore one, or delete old backups.'=>'管理清理前创建的备份。你可以创建手动备份、还原或删除旧备份。','No backups available.'=>'没有可用的备份。','item' . "\0" . 'items'=>'项目','Restore this backup? It replaces the current data with the saved copy.'=>'恢复此备份？它会用已保存的副本替换当前数据。','Delete this backup permanently?'=>'永久删除此备份？','Last updated %s'=>'上次更新 %s','Operation'=>'操作','Contents'=>'内容','All operations'=>'所有操作','Cleanup (deletion)'=>'清理（删除）','Manual backup'=>'手动备份','Scheduled cleanup'=>'计划清理','Duplicate media removal'=>'删除重复媒体','Unused media removal'=>'删除未使用的媒体','Autoload change'=>'自动加载修改','Background transient sweep'=>'后台瞬态清扫','Scheduled task run now'=>'立即运行计划任务','Plugin or theme uninstall'=>'卸载插件或主题','.htaccess change'=>'.htaccess 修改','wp-config.php change'=>'wp-config.php 修改','Thumbnail regeneration'=>'重新生成缩略图','Backup'=>'备份','Details'=>'详情','Includes:'=>'包含：','(+%d more)'=>'（还有 %d 个）','Front-end settings saved.'=>'前端设置已保存。','The restore finished, but %d item could not be written back. Check the permissions of the backup folder and of wp-content, then restore again.' . "\0" . 'The restore finished, but %d items could not be written back. Check the permissions of the backup folder and of wp-content, then restore again.'=>'恢复已完成，但有 %d 个项目无法写回。请检查备份文件夹和 wp-content 的权限，然后重新恢复。','Backup created.'=>'已创建备份。','Test report sent to the notification address.'=>'测试报告已发送至通知地址。','Could not send the test report — check the notification email and that a scan has run.'=>'无法发送测试报告——请检查通知邮箱以及是否已运行过扫描。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','another plugin'=>'另一个插件','wp-content/%1$s belongs to %2$s. WPOptimizing will not overwrite it unless you choose to replace it.'=>'wp-content/%1$s 属于 %2$s。除非您选择替换，否则 WPOptimizing 不会覆盖它。','wp-content/%s could not be copied aside, so it was left in place.'=>'无法另存 wp-content/%s 的副本，因此保留原样。','%s is active and serves its own page cache. Use its cache, or deactivate it first: two page caches on the same pages fight each other.'=>'%s 已启用并提供自己的页面缓存。请使用它的缓存，或先停用它：同一页面上的两个页面缓存会互相冲突。','%s is active and provides the object cache. Use it, or deactivate it first if you prefer WPOptimizing’s.'=>'%s 已启用并提供对象缓存。请使用它，或者如果您更喜欢 WPOptimizing 的对象缓存，请先停用它。','The db.php of %s routes the connection to the database itself; replacing it could leave the site without a database. WPOptimizing will not touch it.'=>'%s 的 db.php 自行路由数据库连接；替换它可能导致网站无法连接数据库。WPOptimizing 不会动它。','%1$s The drop-in of %2$s that it had replaced is back in place.'=>'%1$s 之前被替换的 %2$s 的 drop-in 已恢复原位。','Managed by another plugin'=>'由其他插件管理','wp-content/%s belongs to another plugin, which could not be identified.'=>'wp-content/%s 属于另一个无法识别的插件。','wp-content/%1$s belongs to %2$s, which is active.'=>'wp-content/%1$s 属于 %2$s，该插件已启用。','wp-content/%1$s belongs to %2$s, which is no longer active: it is a leftover.'=>'wp-content/%1$s 属于 %2$s，该插件已不再启用：这是残留文件。','wp-content/%1$s belongs to %2$s.'=>'wp-content/%1$s 属于 %2$s。','WPOptimizing can take its place: the current %1$s is kept and put back when you disable this. Meanwhile, whatever %2$s does with that file stops.'=>'WPOptimizing 可以取代它：当前的 %1$s 会被保存，并在您停用此功能时恢复。在此期间，%2$s 对该文件的用途将停止工作。','the other plugin'=>'另一个插件','Replace with WPOptimizing’s'=>'替换为 WPOptimizing 的','You do not have permission to manage the object cache.'=>'你没有管理对象缓存的权限。','The object cache template is missing from the plugin.'=>'插件中缺少对象缓存模板。','Could not write wp-content/object-cache.php. Check filesystem permissions.'=>'无法写入 wp-content/object-cache.php。请检查文件系统权限。','Persistent object cache enabled.'=>'已启用持久对象缓存。','The active object cache drop-in is not managed by WPOptimizing; it was left untouched.'=>'当前活动的对象缓存 drop-in 不由 WPOptimizing 管理；已保持原样未做改动。','Persistent object cache disabled.'=>'已禁用持久对象缓存。','The query-deduplication template is missing from the plugin.'=>'插件中缺少查询去重模板。','Could not write wp-content/db.php. Check filesystem permissions.'=>'无法写入 wp-content/db.php。请检查文件系统权限。','Query deduplication enabled.'=>'已启用查询去重。','The active database drop-in is not managed by WPOptimizing; it was left untouched.'=>'当前活动的数据库 drop-in 不由 WPOptimizing 管理；已保持原样未做改动。','Query deduplication disabled.'=>'已禁用查询去重。','Only a network administrator can flush the object cache: on a network it is shared by every site.'=>'只有网络管理员才能清空对象缓存：在多站点网络中，它由所有站点共享。','Object cache flushed.'=>'对象缓存已清空。','Could not flush the object cache.'=>'无法清空对象缓存。','Cache settings saved.'=>'缓存设置已保存。','The Cloudflare token has been removed. Cloudflare is no longer purged.'=>'已删除 Cloudflare 令牌。不再清除 Cloudflare 缓存。','That is the Global API Key, not an API token. It opens your whole Cloudflare account, so it is not saved: create a token with only the Zone › Cache Purge › Purge permission (see “How to get them”).'=>'这是 Global API Key，而不是 API 令牌。它能打开你的整个 Cloudflare 账户，因此不会保存：请创建一个仅具有“区域 › 缓存清除 › 清除”权限的令牌（见“如何获取”）。','That is not a Cloudflare zone ID: it is a 32-character code shown on the zone\'s Overview page.'=>'这不是 Cloudflare 区域 ID：它是显示在区域“概述”页面上的 32 位代码。','Cloudflare settings saved. Add the zone ID and an API token to start purging.'=>'Cloudflare 设置已保存。添加区域 ID 和 API 令牌即可开始清除。','Cloudflare connected: the home page was purged as a test.'=>'Cloudflare 已连接：已清除首页作为测试。','Settings saved, but Cloudflare refused the test purge: %s'=>'设置已保存，但 Cloudflare 拒绝了测试清除：%s','How to get them'=>'如何获取','Cloudflare: zone ID and API token'=>'Cloudflare：区域 ID 和 API 令牌','Zone ID'=>'区域 ID','In Cloudflare, open your domain. On the Overview page, the “API” box on the right shows the Zone ID: copy it into the first field.'=>'在 Cloudflare 中打开你的域名。在“概述”页面右侧的“API”框中可以看到区域 ID：将其复制到第一个字段。','API token'=>'API 令牌','Go to My Profile › API Tokens › Create token, and choose “Create custom token”.'=>'前往 我的个人资料 › API 令牌 › 创建令牌，然后选择“创建自定义令牌”。','Under Permissions, one line:'=>'在“权限”中添加一行：','Zone'=>'区域','Cache Purge'=>'缓存清除','Purge'=>'清除','To also cache the pages at Cloudflare, a second line:'=>'若也要在 Cloudflare 缓存页面，添加第二行：','Cache Rules'=>'Cache Rules','Edit'=>'编辑','Under Zone Resources:'=>'在“区域资源”中：','Include'=>'包括','Specific zone'=>'特定区域','Or “All zones” to use the same token on every site of the account: it can then purge any of them, and nothing else.'=>'或选择“所有区域”，以便在账户的所有站点上使用同一个令牌：它可以清除其中任何一个站点的缓存，除此之外什么也做不了。','Continue to summary › Create token. Cloudflare shows the token only once: paste it into the second field and save.'=>'继续以显示摘要 › 创建令牌。Cloudflare 只显示一次令牌：将其粘贴到第二个字段并保存。','Do not use the Global API Key: it opens your whole account, and WPOptimizing refuses it.'=>'不要使用 Global API Key：它能打开你的整个账户，WPOptimizing 会拒绝它。','This site is served through Cloudflare and it is not being purged yet.'=>'本站通过 Cloudflare 提供服务，但尚未对其进行清除。','If your site is behind Cloudflare, WPOptimizing purges its cache too: everything when it flushes the other caches, and only the affected pages when content changes. It needs the zone ID and an API token.'=>'如果你的站点位于 Cloudflare 之后，WPOptimizing 也会清除其缓存：在清空其他缓存时全部清除，内容变化时只清除受影响的页面。需要区域 ID 和 API 令牌。','Your domain’s Overview page, under “API” on the right.'=>'你域名的“概述”页面，右侧“API”下。','Saved — leave empty to keep it'=>'已保存——留空以保留','An API token with the Zone › Cache Purge › Purge permission, not the Global API Key. Stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'具有“区域 › 缓存清除 › 清除”权限的 API 令牌，而不是 Global API Key。加密保存，不再显示。','When to purge'=>'何时清除','Purge everything when WPOptimizing flushes caches (after a cleanup and from “Flush all caches”)'=>'WPOptimizing 清空缓存时清除全部（清理之后以及通过“清空所有缓存”）','Purge the affected pages when a post, page or comment changes'=>'文章、页面或评论变化时清除受影响的页面','everything'=>'全部','Last purge'=>'上次清除','%1$s — %2$s, confirmed by Cloudflare'=>'%1$s — %2$s，Cloudflare 已确认','%1$s — failed: %2$s'=>'%1$s — 失败：%2$s','Cloudflare did not accept the credential. It must be an API token with the Zone › Cache Purge › Purge permission; the Global API Key does not work here.'=>'Cloudflare 未接受该凭据。必须是具有“区域 › 缓存清除 › 清除”权限的 API 令牌；Global API Key 在这里不可用。','Save and test Cloudflare'=>'保存并测试 Cloudflare','Remove token'=>'删除令牌','Cloudflare does not keep HTML by default. This adds a Cache Rule to your zone so it does, for anonymous visitors only, and each page tells the edge whether it may be kept: the pages the page cache would store, for as long as it would keep them. Logged-in users, carts, searches, 404s and any page that sets a cookie always reach your server. Your own cache rules are not touched. The token needs one more permission: Zone › Cache Rules › Edit.'=>'Cloudflare 默认不保存 HTML。此功能会在你的区域中添加一条缓存规则让它保存，仅针对匿名访客，并且每个页面会告诉边缘节点能否保存：页面缓存会保存的页面，保存时长与页面缓存相同。已登录用户、购物车、搜索、404 以及任何设置 cookie 的页面都始终到达你的服务器。不会改动你自己的缓存规则。令牌还需要一项权限：区域 › Cache Rules › 编辑。','Check now'=>'立即检查','Turn off and empty the edge'=>'关闭并清空边缘缓存','Turn on and check it'=>'开启并检查','The rule was removed and the edge emptied: %s'=>'规则已删除，边缘缓存已清空：%s','The check could not reach the site through Cloudflare from this server, so the rule was not left on: an untested rule is not worth the risk.'=>'检查无法从此服务器经由 Cloudflare 访问站点，因此没有保留该规则：未经测试的规则不值得冒险。','Cloudflare served a cached page to a request with a session cookie or to the login page, so the rule was removed and the edge emptied. Nothing else was changed.'=>'Cloudflare 把缓存的页面提供给了带会话 cookie 的请求或登录页，因此已移除规则并清空边缘缓存。其他内容未作更改。','Checked: the home page is served from Cloudflare\'s edge, and requests with a session cookie and the login page reach your server.'=>'已检查：首页由 Cloudflare 边缘提供，带会话 cookie 的请求和登录页会到达你的服务器。','Checked: requests with a session cookie and the login page reach your server, but the home page was not served from the edge yet. That is normal while it fills, and also when the page cache would not store the home page.'=>'已检查：带会话 cookie 的请求和登录页会到达你的服务器，但首页尚未由边缘提供。在填充期间这很正常，页面缓存不会保存首页时也是如此。','Turned off here, but Cloudflare refused to delete the rule: %s. Delete the WPOptimizing rule in Caching › Cache Rules.'=>'此处已关闭，但 Cloudflare 拒绝删除规则：%s。请在 缓存 › Cache Rules 中删除 WPOptimizing 规则。','Pages are no longer cached at Cloudflare: the rule was removed and the edge emptied.'=>'页面不再在 Cloudflare 缓存：已移除规则并清空边缘缓存。','Cloudflare refused to create the rule: %s. The token needs the Zone › Cache Rules › Edit permission.'=>'Cloudflare 拒绝创建规则：%s。令牌需要 区域 › Cache Rules › 编辑 权限。','You do not have permission to manage the page cache.'=>'您无权管理页面缓存。','Page cache enabled.'=>'页面缓存已启用。','The page cache is not available on a multisite network: it cannot yet purge each site\'s pages separately.'=>'多站点网络中无法使用页面缓存：它目前还不能分别清除每个站点的页面。','An advanced-cache.php from another plugin is already active. WPOptimizing will not overwrite it.'=>'已有其他插件的 advanced-cache.php 在运行。WPOptimizing 不会覆盖它。','The other advanced-cache.php could not be copied aside, so it was left in place.'=>'无法另存另一个 advanced-cache.php 的副本，因此保留原样。','Another page cache is active (%s). Disable it before enabling ours.'=>'另一个页面缓存正在运行 (%s)。请先停用它再启用我们的。','Could not edit wp-config.php to define WP_CACHE. Check file permissions.'=>'无法编辑 wp-config.php 来定义 WP_CACHE。请检查文件权限。','Could not install advanced-cache.php. Check wp-content permissions.'=>'无法安装 advanced-cache.php。请检查 wp-content 权限。','Page cache disabled.'=>'页面缓存已停用。','Page cache cleared.'=>'页面缓存已清除。','You do not have permission to manage the browser cache.'=>'您无权管理浏览器缓存。','Browser cache and compression enabled.'=>'浏览器缓存与压缩已启用。','Browser cache and compression disabled.'=>'浏览器缓存与压缩已停用。','Could not write .htaccess. Check file permissions.'=>'无法写入 .htaccess。请检查文件权限。','Could not update .htaccess.'=>'无法更新 .htaccess。','No cache found in front of the site.'=>'网站前面没有发现缓存。','Found in front of the site: %s.'=>'网站前面有：%s。','Page cache settings saved.'=>'页面缓存设置已保存。','%s page queued for preloading.' . "\0" . '%s pages queued for preloading.'=>'已将 %s 个页面加入预加载队列。','Speed up the admin and the front end with a persistent object cache and per-request query deduplication — safe, reversible and free. Full-page HTML caching is available too, but it is opt-in and off by default, so nothing ever serves a stale page unless you turn it on.'=>'通过持久化对象缓存和每次请求的查询去重来加速后台和前台——安全、可撤销且免费。也提供整页 HTML 缓存，但需手动开启、默认关闭，因此除非您启用，否则绝不会提供过期页面。','This site is served through Cloudflare, which keeps its own copy of your pages and files. Connect it so WPOptimizing purges it along with the other caches.'=>'本站通过 Cloudflare 提供服务，它会保留您页面和文件的副本。连接它，让 WPOptimizing 与其他缓存一起清除它。','Set up Cloudflare'=>'设置 Cloudflare','A persistent object cache stores the results of expensive database queries in memory (or on disk). It uses your server cache (Redis or Memcached) when available, APCu if you choose it, and a self-contained SQLite store otherwise.'=>'持久对象缓存将开销较大的数据库查询结果存储在内存（或磁盘）中。可用时使用你服务器的缓存（Redis 或 Memcached），选择后可使用 APCu，否则使用自包含的 SQLite 存储。','Not active'=>'未启用','Active backend'=>'活动后端','Available backends'=>'可用后端','Hits / misses (this request)'=>'命中 / 未命中（本次请求）','%1$s hits · %2$s misses · %3$d%% hit rate'=>'%1$s 次命中 · %2$s 次未命中 · 命中率 %3$d%%','Detected page caches'=>'检测到的页面缓存','WPOptimizing detects your host or plugin page cache and purges it automatically after a cleanup (and from the toolbar “Flush all caches”), so visitors never see stale content. Its own page cache, in this tab, is optional and does not run alongside another one.'=>'WPOptimizing 会检测你的主机或插件的页面缓存，并在清理后（以及通过工具栏的“清除所有缓存”按钮）自动清除，使访客永远不会看到过期内容。它自带的页面缓存位于此标签页，为可选功能，且不会与其他页面缓存同时运行。','Integration'=>'集成','Auto-purges on changes'=>'更改时自动清除','Purged after cleanup and from the toolbar'=>'清理后及从工具栏清除','A newer version of the object cache drop-in is available. Update to get the latest fixes and backends.'=>'对象缓存 drop-in 有更新版本可用。请更新以获取最新修复和后端。','Only a network administrator can enable or disable the object cache on this multisite network.'=>'在此多站点网络中，只有网络管理员才能启用或禁用对象缓存。','Update drop-in'=>'更新 drop-in','Disable object cache'=>'禁用对象缓存','Flush cache now'=>'立即清空缓存','Enable object cache'=>'启用对象缓存','Serves a static HTML copy of each page to anonymous visitors, so most requests never boot WordPress — the single biggest speed win. Opt-in and off by default: logged-in users, carts, checkout, admin, feeds and any dynamic request are never cached, and the cache is purged automatically whenever content changes.'=>'向匿名访客提供每个页面的静态 HTML 副本，因此大多数请求根本不会启动 WordPress——这是最大的速度提升。默认关闭、需手动开启：已登录用户、购物车、结账、后台、订阅源以及任何动态请求都不会被缓存，且内容变更时缓存会自动清除。','WP_CACHE constant'=>'WP_CACHE 常量','Defined'=>'已定义','Not defined'=>'未定义','Another page cache is active: %s. Disable it before enabling ours to avoid two caches fighting over the same page.'=>'另一个页面缓存正在运行：%s。请先停用它再启用我们的，以免两个缓存争夺同一页面。','Only a network administrator can manage the page cache on this multisite network.'=>'在此多站点网络中，只有网络管理员才能管理页面缓存。','Disable page cache'=>'停用页面缓存','Clear page cache now'=>'立即清除页面缓存','Enable page cache'=>'启用页面缓存','Rebuilds the cached pages in the background after they are cleared, so the next visitor gets the fast copy instead of waiting for WordPress. It visits a few pages at a time and waits while the server is busy.'=>'在缓存被清除后于后台重建页面，让下一位访客直接获得快速副本，而不必等待 WordPress。每次只访问少量页面，服务器繁忙时会等待。','Pages waiting'=>'等待中的页面','Last run'=>'上次运行','%1$s (%2$s page)' . "\0" . '%1$s (%2$s pages)'=>'%1$s（%2$s 个页面）','Rebuild pages automatically after they are cleared'=>'清除后自动重建页面','Preload now'=>'立即预加载','Extra rules on top of the automatic ones (which can never be removed). One entry per line.'=>'在自动规则（永不可移除）之外的额外规则。每行一条。','Never cache these URL paths'=>'绝不缓存这些 URL 路径','e.g. /my-dynamic-page/'=>'例如 /my-dynamic-page/','Never cache when these cookies are present'=>'存在这些 Cookie 时绝不缓存','cookie name fragment, e.g. my_membership_'=>'Cookie 名称片段，例如 my_membership_','Still cache with these query parameters'=>'带有这些查询参数时仍然缓存','parameter name, e.g. currency'=>'参数名称，例如 currency','Mobile devices'=>'移动设备','Turn this on only if your theme shows phones a different page, for example another menu or fewer sections. Pages are then cached twice, once for phones and once for computers.'=>'仅当你的主题在手机上显示不同的页面（例如不同的菜单或更少的区块）时才启用。页面将被缓存两次：一次用于手机，一次用于电脑。','Separate cache for mobile devices'=>'为移动设备单独缓存','Save settings'=>'保存设置','Custom page-cache exclusions (URLs, cookies and query strings) and a separate cache for mobile devices are not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含页面缓存的自定义排除规则（URL、Cookie 和查询参数）以及独立的移动设备缓存。','Pro adds custom exclusions (URLs, cookies and query strings) and a separate cache for mobile devices.'=>'Pro 版增加自定义排除规则（URL、Cookie 和查询参数）以及独立的移动设备缓存。','The caches outside WordPress: the ones your host or CDN keeps in front of the site, and the copies of your files that visitors’ browsers keep.'=>'WordPress 之外的缓存：你的主机或 CDN 在网站前面保存的缓存，以及访客浏览器保存的你的文件副本。','Your host or CDN may keep its own copy of each page, which a WordPress plugin cannot see from the inside. This asks for your home page as a visitor and reads what each layer says about itself.'=>'你的主机或 CDN 可能会保存每个页面的自有副本，WordPress 插件从内部看不到它。此检查以访客身份请求你的首页，并读取每一层对自身的说明。','No cache in front of the site: every visit reaches your server.'=>'网站前面没有缓存：每次访问都会到达你的服务器。','Present'=>'存在','Serving from its cache'=>'正在从其缓存提供','Present, not serving this page from cache'=>'存在，但此页面未从缓存提供','Checked %s ago.'=>'%s前检查。','Varnish is purged by Proxy Cache Purge, so WPOptimizing leaves it to it.'=>'Varnish 由 Proxy Cache Purge 清除，因此 WPOptimizing 交由它处理。','Purge Varnish when content changes and when all caches are flushed'=>'内容变化及清空所有缓存时清除 Varnish','Sends PURGE requests for the pages a change makes stale. Varnish only accepts them when its configuration allows PURGE from this server, which hosts that run Varnish usually set up.'=>'为因更改而过期的页面发送 PURGE 请求。只有当 Varnish 配置允许来自此服务器的 PURGE 时才会接受，使用 Varnish 的主机通常已设置好。','Check again'=>'再次检查','Tells returning visitors’ browsers to reuse your CSS, JS, images and fonts instead of re-downloading them, and serves everything GZIP/Brotli-compressed. Adds a managed, reversible block to .htaccess (Apache/LiteSpeed).'=>'告诉回访者的浏览器重复使用您的 CSS、JS、图片和字体，而不是重新下载，并以 GZIP/Brotli 压缩方式提供所有内容。会在 .htaccess 中添加一个受管理、可撤销的规则块（Apache/LiteSpeed）。','Your server does not use .htaccess (e.g. Nginx). Add equivalent expires and gzip rules to your server config instead.'=>'您的服务器不使用 .htaccess（例如 Nginx）。请改在服务器配置中添加等效的 expires 和 gzip 规则。','Disable browser cache'=>'停用浏览器缓存','Enable browser cache & compression'=>'启用浏览器缓存与压缩','Cache analytics'=>'缓存分析','Hit/miss ratio, query metrics and the most-duplicated queries, aggregated per day over the last 30 days.'=>'命中/未命中率、查询指标以及重复最多的查询，按天聚合，涵盖最近 30 天。','No analytics yet — figures appear after some traffic flows through the cache.'=>'暂无分析数据——在一些流量经过缓存后才会出现数字。','Overall hit rate'=>'总体命中率','Improvable'=>'可改善','High'=>'高','Time WordPress takes to start sending the page — the server share of TTFB (not the visitor network).'=>'WordPress 开始发送页面所需的时间——TTFB 中服务器的部分（不含访客网络）。','Open the Performance report'=>'打开性能报告','Requests sampled'=>'采样的请求','Total hits / misses'=>'总命中 / 未命中','Duplicate queries avoided'=>'已避免的重复查询','%1$s of %2$s read queries'=>'%2$s 条读取查询中的 %1$s 条','Read queries by type'=>'按类型统计的读取查询','Slow queries (>50 ms)'=>'慢查询（>50 毫秒）','Total query time'=>'查询总时间','%s s'=>'%s 秒','Duplicate queries by source'=>'按来源统计的重复查询','Source'=>'来源','Per-day trend'=>'每日趋势','Requests'=>'请求','Installs a db.php drop-in that returns the cached result of identical read queries within the same request (admin and front end), so the same query never hits MySQL twice. Any write clears it immediately, so results are never stale.'=>'安装一个 db.php drop-in，在同一次请求内（后台和前台）返回相同读取查询的缓存结果，使同一查询不会两次访问 MySQL。任何写入都会立即清除它，因此结果绝不会过期。','Only a network administrator can manage this on a multisite network.'=>'在多站点网络中，只有网络管理员才能管理此项。','Query deduplication is active.'=>'查询去重已启用。','Disable query deduplication'=>'禁用查询去重','Enable query deduplication'=>'启用查询去重','Most duplicated queries'=>'重复最多的查询','“Times” is the highest number of times a single page load repeated the exact same read (deduplication collapses them to one hit on MySQL). It is a rolling peak recorded over time, not a fixed window. “Source” is the plugin, theme or WordPress core that fired the query.'=>'“次数”是单次页面加载重复同一读取的最高次数（去重将其合并为对 MySQL 的一次访问）。这是随时间记录的峰值，并非固定时间窗口。“来源”是发起该查询的插件、主题或 WordPress 核心。','Times'=>'次','Query'=>'查询','Cache settings'=>'缓存设置','Choose the cache backend (and the Redis/Memcached connection), plus safe admin-side optimizations.'=>'选择缓存后端（以及 Redis/Memcached 连接）以及安全的后台优化。','Backend'=>'后端','Auto picks the fastest available backend: Redis, then Memcached, then SQLite. APCu is only used when chosen here, and never from WP-CLI or a system cron, which cannot see its memory.'=>'“自动”会选择可用的最快后端：Redis，其次 Memcached，最后 SQLite。只有在此处选择时才会使用 APCu，并且绝不会在 WP-CLI 或系统 cron 中使用，因为它们看不到其内存。','Auto (recommended)'=>'自动（推荐）','not available'=>'不可用','Redis host / port'=>'Redis 主机 / 端口','Redis password'=>'Redis 密码','Redis database'=>'Redis 数据库','Numeric index (0–255). Leave 0 unless your Redis uses a dedicated database.'=>'数字索引（0–255）。除非你的 Redis 使用专用数据库，否则保持为 0。','Memcached host / port'=>'Memcached 主机 / 端口','Admin optimizations'=>'后台优化','Safe admin-side speedups. These never cache full admin pages (which would break security tokens).'=>'安全的后台加速。它们绝不缓存完整的后台页面（那会破坏安全令牌）。','Cache dashboard comment counts (At a Glance / menu bubble). Refreshed instantly when comments change.'=>'缓存仪表盘评论计数（概览/菜单气泡）。评论变化时立即刷新。','Heartbeat (admin background polling):'=>'Heartbeat（后台轮询）：','Default'=>'默认','Slow (every 60 s)'=>'慢速（每 60 秒）','Off outside the editor'=>'在编辑器之外关闭','Heartbeat powers autosave and edit locks via admin-ajax.php. Slowing it reduces server load; turning it off stops it everywhere except the editor, where autosave and edit locks keep working.'=>'Heartbeat 通过 admin-ajax.php 负责自动保存和编辑锁定。降低频率可减轻服务器负载；关闭后它会在除编辑器以外的所有地方停止，编辑器中的自动保存和编辑锁定仍然有效。','Save cache settings'=>'保存缓存设置','Must-use plugin'=>'必用插件','Plugin: %s'=>'插件：%s','Theme: %s'=>'主题：%s','None (per-request only)'=>'无（仅限单次请求）','installed'=>'已安装','Use “%s” as a plugin slug'=>'将“%s”用作插件 slug','Use “%s” as a theme slug'=>'将“%s”用作主题 slug','Tell WPOptimizing who really owns an item when the automatic attribution is wrong or missing. Use “contains” for a family of items (e.g. wysija → MailPoet) or “exact” for one specific value, and pick one or more owners (e.g. MailPoet and MailPoet Premium). Your rule takes priority and the item moves to In use, Inactive or Orphans by whether the owner is installed.'=>'当自动归属有误或缺失时，告诉 WPOptimizing 某个项目的真正所有者。对一组项目使用“包含”（例如 wysija → MailPoet），对某个具体值使用“精确”，并选择一个或多个所有者（例如 MailPoet 和 MailPoet Premium）。你的规则优先，项目会根据所有者是否已安装而移动到“使用中”、“未激活”或“孤立”。','Selected rows'=>'所选行','Clear'=>'清除','These rows will be attributed (exact) to the owner(s) you pick below.'=>'这些行将（精确）归属到下方选择的所有者。','Match type'=>'匹配类型','Contains'=>'包含','Exact value'=>'精确值','Text to match'=>'要匹配的文本','text to match (e.g. wysija)'=>'要匹配的文本（例如 wysija）','Owner(s): search installed, wp.org or KB — or type a slug'=>'所有者：搜索已安装、wp.org 或知识库——或输入 slug','Owners'=>'所有者','Type for a typed owner'=>'手动输入所有者的类型','Add rule'=>'添加规则','All owners'=>'所有所有者','Select at least one row first.'=>'请先至少选择一行。','Pick at least one row or type a value to match first.'=>'请先选择至少一行，或输入要匹配的值。','Choose at least one owner for the rule.'=>'请为该规则至少选择一个所有者。','Attribution rule removed; the affected items were re-evaluated.'=>'已删除归属规则；受影响的项目已重新评估。','That attribution rule no longer exists; nothing was removed.'=>'该归属规则已不存在，未删除任何内容。','%s manual attribution saved; the affected items were re-attributed.' . "\0" . '%s manual attributions saved; the affected items were re-attributed.'=>'已保存 %s 条手动归属；受影响的项目已重新归属。','Sharing is off, so this hint stays on your site. Turn on data sharing to improve automatic attribution for everyone — and receive the shared dataset in return.'=>'共享已关闭，因此该提示仅保留在你的站点。开启数据共享可改善所有人的自动归因——并作为回报获得共享数据集。','No rules were added. Provide a value to match and at least one owner, and check the rule does not already exist.'=>'未添加任何规则。请提供要匹配的值和至少一个所有者，并确认该规则尚不存在。','These database entries could not be attributed to any installed or known extension. They may belong to a plugin not yet in the manifest database. Review them manually before taking any action.'=>'这些数据库条目无法归因于任何已安装或已知的扩展。它们可能属于尚未在清单数据库中的插件。在采取任何操作之前请手动检查。','No unattributed records — everything WPOptimizing found is confidently attributed to an extension or to WordPress core.'=>'没有未归因的记录——WPOptimizing 找到的一切都已可靠归因到某个扩展或 WordPress 核心。','These files could not be attributed to any installed or known extension. They may belong to a plugin not yet in the manifest database. Review them manually before taking any action.'=>'这些文件无法归因于任何已安装或已知的扩展。它们可能属于尚未在清单数据库中的插件。在采取任何操作之前请手动检查。','Database entries whose stored value is empty (NULL, an empty string, or an empty serialized/JSON structure). A grouped meta key is listed only when EVERY one of its records is empty, never when only some are. The Status column shows whether each one is To identify, Orphan, Inactive or In use. Records owned by an active extension or by WordPress core are read-only: they may be empty on purpose.'=>'存储值为空的数据库条目（NULL、空字符串，或空的序列化/JSON 结构）。分组的元数据键只有在其所有记录都为空时才会列出，绝不会在仅有部分为空时出现。状态列显示每条记录是待识别、孤立、未启用还是使用中。属于已启用扩展或 WordPress 核心的记录为只读：它们可能是有意为空。','No empty records were found. Re-run the analysis after making changes to refresh this list.'=>'未找到空记录。修改后请重新运行分析以刷新此列表。','Auto-drafts & trashed posts'=>'自动草稿和回收站文章','Spam/trashed/other comments'=>'垃圾/回收站/其他评论','Transients'=>'瞬态','oEmbed caches'=>'oEmbed 缓存','Unused tags'=>'未使用标签','Orphaned elements'=>'孤立元素','Duplicate metadata'=>'重复元数据','Action Scheduler logs'=>'Action Scheduler 日志','Some of these counts did not finish (they took too long or the database returned an error), so the estimate is incomplete and the real figures may be higher. Preview the cleanup again later.'=>'其中部分统计未完成（耗时过长或数据库返回错误），因此估算不完整，实际数字可能更高。请稍后再次预览。','Run a quick database maintenance pass: revisions, drafts/trash, comment cleanup, transients, and optional table optimization.'=>'执行快速数据库维护：修订版本、草稿/回收站、评论清理、瞬态，以及可选的表优化。','Run cleanup'=>'运行清理','Last run: %s'=>'上次运行：%s','Run the cleanup now with your current settings. The cards below show the cumulative totals across all runs and your active configuration.'=>'立即使用当前设置运行清理。下方卡片显示所有运行的累计总数和当前生效的配置。','Yes'=>'是','No'=>'否','Cleanup totals (all runs)'=>'清理总计（所有运行）','Times run'=>'运行次数','Revisions removed'=>'已删除修订','Posts removed'=>'已删除文章','Comments removed'=>'已删除评论','Transients removed'=>'已删除瞬态','oEmbed cache rows removed'=>'已删除 oEmbed 缓存行','Unused tags removed'=>'已删除未使用标签','Orphan rows removed'=>'已删除孤立行','Tables optimized'=>'已优化表','DB size (before)'=>'数据库大小（前）','DB size (after)'=>'数据库大小（后）','Estimated freed'=>'预计释放空间','Configure in %s.'=>'在 %s 中配置。','Max revision age (days)'=>'修订最长保留天数','Auto-drafts to keep'=>'保留自动草稿数','Max auto-draft age (days)'=>'自动草稿最大保留天数','Remove auto-drafts'=>'删除自动草稿','Remove trashed posts'=>'删除回收站文章','Remove spam comments'=>'删除垃圾评论','Remove trashed comments'=>'删除回收站评论','Remove unapproved comments'=>'删除未审核评论','Delete pingbacks'=>'删除Pingback','Delete trackbacks'=>'删除Trackback','Delete all transients, including those that have not expired yet'=>'删除所有 Transients，包括尚未过期的','Delete oEmbed cache'=>'删除oEmbed缓存','Delete unused tags'=>'删除未使用标签','Delete orphan elements'=>'删除孤立元素','Delete duplicate metadata'=>'删除重复元数据','Delete finished Action Scheduler logs'=>'删除已完成的 Action Scheduler 日志','Expired WooCommerce sessions'=>'过期的 WooCommerce 会话','Orphaned product variations'=>'孤立的商品变体','Optimize database tables'=>'优化数据库表','Preview — nothing has been deleted.'=>'预览——未删除任何内容。','About %s records would be removed with the current settings (estimate).'=>'按当前设置，约会移除 %s 条记录（估算）。','With your current settings, a cleanup would remove about:'=>'按你当前的设置，清理大约会移除：','About %s records in total (estimate). Nothing is deleted until you run the cleanup, and everything it deletes is backed up first and can be restored from Backups.'=>'共约 %s 条记录（估算）。在你执行清理之前不会删除任何内容，而且它删除的所有内容都会先备份，可在「备份」中恢复。','Nothing to remove with the current settings.'=>'按当前设置没有可移除的内容。','Tip: use Preview (dry run) first to see exactly what would be removed. Like every other deletion, the general cleanup backs up what it removes first (listed under Backups).'=>'提示：先用「预览（试运行）」查看究竟会删除什么。与其他所有删除一样，常规清理会先备份它要移除的内容（列在「备份」中）。','Run the general cleanup now? About %s records will be removed. They are backed up first and can be restored from Backups.'=>'现在运行常规清理吗？将删除约 %s 条记录。它们会先备份，可在「备份」中恢复。','Run the general cleanup now? What it removes is backed up first and can be restored from Backups.'=>'现在运行常规清理吗？它移除的内容会先备份，可在「备份」中恢复。','Review the last cleanup run and the history of saved reports — view them on screen or download them.'=>'查看最近一次清理运行和已保存报告的历史记录——在屏幕上查看或下载。','No cleanup logs yet. Run a general cleanup to generate your first report.'=>'暂无清理日志。运行一次常规清理以生成第一份报告。','Last run summary'=>'上次运行摘要','oEmbed cache rows'=>'oEmbed 缓存行','Cleanup report'=>'清理报告','Detailed event lines are included only when "Generate detailed log" is enabled.'=>'仅在启用"生成详细日志"时才包含详细事件行。','Status: %s'=>'状态：%s','Started: %s'=>'开始时间：%s','Finished: %s'=>'结束时间：%s','Duration: %d ms'=>'耗时：%d 毫秒','Detailed log (%d events)'=>'详细日志（%d 个事件）','Download report'=>'下载报告','Cleanup logs'=>'清理日志','Select a previous report to view it on screen or download it.'=>'选择之前的报告以在屏幕上查看或下载。','View log'=>'查看日志','Download log'=>'下载日志','Report (PDF)'=>'报告（PDF）','Content by type'=>'按类型查看内容','Where your database weight sits, grouped by post type: live entries, revisions, auto-drafts and attached metadata rows. Read-only — nothing is deleted here.'=>'数据库的体量分布，按内容类型分组：活动条目、修订版本、自动草稿和关联的元数据行。只读 — 此处不会删除任何内容。','No content found.'=>'未找到内容。','Content type'=>'内容类型','Entries'=>'条目','Revisions'=>'修订版本','Auto-drafts'=>'自动草稿','Metadata rows'=>'元数据行','Revisions and auto-drafts are attributed to their real content type. Use the per-post “Keep all revisions” option in the editor to protect specific entries.'=>'修订版本和自动草稿会归入其真实的内容类型。在编辑器中对每篇文章使用“保留所有修订版本”选项以保护特定条目。','Metadata totals are omitted on very large databases to keep this page fast.'=>'在超大型数据库上会省略元数据合计，以保持此页面的速度。','Completed'=>'已完成','Partial'=>'部分完成','Failed'=>'失败','Running'=>'运行中','Locked'=>'已锁定','Retry scheduled'=>'已安排重试','Stopped: backup failed'=>'已停止：备份失败','Nothing was deleted: a backup could not be created (check disk space and folder permissions). Please try again.'=>'未删除任何内容：无法创建备份（请检查磁盘空间和文件夹权限）。请重试。','WordPress scheduled tasks. An event whose hook has no registered callback is likely orphaned (left by an uninstalled plugin) and will never run — safe to remove. Active and WordPress-core events are protected.'=>'WordPress 计划任务。如果某个事件的钩子没有已注册的回调，则很可能是孤立的（由已卸载的插件遗留），且永远不会运行——可安全删除。活动事件和 WordPress 核心事件受保护。','%d scheduled event looks orphaned (its hook has no callback).' . "\0" . '%d scheduled events look orphaned (their hooks have no callback).'=>'%d 个计划事件似乎是孤立的（其钩子没有回调函数）。','Search hooks'=>'搜索钩子','Unschedule all'=>'全部取消计划','Only orphaned events (a hook with no callback) can be removed; active and WordPress-core events are protected.'=>'只能删除孤立事件（没有回调的钩子）；活动事件和 WordPress 核心事件受保护。','Unschedule the %d selected orphaned event(s)?'=>'取消计划选中的 %d 个孤立事件？','Unschedule ALL %d filtered orphaned event(s)?'=>'取消计划全部 %d 个已筛选的孤立事件？','An event that is long overdue means nothing is firing WP-Cron, and every task behind it — updates, emails, cleanups, scheduled posts — is silently not happening.'=>'事件严重逾期意味着没有任何东西在触发 WP-Cron，依赖它的所有任务——更新、邮件、清理、定时文章——都在悄无声息地停摆。','Running on time'=>'准时','No scheduled event is more than 10 minutes late.'=>'没有计划事件逾期超过 10 分钟。','Tasks overdue'=>'任务逾期','%1$d event is overdue; the oldest by %2$s.' . "\0" . '%1$d events are overdue; the oldest by %2$s.'=>'%1$d 个事件已逾期；最久的逾期 %2$s。','WP-Cron is disabled, so a server cron has to call wp-cron.php: check that the crontab line above is in place and running.'=>'WP-Cron 已禁用，因此需要由服务器 cron 调用 wp-cron.php：请确认上方的 crontab 行已配置并在运行。','WP-Cron only runs when someone visits the site, and some hosts block the request it makes to itself. On a quiet site, switch to a server cron with the panel above.'=>'WP-Cron 只在有人访问网站时运行，而有些主机会拦截它发给自己的请求。访问量少的网站，请用上方面板改用服务器 cron。','That scheduled event no longer exists or has no callback.'=>'该计划事件已不存在或没有回调。','%s will run in a moment, in the background.'=>'%s 将很快在后台运行。','%s could not be queued (it may be paused).'=>'无法将 %s 加入队列（可能已暂停）。','WordPress core tasks cannot be paused.'=>'WordPress 核心任务无法暂停。','%s is paused: it stays scheduled but does nothing until you resume it.'=>'%s 已暂停：它仍在计划中，但在你恢复之前不会执行任何操作。','%s resumed.'=>'%s 已恢复。','By default WordPress runs scheduled tasks on visitor page loads: this adds latency to random requests and misses tasks on low-traffic sites. Disable WP-Cron and drive it from a real server cron instead for faster page loads and dependable scheduling.'=>'默认情况下，WordPress 会在访客加载页面时运行计划任务：这会给随机请求增加延迟，并在低流量站点上遗漏任务。请禁用 WP-Cron，改为通过真正的服务器 cron 来驱动它，以获得更快的页面加载和可靠的计划调度。','WP-Cron disabled'=>'已禁用 WP-Cron','WordPress no longer fires cron on page loads.'=>'WordPress 不再在页面加载时运行 cron。','Runs on page loads'=>'在页面加载时运行','WP-Cron fires on visitor requests (the WordPress default).'=>'WP-Cron 在访客请求时触发（WordPress 默认行为）。','Add this line to your server crontab so scheduled tasks keep running every 5 minutes:'=>'将此行添加到服务器的 crontab 中，以便计划任务每 5 分钟继续运行一次：','Re-enable WP-Cron'=>'重新启用 WP-Cron','DISABLE_WP_CRON is already defined elsewhere (wp-config.php or a must-use plugin), so there is nothing to change here.'=>'DISABLE_WP_CRON 已在其他位置定义（wp-config.php 或 must-use 插件），因此此处无需更改。','Disable WP-Cron'=>'禁用 WP-Cron','This edits wp-config.php and keeps a protected backup copy of it in the plugin\'s data folder. After disabling, add the crontab line below.'=>'这会编辑 wp-config.php，并在插件的数据文件夹中保留一份受保护的备份副本。禁用后，请添加下方的 crontab 行。','wp-config.php is not writable. Add this line by hand, just after its opening <?php tag:'=>'wp-config.php 不可写。请手动添加此行，就放在其开头的 <?php 标签之后：','The table %1$s was not deleted: it takes %2$s, too much to back up and drop from here. Your hosting provider can back it up and drop it.'=>'未删除表 %1$s：它占用 %2$s，太大，无法在此处备份并删除。你的主机服务商可以备份并删除它。','%1$s was not deleted: it has %2$s rows, too many to back up and delete from here. Your hosting provider can back them up and delete them.'=>'未删除 %1$s：它有 %2$s 行，太多，无法在此处备份并删除。你的主机服务商可以备份并删除它们。','%d selected entries were still there after deleting them, so they stay in the list. The backup taken before the delete is kept.'=>'%d 个所选条目在删除后仍然存在，因此保留在列表中。删除前创建的备份会被保留。','Some selected entries were not removed: deleting orphaned post-type content or taxonomy terms needs the "also delete content" checkbox. Other entries (such as REST namespaces) are inventory only and have nothing to remove from the database.'=>'部分所选条目未被移除：删除孤立内容类型的内容或分类法术语需要勾选“同时删除内容”。其他条目（如 REST 命名空间）仅为清单项，数据库中没有可移除的内容。','Some selected entries are inventory only (such as REST namespaces) and have nothing to remove from the database, so they were left in place.'=>'部分所选条目仅为清单项（如 REST 命名空间），数据库中没有可移除的内容，因此予以保留。','Some selected entries were kept because they are protected here: in use by an active plugin or theme, part of WordPress or of WPOptimizing, reserved to the network administrator, or no longer in the latest analysis.'=>'部分所选条目已保留，因为它们在此受保护：被启用的插件或主题使用、属于 WordPress 或 WPOptimizing、仅限网络管理员操作，或已不在最近一次分析中。','Some selected rows were kept: empty records owned by an active extension or by WordPress core are read-only here, as they may be empty on purpose.'=>'部分所选行被保留：属于已启用扩展或 WordPress 核心的空记录在此为只读，因为它们可能是有意为空。','Deletion aborted: the backup could not be created, so nothing was deleted. Check filesystem permissions.'=>'已中止删除：无法创建备份，因此未删除任何内容。请检查文件系统权限。','%d item(s) were still there after deleting them, usually because of file permissions, so they stay in the list. The backup taken before the delete is kept.'=>'%d 个项目在删除后仍然存在（通常是文件权限所致），因此保留在列表中。删除前创建的备份会被保留。','Kept %d item(s) because their backup could not be verified — they were not deleted. Check filesystem permissions and retry.'=>'已保留 %d 个项目，因为无法验证其备份，所以未删除。请检查文件系统权限后重试。','These plugins are still active: %s. A plugin active across the network can only be deactivated by a network administrator, from the network admin.'=>'这些插件仍处于启用状态：%s。在整个网络中启用的插件只能由网络管理员在网络后台停用。','Quick reference for every feature. Other tabs link directly to the relevant section.'=>'每项功能的快速参考。其他标签页直接链接到相应章节。','Tools & data'=>'工具与数据','In this section'=>'本节内容','Analyzes your uploads and optimizes new ones as they arrive: it resizes oversized uploads and recompresses them, and serves the next-gen copies they already have on the front-end with a fallback to the original.'=>'分析你的上传，并在新图片上传时进行优化：缩小过大的上传并重新压缩，并在前端提供它们已有的新一代副本，必要时回退到原图。','The "Heaviest images" view of Image optimization turns the aggregate numbers into a concrete, per-image to-do list: a table with a thumbnail, dimensions, weight, a plain-language tag of what would help each image (Oversized, No WebP, No AVIF — only ever suggesting formats your server can actually create) and an estimated saving, with search, a format filter and pagination. On very large libraries the scan is time-bounded, so the list shows the worst offenders it reached.'=>'“图片优化”中的“最重的图片”视图将汇总数字转化为按图片列出的具体待办清单：一个包含缩略图、尺寸、大小、以通俗语言标注每张图片改进方式（尺寸过大、无 WebP、无 AVIF——仅建议你的服务器确实能创建的格式）以及预计节省的表格，并带有搜索、格式筛选和分页。在超大媒体库中扫描有时间限制，因此列表显示的是它所处理到的最严重的情况。','Compatibility with other optimizers: WPOptimizing recognizes WebP/AVIF copies created by plugins such as Imagify, LiteSpeed Cache, EWWW or ShortPixel (both the photo.jpg.webp and photo.webp naming conventions), so it never regenerates a copy that already exists and can serve theirs too. If one of those plugins is active and already serving next-gen images, WPOptimizing automatically steps back from serving to avoid a double <picture>.'=>'与其他优化器的兼容性：WPOptimizing 能识别 Imagify、LiteSpeed Cache、EWWW 或 ShortPixel 等插件创建的 WebP/AVIF 副本（photo.jpg.webp 和 photo.webp 两种命名约定），因此绝不会重新生成已存在的副本，也能提供它们的副本。如果其中某个插件已启用并已提供新一代图片，WPOptimizing 会自动停止提供，以避免重复的 <picture>。','Shows the CSS and JavaScript actually loaded on your public pages, sampled in the background, and lets you stop specific assets from loading — on the whole site or only where you choose.'=>'显示你的公开页面上实际加载的 CSS 和 JavaScript（在后台采样），并允许你停止加载特定资源——可以是全站，也可以只在你选择的位置。','Test mode (free): before applying your rules to everyone, turn on test mode to try them safely. While it is on, every unload rule takes effect only for logged-in administrators, so your visitors keep every asset. Browse your key pages while logged in to confirm they still look and work correctly, then turn test mode off to apply the rules to all visitors. This lets you validate an aggressive setup with zero risk to the public site.'=>'测试模式（免费）：在对所有人应用规则之前，开启测试模式即可安全试用。开启期间，每条卸载规则仅对已登录的管理员生效，因此访客仍会加载全部资源。请在登录状态下浏览关键页面，确认其显示和功能正常，然后关闭测试模式即可对所有访客应用这些规则。这样你就能在对公开站点零风险的情况下验证激进的配置。','URL exceptions (free): list the pages that must always load every asset — the checkout, a booking form, a landing page — and no unloading of any kind (site-wide or per page) will run there. Enter one URL pattern per line, matched against the path, and use * as a wildcard: /checkout protects any URL containing that path, */thank-you/* protects every order-received page. The "Quick add" buttons fill in this site\'s own pages — the WooCommerce cart, checkout and account, the Easy Digital Downloads pages, the course and lesson addresses, the pages with a contact or booking form — and only appear for what is installed here. This is the surgical companion to broad unloading: strip assets site-wide, but never on the pages that need them.'=>'URL 例外（免费）：列出必须始终加载全部资源的页面——结账页、预订表单、着陆页——这些页面上不会执行任何卸载（全站或按页）。每行输入一个 URL 模式，按路径匹配，并使用 * 作为通配符：/checkout 可保护任何包含该路径的 URL，*/thank-you/* 可保护每个订单完成页。“快速添加”按钮会填入本站的真实页面——WooCommerce 的购物车、结账和账户页面、Easy Digital Downloads 的页面、课程和课时的地址、包含联系或预约表单的页面——并且只针对此处已安装的插件显示。这是广泛卸载的精细补充：在全站移除资源，但绝不动那些真正需要它们的页面。','Quick Profiles apply a full recommended configuration (cleanup tasks plus object cache, query deduplication and heartbeat) with a single click. Individual cleanup options and backup retention are configured here.'=>'快速配置方案通过单击即可应用完整的推荐配置（清理任务加上对象缓存、查询去重和 Heartbeat）。单独的清理选项和备份保留期均在此处配置。','Notification email and maintenance report: the notification address is where WPOptimizing sends the periodic report; for agencies, point it at the maintainer instead of the site owner. Network alerts go to the network administrator instead. The maintenance report is a recurring email summary you can set to daily, weekly, fortnightly or monthly (off by default): it includes the Health Score and its trend, key database and media metrics, any unusual table growth, and the scans and cleanups done since the last report. Use "Send a test now" to check delivery without changing the schedule.'=>'通知邮箱与维护报告：通知地址是 WPOptimizing 发送定期报告的去向；对于代理商，请将其指向维护者而非站点所有者。网络提醒则发送给网络管理员。维护报告是可设置为每日、每周、每两周或每月的定期邮件摘要（默认关闭）：它包含 Health Score 及其趋势、数据库和媒体的关键指标、任何异常的表增长，以及自上次报告以来完成的扫描和清理。使用“立即发送测试”可在不更改计划的情况下检查投递。','You can opt out at any time from the Settings tab. Your cleanup features keep working, but sharing is strictly reciprocal: if your site does not contribute, it does not receive the shared dataset either — the community knowledge base only flows to sites that take part. With sharing off, attribution falls back to what your own site captures locally.'=>'你可以随时在“设置”选项卡中关闭它。你的清理功能照常工作，但共享是严格互惠的：如果你的站点不贡献，也不会收到共享数据集——社区知识库只会流向参与的站点。关闭共享后，归因将回退到你自己站点在本地捕获的内容。','Analyzes your uploads (free) and, with Pro, optimizes originals (backup-first), generates WebP and AVIF copies, resizes oversized uploads, and serves the next-gen copies on the front-end with a fallback to the original.'=>'分析你的上传（免费），并在 Pro 下优化原图（先备份）、生成 WebP 和 AVIF 副本、缩小过大的上传，并在前端提供新一代副本，必要时回退到原图。','Generate a WebP copy on upload (Pro) makes the WebP copy for a new image (and each of its sizes) the moment it is uploaded, so the front-end can serve next-gen straight away without waiting for the bulk pass. It is logged exactly like the bulk copies, so "Remove copies" still undoes it. AVIF stays a deliberate bulk action because encoding it is far too slow to run on every upload. Like the rest, it stands down when another image optimizer is active.'=>'“上传时生成 WebP 副本”（Pro）会在上传新图片（及其每个尺寸）的那一刻创建 WebP 副本，使前端无需等待批处理即可立即提供次世代格式。它的记录方式与批量副本完全相同，因此“移除副本”仍可撤销它。AVIF 仍是有意保留的批处理操作，因为对其编码在每次上传时运行都太慢。与其余功能一样，当另一个图片优化插件处于启用状态时，它会自动停用。','Compatibility with other optimizers: WPOptimizing recognizes WebP/AVIF copies created by plugins such as Imagify, LiteSpeed Cache, EWWW or ShortPixel (both the photo.jpg.webp and photo.webp naming conventions), so it never regenerates a copy that already exists and can serve theirs too. If one of those plugins is active and already serving next-gen images, WPOptimizing automatically steps back from serving to avoid a double <picture>. "Remove copies" only ever deletes the copies WPOptimizing itself generated.'=>'与其他优化器的兼容性：WPOptimizing 能识别 Imagify、LiteSpeed Cache、EWWW 或 ShortPixel 等插件创建的 WebP/AVIF 副本（photo.jpg.webp 和 photo.webp 两种命名约定），因此绝不会重新生成已存在的副本，也能提供它们的副本。如果其中某个插件已启用并已提供新一代图片，WPOptimizing 会自动停止提供，以避免重复的 <picture>。“移除副本”只会删除 WPOptimizing 自己生成的副本。','Shows the CSS and JavaScript actually loaded on your public pages, sampled in the background. You can stop specific assets from loading site-wide (free); automatic, context-aware unloading driven by the knowledge base is a Pro feature.'=>'显示你的公开页面上实际加载的 CSS 和 JavaScript（在后台采样）。你可以在全站停止加载特定资源（免费）；基于知识库的自动、按上下文卸载是高级功能。','Test mode (free): before applying your rules to everyone, turn on test mode to try them safely. While it is on, every unload rule — manual and automatic — takes effect only for logged-in administrators, so your visitors keep every asset. Browse your key pages while logged in to confirm they still look and work correctly, then turn test mode off to apply the rules to all visitors. This lets you validate an aggressive setup with zero risk to the public site.'=>'测试模式（免费）：在对所有人应用规则之前，开启测试模式即可安全试用。开启期间，每条卸载规则（手动和自动）仅对已登录的管理员生效，因此访客仍会加载全部资源。请在登录状态下浏览关键页面，确认其显示和功能正常，然后关闭测试模式即可对所有访客应用这些规则。这样你就能在对公开站点零风险的情况下验证激进的配置。','URL exceptions (free): list the pages that must always load every asset — the checkout, a booking form, a landing page — and no unloading of any kind (manual, automatic or per-page) will run there. Enter one URL pattern per line, matched against the path, and use * as a wildcard: /checkout protects any URL containing that path, */thank-you/* protects every order-received page. The "Quick add" buttons fill in this site\'s own pages — the WooCommerce cart, checkout and account, the Easy Digital Downloads pages, the course and lesson addresses, the pages with a contact or booking form — and only appear for what is installed here. This is the surgical companion to broad unloading: strip assets site-wide, but never on the pages that need them.'=>'URL 例外（免费）：列出必须始终加载全部资源的页面——结账页、预订表单、着陆页——这些页面上不会执行任何卸载（手动、自动或按页）。每行输入一个 URL 模式，按路径匹配，并使用 * 作为通配符：/checkout 可保护任何包含该路径的 URL，*/thank-you/* 可保护每个订单完成页。“快速添加”按钮会填入本站的真实页面——WooCommerce 的购物车、结账和账户页面、Easy Digital Downloads 的页面、课程和课时的地址、包含联系或预约表单的页面——并且只针对此处已安装的插件显示。这是广泛卸载的精细补充：在全站移除资源，但绝不动那些真正需要它们的页面。','Quick Profiles apply a full recommended configuration (cleanup tasks plus object cache, query deduplication and heartbeat) with a single click. Individual cleanup options, backup retention and license management are all configured here.'=>'快速配置方案通过单击即可应用完整的推荐配置（清理任务加上对象缓存、查询去重和 Heartbeat）。单独的清理选项、备份保留期和许可证管理均在此处配置。','Notification email and maintenance report: the notification address is where WPOptimizing sends license notices and the periodic report; for agencies, point it at the maintainer instead of the site owner. Network alerts go to the network administrator instead. The maintenance report is a recurring email summary you can set to daily, weekly, fortnightly or monthly (off by default): it includes the Health Score and its trend, key database and media metrics, any unusual table growth, and the scans and cleanups done since the last report. Use "Send a test now" to check delivery without changing the schedule.'=>'通知邮箱与维护报告：通知地址是 WPOptimizing 发送许可证通知和定期报告的去向；对于代理商，请将其指向维护者而非站点所有者。网络提醒则发送给网络管理员。维护报告是可设置为每日、每周、每两周或每月的定期邮件摘要（默认关闭）：它包含 Health Score 及其趋势、数据库和媒体的关键指标、任何异常的表增长，以及自上次报告以来完成的扫描和清理。使用“立即发送测试”可在不更改计划的情况下检查投递。','Import / export: download the whole configuration as a JSON file and restore it here or on another site — handy to replicate your setup across a fleet. The export covers the settings for cleanup, scheduling, cache, media and images, Smart Assets, backups and attribution. For safety it never includes keys, passwords, the license, webhooks, the data-sharing consent, branding or measured runtime state (scan results, baselines, cached sizes), so importing onto another site only carries configuration. On import, existing settings are overwritten and any unrecognized keys are ignored.'=>'导入 / 导出：将整个配置下载为 JSON 文件，并在此处或其他站点恢复——便于在多个站点之间复制你的设置。导出涵盖清理、计划、缓存、媒体和图片、Smart Assets、备份和归属的设置。出于安全考虑，它从不包含密钥、密码、许可证、webhook、数据共享许可、品牌设置或测得的运行时状态（扫描结果、基线、缓存大小），因此导入到其他站点时只会携带配置。导入时，现有设置将被覆盖，未识别的键将被忽略。','You can opt out at any time from the Settings tab. Your cleanup features keep working, but sharing is strictly reciprocal: if your site does not contribute, it does not receive the shared dataset either — not even with an active license. A license unlocks every feature of the plugin; the community knowledge base only flows to sites that take part. With sharing off, attribution falls back to what your own site captures locally.'=>'你可以随时在“设置”选项卡中关闭它。你的清理功能照常工作，但共享是严格互惠的：如果你的站点不贡献，也不会收到共享数据集——即使拥有有效许可证也是如此。许可证解锁插件的所有功能；社区知识库只会流向参与的站点。关闭共享后，归因将回退到你自己站点在本地捕获的内容。','Performance assistant'=>'性能助手','A guided view of your server response time (TTFB) with one-click fixes. It rates the server share of TTFB, scores it into the Optimization health, and walks you through the levers that lower it — applying the ones WPOptimizing can do itself and explaining the ones it cannot.'=>'以引导方式查看服务器响应时间（TTFB），并提供一键修复。它会评估 TTFB 的服务器部分，计入优化健康度，并带你逐一了解可降低它的各项措施——能由 WPOptimizing 自行完成的就执行，不能的则给出说明。','The Performance tab measures the server share of TTFB — the time WordPress takes to start sending a page, excluding the visitor network. It samples real front-end requests, averages them, and shows a level (good / improvable / high) that also feeds the Optimization health score.'=>'“性能”选项卡测量 TTFB 的服务器部分：WordPress 开始发送页面所需的时间，不含访客网络。它对真实的前端请求进行采样并取平均，显示一个级别（良好/可改善/高），并计入优化健康度评分。','Below the diagnosis is a checklist of levers. For the ones WPOptimizing can act on — the persistent object cache, query deduplication, autoload weight (Smart Deactivation) and the Heartbeat — an Apply button performs the change in one click, reusing the same safe, reversible actions as their own tabs. A result notice confirms each change.'=>'诊断下方是一份措施清单。对于 WPOptimizing 能够执行的项目——持久对象缓存、查询去重、autoload 体积（智能停用）和 Heartbeat——“应用”按钮可一键完成更改，复用与各自选项卡相同的安全、可逆操作。每次更改都会有提示确认。','For the levers WPOptimizing cannot change it shows guidance instead of a button: moving WP-Cron to a real system cron (needs wp-config.php and server access), and the server or host itself (PHP version, OPcache, hosting resources, a light theme). This is the honest case: when the database, cache and autoload are all green and TTFB is still high, the remaining time is the server, and the assistant says so rather than suggesting cleanups that would not help.'=>'对于 WPOptimizing 无法更改的项目，它会显示指引而非按钮：将 WP-Cron 改为真正的系统 cron（需要 wp-config.php 和服务器访问权限），以及服务器或主机本身（PHP 版本、OPcache、主机资源、轻量主题）。这就是如实相告的情形：当数据库、缓存和 autoload 都为绿色而 TTFB 仍然偏高时，剩余时间来自服务器，助手会照实说明，而不是建议无济于事的清理。','Deep analysis is an optional, consented profiler: it has zero effect on your site until you click "Run profiling test", then it profiles just the next few front-end requests and disarms itself. It breaks the server response time into phases (boot, init, routing, queries and render) and summarises the request\'s database work, so you get unequivocal information about where the time goes — which is especially useful when everything WPOptimizing controls is already optimal.'=>'深度分析是一个可选的、经你同意的性能分析器：在你点击“运行性能分析测试”之前，它对你的网站没有任何影响；之后它只分析接下来的若干前端请求并自动解除。它将服务器响应时间分解为各个阶段（启动、init、路由、查询和渲染），并汇总该请求的数据库工作，从而让你明确了解时间花在哪里——当 WPOptimizing 能控制的一切都已最优时尤其有用。','It also points to the concrete culprit: during the test it times each hook, and because plugins fire their own hooks inside init (woocommerce_init, elementor/loaded and so on), the "Where the time went" list names the responsible plugin instead of just the generic phase — so you know exactly what to disable or review.'=>'它还会指出具体的元凶：测试期间会测量每个钩子的耗时，由于插件会在 init 内触发自己的钩子（如 woocommerce_init、elementor/loaded 等），“时间都花在哪了”列表会指明负责的插件，而不仅仅是通用阶段，让你确切知道该停用或检查什么。','The deep analysis also flags slow SELECT queries that scan a large table without a usable index — the classic cause of a sluggish database — attributing each to the plugin that ran it and, when the query is simple enough, showing the exact CREATE INDEX you could add. With a license, Apply index creates it for you after asking, and Undo removes it again, checking afterwards that it is really gone; without one, it only advises, so you can review it with your developer first.'=>'深度分析还会标记那些在没有可用索引的情况下扫描大表的慢速 SELECT 查询——这是数据库迟缓的典型原因——并将每条查询归因于执行它的插件；当查询足够简单时，还会显示您可以添加的确切 CREATE INDEX 语句。有许可证时，“应用索引”会在征得您确认后为您创建该索引，“撤销”则会再次将其删除，并在之后检查它确实已被移除；没有许可证时，它只提供建议，因此您可以先与开发人员一起核对。','The full breakdown opens on its own report screen — use "View report" from the assistant (running a test lands you there directly). It is a plain URL you can bookmark, share or print.'=>'完整分解会在独立的报告页面打开——在助手中使用“查看报告”（运行测试后会直接进入）。这是一个普通网址，可收藏、分享或打印。','Fetches your Google PageSpeed score and Core Web Vitals for the home page, on demand. It sends only the public URL of your site to Google’s public API and changes nothing here. The optional free API key simply raises the request quota.'=>'按需获取首页的 Google PageSpeed 分数和 Core Web Vitals。只会把你站点的公开网址发送给 Google 的公共 API，不会改动这里的任何内容。免费 API 密钥是可选的，作用仅是提高请求配额。','PageSpeed Insights is Google’s own measurement of how fast your site loads. WPOptimizing asks for it on demand — one outbound HTTPS request carrying only the public URL of your home page — and shows the performance score plus the Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS, FCP, TBT and Speed Index). Nothing is installed, changed or stored on your site beyond the last result.'=>'PageSpeed Insights 是 Google 自己对你站点加载速度的测量。WPOptimizing 按需请求一次——一个只携带首页公开网址的出站 HTTPS 请求——并显示性能分数以及 Core Web Vitals（LCP、INP、CLS、FCP、TBT 和 Speed Index）。除了最近一次结果外，不会在你的站点上安装、修改或保存任何内容。','Lab metrics come from a simulated load and are always available. Field data (what real visitors experienced over the last 28 days) is only included when Google has enough traffic for your site, which is why it can be missing on smaller sites. Test both mobile and desktop: mobile is the stricter of the two and the one Google ranks on.'=>'实验室指标来自模拟加载，始终可用。字段数据（真实访客在过去 28 天的实际体验）只有在 Google 拥有足够的站点流量时才会包含，因此小站点上可能缺失。移动端和桌面端都要测：移动端更严格，也是 Google 用于排名的那一个。','The API key is optional. Without one Google applies a shared, anonymous quota that is enough for occasional tests; if you test often you will eventually see a quota error. A free key raises that limit, costs nothing and needs no payment method.'=>'API 密钥是可选的。没有它时 Google 会套用共享的匿名配额，偶尔测试足够用；如果你测试频繁，迟早会看到配额错误。免费密钥可提高该上限，不花钱，也不需要绑定付款方式。','Installs a persistent object cache drop-in that stores expensive database queries in memory (Redis, Memcached, APCu or built-in SQLite). Query deduplication collapses repeated identical queries within a single request. Heartbeat control reduces admin-side server load.'=>'安装持久性对象缓存插件，将耗费资源的数据库查询存储在内存中（Redis、Memcached、APCu 或内置 SQLite）。查询去重功能可在单次请求中合并重复的相同查询。Heartbeat 控制可减少后台管理区域的服务器负载。','WPOptimizing installs a drop-in file (wp-content/object-cache.php) that intercepts WordPress object cache calls and routes them to the fastest available backend. Redis and Memcached are used when the server offers them; APCu works well on single-server hosts; the built-in SQLite store is the automatic fallback that requires zero configuration.'=>'WPOptimizing 安装一个替换文件（wp-content/object-cache.php），拦截 WordPress 对象缓存调用并将其路由到最快可用的后端。服务器提供时使用 Redis 和 Memcached；APCu 在单服务器主机上效果良好；内置的 SQLite 存储是无需任何配置的自动备用方案。','Query deduplication (db.php drop-in) intercepts wpdb calls and returns a cached result when the same query string is executed more than once in the same HTTP request. This is particularly effective on complex pages that call get_post(), get_terms() or get_user() for the same IDs from many different code paths.'=>'查询去重（db.php 替换文件）拦截 wpdb 调用，当同一查询字符串在同一 HTTP 请求中执行超过一次时返回缓存结果。这对在许多不同代码路径中为相同 ID 调用 get_post()、get_terms() 或 get_user() 的复杂页面尤为有效。','Login-safe by design: WordPress stores user session tokens inside the user_meta cache group, so under heavy concurrent traffic a persistent cache can occasionally overwrite a freshly issued login token and log users out. WPOptimizing keeps the user_meta group out of the persistent store by default and reads it fresh on every request, so sessions stay reliable. Sites on a low-contention backend can opt back in from the cache config file.'=>'登录安全设计：WordPress 将用户会话令牌存储在 user_meta 缓存组中，因此在高并发流量下，持久缓存有时会覆盖刚刚签发的登录令牌并导致用户被注销。WPOptimizing 默认将 user_meta 组排除在持久存储之外，并在每次请求时重新读取，从而保持会话可靠。写入争用较低的后端站点可以在缓存配置文件中重新启用该功能。','Heartbeat control lets you set the WordPress admin heartbeat to Default, Slow (every 60 s) or Off outside the editor, where autosave and edit locks keep working. Slowing it or turning it off noticeably lowers PHP and database load during active admin sessions.'=>'Heartbeat 控制可将 WordPress 后台心跳设为默认、慢速（每 60 秒）或在编辑器之外关闭，编辑器中的自动保存和编辑锁定仍然有效。降低频率或关闭可明显减少后台活跃会话期间的 PHP 和数据库负载。','Server TTFB and what to do about it: the Cache analytics show the server share of TTFB (the time WordPress takes to start sending the page, not the visitor network). WPOptimizing rates it (good / improvable / high), folds it into the Optimization health score, and gives prioritized actions. The advice is context-aware: if the object cache is off it suggests enabling it; if autoload is heavy it points you there; and — crucially — when the database, cache and autoload are already optimal it tells you honestly that the bottleneck is the server itself (PHP version, OPcache, hosting resources or a heavy theme/plugin), which the plugin cannot fix.'=>'服务器 TTFB 及应对方法：缓存分析会显示 TTFB 的服务器部分（WordPress 开始发送页面所需的时间，不含访客网络）。WPOptimizing 会对其评级（良好/可改善/高），并计入优化健康度评分，同时给出按优先级排列的操作建议。建议是结合上下文的：如果对象缓存已关闭，会建议启用；如果 autoload 过重，会引导你前往处理；而且——关键是——当数据库、缓存和 autoload 都已最佳时，它会如实告诉你瓶颈在于服务器本身（PHP 版本、OPcache、主机资源或繁重的主题/插件），这是插件无法解决的。','Page cache (opt-in, off by default): WPOptimizing can also serve a static HTML copy of each page to anonymous visitors, so most requests never boot WordPress — the biggest speed win. It stays disabled until you enable it in the Cache tab, and it never caches logged-in users, carts, checkout, admin, feeds, search, REST/AJAX or requests with a non-tracking query string; the cache is purged automatically whenever content changes. Leave it off and WPOptimizing only caches database queries and objects, which can never serve a stale page or break a nonce.'=>'页面缓存（可选，默认关闭）：WPOptimizing 也能向匿名访客提供每个页面的静态 HTML 副本，因此大多数请求根本不会启动 WordPress——最大的速度提升。在您于“缓存”选项卡中启用之前，它始终保持关闭，并且绝不缓存已登录用户、购物车、结账、后台、订阅源、搜索、REST/AJAX 或带有非跟踪查询字符串的请求；内容变更时缓存会自动清除。保持关闭时，WPOptimizing 只缓存数据库查询和对象，这绝不会提供过期页面或破坏 nonce。','Coexistence with host and plugin caches: WPOptimizing refuses to enable its own page cache alongside a third-party one (WP Rocket, LiteSpeed, W3 Total Cache…) or a host page cache, and it never overwrites another plugin’s advanced-cache.php. It detects them and purges their page cache automatically after a cleanup, and from the toolbar “Flush all caches”, so a database cleanup never leaves stale pages. The Cache tab lists the page caches it detected; a wpoptimizing_flush_all action lets hosts without a known API hook their own purge.'=>'与主机和插件缓存共存：WPOptimizing 拒绝在第三方缓存（WP Rocket、LiteSpeed、W3 Total Cache…）或主机页面缓存旁边启用自己的页面缓存，也绝不覆盖其他插件的 advanced-cache.php。它会检测到它们，并在清理后以及从工具栏“清除所有缓存”自动清除其页面缓存，因此数据库清理绝不会留下过期页面。“缓存”选项卡会列出检测到的页面缓存；wpoptimizing_flush_all 操作让没有已知 API 的主机挂接自己的清除逻辑。','Browser cache and compression (Apache): from the Cache tab WPOptimizing can add a managed block to your .htaccess that sets far-future Expires/Cache-Control headers for static files (images, CSS, JS, fonts) and enables on-the-fly compression (Brotli when the server offers it, otherwise gzip). Returning visitors then reuse files from their own browser instead of re-downloading them, and every text response travels compressed. The block is written between clearly marked WPOptimizing markers, a timestamped backup of .htaccess is kept, and disabling it removes exactly that block and nothing else. It is skipped when the server is not Apache or when another plugin already manages these headers.'=>'浏览器缓存与压缩（Apache）：在「缓存」选项卡中，WPOptimizing 可以向您的 .htaccess 添加一个受管理的区块，为静态文件（图片、CSS、JS、字体）设置远期的 Expires/Cache-Control 标头，并启用实时压缩（服务器支持时用 Brotli，否则用 gzip）。这样回访者便可从自己的浏览器重用文件，而无需重新下载，并且每个文本响应都以压缩形式传输。该区块写在清晰标记的 WPOptimizing 标记之间，并保留带时间戳的 .htaccess 备份；停用时仅移除该区块，别无其他。当服务器并非 Apache，或已有其他插件管理这些标头时，则会跳过。','CSS and JavaScript minification (opt-in, off by default): under Speed › Page & browser › Minification WPOptimizing can serve minified copies of your own local CSS and JS, stripping comments and whitespace so they download faster. It is deliberately conservative: files that are already minified, hosted on another domain, or listed in your exclusions are left untouched; the minified copies live in wp-content/uploads/wpopt-assets/ and are rebuilt automatically when the source changes or a cache is flushed. A test mode lets administrators preview the result before exposing it to visitors, and — like the page cache — it refuses to run alongside another asset optimizer (Autoptimize, WP Rocket, Perfmatters, LiteSpeed) to avoid double-processing.'=>'CSS 与 JavaScript 压缩（可选，默认关闭）：在「速度 › 页面与浏览器 › 压缩」中，WPOptimizing 可以提供您本地 CSS 和 JS 的压缩副本，去除注释和空白以加快下载。它有意保持保守：已压缩、托管于其他域名或列入排除项的文件保持不变；压缩副本存放在 wp-content/uploads/wpopt-assets/，并在源文件更改或清空缓存时自动重建。测试模式允许管理员在向访客展示前预览结果，并且——与页面缓存一样——它拒绝与其他资源优化工具（Autoptimize、WP Rocket、Perfmatters、LiteSpeed）同时运行，以避免重复处理。','Advanced CSS/JS delivery (Pro): on top of the free minification, Speed › Page & browser can defer local JavaScript (scripts run after the page paints, while jQuery stays eager so inline snippets keep working), load CSS asynchronously (the loadCSS pattern, so stylesheets no longer block the first paint), and inline your critical above-the-fold CSS in the head to remove the brief flash the async loading would otherwise cause. Each has its own exclusion list, and all of them stand down when another optimizer is active.'=>'高级 CSS/JS 交付（Pro）：在免费压缩之外，「速度 › 页面与浏览器」还可以推迟本地 JavaScript（脚本在页面绘制后运行，而 jQuery 保持立即加载，使内联代码段继续正常工作）、异步加载 CSS（loadCSS 模式，使样式表不再阻塞首次绘制），并将您的首屏关键 CSS 内联到头部，以消除异步加载原本会造成的短暂闪烁。每项功能都有各自的排除列表，并且在其他优化工具处于活动状态时全部停用。','Plugins by URL (Pro): under Speed › Page & browser › Plugins by URL you can keep a plugin from loading on the URLs you choose, or load it only on them, so its PHP, queries, CSS and JavaScript stay out of pages where it does nothing. It applies to visitors only — logged-in users, the admin, AJAX, the REST API and cron always get every plugin. Before saving, each set of rules is tried on the home page and up to four more pages, loaded with every plugin and with the rules; it is not saved if any of them breaks, nor if it would leave out a plugin another one needs. If a visit ever ends in a fatal error with plugins left out, every rule switches itself off. Deactivating WPOptimizing undoes it all.'=>'按 URL 加载插件（Pro）：在“速度 › 页面与浏览器 › 按 URL 加载插件”中，可以让插件不在你选择的 URL 上加载，或只在这些 URL 上加载，使它的 PHP、查询、CSS 和 JavaScript 不出现在它毫无作用的页面上。仅对访客生效——已登录用户、后台、AJAX、REST API 和 cron 始终加载全部插件。保存前，每组规则都会在首页和最多另外四个页面上试运行，分别加载全部插件和应用规则；只要其中一个页面出错，或会把另一个插件依赖的插件排除在外，就不会保存。如果某次省略插件的访问以致命错误结束，所有规则会自动关闭。停用 WPOptimizing 即可全部撤销。','Cloudflare: if the site is behind Cloudflare, WPOptimizing also purges its cache — everything when it flushes the other caches, and only the affected pages when content changes. It needs the zone ID and an API token with the Zone › Cache Purge › Purge permission; “How to get them” in the Cache tab shows the steps. The Global API Key is refused, because it opens the whole account. A token for “All zones” can be reused on every site of the account, and it can only purge.'=>'Cloudflare：如果站点位于 Cloudflare 之后，WPOptimizing 也会清除其缓存——清空其他缓存时全部清除，内容变化时只清除受影响的页面。需要区域 ID 和具有“区域 › 缓存清除 › 清除”权限的 API 令牌；缓存选项卡中的“如何获取”会显示步骤。Global API Key 会被拒绝，因为它能打开整个账户。适用于“所有区域”的令牌可在账户的所有站点上重复使用，且只能清除缓存。','Pages at Cloudflare\'s edge (opt-in): with the page cache on and a token that also has Zone › Cache Rules › Edit, WPOptimizing can add a Cache Rule so Cloudflare keeps the pages too, for anonymous visitors only. Each page says whether it may be kept — the pages the page cache stores, for as long as it keeps them — and logged-in users, carts, searches, 404s and pages that set a cookie always reach your server. Turning it on is checked with real requests, and if a request with a session cookie or the login page is ever served from the edge, the rule is removed by itself.'=>'Cloudflare 边缘缓存页面（可选）：在开启页面缓存、且令牌还拥有 区域 › Cache Rules › 编辑 权限时，WPOptimizing 可以添加一条缓存规则，让 Cloudflare 也保存页面，仅针对匿名访客。每个页面会说明能否保存——即页面缓存会保存的页面，保存时长与之相同——已登录用户、购物车、搜索、404 以及设置 cookie 的页面始终到达你的服务器。开启时会用真实请求检查，如果带会话 cookie 的请求或登录页曾从边缘提供，规则会自动移除。','Autoloaded options are loaded from the database on every single page request. This tab lists them sorted by size so you can disable autoload for options that are not needed on every request, reducing the upfront database cost on every page.'=>'自动加载的选项在每次页面请求时都会从数据库中加载。此选项卡按大小排列列出这些选项，方便您禁用那些无需每次请求都加载的选项的自动加载，从而降低每个页面的数据库初始成本。','WordPress loads all autoloaded options in a single SELECT at the start of every request. If plugins have added large blobs or configuration arrays with autoload=yes, this query can transfer hundreds of kilobytes before a single line of your template runs. The Autoload tab lists every autoloaded option with its size, so you can identify the heaviest ones at a glance.'=>'WordPress 在每个请求开始时通过单一 SELECT 加载所有自动加载选项。如果插件添加了设置 autoload=yes 的大型数据块或配置数组，此查询可能在模板运行第一行之前传输数百千字节。自动加载标签页列出每个自动加载选项及其大小，让您一目了然地识别最重的选项。','Smart Deactivation analyses every autoloaded option against the attribution manifest and automatically disables autoload for options that are confidently attributed to plugins that are no longer installed. This is completely safe: an uninstalled plugin cannot need its options on every request.'=>'智能停用功能根据归因清单分析每个自动加载选项，并自动禁用确信归属于已不再安装的插件的选项的自动加载。这完全安全：已卸载的插件不可能在每次请求时需要其选项。','De-autoload never-read goes further and is the most surgical option. WPOptimizing measures which of the largest autoloaded options are actually read on each request (a sampled, near-zero-overhead measurement) and, combined with the same signal aggregated across the network, turns off autoload only for options that load on every request yet are (almost) never read. WordPress core options are always protected, nothing is deleted, and every change is reversible.'=>'「取消从不读取项的自动加载」更进一步，是最精准的选项。WPOptimizing 测量哪些最大的自动加载选项在每次请求中确实被读取（一种抽样、几乎零开销的测量），并结合在整个网络中汇总的同一信号，仅对那些每次请求都加载却（几乎）从不读取的选项关闭自动加载。WordPress 核心选项始终受到保护，不会删除任何内容，且每项更改均可撤销。','Disable all non-essential is the broadest reversible action: it de-autoloads every option that is neither core nor owned by an installed extension (options the network reads on most requests are kept). Delete confirmed orphans removes, backup-first, the dead options of uninstalled extensions.'=>'「停用所有非必要项」是范围最广的可撤销操作：它会对既非核心、也不属于已安装扩展的每个选项取消自动加载（网络在大多数请求中读取的选项会保留）。「删除已确认的孤立项」会在先行备份后，删除已卸载扩展的失效选项。','The Candidates sub-tab shows non-autoloaded options that are read on almost every request (measured by the read-frequency tracker). Enabling autoload for those options turns the per-read SELECT into a zero-cost cache hit.'=>'候选项子标签页显示在几乎每次请求时都会被读取（由读取频率追踪器测量）的非自动加载选项。为这些选项启用自动加载可将每次读取的 SELECT 转变为零成本的缓存命中。','Tip: a healthy site keeps total autoload weight below about 800 KB. Sites above 1 MB will see a measurable latency improvement after a cleanup.'=>'提示：健康的站点将自动加载总重量保持在约 800 KB 以下。超过 1 MB 的站点在清理后将看到可测量的延迟改善。','Lists every database table with its engine, row count, data size and recoverable overhead. Optimizing a table reclaims fragmented space. Tables still using the legacy MyISAM engine are highlighted for conversion to InnoDB.'=>'列出每个数据库表及其引擎、行数、数据大小和可回收的额外开销。优化表可回收碎片化空间。仍使用旧版 MyISAM 引擎的表将被高亮显示，以便转换为 InnoDB。','Database tables accumulate fragmented space over time as rows are deleted or updated. The "overhead" column shows how much space can be reclaimed without touching any data: MySQL simply compacts the existing rows. For busy e-commerce or membership sites this can save tens or hundreds of megabytes.'=>'随着行的删除或更新，数据库表会随时间累积碎片空间。"overhead" 列显示无需触及任何数据即可回收的空间：MySQL 只需压缩现有行。对于繁忙的电商或会员站点，这可以节省数十甚至数百兆字节。','When there is reclaimable overhead, a "Reclaim overhead now" button appears above the list. It runs OPTIMIZE on exactly the tables that carry recoverable overhead (file-based engines such as MyISAM and Aria) in one click, so you do not have to find and select them by hand. It never touches InnoDB internal free space, which the engine reuses on its own, and it never deletes data.'=>'当存在可回收开销时，列表上方会出现「立即回收开销」按钮。它会一键对恰好带有可回收开销的表（基于文件的引擎，如 MyISAM 和 Aria）运行 OPTIMIZE，这样你就不必手动查找并选择它们。它绝不会触及 InnoDB 的内部空闲空间（引擎会自行重用），也绝不会删除数据。','MyISAM is the older MySQL table format. It lacks transaction support, uses table-level locking (so a single slow query blocks all writes), and cannot recover safely after a crash. InnoDB offers row-level locking, crash-safe recovery via a redo log, and significantly better performance under concurrent write workloads.'=>'MyISAM 是较旧的 MySQL 表格式。它缺乏事务支持，使用表级锁（单个慢查询会阻塞所有写操作），并且无法在崩溃后安全恢复。InnoDB 提供行级锁、通过重做日志实现的崩溃安全恢复，以及在并发写工作负载下显著更好的性能。','The conversion from MyISAM to InnoDB is an online ALTER TABLE that rebuilds the table in place. It is non-destructive: all data is preserved, all indexes are rebuilt, and WordPress continues to function normally throughout. For safety, take a database backup before converting large tables.'=>'从 MyISAM 转换为 InnoDB 是一个在线 ALTER TABLE，它在原地重建表。这是非破坏性的：所有数据被保留，所有索引被重建，WordPress 在整个过程中继续正常运行。为安全起见，在转换大型表之前请备份数据库。','Orphaned custom tables from plugins that have been uninstalled appear in the Orphans tab rather than here, so the Tables tab only lists tables that belong to something still installed.'=>'已卸载插件遗留的孤立自定义表出现在孤立项标签页而非此处，因此表格标签页只列出属于仍已安装内容的表。','After each scan WPOptimizing records the size and row count of every table and compares them with the previous scan. When a table grows abnormally between scans — both by a meaningful amount and by a large percentage — it is flagged at the top of this tab (and in the performance report). This is how you catch a runaway log table, a transient/cache table that never clears, or a stuck background job before it bloats the database. A brand-new table is reported as new, never as a warning.'=>'每次扫描后，WPOptimizing 会记录每个表的大小和行数，并与上次扫描进行比较。当某个表在两次扫描之间异常增长——既有可观的绝对量，又有很大的百分比——时，它会在此选项卡顶部（以及性能报告中）被标记出来。这样你就能在失控的日志表、永不清理的瞬态/缓存表或卡住的后台任务撑大数据库之前发现它们。新建的表会被报告为新表，而不会作为警告。','Shows all WordPress scheduled events with their hook, next run time and recurrence. Orphaned events — hooks whose callback function no longer exists, usually left by uninstalled plugins — are flagged so you can remove them safely.'=>'显示所有 WordPress 计划事件及其钩子、下次运行时间和重复频率。孤立事件——那些回调函数已不存在的钩子，通常由已卸载的插件遗留——会被标记，以便您安全地将其删除。','WordPress Cron (wp-cron) fires scheduled tasks on the next page load after the scheduled time. Each event is identified by its hook name. When a plugin is uninstalled without cleaning up, its scheduled hooks remain in the cron table but nothing ever runs them — they fire silently, waste a small amount of server time, and clutter the schedule.'=>'WordPress Cron（wp-cron）在计划时间后的下一次页面加载时触发计划任务。每个事件由其钩子名称标识。当插件在未清理的情况下卸载时，其计划钩子仍留在 cron 表中，但从未被执行——它们静默触发，浪费少量服务器时间，并使计划表混乱。','An event is flagged as orphaned only when TWO checks agree: nothing is listening for its hook, AND the hook name does not belong to any plugin still installed. The second check is not a refinement, it is what makes the first usable: plugins such as MainWP Child, Complianz or LiteSpeed register their cron callback only in the context where it runs — a REST call, the front end, their own request — so on this admin screen the hook looks unclaimed while the plugin is present and keeps re-creating the event. The bias is deliberately conservative: when in doubt, not an orphan. Removing a genuine orphan is entirely safe — no code listens for the hook, so firing it has no effect, and removing it only stops the silent wasted trigger.'=>'只有两项检查同时成立时，事件才会被标记为孤立：没有任何代码监听它的钩子，并且该钩子名称不属于任何仍然安装着的插件。第二项检查不是锦上添花，而是让第一项真正可用的前提：MainWP Child、Complianz、LiteSpeed 等插件只在其运行的上下文中注册 cron 回调——REST 请求、前台、它们自己的请求——因此在这个后台页面上，钩子看起来无人认领，而插件其实仍在并不断重新创建该事件。判定刻意偏保守：有疑问就不算孤立。删除真正的孤立事件完全安全：没有代码监听该钩子，触发它不会产生任何效果，删除它只是停止这次悄无声息的无用触发。','The list also shows legitimate recurring events (WordPress core, active plugins) so you have a complete picture of what is scheduled and how frequently. This helps spot events that are running too often or that you did not expect.'=>'列表还显示合法的定期事件（WordPress 核心、活跃插件），以便您全面了解计划内容及其频率。这有助于发现运行过于频繁或您未预期的事件。','The WP-Cron trigger panel at the top of the tab controls how cron fires. By default WordPress runs it on visitor page loads, which adds latency to random requests and can miss tasks on low-traffic sites. Disabling WP-Cron writes the DISABLE_WP_CRON constant into wp-config.php (a protected backup copy is kept in the plugin\'s data folder) and shows the exact crontab line to add so a real server cron drives wp-cron.php on a fixed schedule. If wp-config.php is not writable, the panel shows the snippet to add by hand. The change is fully reversible from the same panel.'=>'选项卡顶部的 WP-Cron 触发器面板控制 cron 的运行方式。默认情况下，WordPress 会在访客加载页面时运行它，这会给随机请求增加延迟，并可能在低流量站点上遗漏任务。禁用 WP-Cron 会将 DISABLE_WP_CRON 常量写入 wp-config.php（会在插件的数据文件夹中保留一份受保护的备份副本），并显示需要添加的确切 crontab 行，以便真正的服务器 cron 按固定计划运行 wp-cron.php。如果 wp-config.php 不可写，面板会显示需手动添加的代码片段。该更改可从同一面板完全撤销。','Optional speed features for the public site, configured in Speed › Page & browser: speculative loading (prefetch/prerender the next page), content image loading optimization, resource hints, self-hosted Google Fonts, CDN URL rewriting, and a Server-Timing diagnostic header. All opt-in and reversible; none cache full HTML pages.'=>'面向公开站点的可选速度功能，在「速度 › 页面与浏览器」中配置：推测性加载（预取/预渲染下一页）、内容图片加载优化、资源提示、自托管 Google Fonts、CDN URL 重写以及用于诊断的 Server-Timing 响应头。全部为可选且可逆；均不缓存完整的 HTML 页面。','Speculative loading uses the browser Speculation Rules API to load the next page before the visitor clicks. In Conservative mode the next page is prefetched when a link is clicked; in Eager mode it is prerendered on hover, so navigation can feel instant. The admin, the login page, URLs with a query string, and WooCommerce cart/checkout/account pages are excluded automatically, as are links marked rel="nofollow" or with the class no-prerender / no-prefetch.'=>'推测式加载使用浏览器的 Speculation Rules API 在访客点击前加载下一页。保守模式下，点击链接时预取下一页；积极模式下，悬停时预渲染，使导航感觉即时。后台、登录页、带查询字符串的 URL 以及 WooCommerce 的购物车/结账/账户页面会被自动排除，带有 rel="nofollow" 或 no-prerender / no-prefetch 类的链接也会被排除。','Content image loading optimization marks the first image of a post as the priority (LCP) image — loaded eagerly with fetchpriority=high — while the remaining images are lazy-loaded with asynchronous decoding. It uses the WordPress HTML Tag Processor, so it works even on markup produced by page builders.'=>'图片加载优化会将文章的第一张图片标记为优先（LCP）图片——以 fetchpriority=high 立即加载——其余图片则以异步解码进行延迟加载。它使用 WordPress 的 HTML Tag Processor，因此即使是页面构建器生成的标记也同样有效。','The Server-Timing header is a diagnostic for developers: it reports the WordPress processing time, the number of database queries and the object-cache hit rate, visible in the browser DevTools Network panel. It is off by default and intended for troubleshooting, not for end users.'=>'Server-Timing 标头是面向开发者的诊断：报告 WordPress 处理时间、数据库查询数量和对象缓存命中率，可在浏览器 DevTools 的网络面板中查看。默认关闭，用于排查问题，而非面向最终用户。','Resource hints look at the external origins your page actually loads (web fonts, CDNs) and ask the browser to resolve DNS and open the connection early, so those assets start downloading sooner. WPOptimizing adds preconnect for the well-known font origins and dns-prefetch for the rest, automatically and only for origins the page really uses — there is nothing to configure. The hints are advisory and harmless: a redundant one only costs a cheap DNS lookup.'=>'资源提示会查看你的页面实际加载的外部来源（网页字体、CDN），并请求浏览器尽早解析 DNS 并建立连接，使这些资源更早开始下载。WPOptimizing 会为知名字体来源添加 preconnect，并为其余来源添加 dns-prefetch——自动进行，且仅针对页面真正使用的来源，无需任何配置。这些提示是建议性的且无害：多余的提示只会花费一次廉价的 DNS 解析。','Preloading key resources goes one step further than a hint: it tells the browser to start downloading a specific file right away, before it would normally discover it. WPOptimizing preloads the featured image of the current post or page (usually the largest above-the-fold image, so this directly improves the LCP metric) with a high priority, and any extra URLs you list — typically an above-the-fold web font or a hero image. The correct type (image, font, style, script) is inferred from the file extension and fonts get the required crossorigin attribute automatically. Preload sparingly: it is a good default for the one or two resources the page needs first, but preloading a long list forces the browser to fetch everything at once and can make the page slower, not faster.'=>'预加载关键资源比提示更进一步：它让浏览器立即开始下载某个特定文件，而不必等到通常才发现它。WPOptimizing 会以高优先级预加载当前文章或页面的特色图片（通常是首屏最大的图片，因此直接改善 LCP 指标），以及您列出的任何额外网址——通常是首屏网页字体或主视觉图片。正确的类型（图片、字体、样式、脚本）会根据文件扩展名推断，字体会自动获得所需的 crossorigin 属性。请谨慎预加载：对于页面最先需要的一两个资源来说这是不错的默认选择，但预加载一长串资源会迫使浏览器一次性获取所有内容，可能让页面变慢而非变快。','Self-hosting Google Fonts downloads the font stylesheet and its woff2 files into your uploads folder and serves them from your own domain, so the browser never connects to fonts.googleapis.com or fonts.gstatic.com. This removes a third-party connection (faster first render) and addresses the GDPR concern about Google Fonts leaking visitor IP addresses. Turn it on, save, then open your site once so the fonts are detected and click "Localize now": WPOptimizing fetches and rewrites them, and from then on swaps the remote stylesheet for the local copy with no per-request network calls. "Remove local fonts" reverts to the original Google-hosted fonts.'=>'自托管 Google Fonts 会将字体样式表及其 woff2 文件下载到你的上传文件夹，并从你自己的域名提供，这样浏览器就永远不会连接 fonts.googleapis.com 或 fonts.gstatic.com。这消除了一个第三方连接（首次渲染更快），并解决了关于 Google Fonts 泄露访客 IP 地址的 GDPR 顾虑。启用它、保存，然后打开你的站点一次以便检测到字体，再点击「立即本地化」：WPOptimizing 会获取并重写它们，此后在每次请求时以本地副本替换远程样式表，且无需网络调用。「移除本地字体」会恢复为 Google 托管的字体。','CDN rewriting changes the URLs of your static files (images, CSS, JS under uploads, wp-content and wp-includes) to a CDN hostname, so visitors download them from the CDN edge closest to them instead of your server. Enter the CDN host (for example cdn.example.com), choose which folders to rewrite, and save. Only local static files are rewritten — dynamic PHP endpoints and any external URL are left untouched. First configure the CDN as a pull zone whose origin is this site, and make sure it forwards the correct CORS headers for fonts. WPOptimizing does not upload anything; it only rewrites URLs, so switching the feature off instantly returns to serving from your origin.'=>'CDN 重写会将你的静态文件（uploads、wp-content 和 wp-includes 下的图片、CSS、JS）的 URL 更改为 CDN 主机名，这样访客就会从离他们最近的 CDN 边缘节点下载，而不是从你的服务器下载。输入 CDN 主机（例如 cdn.example.com），选择要重写的文件夹并保存。仅重写本地静态文件 — 动态 PHP 端点和任何外部 URL 都不会被触及。请先将 CDN 配置为以本站点为源的拉取区（pull zone），并确保它为字体转发正确的 CORS 响应头。WPOptimizing 不会上传任何内容；它只重写 URL，因此关闭该功能会立即恢复为从你的源站提供服务。','Compatibility with caching, SEO and image-optimization plugins: these features are built to coexist. WPOptimizing never overwrites an object-cache.php or db.php drop-in installed by another plugin — it detects it and steps aside. Resource hints are de-duplicated against hints the theme or another plugin already added. Image loading only ADDS attributes and skips any image another lazy-loader has already deferred, so it does not fight a dedicated image plugin or WordPress core. The sitemap and feed core-tweaks simply switch off the built-in versions, which an SEO plugin normally replaces anyway, so enabling them next to one is safe.'=>'与缓存、SEO 和图片优化插件的兼容性：这些功能为共存而设计。WPOptimizing 绝不会覆盖其他插件安装的 object-cache.php 或 db.php drop-in——它会检测到并主动让位。资源提示会与主题或其他插件已添加的提示去重。图片加载优化只会“添加”属性，并跳过其他懒加载工具已延迟的任何图片，因此不会与专用图片插件或 WordPress 核心冲突。站点地图和订阅源相关优化只是关闭内置版本，而 SEO 插件通常本就会替代它们，所以与其并用是安全的。','You do not have to configure these by hand: each cleanup profile (applied from Settings or the welcome wizard) already enables sensible front-end defaults, so choosing a profile sets them up for you. You can override any of them anytime under Speed › Page & browser › Loading & delivery.'=>'您无需手动配置：每个清理配置方案（从设置或欢迎向导应用）都已启用合理的前端默认值，因此选择一个方案就会为您设置好。您可以随时在“速度 › 页面与浏览器 › 加载与交付”中更改其中任意一项。','Optional toggles in Settings that disable WordPress features you may not use (emojis, the version meta, RSD/WLW links, jQuery Migrate, oEmbed extras, REST API head links and more), trimming front-end weight and head noise. All are off by default and reversible.'=>'“设置”中的可选开关，用于停用你可能不使用的 WordPress 功能（表情符号、版本 meta、RSD/WLW 链接、jQuery Migrate、oEmbed 附加项、头部的 REST API 链接等），从而减轻前端负担和头部冗余。全部默认关闭且可逆。','WordPress loads a number of features on every page that many sites never use: the emoji script and its DNS prefetch, a generator meta tag with your version, RSD and Windows Live Writer links, a shortlink tag, the jQuery Migrate compatibility script, oEmbed discovery and the wp-embed script, REST API discovery links, and more. Each one is small, but together they add markup, requests and a little attack surface. The Core tweaks section lets you switch off the ones you do not need.'=>'WordPress 在每个页面都会加载许多很多站点从不使用的功能：表情符号脚本及其 DNS 预取、包含你版本号的 generator 元标签、RSD 和 Windows Live Writer 链接、shortlink 标签、jQuery Migrate 兼容脚本、oEmbed 发现和 wp-embed 脚本、REST API 发现链接等等。每一项都很小，但加在一起会增加标记、请求和少量攻击面。“核心优化”部分让你关闭不需要的项。','Tweaks are grouped by risk so you can decide how far to go. Safe tweaks have no visible effect (they only remove head noise). Moderate tweaks may affect a few setups — for example removing jQuery Migrate can reveal an old theme or plugin that still relies on deprecated jQuery, and removing front-end Dashicons assumes your theme does not use that icon font for logged-out visitors.'=>'这些调整按风险分组，方便你决定做到什么程度。安全项没有可见影响（仅移除头部冗余）。中等项可能影响少数配置——例如移除 jQuery Migrate 可能暴露仍依赖过时 jQuery 的旧主题或插件，而移除前端 Dashicons 则假设你的主题未对未登录访客使用该图标字体。','Everything here is fully reversible: a tweak only removes a core hook or adds a short-circuit filter while it is enabled, and unticking it restores the default behaviour on the next page load. No content or settings are deleted. Features that WPOptimizing already manages elsewhere — Heartbeat, post revisions and autosave, the oEmbed cache, the object cache, query deduplication and front-end asset unloading — are intentionally not duplicated here; configure those on their own screens. Security-oriented switches such as XML-RPC are also out of scope and belong to dedicated hardening tools.'=>'这里的一切都完全可逆：优化项在启用期间只会移除一个核心钩子或添加一个短路过滤器，取消勾选会在下次页面加载时恢复默认行为。不会删除任何内容或设置。WPOptimizing 已在别处管理的功能——Heartbeat、文章修订与自动保存、oEmbed 缓存、对象缓存、查询去重以及前端资源卸载——在此特意不重复；请在它们各自的页面中配置。诸如 XML-RPC 之类面向安全的开关也不在范围内，应交由专门的加固工具处理。','You do not have to enable these one by one: each cleanup profile (applied from Settings or the welcome wizard) already turns on a sensible set — all the Safe tweaks for every profile, plus selected Moderate ones for the blog and aggressive presets.'=>'你无需逐一启用：每个清理配置（从“设置”或欢迎向导应用）都已启用一组合理的项——每个配置包含全部安全项，博客与激进预设再加上部分中等项。','The analysis is free and read-only: it walks /uploads and reports the total image weight, a breakdown by format, how many images are large (≥ 300 KB), how many exceed your max dimensions, and how many lack a WebP/AVIF copy, with an estimate of the space a conversion could save. It never changes a file.'=>'分析是免费且只读的：它会遍历 /uploads 并报告图片总大小、按格式的细分、有多少较大（≥ 300 KB）、有多少超过你的最大尺寸，以及有多少缺少 WebP/AVIF 副本，并估算转换可节省的空间。它绝不会更改任何文件。','Optimize originals (Pro) shrinks JPEG/PNG files in place and resizes any that exceed your max width/height — without a visible loss of quality. It is strictly backup-first: each original is copied to a backup before being overwritten, the result is kept only if it is actually smaller, and each image is processed once. "Restore originals" copies the backups back, so the whole step is reversible. Run it before generating copies so the copies are made from the optimized originals.'=>'「优化原图」（Pro）就地压缩 JPEG/PNG 文件，并缩放超出你所设最大宽高的图片——不会有可见的画质损失。它严格遵循先备份：每张原图在被覆盖前都会复制一份备份，只有结果确实更小才会保留，且每张图片只处理一次。「恢复原图」会把备份复制回来，因此整个步骤可逆。请在生成副本之前运行它，这样副本就以优化后的原图为基础。','Generate next-gen copies (Pro) creates a .webp and/or .avif copy next to each image (for example photo.jpg.webp). The originals are never modified or deleted, and every copy we create is logged so "Remove copies" deletes only our files, never another optimizer\'s. AVIF needs a newer server (PHP 8.1+ GD with AVIF, or Imagick with libheif); where it is unavailable, WebP is still offered. Because the copies are derivatives, they do not appear in the images-by-format table — they are listed in their own "Generated copies" table.'=>'生成新一代副本（Pro）会在每张图片旁创建 .webp 和/或 .avif 副本（例如 photo.jpg.webp）。原图绝不会被修改或删除，我们创建的每个副本都会被记录，因此“移除副本”只会删除我们的文件，绝不会删除其他优化器的文件。AVIF 需要较新的服务器（PHP 8.1+ 的 GD 支持 AVIF，或带 libheif 的 Imagick）；在不可用之处仍会提供 WebP。由于副本是衍生文件，它们不会出现在“按格式的图片”表中——而是列在各自的“已生成副本”表中。','Front-end serving wraps each image in a <picture> element with the AVIF and WebP copies as sources and the original as the fallback. The browser picks the first format it supports; browsers that support neither receive the untouched JPEG/PNG. A source is only added when its copy actually exists on disk, so serving is always safe.'=>'前端提供会把每张图片包裹在 <picture> 元素中，以 AVIF 和 WebP 副本作为源，原图作为回退。浏览器选择它支持的第一个格式；两者都不支持的浏览器会收到未改动的 JPEG/PNG。只有当某个源的副本确实存在于磁盘上时才会添加，因此提供始终是安全的。','Settings: Conversion quality (40–100) is the lossy knob for WebP, AVIF and JPEG; PNG recompression is always lossless. Max dimensions set separate width and height limits (0 on an axis disables it). Lossless mode keeps PNG lossless and leaves JPEGs untouched unless they must be resized, since there is no lossless JPEG recompression. Strip metadata removes EXIF/ICC/comments for smaller files (turn it off to keep camera data; note that the GD fallback always drops metadata). Optimize on upload applies the same settings to new uploads: it resizes those above the max size (WordPress\' native handling, preserving the full-size original), recompresses them and strips their metadata.'=>'设置：转换质量（40–100）是 WebP、AVIF 和 JPEG 的有损调节；PNG 重新压缩始终无损。最大尺寸分别设置宽度和高度上限（某一轴为 0 表示禁用）。无损模式保持 PNG 无损，并且除非必须缩放，否则不改动 JPEG，因为不存在无损的 JPEG 重新压缩。去除元数据会删除 EXIF/ICC/注释以减小文件（关闭可保留相机数据；GD 回退总会删除元数据）。上传时优化会对新上传应用相同设置：缩小超过最大尺寸的上传（WordPress 原生处理，保留全尺寸原图），重新压缩并去除其元数据。','Every theme and plugin can enqueue its own CSS and JavaScript, and many load their files on pages that do not use them — a slider script on your contact page, a forms stylesheet site-wide. Smart Assets records which handles are actually enqueued on real front-end page loads (it samples public visits in the background; sharing must be enabled) and lists them so you can see what each page carries.'=>'每个主题和插件都可以加入自己的 CSS 和 JavaScript，许多会在不使用它们的页面上加载文件——联系页上的轮播脚本、全站的表单样式表。Smart Assets 会记录在真实前端页面加载中实际入队的句柄（在后台采样公开访问；必须启用共享），并将它们列出，让你看到每个页面加载了什么。','Manual unloading (free): tick the assets you want to stop loading and save. The selected handles are dequeued on the front-end site-wide, which removes their HTTP requests and bytes. It is fully reversible — untick to restore. Start conservatively and test the public site after each change, because some scripts are dependencies of others.'=>'手动卸载（免费）：勾选你想停止加载的资源并保存。所选句柄会在全站前端出队，从而消除其 HTTP 请求和字节。完全可逆：取消勾选即可恢复。请谨慎开始，并在每次更改后测试公开网站，因为某些脚本是其他脚本的依赖。','Automatic unloading (Pro): instead of choosing by hand, WPOptimizing uses the shared knowledge base to decide, per page type, which assets are safe to drop — context-aware and kept up to date as the dataset grows. It is opt-in and can be turned off at any time.'=>'自动卸载（高级）：WPOptimizing 不需手动选择，而是使用共享知识库按页面类型决定哪些资源可以安全移除——按上下文判断，并随数据集增长保持更新。此功能为可选，可随时关闭。','Per-rule targeting (free): by default an unloaded asset is dropped on the whole site. Under "Per-rule targeting" you can narrow any single rule to a content type (front page, posts & pages, or archives) and/or to specific URLs — the opposite of the exceptions: "unload this ONLY on /shop and */product/*". Enter one or more URL patterns (comma-separated, wildcard *) in "Only on URLs"; leave it empty to keep the rule site-wide. Scope and URL are combined, so you can say "on single posts, but only under /guides". Changes save as you edit.'=>'按规则定向（免费）：默认情况下，被卸载的资源会在整个站点移除。在“按规则定向”中，你可以将任何单条规则限定到某种内容类型（首页、文章和页面，或归档）和/或特定 URL——这与例外相反：“仅在 /shop 和 */product/* 卸载它”。在“仅在这些 URL”中输入一个或多个 URL 模式（用逗号分隔，通配符 *）；留空则保持规则全站生效。范围与 URL 相结合，因此你可以说“仅在单篇文章、且仅在 /guides 下”。修改会在编辑时自动保存。','Who owns an asset (free): your site can only name the handles its own plugins print, so some rows show no owner at all — and an asset you cannot name is one you cannot safely act on. WPOptimizing asks the shared knowledge base: when the sites that contribute their registry agree on who owns a handle, its owner is shown with a "shared data" mark, so you know the name came from them and not from your own site. When they disagree — two different extensions claiming the same handle — the row is marked "conflicting" and no owner is shown. That is deliberate: we never pick the most popular answer, because unloading an asset attributed to the wrong extension breaks the page that needed it.'=>'资源归属（免费）：你的站点只能识别自己的插件所输出的句柄，因此有些行完全不显示所有者——而无法识别归属的资源，也就无法安全处置。WPOptimizing 会向共享知识库求证：当共享清单的站点对某个句柄的归属意见一致时，所有者会带上「共享数据」标记显示，让你清楚这个名字来自它们而非你自己的站点。当它们意见不一致时——两个不同的扩展都声称拥有同一个句柄——该行会标记为「存在冲突」，并且不显示所有者。这是刻意为之：我们绝不采用最流行的答案，因为卸载一个被归错扩展的资源，会让原本需要它的页面出错。','Safety: unloading only stops an asset from being enqueued; it never deletes files. If a page looks wrong after unloading something, re-enable it and the asset loads again on the next request.'=>'安全：卸载只是阻止资源入队，绝不删除文件。如果移除某项后页面显示异常，重新启用它，资源会在下次请求时再次加载。','Removes database clutter: post revisions, auto-drafts, trashed posts, spam comments, and expired transients. Runs from a single button or automatically on a schedule. A detailed log is saved after every run.'=>'删除数据库垃圾：文章修订版、自动草稿、已删除文章、垃圾评论和过期的临时数据。可通过单个按钮运行或自动按计划运行。每次运行后保存详细日志。','Over time WordPress accumulates records that are no longer needed for the site to function: every draft save creates a revision, every failed publish leaves an auto-draft, deleted content sits in the trash, spam fills the comments table, and transients created by plugins often expire but are never purged. General Cleanup removes all of these in one pass.'=>'随着时间推移，WordPress 积累了站点运行不再需要的记录：每次保存草稿创建一个修订版，每次发布失败留下一个自动草稿，删除的内容留在回收站中，垃圾邮件填满评论表，插件创建的临时数据经常过期但从未清除。通用清理一次性删除所有这些内容。','Quick Profiles apply a recommended set of tasks in a single click. Every profile enables the basic tasks (auto-drafts, trash, spam, expired transients and table optimization); Safe, Blog and Membership add nothing riskier, WooCommerce adds orphaned elements, Action Scheduler, WooCommerce sessions and orphaned variations, and Agency (maximum) adds unapproved comments, duplicate metadata, orphaned elements, Action Scheduler and unused tags. No profile deletes all transients.'=>'快速配置方案只需一次点击即可应用一组推荐的任务。每个配置方案都会启用基本任务（自动草稿、回收站、垃圾评论、过期瞬态和数据表优化）；安全、博客和会员不会添加任何风险更高的任务，WooCommerce 会添加孤立项、Action Scheduler、WooCommerce 会话和孤立的商品变体，代理机构（最大化）会添加未审核评论、重复元数据、孤立项、Action Scheduler 和未使用标签。没有任何配置方案会删除所有瞬态。','The Dry Run option shows a count of what would be removed without deleting anything — useful for auditing before your first cleanup. After a real run, a detailed HTML log is saved and accessible from the history list so you can review exactly what was deleted.'=>'试运行选项显示将要删除的内容数量而不实际删除任何内容——在首次清理前进行审计非常有用。实际运行后，详细的 HTML 日志会被保存，可从历史列表访问，以便查看确切删除了什么。','Every batch the cleanup deletes is backed up first, into one Backups entry per run (scheduled and automatic runs included). If that backup cannot be written, the run stops with the status “Stopped: backup failed” and deletes nothing more. Table optimization changes no data and needs no backup.'=>'清理删除的每一批数据都会先备份，每次运行对应「备份」中的一条条目（包括计划运行和自动运行）。如果无法写入该备份，本次运行会以状态“已停止：备份失败”停止，不再删除任何内容。表优化不会改动数据，因此无需备份。','Tip: schedule cleanup to run nightly or weekly from the Settings tab. Keeping the database lean reduces backup sizes and speeds up queries that scan post meta or comment tables.'=>'提示：在设置标签页中安排清理每晚或每周运行。保持数据库精简可减少备份大小并加速扫描文章元数据或评论表的查询。','Per-post protection: open any post in the editor (block or classic) and tick "Keep all revisions" to exclude that single post from revision cleanup — useful for legal pages or contracts where the full edit history matters. WPOptimizing also honors the keep_revisions custom field used by "Optimize Database after Deleting Revisions", so you can migrate from that plugin without reconfiguring anything.'=>'按文章保护：在编辑器（区块或经典）中打开任意文章并勾选“保留所有修订版本”，即可将该篇文章排除在修订版本清理之外——适用于需要完整编辑历史的法律页面或合同。WPOptimizing 还会识别“Optimize Database after Deleting Revisions”使用的 keep_revisions 自定义字段，因此你可以从该插件迁移而无需重新配置。','The "By content type" sub-tab is a read-only diagnostic that shows where your database weight concentrates, grouped by post type: live entries, revisions, auto-drafts and attached metadata rows. Revisions and auto-drafts are attributed to their real type (revisions through their parent post), so you can see at a glance which content types carry the most overhead before deciding what to clean.'=>'“按内容类型”子选项卡是一个只读诊断，按内容类型分组显示数据库的体量集中在何处：活动条目、修订版本、自动草稿和关联的元数据行。修订版本和自动草稿会归入其真实类型（修订版本通过其父文章归类），因此你可以一眼看出哪些内容类型承担了最多的负担，再决定要清理什么。','Toolbar shortcuts: the WPOptimizing menu in the top admin bar runs a general cleanup or a full analysis in one click from any screen, on desktop and mobile alike.'=>'工具栏快捷方式：顶部管理栏中的 WPOptimizing 菜单可在任意页面一键运行常规清理或完整分析，桌面端和移动端皆可。','Very large databases: the analysis runs asynchronously in stages, so it never blocks the browser or times out a request. On installs with tens of millions of rows, WPOptimizing automatically switches the heaviest counts to fast approximate queries and caps the per-query time, so some figures (like per-type metadata totals) may be shown as approximate or omitted to protect the live site.'=>'超大型数据库：分析以异步分阶段方式运行，因此绝不会阻塞浏览器或导致请求超时。在拥有数千万行的站点上，WPOptimizing 会自动将最繁重的统计切换为快速的近似查询并限制单次查询时间，因此某些数字（如按类型的元数据合计）可能显示为近似值或被省略，以保护线上站点。','Scans your uploads for files with no database attachment record, orphaned thumbnail sizes, and exact-content duplicates. Duplicate detection keeps the oldest copy and reassigns all post references before any deletion.'=>'扫描您的上传内容，查找没有数据库附件记录的文件、孤立的缩略图尺寸以及内容完全相同的重复文件。重复检测会保留最旧的副本，并在任何删除操作之前重新分配所有文章引用。','The Media tab covers three separate problem types. Potentially-unused attachments are Media Library entries that are not referenced in any post content, post meta, widget, option or theme mod — they may have been uploaded and then forgotten. Review each one carefully: a file can be "unused" in the database but still referenced by hard-coded HTML in a template.'=>'媒体标签页涵盖三种不同的问题类型。可能未使用的附件是媒体库条目，未在任何文章内容、文章元数据、小工具、选项或主题修改中被引用——它们可能已上传后被遗忘。仔细检查每一个：文件在数据库中可能是"未使用"的，但仍可能被模板中的硬编码 HTML 引用。','Duplicate detection computes a hash of the actual file content (not the filename). When two or more files share the same hash, WPOptimizing keeps the attachment with the oldest ID (the original) and reassigns every post_content, post_meta and thumbnail reference that pointed to a duplicate before deleting the duplicate file and its attachment record.'=>'重复检测计算实际文件内容（而非文件名）的哈希值。当两个或更多文件共享相同哈希值时，WPOptimizing 保留具有最旧 ID 的附件（原始文件），并在删除重复文件及其附件记录之前，重新分配所有指向重复项的 post_content、post_meta 和缩略图引用。','Orphaned thumbnail files are physical image files in wp-content/uploads that correspond to intermediate sizes no longer registered by any active theme or plugin. They consume disk space but are never served. They are safe to remove once you have confirmed the size is no longer needed.'=>'孤立缩略图文件是 wp-content/uploads 中对应于不再被任何活跃主题或插件注册的中间尺寸的实体图像文件。它们占用磁盘空间但从不被使用。一旦确认不再需要该尺寸，即可安全删除。','Every media deletion is backed up first, so it is reversible: WPOptimizing copies each file (and reassigns duplicate references) before removing anything. If you ever need to undo a deletion, the Media tab shows how many file backups are available and links straight to the Backups tab, where you restore a whole operation in one click. Nothing is deleted that was not fully backed up.'=>'每次删除媒体都会先进行备份，因此可逆：WPOptimizing 会在移除任何内容之前复制每个文件（并重新分配重复项的引用）。如果你需要撤销某次删除，“媒体”选项卡会显示有多少个文件备份可用，并直接链接到“备份”选项卡，你可以在那里一键恢复整个操作。凡是没有完整备份的内容都不会被删除。','Image optimization (recompression, WebP/AVIF generation, resizing and front-end serving) has its own sub-section, documented separately under Image optimization.'=>'图片优化（重新压缩、WebP/AVIF 生成、缩放和前端提供）有自己的子部分，单独记录在“图片优化”下。','In the Library audit, the Renamed-original backups group lists a specific kind of leftover: the *-mfrh-original* copies that rename plugins such as Media File Renamer keep as a backup of the pre-rename original and register as the attachment original_image. The renamed file is what the site serves, so these copies are redundant and do not appear under Orphan files (they are still referenced). Deleting one is backup-first and also clears the leftover original_image reference so nothing is left dangling.'=>'在“媒体库审计”中，「重命名原图备份」组列出一类特定的残留文件：Media File Renamer 等重命名插件保留的 *-mfrh-original* 副本，作为重命名前原图的备份，并注册为附件的 original_image。站点提供的是重命名后的文件，因此这些副本是冗余的，也不会出现在「孤立文件」中（它们仍被引用）。删除时会先备份，并额外清除残留的 original_image 引用，不留任何悬空。','Media has six entries: Orphans (with a filter for orphan files, orphan thumbnails and other files), Duplicate sets, Unused attachments, Image optimization (Summary and Heaviest images), Trash and Library audit. The audit examines the uploads folder and offers a fix for each finding it can stand behind: protect or delete files that should not be downloadable, delete unused orphan sizes and loose files (backup first), regenerate thumbnails that carry an older name, and a direct link when another Media section already lists the file. It never moves files.'=>'媒体有六个条目：孤立文件（可按孤立文件、孤立缩略图和其他文件筛选）、重复文件组、未使用的附件、图片优化（摘要和最重的图片）、回收站和媒体库审计。审计会检查上传文件夹，并为它能负责的每项发现提供修复：保护或删除不应被下载的文件，删除未使用的孤立尺寸和零散文件（先备份），重新生成带旧名称的缩略图；当其他媒体分区已列出该文件时提供直接链接。它从不移动文件。','Records and files that could not be attributed to any known plugin or theme. They may belong to a custom plugin not yet in the manifest, or to bespoke code. Review them manually before taking any action.'=>'无法归属于任何已知插件或主题的记录和文件。它们可能属于尚未列入清单的自定义插件，或属于定制代码。在采取任何操作之前，请手动检查它们。','Attribution uses a shared community dataset built from scan results contributed by thousands of WordPress installations. When WPOptimizing finds a database record or file that does not match any entry in the dataset and cannot be inferred from the slug or prefix of an installed extension, it is listed under “To identify” instead of being classified as Orphan or Inactive.'=>'归因使用由数千个 WordPress 安装贡献的扫描结果构建的共享社区数据集。当 WPOptimizing 发现一条数据库记录或文件不匹配数据集中的任何条目，且无法从已安装扩展的 slug 或前缀推断出来时，它会列在“待识别”下，而非被归类为孤立或非活跃。','Every attributed item carries a confidence level, from most to least reliable: Manual (you attributed it yourself), Sure, Likely, Possible, Doubtful and Estimated; hover over a badge to see what it means. Only Manual, Sure, Likely and Possible allow bulk deletion. Items to identify that have no owner at all show Undetermined.'=>'每个已归因项目都带有可信度级别，从最可靠到最不可靠依次为：手动（由你亲自归因）、确定、很可能、可能、存疑和推测；将鼠标悬停在徽章上即可查看其含义。只有手动、确定、很可能和可能允许批量删除。完全找不到所有者的待识别项目显示为“未确定”。','What to do with items to identify: first, check whether the record or file belongs to a custom plugin or active feature of your site. If it does, no action is needed. If you are confident it is orphaned clutter from something you removed, you can delete it via the standard checkbox interface — a backup is created first as with all deletions.'=>'如何处理待识别项目：首先检查记录或文件是否属于您站点的自定义插件或活跃功能。如果是，则无需采取任何行动。如果您确信它是已删除内容遗留的孤立垃圾，可以通过标准复选框界面删除它——与所有删除操作一样，会先创建备份。','Attribute manually: when you know who owns an item to identify, the "Attribute manually" panel above the list lets you teach WPOptimizing so the item leaves “To identify”. Open its own help — the ? next to the panel title — for the full guide.'=>'手动归属：当你知道某个待识别项目归谁所有时，列表上方的“手动归属”面板可让你将其告知 WPOptimizing，使该项目离开“待识别”。打开它自己的帮助——面板标题旁的 ?——查看完整指南。','The dataset grows with each contribution. Items still to identify today may be automatically attributed after the next dataset update.'=>'数据集随每次贡献而增长。今天仍待识别的项目可能在下次数据集更新后自动获得归因。','Every database record whose stored value is empty, with a Status column telling you whether each one is To identify, Orphan, Inactive or In use. A convenient way to clear leftover keys that hold nothing.'=>'所有存储值为空的数据库记录，并通过状态列显示其为待识别、孤立、未启用还是使用中。这是清理不存储任何内容的残留键的便捷方式。','This section lists options and post/user/term meta whose value is empty: NULL, an empty string, or an empty serialized/JSON structure (a:0:{}, [], {}). It deliberately ignores values like 0 or false, which carry meaning. A meta key appears only when EVERY record under it is empty, never when only some are; the “Empty records” column then shows the total — all of them empty.'=>'本区列出值为空的选项以及文章/用户/术语元数据：NULL、空字符串，或空的序列化/JSON 结构（a:0:{}、[]、{}）。它有意忽略 0 或 false 这类有意义的值。元数据键只有在其所有记录都为空时才会出现，绝不会在仅有部分为空时出现；此时“空记录”列显示总数——全部为空。','The Status column reuses the same attribution engine as the rest of the plugin, so each row is marked To identify (no known owner), Orphan (owner not installed), Inactive (owner installed but off) or In use (owner running now). This lets you clean with judgement instead of blindly.'=>'状态列复用与插件其余部分相同的归属引擎，因此每行会被标记为待识别（无已知所有者）、孤立（所有者未安装）、未启用（所有者已安装但已关闭）或使用中（所有者正在运行）。这样你就能有依据地清理，而不是盲目操作。','Safety: records owned by an active extension or by WordPress core are shown read-only — they have no checkbox and cannot be deleted here, because a key may be empty on purpose and removing it could break the owner. Only empties marked To identify, Orphan or Inactive can be selected.'=>'安全性：属于已启用扩展或 WordPress 核心的记录显示为只读——它们没有复选框，无法在此删除，因为某个键可能是有意为空，删除它可能会破坏所有者。只能选择标记为待识别、孤立或未启用的空记录。','Empty-row deletion is backup-first and removes only the empty rows for a key, never the non-empty ones that share the same name — so it is fully restorable from the Backups tab.'=>'空行删除采用先备份的方式，且只移除某个键的空行，绝不会动同名的非空行——因此完全可以从「备份」标签页恢复。','Manually tell WPOptimizing who owns items it could not attribute. Matched items leave “To identify” and move to Orphan or Inactive depending on whether the owner is installed.'=>'手动告诉 WPOptimizing 它无法归属的项目归谁所有。匹配的项目将离开“待识别”，并根据所有者是否已安装而转为“孤立”或“未启用”。','Use this panel when you know who owns an item to identify but the shared dataset does not. Add a rule that matches either by “contains” — a family of items that share a fragment, e.g. wysija → MailPoet — or by “exact”, a single specific value. Rules are applied at display time, so matched items leave “To identify” on the next load without re-scanning, and are re-classified as Orphan (owner not installed) or Inactive (owner installed but currently off).'=>'当你知道某个待识别项目的所有者、而共享数据集不知道时，使用此面板。添加一条按“包含”匹配的规则——共享某一片段的一类项目，例如 wysija → MailPoet——或按“精确”匹配单个具体值。规则在显示时应用，因此匹配的项目会在下次加载时离开“待识别”而无需重新扫描，并被重新分类为“孤立”（所有者未安装）或“未启用”（所有者已安装但当前关闭）。','Pick one or more owners per rule. The owner box searches as you type across three sources: your installed plugins and themes, the public wordpress.org repository, and the shared knowledge base — so you can pin the exact extension even if it is no longer installed, or type a slug for one that is not listed. Choosing several owners at once (e.g. MailPoet and MailPoet Premium) creates one rule per owner, which is useful when a value belongs to a plugin and its add-ons.'=>'每条规则可选择一个或多个所有者。所有者框会在你输入时跨三个来源搜索：你已安装的插件和主题、公开的 wordpress.org 仓库以及共享知识库——这样即使某扩展已不再安装，你也能锁定确切的扩展，或为列表中没有的扩展输入 slug。一次选择多个所有者（例如 MailPoet 和 MailPoet Premium）会为每个所有者各创建一条规则，当某个值同时属于某插件及其附加组件时很有用。','Faster still: tick the rows you recognise in the “To identify” list, click “Attribute selected”, and choose the owner(s) once — WPOptimizing creates one exact rule per selected row and owner and opens this panel with them prefilled.'=>'更快的方式：在“待识别”列表中勾选你认识的行，点击“归属所选”，然后一次性选择所有者——WPOptimizing 会为每个所选行和所有者各创建一条精确规则，并打开此面板且预填这些值。','If the owner you pick is currently active, WPOptimizing also refuses to delete the matched items — including items already ticked in a list that was loaded before you added the rule. An owner that is switched off or no longer installed does not protect anything: attributing an orphan is how you get to delete it knowingly.'=>'如果你选择的归属方当前处于启用状态，WPOptimizing 还会拒绝删除匹配到的项目——包括在添加规则之前载入的列表中已被勾选的项目。已停用或已不再安装的归属方不提供任何保护：为孤立项目指定归属，正是为了让你在明确知情的前提下删除它。','The rules you have added are listed under the form with their own search, owner filter and pagination; click “Remove” to delete a rule. Removing a rule sends its matched items back to “To identify” on the next load.'=>'你添加的规则会列在表单下方，并带有各自的搜索、所有者筛选和分页；点击“移除”可删除某条规则。移除一条规则会在下次加载时将其匹配的项目送回“待识别”。','With your consent (the shared-dataset setting), each rule is also sent — batched and off-request, never blocking the page — to the shared knowledge base, where it is verified before being promoted. Your manual hints improve automatic attribution for everyone over time.'=>'在你同意的情况下（共享数据集设置），每条规则还会——批量并在请求之外发送，绝不阻塞页面——发送到共享知识库，在被采纳之前会先经过验证。随着时间推移，你的手动提示会改进所有人的自动归属。','Ask the shared knowledge base to suggest the owner of database records still to identify. After each analysis the sure ones are applied on their own; you confirm the rest, and nothing is ever deleted automatically.'=>'让共享知识库为仍待识别的数据库记录建议所属对象。每次分析后，确定的建议会自动应用；其余的由你确认，且绝不会自动删除任何内容。','The assistant appears under Analysis results › To identify › Database and under Orphans › Database. It sends only the identifier NAMES of the records shown (option, meta, cron and table names — never their values or any content) to the shared knowledge base, which returns the most likely owning plugin or theme for each one. On Orphans it also compares the answer with the owner already on screen and flags the records where the two disagree, which is what you want to see before deleting anything.'=>'助手出现在「分析结果 › 待识别 › 数据库」和「孤立 › 数据库」中。它只把所显示标识符的名称（选项名、元数据名、计划任务名和表名——绝不包含其值或任何内容）发送到共享数据集，并为每一项返回最可能的归属插件或主题。在「孤立」中，它还会把答案与屏幕上已显示的归属作比较，标出两者不一致的记录——这正是删除前要看的。','Each result carries a verdict: Sure or Likely (a confident, namespace-backed match), Possible (a single-owner hint to confirm), or Ambiguous / No data (shown for review only, with no owner). Confident results offer an Accept button that creates an exact manual attribution rule — exactly as if you had typed it yourself — so the record leaves “To identify” on the next load and your choice also feeds the knowledge base. The assistant is retrieval over the shared knowledge base, not a language model: it can only answer with owners that are already recorded there, and it abstains instead of guessing. When there are several Sure results, “Accept all sure suggestions” accepts them in one go.'=>'每条结果都带有判定：确定或很可能（可靠且有命名空间支撑的匹配）、可能（单一归属的线索，待确认），或存疑／无数据（仅供查看，无归属）。可靠的结果会提供「接受」按钮，创建一条精确的手动归属规则——就如同你亲手输入的一样——因此该记录会在下次加载时离开「待识别」，你的选择也会回馈到知识库。助手是对共享数据集的检索，不是语言模型：它只能用其中已记录的归属来回答，不确定时会弃权而不是猜测。当有多个“确定”结果时，“接受所有确定的建议”会一次性全部接受。','Only the Sure verdicts are applied on their own: after each analysis, in the background, the records still to identify are asked about, and the Sure answers become Likely attributions — below anything this site saw itself, never manual rules, and they never delete anything. Everything else waits for you. A record attributed to a plugin that is not installed becomes an orphan like any other, deleted only when you choose to and with a backup first. The assistant is opt-in: it requires the shared-dataset setting to be on, since it relies on the same anonymous knowledge base you contribute to.'=>'只有“确定”判定会自动应用：每次分析后，系统会在后台询问仍待识别的记录，“确定”的答复会成为“很可能”级别的归属——低于本站自身观察到的任何结果，绝不会成为手动规则，也绝不会删除任何内容。其余的都等你决定。归属到未安装插件的记录会像其他记录一样成为孤立项，只有在你决定时才会删除，并且会先备份。该助手需自愿开启：它要求启用共享数据集设置，因为它依赖于你所贡献的同一个匿名知识库。','Records and files confirmed as belonging to plugins or themes that are no longer installed. The manifest attributes them with high certainty, so nothing on the site uses them. Delete them unless you plan to reinstall that extension and want to keep its settings; orphan deletions are backed up automatically beforehand.'=>'已确认属于不再安装的插件或主题的记录和文件。清单以高确定性对其归属，因此网站上没有任何内容使用它们。除非你打算重新安装该扩展并希望保留其设置，否则请删除它们；删除孤立项前会自动创建备份。','Items are listed as Orphans when the dataset can attribute them to a specific extension slug AND that slug is not present in the list of installed plugins or themes. Its confidence must be Possible or higher (Manual, Sure, Likely or Possible) for the item to be classified as an Orphan; with Doubtful or Estimated it stays in “To identify”.'=>'当数据集能将项目归因于特定扩展 slug 且该 slug 不在已安装插件或主题列表中时，项目会列为孤立项。可信度须为“可能”或更高（手动、确定、很可能或可能），项目才会被分类为孤立；若为“存疑”或“推测”，则留在“待识别”中。','Database orphans include options (rows in wp_options), custom tables, user roles, post meta keys, taxonomies, and custom post type records left by plugins that were deleted without running their uninstall routines. File orphans are files and directories inside wp-content that belonged to a plugin or theme folder that is now gone.'=>'数据库孤立项包括选项（wp_options 中的行）、自定义表、用户角色、文章元键、分类法以及未运行卸载程序而被删除的插件遗留的自定义文章类型记录。文件孤立项是 wp-content 内属于已消失的插件或主题文件夹的文件和目录。','Orphan deletion is backup-first: WPOptimizing exports the affected rows (for database items) or records the file paths (for filesystem items) into a restorable backup entry before removing anything. If you delete something by mistake, go to the Backups tab and restore the relevant operation.'=>'孤立项删除采用先备份的方式：WPOptimizing 会在移除任何内容之前，把受影响的行（数据库项）导出、或把文件路径（文件系统项）记录到一条可恢复的备份条目中。如果你误删了什么，打开「备份」标签页恢复对应的操作即可。','Tip: use the extension filter above the table to delete all orphans from a single plugin at once, rather than selecting rows one by one.'=>'提示：使用表格上方的扩展过滤器一次性删除单个插件的所有孤立项，而不是逐行选择。','Protected items: you can mark any database element as protected so it is never deleted, even by a "delete all" action, regardless of how the attribution heuristics classify it. Click the shield icon next to an item in the To identify, Orphans, Inactive or Empty lists to protect it (the shield turns green) or click it again to unprotect. The shield is not shown under In use: those records belong to currently-active extensions and are never a deletion target, so there is nothing to protect them from. To protect (or unprotect) many at once, tick the rows and use the single "Protect selected" button: it unprotects when every ticked row is already protected, and protects otherwise (leaving any already-protected rows untouched). This is a hard safety net for the rare case where an item is misattributed. Developers can protect items programmatically by returning false from the wpoptimizing_can_delete_item filter.'=>'受保护项目：你可以将任何数据库元素标记为受保护，使其永不被删除，即使执行“全部删除”操作也不会，无论归属启发式如何对其分类。在“待识别”“孤立项”“未启用”或“空记录”列表中，点击某个项目旁边的盾牌图标即可保护它（盾牌变绿），再次点击可取消保护。“使用中”中不显示盾牌：这些记录属于当前已启用的扩展，永远不会成为删除目标，因此无需保护。若要一次保护（或取消保护）多个项目，勾选相应行并使用单个“保护所选”按钮：当所有勾选行都已受保护时它会取消保护，否则进行保护（不影响已受保护的行）。对于极少数元素归属错误的情况，这是一道硬性安全防线。开发者可以通过在 wpoptimizing_can_delete_item 过滤器中返回 false 以编程方式保护项目。','Database records and files belonging to plugins or themes that are installed but currently inactive. These items are not needed while the extension is off, but may be required again if it is reactivated. The Plugins & Themes sub-tab lets you uninstall inactive extensions directly.'=>'属于已安装但当前未激活的插件或主题的数据库记录和文件。这些项目在扩展关闭期间不需要，但如果重新激活则可能再次用到。【插件与主题】子选项卡允许您直接卸载未激活的扩展。','Inactive items are a middle ground: the plugin is still installed (its files are present), but it is not active, so its database entries and any files it manages outside its own plugin folder are serving no purpose right now. Whether to delete them depends on your intent: if the plugin is being kept around for occasional use, leave its data alone; if you know you will never reactivate it, uninstall it properly.'=>'非活跃项目是中间状态：插件仍已安装（其文件存在），但未激活，因此其数据库条目和它在自身插件文件夹外管理的任何文件目前没有任何用途。是否删除取决于您的意图：如果插件保留供偶尔使用，请保留其数据；如果您知道永远不会重新激活它，请正确卸载它。','The Plugins & Themes sub-tab lists every inactive plugin and theme with a checkbox for selection. Clicking Delete runs the plugin\'s own uninstall hook (if it has one) and removes its files. The "Also remove associated data" checkbox cascade-deletes the database and filesystem items associated with those slugs from the Inactive lists at the same time.'=>'插件和主题子标签页列出每个非活跃插件和主题，并带有选择复选框。点击删除会运行插件自身的卸载钩子（如果有的话）并删除其文件。"同时删除关联数据" 复选框会同时从非活跃列表中级联删除与这些 slug 关联的数据库和文件系统项目。','Caution: deactivating a plugin does not remove its data. Uninstalling it may, depending on whether the plugin\'s author implemented an uninstall routine. WPOptimizing\'s cascade-delete fills that gap for items it can attribute, but it cannot know about data a plugin stores in non-standard locations.'=>'注意：停用插件不会删除其数据。卸载可能会，这取决于插件作者是否实现了卸载程序。WPOptimizing 的级联删除为其能够归因的项目填补了这一空白，但它无法知道插件在非标准位置存储的数据。','Read-only view of records and files attributed to currently active plugins or themes. No deletion is allowed here. It is an audit view so you can see what active extensions are storing and how much space they use.'=>'当前活跃插件或主题所归属的记录和文件的只读视图。此处不允许任何删除操作。这是一个审计视图，供您查看活跃扩展存储了哪些内容以及占用了多少空间。','The In use list (Analysis results › In use) gives you a complete picture of what each running plugin or theme is storing in your database and filesystem. Because the extension is active, deleting these items would break functionality — the tab is intentionally read-only. Its purpose is transparency and accountability.'=>'“使用中”列表（分析结果 › 使用中）提供每个运行中的插件或主题在您的数据库和文件系统中存储内容的完整概况。由于扩展处于活跃状态，删除这些项目会破坏功能——该标签页被有意设为只读。其目的是透明度和问责制。','Use the extension filter to drill down into a single plugin and see every option, post meta key, custom table or file it owns. This is useful when auditing a new plugin before committing to it, or when investigating unexpected database growth.'=>'使用扩展过滤器深入研究单个插件，查看其拥有的每个选项、文章元键、自定义表或文件。在决定使用新插件之前进行审计，或在调查意外的数据库增长时，这非常有用。','Each item carries its confidence level (Manual, Sure, Likely, Possible, Doubtful, Estimated or Undetermined), which says how its owner was established: from your own rule, captured live, read from the code or the shared dataset, or guessed from a prefix. Here it matters only for correcting a wrong owner or protecting a record, since nothing in this list is deleted.'=>'每个项目都带有其置信度（手动、确定、很可能、可能、存疑、推测或未确定），说明其拥有者是如何确定的：来自您自己的规则、实时捕获、从代码或共享数据集中读取，或根据前缀推测。在这里，它只用于更正错误的拥有者或保护某条记录，因为此列表中的任何内容都不会被删除。','Tracks your site\'s database size, autoload weight, table overhead and other metrics over time. A snapshot is recorded automatically after every scan and cleanup so you can measure the impact of each action.'=>'随时间追踪您网站的数据库大小、自动加载权重、表额外开销和其他指标。每次扫描和清理后都会自动记录快照，以便您衡量每次操作的效果。','Every time a scan completes or a cleanup runs, WPOptimizing captures a snapshot of key metrics: total database size, autoloaded options weight, total table overhead, number of orphaned records, and more. These snapshots build a timeline you can browse to see whether your site is getting leaner over time.'=>'每次扫描完成或清理运行时，WPOptimizing 都会捕获关键指标的快照：数据库总大小、自动加载选项权重、表总开销、孤立记录数量等。这些快照构建了一个时间轴，您可以浏览以查看站点是否随时间变得更精简。','The headline cards at the top summarise the metrics that matter most — including a Server TTFB card with a trend sparkline — each showing the current value, the change since the baseline, and a mini chart of its evolution. A card always shows the latest recorded value of its metric, even if the most recent snapshot happened to be a database-only scan that did not capture it, so the same set of cards appears consistently.'=>'顶部的重点卡片汇总了最重要的指标——包括一张带趋势迷你图的服务器 TTFB 卡片——每张都显示当前值、相对基线的变化以及其演变的迷你图。卡片始终显示其指标最近一次记录的值，即使最近一次快照恰好是仅数据库的扫描而未捕获它，因此卡片集合会保持一致地显示。','The baseline is the very first snapshot recorded. All subsequent values are shown relative to it so you can see absolute improvements at a glance. You can reset the baseline at any time — for example, after a major cleanup — to start measuring from a new reference point.'=>'基线是记录的第一个快照。所有后续值都相对于它显示，以便您一目了然地看到绝对改善。您可以随时重置基线——例如，在重大清理之后——从新的参考点开始测量。','The Export button streams the full timeline as a CSV file. Import it into a spreadsheet to build your own charts, share it with a client, or keep it as an audit record.'=>'导出按钮将完整时间轴流式传输为 CSV 文件。将其导入电子表格以构建自己的图表、与客户共享或作为审计记录保存。','Browse the timeline with the event and date filters, per-page and search — the same controls as the other tables. You decide how long snapshots are kept with the "Keep timeline data" control below the timeline (Forever, 3 months by default, 6 months or 1 year); older ones are pruned automatically each day, while the pinned baseline is always kept.'=>'用事件和日期筛选、每页数量和搜索浏览时间线——与其他表格相同的控件。你可通过时间线下方的“保留时间线数据”控件决定快照的保留时长（永久、默认 3 个月、6 个月或 1 年）；较旧的会每天自动清除，而固定的基准始终保留。','A change journal for the whole site: what other plugins and themes add or remove over time — tables, options, post/user meta keys, scheduled events and top-level files — each dated and attributed when possible.'=>'整个站点的变更日志：其他插件和主题随时间添加或移除的内容 — 表、选项、文章/用户元键、计划事件和顶层文件 — 每一项都带有日期并尽可能标注归属。','When WPOptimizing is installed it captures a baseline signature of your site: the set of database tables, option names, post and user meta keys, scheduled cron hooks, and the top-level entries under plugins, themes, mu-plugins and uploads. From then on it compares the current state against that baseline at meaningful moments and records what changed.'=>'安装时，WPOptimizing 会捕获你站点的基线签名：数据库表、选项名、文章和用户元键、计划的 cron 钩子，以及 plugins、themes、mu-plugins 和 uploads 下的顶层条目集合。此后，它会在关键时刻将当前状态与该基线进行比较，并记录发生的变化。','A change is captured whenever a plugin or theme is installed, activated, deactivated, deleted or updated, and after each analysis. This has no per-page-load cost — nothing is measured on normal requests. When the change rides a plugin or theme action, that extension is recorded as responsible, so you can see exactly what a newly installed plugin added to your database and filesystem.'=>'每当插件或主题被安装、启用、停用、删除或更新时，以及每次分析之后，都会捕获一次变更。这不会带来任何每次页面加载的开销 — 普通请求不会进行任何测量。当变更来自插件或主题操作时，会将该扩展记录为负责方，因此你可以准确看到新安装的插件向你的数据库和文件系统添加了什么。','Each entry shows the date, whether the item was added or removed, its type, its name, and the responsible extension (or Unknown for background changes). Filter by type or change and search by name, with the same controls as the other tables. The journal is capped and kept out of autoload, so it never weighs on the site; you can clear it at any time and tracking continues from the current baseline.'=>'每条记录会显示日期、该项是被添加还是移除、其类型、名称以及负责的扩展（后台变更则显示「未知」）。可按类型或变更筛选并按名称搜索，控件与其他表相同。日志有上限且不参与自动加载，因此绝不会拖累站点；你可以随时清除，跟踪会从当前基线继续。','Every change WPOptimizing makes to your data is backed up first: deletions (orphans, empty rows, media, the general cleanup and its scheduled and automatic runs) and changes (autoload flags, scheduled tasks, .htaccess and wp-config.php edits). Backups are grouped by operation so you can find and restore exactly what a specific action changed. Manual backups can also be created at any time.'=>'WPOptimizing 对你的数据所做的每项改动都会先备份：删除（孤立项、空行、媒体、常规清理及其计划运行和自动运行）和修改（自动加载标记、计划任务、.htaccess 和 wp-config.php 的编辑）。备份按操作分组，因此你能准确找到并恢复某次操作所改动的内容。你也可以随时手动创建备份。','Before WPOptimizing removes or changes database rows, it serialises them into a backup file under wp-content/wpoptimizing/backups/ (not in the database). For filesystem deletions it writes a manifest and copies each file alongside it; an edited file (.htaccess, wp-config.php) is copied whole. Each entry is tagged with the operation that created it (orphan deletion, database cleanup, autoload change, media deletion, etc.) and a timestamp, so you can quickly find the one you need. If the backup cannot be written — disk full, permissions, or the size limit set in Settings — the action does not run.'=>'在 WPOptimizing 删除或修改数据库行之前，它会把这些行序列化为 wp-content/wpoptimizing/backups/ 下的备份文件（不在数据库里）。对于文件系统删除，它会写入一份清单，并把每个文件复制到清单旁边；被编辑的文件（.htaccess、wp-config.php）会整份复制。每条条目都标记了创建它的操作（孤立项删除、数据库清理、自动加载修改、媒体删除等）和时间戳，便于你快速找到所需的那条。如果无法写入备份——磁盘已满、权限不足或达到「设置」中设定的大小上限——该操作就不会执行。','To restore a backup, open the Backups tab, find the entry, and click Restore. For database backups this re-inserts the rows keeping their original IDs; for file backups it copies the files back to their original paths and reports any it could not restore.'=>'要恢复备份，打开「备份」标签页，找到条目并点击「恢复」。数据库备份会保留原始 ID 重新插入这些行；文件备份则会把文件复制回原始路径，并报告未能恢复的文件。','Old backups are pruned automatically according to the maximum count and maximum age limits set in Settings. You can also delete individual backups manually once you are confident the cleanup was correct. Creating a manual backup from the Backups tab captures the current state of a table or option set you specify.'=>'旧备份根据设置中设置的最大数量和最大期限限制自动清除。一旦确认清理正确，您也可以手动删除单个备份。从备份标签页创建手动备份可捕获您指定的表或选项集的当前状态。','Clean uninstall: by default, deleting the plugin from the Plugins screen removes every trace it created — all settings and transients, scheduled tasks, the object-cache and database drop-ins, the runtime mu-plugin, every backup and scan file, and the WebP/AVIF copies it generated. Your already-optimized images are kept (only the extra next-gen copies and the backups are removed; originals are not restored). You can turn this off in Settings if you plan to reinstall and want to keep your configuration and backups. Note that deactivating the plugin never deletes anything — only deleting it does.'=>'干净卸载：默认情况下，从“插件”页面删除本插件会清除它创建的所有痕迹——所有设置和瞬态数据、计划任务、对象缓存和数据库 drop-in、运行时 mu-plugin、每个备份和扫描文件，以及它生成的 WebP/AVIF 副本。已优化的图片会保留（仅删除额外的新一代副本和备份；不会还原原图）。如果你打算重新安装并希望保留配置和备份，可在“设置”中关闭此项。请注意：停用插件绝不会删除任何内容——只有删除插件才会。','Quick Profiles are the fastest way to configure WPOptimizing for your site type. Each profile bundles a curated set of cleanup rules together with the appropriate performance settings: Safe, Blog and Membership stick to the basic tasks; WooCommerce adds the store-specific ones (sessions, orphaned variations, Action Scheduler); Agency (maximum) adds duplicate metadata and unused tags as well.'=>'快速配置方案是为您的站点类型配置 WPOptimizing 的最快方式。每个配置方案将精心策划的清理规则集与适当的性能设置捆绑在一起：安全、博客和会员仅限于基本任务；WooCommerce 会添加商店专用的任务（会话、孤立的商品变体、Action Scheduler）；代理机构（最大化）还会额外添加重复元数据和未使用标签。','Applying a profile also configures the Cache tab automatically: the appropriate cache backend is installed, query deduplication is enabled or disabled based on the profile\'s recommendation, and the heartbeat rate is set. You can override any of these from the Cache tab after applying a profile.'=>'应用配置方案还会自动配置缓存标签页：安装适当的缓存后端，根据配置方案的建议启用或禁用查询去重，并设置心跳频率。应用配置方案后，您可以从缓存标签页覆盖其中任何设置。','Backup retention: set a maximum number of backup entries, a maximum age in days and a maximum total size. Entries beyond the count or age limit are pruned automatically; when a new backup would cross the size limit, the action stops instead of filling the disk. The minimum retention is 1 entry and 1 day — WPOptimizing always keeps at least the most recent backup.'=>'备份保留：设置备份条目的最大数量、最大期限（天）和最大总大小。超过数量或期限限制的条目会自动清除；当新备份会超出大小上限时，操作会停止，而不是把磁盘写满。最低保留量为 1 个条目和 1 天——WPOptimizing 始终至少保留最新的备份。','License: enter your license key here to activate Pro features (deletion of attributed records, unlimited scan rows, media deduplication). The key is validated against the wpoptimizing.com API. Internet access is required for license checks; they are rate-limited to once per hour.'=>'许可证：在此处输入许可证密钥以激活专业版功能（删除已归因记录、无限扫描行数、媒体去重）。密钥通过 wpoptimizing.com API 进行验证。许可证检查需要互联网访问；每小时限制一次。','Send a JSON POST to an external URL whenever WPOptimizing finishes a scan, a cleanup, a deletion or a dataset upload. Compatible with Slack, Zapier, n8n and any custom HTTP endpoint, and signed with HMAC-SHA256 when you set a secret.'=>'每当 WPOptimizing 完成扫描、清理、删除或数据集上传时，向外部 URL 发送 JSON POST 请求。兼容 Slack、Zapier、n8n 及任何自定义 HTTP 端点；设置密钥后会使用 HMAC-SHA256 签名。','Webhooks let you integrate WPOptimizing events into your existing automation workflows. There is one endpoint, set in Settings › Webhooks, and a POST request goes to it whenever one of the events you selected occurs (with none selected, all of them are sent). The payload is a JSON object with the event, the site URL, the plugin version, a timestamp and the event data.'=>'Webhook 让您将 WPOptimizing 事件集成到现有的自动化工作流中。只有一个端点，在“设置 › Webhooks”中设置；每当您所选的某个事件发生时，就会向其发送 POST 请求（若未选择任何事件，则发送全部事件）。有效载荷是一个 JSON 对象，包含事件、站点 URL、插件版本、时间戳和事件数据。','Every request carries an X-WPOptimizing-Event header with the event name. If you set a signing secret (optional), it also carries X-WPOptimizing-Signature: sha256= followed by the HMAC-SHA256 of the raw JSON body keyed with that secret, so your endpoint can confirm the request is genuine and was not altered in transit.'=>'每个请求都带有一个 X-WPOptimizing-Event 标头，其中包含事件名称。如果您设置了签名密钥（可选），请求还会带有 X-WPOptimizing-Signature: sha256=，后跟以该密钥计算的原始 JSON 正文的 HMAC-SHA256，以便您的端点确认请求是真实的且在传输过程中未被篡改。','Events: scan_completed, cleanup_completed, items_deleted and dataset_uploaded. items_deleted includes the names or paths of what was deleted (up to 100 per request), so send it only to a system you trust.'=>'事件：scan_completed、cleanup_completed、items_deleted 和 dataset_uploaded。items_deleted 包含已删除内容的名称或路径（每个请求最多 100 个），因此请仅将其发送到您信任的系统。','WPOptimizing uses a community manifest that maps plugin and theme slugs to their known database tables, options and files. The more sites that contribute their scan results, the more accurate attribution becomes for everyone.'=>'WPOptimizing 使用社区清单，将插件和主题标识符映射到其已知的数据库表、选项和文件。贡献扫描结果的网站越多，归属对所有人来说就越准确。','Attribution accuracy is the core quality metric of WPOptimizing: the more precisely the plugin can say "this option belongs to plugin X", the safer and more useful the cleanup is. The shared dataset is a crowd-sourced manifest that grows with every participating site. When your site uploads its scan results, the new data is merged into the dataset and made available to every participating site on the next update.'=>'归因准确性是 WPOptimizing 的核心质量指标：插件越能精确地说「此选项属于插件 X」，清理就越安全有效。共享数据集是一个众包清单，随着每个参与站点的加入而增长。当您的站点上传扫描结果时，新数据会被合并到数据集中，并在下次更新时向所有参与的站点提供。','Dataset uploads never include page URLs, post content, user data, option values or personal information. The upload contains only structural metadata: table names, option key patterns, file path patterns, and the plugin slug they are associated with, plus your site’s domain, which authorises the exchange.'=>'数据集上传从不包含页面 URL、文章内容、用户数据、选项值或个人信息。上传只包含结构元数据：表名、选项键模式、文件路径模式以及与之关联的插件 slug，另外还有用于授权交换的你的站点域名。','Languages and custom translations'=>'语言与自定义翻译','English plus eight complete translations. If you want to change a string, put your catalogue in wp-content/languages/plugins/ — never inside the plugin folder, where an update would delete it and where it would not be read.'=>'英文加八种完整翻译。要修改某条文本，请把你的语言文件放在 wp-content/languages/plugins/，绝不要放进插件文件夹——更新会把它删掉，而且它也不会被读取。','The plugin ships English as its source language and eight complete translations: Spanish (es_ES), German (de_DE), French (fr_FR), Italian (it_IT), Portuguese for Portugal (pt_PT), Russian (ru_RU), Arabic (ar) and Chinese Simplified (zh_CN). Portuguese is pt_PT and is not the same as Brazilian Portuguese (pt_BR); a pt_BR site falls back to English until someone contributes that locale.'=>'插件以英文为源语言，并附带八种完整翻译：西班牙语（es_ES）、德语（de_DE）、法语（fr_FR）、意大利语（it_IT）、葡萄牙语-葡萄牙（pt_PT）、俄语（ru_RU）、阿拉伯语（ar）和简体中文（zh_CN）。葡萄牙语是 pt_PT，与巴西葡萄牙语（pt_BR）不同；pt_BR 站点会保持英文，直到有人贡献该语言。','Catalogues are shipped in the WordPress 6.5 performance format (.l10n.php), which loads faster than the classic .mo and is the format WordPress prefers. The .pot template ships too, which is what a translation tool needs to start a new locale or to send us a correction.'=>'语言文件以 WordPress 6.5 的性能格式（.l10n.php）分发，它比传统的 .mo 加载更快，也是 WordPress 优先使用的格式。.pot 模板同样包含在内，那正是翻译工具新增语言或向我们提交修正时所需要的。','Where to put your own catalogue:'=>'你自己的语言文件该放在哪里：','wp-content/languages/plugins/, named wpoptimizing-<locale>.mo (or .l10n.php). WordPress searches that folder BEFORE the plugin\'s own, so your file wins, and it survives plugin updates — anything inside the plugin folder is replaced on every update.'=>'wp-content/languages/plugins/，命名为 wpoptimizing-<语言代码>.mo（或 .l10n.php）。WordPress 会先搜索该文件夹，之后才是插件自己的文件夹，所以你的文件会胜出，而且能在插件更新后保留下来：插件文件夹内的一切在每次更新时都会被替换。','The one trap worth knowing:'=>'唯一值得知道的陷阱：','do not drop your .mo inside the plugin\'s own languages/ folder. Since WordPress 6.5 the .l10n.php in the SAME folder is preferred over a .mo, so your file would sit there being ignored with no error to tell you. In wp-content/languages/plugins/ there is no .l10n.php of ours to shadow it, which is exactly why that is the right place.'=>'不要把你的 .mo 放进插件自身的 languages/ 文件夹。自 WordPress 6.5 起，同一文件夹中的 .l10n.php 会优先于 .mo，因此你的文件会被静静忽略，也不会有任何错误提示。在 wp-content/languages/plugins/ 里没有我们的 .l10n.php 去遮盖它，这正是该目录才是正确位置的原因。','Loco Translate and similar tools already save to that folder by default, so following their defaults is correct. If you improve a translation, send it back and it ships for everyone.'=>'Loco Translate 等工具默认就保存到该文件夹，因此按它们的默认设置操作即可。如果你改进了某个翻译，请发回给我们，我们会分发给所有人。','How to get the key, step by step'=>'如何一步步获取密钥','Sign in to the Google Cloud console with any Google account and create a project (or pick an existing one).'=>'使用任意 Google 账号登录 Google Cloud 控制台，然后新建一个项目（或选择已有项目）。','Open the <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PageSpeed Insights API</a> page and press “Enable”.'=>'打开 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PageSpeed Insights API</a> 页面并点击“启用”。','Go to <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Credentials</a> and choose “Create credentials” → “API key”.'=>'进入 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">凭据</a> 页面，选择“创建凭据”→“API 密钥”。','Copy the key, paste it in the field above and save it. Restricting the key to the PageSpeed Insights API is recommended.'=>'复制密钥，粘贴到上方的字段中并保存。建议将该密钥限制为仅用于 PageSpeed Insights API。','Official documentation: <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get started with the PageSpeed Insights API</a>.'=>'官方文档：<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PageSpeed Insights API 入门</a>。','Performance history'=>'性能历史记录','Where you started versus where you are now, and the change after each scan and cleanup. Snapshots are taken automatically when you scan or clean.'=>'你的起点与当前状态的对比，以及每次扫描和清理后的变化。在你扫描或清理时会自动拍摄快照。','No history yet. Run a scan to record the first (baseline) snapshot.'=>'尚无历史记录。运行一次扫描以记录第一个（基线）快照。','Baseline pinned at %s.'=>'基线已固定于 %s。','Pin a new baseline at the current state? Past snapshots are kept; comparisons will start from now.'=>'将当前状态固定为新的基线？过去的快照会保留；比较将从现在开始。','Forever'=>'永久','3 months'=>'3 个月','6 months'=>'6 个月','1 year'=>'1 年','Save'=>'保存','New performance baseline pinned at the current state.'=>'新的性能基线已固定于当前状态。','from %s'=>'从 %s','Timeline'=>'时间线','Event'=>'事件','All events'=>'所有事件','All dates'=>'所有日期','Server TTFB'=>'服务器 TTFB','Autoload size'=>'自动加载大小','Options'=>'选项','Expired transients'=>'过期瞬态','Attachments'=>'附件','DB orphans'=>'数据库孤立项','FS orphans'=>'文件系统孤立项','Reclaimable (duplicates)'=>'可回收（重复项）','Orphan media'=>'孤立媒体','Backups on disk'=>'磁盘上的备份','Cache hit rate'=>'缓存命中率','Queries saved'=>'节省的查询','Baseline'=>'基线','Before scan'=>'扫描前','After scan'=>'扫描后','After cleanup'=>'清理后','%s ms'=>'%s 毫秒','The uploads folder now refuses dumps, logs, keys and environment files. The audit was run again to check it.'=>'上传文件夹现在会拒绝转储、日志、密钥和环境文件。已重新运行审计进行确认。','The protection rules were removed from the uploads folder.'=>'已从上传文件夹移除保护规则。','The .htaccess file in the uploads folder could not be written. Nothing was changed.'=>'无法写入上传文件夹中的 .htaccess 文件。未做任何更改。','The selected files were deleted. A backup was taken first and is listed under Backups.'=>'所选文件已删除。删除前已创建备份，可在“备份”中找到。','Nothing found.'=>'未发现任何内容。','Select all'=>'全选','Trunk'=>'主干名','…and %s more'=>'…还有 %s 个','An examination of the uploads folder and the attachment records behind it. It detects, explains and says whose each file is; it only acts on files that should not be downloadable, and only when you ask.'=>'检查上传文件夹及其背后的附件记录。它会检测、解释并指出每个文件属于谁；只处理不应可被下载的文件，并且只在您要求时处理。','Run the audit'=>'运行审计','Last run %s ago.'=>'上次运行于 %s 前。','Not run yet. It reads the uploads folder and the database, and checks a few files over HTTP; nothing is modified.'=>'尚未运行。它会读取上传目录和数据库，并通过 HTTP 检查少量文件；不会修改任何内容。','References are matched by file name, so this errs towards reporting a file as used. It will never call a file unused when it is in use; it may call one used when the name merely appears in some text.'=>'引用是按文件名匹配的，因此结果偏向于把文件判为“正在使用”。它绝不会把正在使用的文件说成未使用；但可能把仅仅在某段文字中出现过名字的文件说成在使用。','The folder walk ran out of time, so this is a partial view. Counts below are a floor, not a total.'=>'目录遍历超时，因此这是不完整的视图。下面的数字是下限，不是总数。','downloadable'=>'可下载','blocked'=>'已拦截','not checked'=>'未检查','Database dumps, logs, backups and environment files under the uploads folder. Each was requested over HTTP: “downloadable” means the server returned it. This is a security finding, not a housekeeping one.'=>'上传目录下的数据库转储、日志、备份和环境文件。每一个都通过 HTTP 请求过：“可下载”表示服务器确实返回了它。这是安全问题，不是整理问题。','Reachable'=>'可访问','Belongs to'=>'属于','Delete the selected files? A backup is taken first; if it cannot be made, nothing is deleted. Check first that the plugin they belong to no longer needs them.'=>'删除所选文件？会先创建备份；如果无法创建，则不删除任何内容。请先确认它们所属的插件已不再需要它们。','A size owned by an attachment AND derivable, by string manipulation, from another URL in your content — which is how some themes build their srcset. Both work today; move one half and the other breaks, at whichever screen width asks for that size. There is nothing to repair: the fix is not to move these files.'=>'某个尺寸既属于一个附件，又可以通过字符串处理从你内容中的另一个 URL 推导出来——一些主题就是这样构建 srcset 的。今天两者都能用；移动其中一半，另一半就会在请求该尺寸的屏幕宽度下失效。这里没有需要修复的：解决办法就是不要移动这些文件。','Also derivable from'=>'也可推导自','Referenced from'=>'引用位置','Dimensions that none of the image sizes this site registers right now would generate, and that no attachment still lists. Compared against the live registry, never against what a name looks like. Those not used anywhere can be deleted here, with a backup first.'=>'本站当前注册的任何图片尺寸都不会生成、且已没有附件列出的尺寸。与当前注册表比较，而不是看名称的样子。任何地方都未使用的可以在这里删除，删除前会先备份。','Generated sizes whose name descends from a different original than the attachment they belong to — what a rename leaves behind when the thumbnails are not regenerated. Harmless today; it matters the moment anything moves these files. Regenerating creates the sizes again with the current name; the old files stay on disk and are listed below, to delete once nothing uses them.'=>'名称来自与其所属附件不同的原始文件的已生成尺寸——这是重命名后未重新生成缩略图留下的结果。今天无害；一旦有东西移动这些文件就会出问题。重新生成会用当前名称再次创建这些尺寸；旧文件保留在磁盘上并列在下方，待不再被使用时删除。','Attachment'=>'附件','Regenerate the thumbnails of the selected attachments? New sizes are created with the current name and the attachment is updated; the old files are not deleted. Up to 10 attachments per run.'=>'重新生成所选附件的缩略图？将以当前名称创建新尺寸并更新附件；旧文件不会被删除。每次最多 10 个附件。','Regenerate thumbnails'=>'重新生成缩略图','The renamed originals themselves (*-mfrh-original*) are cleaned in %s.'=>'重命名后的原始文件本身（*-mfrh-original*）在“%s”中清理。','Renamed-original backups'=>'重命名原图备份','Sizes replaced by a regeneration'=>'重新生成后被替换的尺寸','The old sizes of the attachments regenerated above. No attachment lists them any more; those not used anywhere can be deleted, with a backup first.'=>'上面重新生成的附件的旧尺寸。已没有附件列出它们；任何地方都未使用的可以删除，删除前会先备份。','One image, two originals'=>'一张图片，两个原图','The same image registered under two extensions, typically what a conversion left behind. Which one your site actually serves depends on the optimiser, so this is reported and never resolved automatically.'=>'同一张图片以两种扩展名注册，通常是转换留下的。你的网站实际提供哪一个取决于优化插件，因此这里只报告，绝不自动处理。','Files sitting directly in the uploads folder with no year/month directory. Usually the trace of an old migration, and not a fault in itself. Moving them is what this audit advises against; loose files nothing uses can be deleted, with a backup first.'=>'直接位于上传文件夹中、没有年/月目录的文件。通常是旧迁移留下的痕迹，本身不是错误。移动它们正是本审计所不建议的；没有任何内容使用的零散文件可以删除，删除前会先备份。','Orphan files'=>'孤立文件','Orphan thumbnails'=>'孤立缩略图','Other files'=>'其他文件','Server protection'=>'服务器保护','Keep: it stops the folder being listed or run'=>'保留：防止文件夹被列出或执行','In use: Media library (#%d)'=>'使用中：媒体库（#%d）','not identified'=>'未识别','Media library'=>'媒体库','In use: %s'=>'使用中：%s','Delete it in %s'=>'请在“%s”中删除','Not used: can be deleted'=>'未使用：可以删除','Thumbnails regenerated for %1$d attachment(s); %2$d could not be (file missing or not an image). The old sizes are listed under "Sizes replaced by a regeneration".'=>'已为 %1$d 个附件重新生成缩略图；%2$d 个无法重新生成（文件缺失或不是图片）。旧尺寸列在“重新生成后被替换的尺寸”中。','%s (theme)'=>'%s（主题）','Protect the uploads folder'=>'保护上传文件夹','Adds a rule to the .htaccess file of the uploads folder so the server refuses database dumps, logs, backups, keys and environment files. Archives (.zip, .tar, .gz) are left out because shops and themes serve them as downloads. The files stay where they are: the plugin that writes them keeps working.'=>'在上传文件夹的 .htaccess 文件中添加一条规则，使服务器拒绝提供数据库转储、日志、备份、密钥和环境文件。归档文件（.zip、.tar、.gz）不在其列，因为商店和主题会将其作为下载提供。文件保留在原处：写入它们的插件继续正常工作。','This server runs Nginx, which does not read .htaccess. Add this to the site\'s server block, or ask your host to:'=>'此服务器运行 Nginx，它不读取 .htaccess。请将以下内容添加到站点的 server 块中，或请主机商代为添加：','Remove the protection'=>'移除保护','Protect these files'=>'保护这些文件','Files in the uploads folder with no matching database record (not real attachments) — usually leftovers from uploads, migrations or plugins. Review before deleting.'=>'uploads 文件夹中没有匹配数据库记录的文件（非真实附件）— 通常是上传、迁移或插件遗留的内容。删除前请审查。','Generated thumbnail sizes whose original image is missing or no longer registered. Removing them is normally safe once confirmed.'=>'原始图片缺失或不再注册的已生成缩略图尺寸。确认后移除通常是安全的。','Files stored in named folders (not date-based), typically data generated by plugins (imports, exports, assets). Review carefully before deleting.'=>'存储在命名文件夹（非按日期）中的文件，通常是插件生成的数据（导入、导出、资源）。删除前请仔细审查。','Groups of byte-identical files. The lowest-ID copy is kept and references reassigned to it; the remaining copies can be removed.'=>'字节完全相同的文件组。保留 ID 最小的副本并将引用重新指向它；其余副本可以移除。','Attachments with no detectable reference in content, meta, galleries or parent posts. Heuristic and read-only — confirm each is truly unused before deleting.'=>'在内容、元数据、相册或父文章中检测不到引用的附件。基于启发式且只读 — 删除前请确认每一项确实未使用。','Showing the first %1$s of %2$s items. Re-run the media analysis to load the full list.'=>'显示 %2$s 个项目中的前 %1$s 个。重新运行媒体分析以加载完整列表。','The largest source images and what would help each one — oversized originals, missing WebP/AVIF copies and heavy files.'=>'最大的源图片以及各自的改进方式：尺寸过大的原图、缺失的 WebP/AVIF 副本以及大文件。','The largest source images and what would help each one — oversized originals, missing WebP/AVIF copies and heavy files. Select the ones you want and optimize them in one go.'=>'最大的源图片以及各自的改进方式：尺寸过大的原图、缺失的 WebP/AVIF 副本以及大文件。勾选所需图片，一次性优化。','Heaviest images'=>'最重的图片','No heavy images found yet. Open “Image optimization” and run the analysis to populate this list.'=>'尚未发现大图。打开“图片优化”并运行分析以填充此列表。','Bulk optimization of existing images (recompressing originals and generating their WebP/AVIF copies) is not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含对现有图片的批量优化（重新压缩原图并生成其 WebP/AVIF 副本）。','Optimizing images is a Pro feature — this diagnostic list is free.'=>'优化图片是 Pro 功能——此诊断列表是免费的。','Your server cannot process images yet (it needs the GD or Imagick PHP extension), so these are shown for information only.'=>'你的服务器暂时无法处理图片（需要 PHP 的 GD 或 Imagick 扩展），因此这些仅供参考。','Images to act on'=>'待处理图片','Combined weight'=>'合计大小','Search images'=>'搜索图片','Optimize all'=>'优化全部','Recompresses/resizes each original (backup-first, reversible from the Backups tab) and creates the missing WebP/AVIF copies your server supports.'=>'对每个原图重新压缩/调整尺寸（先行备份，可从“备份”标签还原），并创建你的服务器支持的缺失 WebP/AVIF 副本。','Optimize the %d selected image(s)? Originals are backed up first.'=>'优化所选的 %d 张图片？将先备份原图。','Optimize ALL %d filtered image(s)? Originals are backed up first.'=>'优化全部 %d 张筛选后的图片？将先备份原图。','%s already serves WebP/AVIF, so the rule was not added.'=>'%s 已在提供 WebP/AVIF，因此未添加该规则。','The WebP/AVIF rule was removed from the uploads folder.'=>'已从上传文件夹中移除 WebP/AVIF 规则。','Works: asked for a JPEG/PNG the way a browser does, the server answered with its %s copy.'=>'有效：像浏览器那样请求 JPEG/PNG 时，服务器返回了它的 %s 副本。','The server still answers with the original image. mod_rewrite may be off, or another rule answers first: ask your host, or use the <picture> serving.'=>'服务器仍然返回原始图片。可能 mod_rewrite 未启用，或其他规则先响应了：请咨询主机商，或使用 <picture> 方式提供。','The test image could not be requested from the server, so nothing could be checked.'=>'无法向服务器请求测试图片，因此无法进行任何检查。','No image has a WebP or AVIF copy yet, so there is nothing to check.'=>'还没有图片拥有 WebP 或 AVIF 副本，因此没有可检查的内容。','No image has a WebP or AVIF copy yet. Generate the copies, then check again.'=>'还没有图片拥有 WebP 或 AVIF 副本。请先生成副本，然后再检查。','A rule in the uploads folder answers each request for a JPEG, PNG or GIF with its AVIF or WebP copy when the browser accepts it. The address does not change, so it also covers backgrounds in CSS files, page builders and images the theme prints, without any PHP. Images without a copy are served as always.'=>'上传文件夹中的一条规则会在浏览器接受时，用 AVIF 或 WebP 副本响应每个 JPEG、PNG 或 GIF 请求。地址不变，因此也覆盖 CSS 文件中的背景、页面构建器和主题输出的图片，完全不经过 PHP。没有副本的图片照常提供。','This server runs Nginx, which does not read .htaccess. Add this to its configuration, or ask your host to:'=>'此服务器运行 Nginx，它不读取 .htaccess。请把以下内容加入其配置，或请主机商代为添加：','%s already serves WebP/AVIF on this site, so this stays off.'=>'%s 已在本站提供 WebP/AVIF，因此此项保持关闭。','Remove the rule'=>'移除规则','Add the rule and check it'=>'添加规则并检查','The answer carries no "Vary: Accept" header (mod_headers may be off): a shared cache could hand an AVIF to a browser that cannot show it. Ask your host to enable mod_headers.'=>'响应中没有“Vary: Accept”头（可能未启用 mod_headers）：共享缓存可能会把 AVIF 交给无法显示它的浏览器。请让主机商启用 mod_headers。','The images pass through %s. It has to keep one copy per format (Vary: Accept); if your plan does not, remove the rule and keep the <picture> serving, which works behind any CDN.'=>'图片经过 %s。它必须为每种格式保存一份副本（Vary: Accept）；如果你的套餐做不到，请移除规则并保留 <picture> 方式，它在任何 CDN 后面都能工作。','Analyze the images in your uploads — total weight, formats, large files and how many lack a WebP/AVIF copy — then recompress originals (backup-first, reversible), generate WebP and AVIF copies, and auto-resize oversized uploads. Serving the next-gen copies on the front-end is built in.'=>'分析你上传目录中的图片——总大小、格式、大文件，以及有多少缺少 WebP/AVIF 副本——然后重新压缩原图（先备份、可还原），生成 WebP 和 AVIF 副本，并自动缩小过大的上传。前端自动提供新一代副本的功能已内置。','Image settings saved.'=>'图片设置已保存。','The image analysis runs as part of “Analyze now”. Run it to see weight, formats and savings here'=>'图片分析作为“立即分析”的一部分运行。运行后可在此查看大小、格式和可节省空间','or scan images now'=>'或立即扫描图片','Total image weight'=>'图片总体积','Large images (≥ 300 KB)'=>'大图片（≥ 300 KB）','Larger than max size'=>'超过最大尺寸','Without WebP/AVIF copy'=>'无 WebP/AVIF 副本','Estimated WebP savings'=>'预计 WebP 节省','Format'=>'格式','See the heaviest images →'=>'查看最重的图片 →','Generated next-gen copies (created next to each original, served on the front-end):'=>'已生成的新一代副本（创建于每个原图旁，在前端提供）：','Copy format'=>'副本格式','Copies'=>'副本数','Your server cannot process images yet (it needs the GD or Imagick PHP extension).'=>'你的服务器暂时无法处理图片（需要 PHP 的 GD 或 Imagick 扩展）。','Optimizing originals and generating WebP/AVIF copies are Pro features — the analysis above is free.'=>'优化原图和生成 WebP/AVIF 副本是 Pro 功能——上方的分析是免费的。','Shrinks your JPEG/PNG originals (and resizes any larger than your max size) without a visible loss of quality. Backup-first and fully reversible with “Restore originals”. Run it before generating copies, so the copies are made from the optimized originals.'=>'在不可见质量损失的前提下减小 JPEG/PNG 原图的体积（并缩小超过最大尺寸的图片）。先备份，可通过“还原原图”完全还原。请在生成副本之前运行，使副本基于已优化的原图生成。','Optimize %s image' . "\0" . 'Optimize %s images'=>'优化 %s 张图片','Restore originals'=>'恢复原图','Creates .webp / .avif copies next to each image (originals never change) and serves them automatically on the front-end, with a fallback to the original.'=>'在每张图片旁创建 .webp / .avif 副本（原图绝不更改），并在前端自动提供，必要时回退到原图。','%s is active and already serves WebP/AVIF on the front-end, so WPOptimizing will not — you can still generate copies here.'=>'%s 已启用并已在前端提供 WebP/AVIF，因此 WPOptimizing 不会再提供——你仍可以在此生成副本。','Optimize the originals first: the copies are then created from the lighter, optimized images.'=>'请先优化原图：随后副本会基于更轻量的已优化图片生成。','Generate %s WebP copy' . "\0" . 'Generate %s WebP copies'=>'生成 %s 个 WebP 副本','Remove %s WebP copy' . "\0" . 'Remove %s WebP copies'=>'移除 %s 个 WebP 副本','Generate %s AVIF copy' . "\0" . 'Generate %s AVIF copies'=>'生成 %s 个 AVIF 副本','Remove %s AVIF copy' . "\0" . 'Remove %s AVIF copies'=>'移除 %s 个 AVIF 副本','AVIF needs a newer server (PHP 8.1+ GD with AVIF, or Imagick with libheif). WebP is available.'=>'AVIF 需要较新的服务器（PHP 8.1+ 的 GD 支持 AVIF，或带 libheif 的 Imagick）。WebP 可用。','Processed %s…'=>'已处理 %s…','Done. Reloading…'=>'完成。正在重新加载…','Something went wrong. Please retry.'=>'出了点问题。请重试。','For WebP, AVIF and lossy JPEG recompression (40–100). 82 is a good balance; PNG is always lossless.'=>'用于 WebP、AVIF 和有损 JPEG 重新压缩（40–100）。82 是不错的平衡；PNG 始终无损。','Quality by format'=>'按格式设置质量','WebP quality'=>'WebP 质量','AVIF quality'=>'AVIF 质量','0 uses the conversion quality above. AVIF usually looks the same as WebP at a noticeably lower number, around 60.'=>'0 表示使用上方的转换质量。AVIF 通常在明显更低的数值（约 60）下看起来与 WebP 相同。','Never optimize'=>'永不优化','One per line, relative to the uploads folder: a folder (everything inside it), a file name, or a pattern with * such as *-print.jpg. These images are never recompressed or converted on upload. Private folders of shops and forms are always left alone.'=>'每行一个，相对于上传文件夹：一个文件夹（其中的所有内容）、一个文件名，或带 * 的模式，例如 *-print.jpg。这些图片在上传时永远不会被重新压缩或转换。商店和表单的私有文件夹始终不受影响。','One per line, relative to the uploads folder: a folder (everything inside it), a file name, or a pattern with * such as *-print.jpg. These images are never recompressed or converted, in bulk or on upload. Private folders of shops and forms are always left alone.'=>'每行一个，相对于上传文件夹：一个文件夹（其中的所有内容）、一个文件名，或带 * 的模式，例如 *-print.jpg。这些图片永远不会被重新压缩或转换，无论是批量还是上传时。商店和表单的私有文件夹始终不受影响。','Max dimensions (px)'=>'最大尺寸（px）','Down-size images that exceed these (width × height). 0 on an axis disables it. Applies when recompressing.'=>'缩小超过这些尺寸（宽 × 高）的图片。某一轴为 0 表示禁用。在重新压缩时生效。','Image options'=>'图片选项','Lossless mode (do not reduce image quality)'=>'无损模式（不降低图片质量）','Strip metadata (EXIF, comments) for smaller files; the colour profile and orientation are kept'=>'移除元数据（EXIF、注释）以减小文件；保留颜色配置文件和方向','Optimize new uploads: resize oversized images, recompress them and strip their metadata — the full-size original is preserved'=>'优化新上传：缩放过大的图片、重新压缩并去除元数据——完整尺寸的原图会被保留','Serve WebP/AVIF on the front-end (as <picture> sources, falling back to the original)'=>'在前端提供 WebP/AVIF（作为 <picture> 源，回退到原图）','Also backgrounds and theme images: on pages saved by the page cache, inline CSS backgrounds get their WebP/AVIF through image-set() and images outside the content get <picture> sources (the original stays as the fallback)'=>'也包括背景和主题图片：在页面缓存保存的页面上，内联 CSS 背景通过 image-set() 获得 WebP/AVIF，正文之外的图片获得 <picture> 源（原图保留作为后备）','Generate a WebP copy on upload — new images get their copy immediately, without waiting for the bulk pass. AVIF stays a bulk action (too slow per upload).'=>'上传时生成 WebP 副本：新图片会立即获得其副本，无需等待批处理。AVIF 仍为批处理操作（每次上传太慢）。','Analyzed %s ago.'=>'%s前已分析。','Large library: only the first batch was analyzed.'=>'媒体库较大：仅分析了第一批。','Re-scan now'=>'重新扫描','Image sizes'=>'图片尺寸','Posts showing it'=>'显示它的文章','Stop generating'=>'停止生成','%d px wide'=>'宽 %d px','%d px high'=>'高 %d px','cropped'=>'裁剪','Used by the Media Library'=>'媒体库使用','Each size is one more file written for every upload. A size switched off is no longer generated for new uploads; existing files stay. The count only sees images placed in post content: a size your theme prints from its templates (product grids, sliders, featured images) shows 0 here and still matters, so switch off only sizes you recognise.'=>'每个尺寸都会让每次上传多写一个文件。停用的尺寸不再为新上传生成；已有文件保留。此计数只统计放在文章内容中的图片：主题从模板中输出的尺寸（商品网格、轮播、特色图片）在这里显示为 0 但仍然需要，因此只停用你认识的尺寸。','Deleted media is recoverable — file backups available: %s.'=>'已删除的媒体可恢复——可用的文件备份：%s。','Restore from Backups'=>'从备份恢复','Files removed from the media sections (unused attachments, duplicates, orphan files and thumbnails) are backed up first and can be restored here. Restoring puts the files back on disk; deleting permanently frees the backup space. This is the same set of copies as the Backups tab.'=>'从媒体各部分删除的文件（未使用的附件、重复项、孤立文件和缩略图）会先备份，可在此还原。还原会将文件放回磁盘；永久删除会释放备份空间。这与“备份”标签中的副本集相同。','The media trash is empty — nothing has been deleted, or the backups have been pruned.'=>'媒体回收站为空——没有删除任何内容，或备份已被清理。','Finds files in /uploads with no record in the database, orphaned thumbnails, and duplicate media (kept one, reassigned). Free shows everything; deletion is a Pro feature. Media deletions are backed up first and can be restored from the Backups tab.'=>'查找 /uploads 中在数据库里没有记录的文件、孤立缩略图以及重复媒体（保留其一并重新指向引用）。免费版显示全部内容；删除是 Pro 功能。媒体删除会先创建备份，可从「备份」标签页恢复。','Media & uploads'=>'媒体和上传','Media is analysed automatically as part of “Analyze now”.'=>'媒体会作为“立即分析”的一部分自动进行分析。','Last analyzed: %s'=>'上次分析：%s','Run “Analyze now” to see orphaned and duplicate media here.'=>'运行“立即分析”以在此处查看孤立和重复媒体。','Files scanned'=>'已扫描文件','Duplicate set' . "\0" . 'Duplicate sets'=>'重复集','Potentially unused'=>'可能未使用','The scan hit its file limit; results are partial.'=>'扫描已达到文件上限；结果不完整。','Duplicate detection is partial: %s of the media items that share their size with another one were compared (disk read limit).'=>'重复检测不完整：已比较 %s 个与其他文件大小相同的媒体项（磁盘读取限制）。','Image optimization views'=>'图片优化视图','Filter the orphans by kind'=>'按类型筛选孤立文件','Items'=>'项目','Total size'=>'总大小','<strong>Heuristic — verify before deleting.</strong> These attachments have no detectable reference in featured images, post content, post meta (incl. galleries/ACF) or parent posts. But references can live in page builders, theme options, sliders, emails or external systems we can’t see. This list is <strong>read-only</strong>; confirm each is truly unused (e.g. in the Media Library) before removing it.'=>'<strong>启发式 — 删除前请验证。</strong>这些附件在特色图片、文章内容、文章元数据（含相册/ACF）或父文章中均无法检测到引用。但引用可能存在于页面构建器、主题选项、幻灯片、电子邮件或我们无法看到的外部系统中。此列表为<strong>只读</strong>；移除前请确认每一项确实未使用（例如在媒体库中）。','Heads up: these active plugins often reference images dynamically, which this scan cannot see — %s. Be extra careful with images they might use.'=>'注意：这些已启用的插件常以动态方式引用图片，本次扫描无法识别——%s。对它们可能使用的图片请格外小心。','These plugins keep their own list of unused media: %s. Each list is built with a different heuristic, so they will not agree — an item missing from one is not confirmation that the other is right. Check an item yourself before deleting it, whichever list you are looking at.'=>'这些插件各自维护自己的未使用媒体列表：%s。每份列表采用不同的判定方式，因此不会一致——某一项不在其中一份列表里，并不能证明另一份是对的。无论你看的是哪一份列表，删除前都请自己核实每一项。','Detection was bounded on this large site, so some references may have been missed (more items may look unused than really are).'=>'在此大型网站上检测受到限制，因此可能遗漏了一些引用（看起来未使用的项目可能多于实际未使用的）。','Media deletions are backed up first and can be restored from the Backups tab.'=>'媒体删除会先创建备份，可从「备份」标签页恢复。','Search files'=>'搜索文件','Mark selected as known'=>'将所选标记为已知','Mark all as known'=>'将全部标记为已知','Mark the %d selected attachment(s) as known? They will stop appearing as unused.'=>'将所选的 %d 个附件标记为已知？它们将不再显示为未使用。','Mark ALL %d attachment(s) as known? They will stop appearing as unused.'=>'将全部 %d 个附件标记为已知？它们将不再显示为未使用。','Delete all'=>'全部删除','A backup is saved to the Backups tab before deletion, and a file that could not be fully backed up is never deleted. Or mark items as known to keep them and hide them from this list.'=>'删除前会在“备份”选项卡中保存备份，无法完整备份的文件绝不会被删除。或将项目标记为已知，以保留它们并从此列表中隐藏。','Delete the %d selected attachment(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'删除选中的 %d 个附件？将先创建备份。','Delete ALL %d filtered attachment(s)? A backup is created first — and remember this list is heuristic, so verify they are truly unused.'=>'删除全部 %d 个已筛选的附件？将先创建备份——请记住此列表是启发式的，因此请确认它们确实未被使用。','Marking as known keeps these files and hides them from the unused list (reset the known list any time). Deletion is a Pro feature.'=>'标记为已知会保留这些文件并将其从未使用列表中隐藏（可随时重置已知列表）。删除为 Pro 功能。','Clean selected duplicates (keep one)'=>'清理所选重复项（保留一个）','Clean all duplicates'=>'清理所有重复项','Kept files and reassignment are permanent; deleted copies are backed up to the Backups tab.'=>'保留的文件和重新指向是永久性的；已删除的副本会备份到“备份”选项卡。','Clean the %d selected duplicate set(s)? For each, the lowest-ID file is kept, references are reassigned to it, and the rest are deleted (a backup is made first).'=>'清理所选的 %d 个重复项组？对每一组，保留 ID 最小的文件，将引用重新指向它，其余文件删除（将先创建备份）。','Clean ALL %d filtered duplicate set(s)? For each, the lowest-ID file is kept, references reassigned, and the rest deleted (a backup is made first).'=>'清理全部 %d 个已筛选重复项组？对每一组，保留 ID 最小的文件，将引用重新指向它，其余文件删除（将先创建备份）。','Delete the %d selected media file(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'删除所选的 %d 个媒体文件？将先创建备份。','Delete ALL %d filtered media file(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'删除全部 %d 个已筛选媒体文件？将先创建备份。','Redundant original copies left by rename plugins such as Media File Renamer (the *-mfrh-original* files), kept as the attachment original_image. The renamed file is already served, so these are safe to remove. Deleting one saves a backup first and clears the leftover original_image reference.'=>'由 Media File Renamer 等重命名插件留下的冗余原图副本（*-mfrh-original* 文件），作为附件的 original_image 保存。重命名后的文件已在提供服务，因此可以安全删除。删除时会先保存备份，并清除残留的 original_image 引用。','Leftover backups'=>'残留备份','No renamed-original backups were found.'=>'未找到重命名原图备份。','A copy is saved to the Backups tab before deletion, and the leftover original_image reference is cleared.'=>'删除前会在「备份」选项卡中保存一份副本，并清除残留的 original_image 引用。','Delete the %d selected backup(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'删除选中的 %d 个备份？会先创建备份。','Delete ALL %d filtered backup(s)? A backup is created first.'=>'删除全部 %d 个已筛选备份？会先创建备份。','%s (unknown)'=>'%s（未知）','%1$d unused attachment(s) deleted (backup saved to the Backups tab). %2$d skipped.'=>'已删除 %1$d 个未使用的附件（备份已保存到“备份”选项卡）。已跳过 %2$d 个。','%s attachment is marked as known and hidden from this list.' . "\0" . '%s attachments are marked as known and hidden from this list.'=>'已将 %s 个附件标记为已知并从此列表中隐藏。','Reset known list'=>'重置已知列表','Cleaned %1$d duplicate set(s): %2$d files deleted, %3$d posts and %4$d featured images reassigned.'=>'已清理 %1$d 个重复项组：删除 %2$d 个文件，重新指向 %3$d 篇文章和 %4$d 张特色图片。','%d duplicate shared the same file, so only its redundant record was removed (the file was kept).' . "\0" . '%d duplicates shared the same file, so only their redundant records were removed (the files were kept).'=>'%d 个重复项共用同一个文件，因此仅移除了其冗余记录（文件已保留）。','A backup of %d file was saved to the Backups tab.' . "\0" . 'A backup of %d files was saved to the Backups tab.'=>'%d 个文件的备份已保存到备份标签页。','%d set was skipped because its backup could not be created (nothing was deleted for it).' . "\0" . '%d sets were skipped because their backups could not be created (nothing was deleted for them).'=>'%d 个集合被跳过，因为无法创建其备份（未为其删除任何内容）。','How the page reaches the visitor: speculative loading, image loading, preload, lazy embeds, resource hints, self-hosted Google Fonts and a CDN. All optional and reversible; none of them caches whole pages.'=>'页面如何送达访客：推测加载、图片加载、预加载、延迟嵌入、资源提示、本地托管的 Google Fonts 以及 CDN。全部可选且可撤销；都不会缓存整个页面。','Save front-end settings'=>'保存前端设置','What the visitor’s browser downloads and runs: minified copies of your own CSS and JavaScript.'=>'访客浏览器下载并运行的内容：你自己的 CSS 和 JavaScript 的压缩副本。','What the visitor’s browser downloads and runs. From least to most intrusive: minify, delay JavaScript, then critical CSS.'=>'访客浏览器下载并运行的内容。按侵入性从低到高：压缩、延迟 JavaScript，然后是关键 CSS。','Diagnose your server response time (TTFB) and apply the fixes WPOptimizing can do for you in one click. Steps the plugin cannot perform (system cron, PHP/OPcache, hosting) are shown as guidance. Minification is under Speed › Page & browser › CSS & JavaScript.'=>'诊断你的服务器响应时间（TTFB），并一键应用 WPOptimizing 能为你完成的修复。插件无法执行的步骤（系统 cron、PHP/OPcache、主机）会以指引方式显示。压缩功能位于「速度 › 页面与浏览器 › CSS 与 JavaScript」。','Diagnose your server response time (TTFB) and apply the fixes WPOptimizing can do for you in one click. Steps the plugin cannot perform (system cron, PHP/OPcache, hosting) are shown as guidance. Minify, delay JavaScript and critical CSS are under Speed › Page & browser › CSS & JavaScript.'=>'诊断你的服务器响应时间（TTFB），并一键应用 WPOptimizing 能为你完成的修复。插件无法执行的步骤（系统 cron、PHP/OPcache、主机）会以指引方式显示。压缩、延迟 JavaScript 和关键 CSS 位于「速度 › 页面与浏览器 › CSS 与 JavaScript」。','Server response time'=>'服务器响应时间','What WordPress spends before it starts sending the page. The levers WPOptimizing can apply come first; the ones that need server access follow as guidance.'=>'WordPress 开始发送页面之前所花费的时间。先列出 WPOptimizing 可以应用的措施；需要服务器访问权限的措施随后作为指导列出。','No TTFB measurement yet. Let some front-end traffic flow (or run an analysis) and the server response time will appear here, sampled automatically.'=>'尚无 TTFB 测量数据。让一些前端流量通过（或运行一次分析），服务器响应时间会自动采样并显示在此处。','Your server response time is good. Keep the levers below enabled to stay there.'=>'你的服务器响应时间良好。保持下方各项开启以维持现状。','Server TTFB over time'=>'服务器 TTFB 随时间变化','Server TTFB (daily average)'=>'服务器 TTFB（每日平均）','Persistent object cache'=>'持久对象缓存','Keeps expensive database queries in memory — the single biggest server-TTFB win.'=>'将开销大的数据库查询保留在内存中——对服务器 TTFB 最大的改善。','Enable now'=>'立即启用','Collapses identical database queries repeated within the same request.'=>'合并同一请求中重复的相同数据库查询。','Autoload weight'=>'autoload 体积','Options loaded on every request: %s (target under 800 KB). Smart Deactivation turns off autoload for options owned by uninstalled plugins.'=>'每次请求加载的选项：%s（目标低于 800 KB）。智能停用会关闭已卸载插件所属选项的 autoload。','Options loaded on every request. Smart Deactivation turns off autoload for options owned by uninstalled plugins.'=>'每次请求加载的选项。智能停用会关闭已卸载插件所属选项的 autoload。','Smart Deactivation will turn off autoload for options confidently attributed to plugins that are no longer installed. This is reversible. Continue?'=>'智能停用将关闭那些可确信归属于已卸载插件的选项的 autoload。此操作可逆。是否继续？','WordPress Heartbeat'=>'WordPress Heartbeat','The admin Heartbeat fires admin-ajax every minute. Slowing or disabling it lowers PHP/DB load during active sessions.'=>'后台 Heartbeat 每分钟触发一次 admin-ajax。将其放慢或关闭可降低活跃会话期间的 PHP/数据库负载。','Disabled'=>'已关闭','Slowed'=>'已放慢','Disable Heartbeat'=>'关闭 Heartbeat','WP-Cron on visitor requests'=>'访客请求触发的 WP-Cron','By default WordPress runs scheduled tasks during visits, which can add to TTFB. Define DISABLE_WP_CRON in wp-config.php and add a real system cron that hits wp-cron.php every few minutes. This needs server access, so WPOptimizing does not change it for you.'=>'WordPress 默认在访问期间运行计划任务，这可能增加 TTFB。请在 wp-config.php 中定义 DISABLE_WP_CRON，并添加每隔几分钟访问一次 wp-cron.php 的真正系统 cron。这需要服务器访问权限，因此 WPOptimizing 不会替你更改。','On system cron'=>'使用系统 cron','Server & hosting'=>'服务器与主机','PHP %1$s · OPcache %2$s. If the levers above are all green and TTFB is still high, the remaining time is your server: a modern PHP version, OPcache enabled, enough hosting resources and a light theme matter most. WPOptimizing cannot change these.'=>'PHP %1$s · OPcache %2$s。如果上面各项都为绿色而 TTFB 仍然偏高，剩余时间来自你的服务器：现代的 PHP 版本、启用 OPcache、足够的主机资源以及轻量主题最为关键。WPOptimizing 无法更改这些。','enabled'=>'已启用','disabled'=>'已禁用','OPcache on'=>'OPcache 已开','Fetch your Google PageSpeed score and Core Web Vitals. This sends your site URL to Google’s public API and changes nothing on your site.'=>'获取您的 Google PageSpeed 分数和核心网页指标。这会将您的网站网址发送到 Google 的公共 API，且不会更改您网站上的任何内容。','Page to test'=>'要测试的页面','Test mobile'=>'测试移动端','Test desktop'=>'测试桌面端','desktop'=>'桌面端','mobile'=>'移动端','Performance (%s)'=>'性能（%s）','LCP'=>'LCP','INP'=>'INP','CLS'=>'CLS','FCP'=>'FCP','TBT'=>'TBT','Speed Index'=>'速度指数','Largest element (LCP):'=>'最大元素 (LCP)：','It is an image and it is already in your preload list.'=>'这是一张图片，并且已在你的预加载列表中。','It is an image: if it is the same on every page of this kind, add its URL to "Preload key resources" so the browser asks for it first. A featured image is preloaded on its own when that option is on.'=>'这是一张图片：如果此类页面上都是同一张，请将其 URL 添加到“预加载关键资源”，让浏览器优先请求。启用该选项时特色图片会自动预加载。','Field data (real visitors, last 28 days) is included when Google has enough traffic for your site.'=>'当 Google 拥有您网站足够的流量时，将包含实测数据（真实访客，最近 28 天）。','Last tested %s ago.'=>'上次测试于 %s 前。','PageSpeed API key (optional)'=>'PageSpeed API 密钥（可选）','Not required. A free Google API key raises the request quota if you test often.'=>'非必需。如果您经常测试，免费的 Google API 密钥可提高请求配额。','Save API key'=>'保存 API 密钥','Database and Redis'=>'数据库和 Redis','What MySQL and, if you use it, Redis say about themselves: only what needs fixing, with the setting that fixes it. Most of these are changed by your host.'=>'MySQL 以及（如果你在用）Redis 对自身的报告：只列出需要修复的问题，并给出修复它的设置。其中大多数由你的主机商修改。','Nothing to fix'=>'没有需要修复的','Important'=>'重要','Worth a look'=>'值得一看','Database server'=>'数据库服务器','InnoDB buffer pool'=>'InnoDB 缓冲池','Your InnoDB data'=>'你的 InnoDB 数据','Connections used / max'=>'已用连接 / 最大','Redis'=>'Redis','Redis memory'=>'Redis 内存','Redis eviction policy'=>'Redis 淘汰策略','Redis hit rate'=>'Redis 命中率','Home page'=>'首页','Latest post'=>'最新文章','A page'=>'某个页面','Latest product'=>'最新商品','Shop'=>'商店','Busiest category'=>'文章最多的分类','Previous tests'=>'以往测试','Page'=>'页面','Device'=>'设备','Score'=>'分数','Real visitors over time (Chrome UX Report)'=>'真实访客的变化（Chrome UX Report）','Values are the 75th percentile of real Chrome visits to the whole site, in 28-day windows. Lower is better.'=>'数值为整个网站真实 Chrome 访问的第 75 百分位，按 28 天窗口统计。越低越好。','Needs the API key below, with the Chrome UX Report API enabled for it in the Google Cloud console.'=>'需要下方的 API 密钥，并在 Google Cloud 控制台为其启用 Chrome UX Report API。','Load real-visitor history'=>'加载真实访客历史','You do not have permission.'=>'您没有权限。','Real-visitor history loaded.'=>'已加载真实访客历史。','Get one free at the <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Cloud console</a> — it takes a couple of minutes and no card is required.'=>'可在 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Cloud 控制台</a> 免费获取，只需几分钟，无需绑定银行卡。','PageSpeed test failed: %s'=>'PageSpeed 测试失败：%s','PageSpeed test completed.'=>'PageSpeed 测试完成。','Applying an index automatically is a Pro feature.'=>'自动应用索引是 Pro 功能。','That index was not one of the suggestions, so it was not applied.'=>'该索引不属于建议项，因此未被应用。','The table or column no longer exists, so the index was not applied.'=>'该表或列已不存在，因此未应用索引。','That index already exists.'=>'该索引已存在。','The database cannot build this index without locking the table, and the table is too big to lock safely. Convert it to InnoDB in Tables, or have it created from the command line at a quiet time.'=>'数据库无法在不锁定数据表的情况下创建此索引，而该数据表太大，无法安全锁定。请在“数据表”中将其转换为 InnoDB，或在空闲时段通过命令行创建该索引。','The database refused to create the index.'=>'数据库拒绝创建该索引。','Index created. You can undo it below.'=>'索引已创建。您可以在下方撤销。','That index was not one WPOptimizing created, so it was left alone.'=>'该索引并非 WPOptimizing 创建，因此未做改动。','The table no longer exists.'=>'该表已不存在。','The index is still there after removing it. Nothing was changed; try again.'=>'删除后索引仍然存在。未做任何更改，请重试。','The database refused to remove the index. It is still in place, and you can try again below.'=>'数据库拒绝删除该索引。它仍然存在，你可以在下方重试。','Index removed.'=>'索引已移除。','PageSpeed API key saved.'=>'PageSpeed API 密钥已保存。','CSS & JavaScript minification'=>'CSS 与 JavaScript 压缩','Serves minified copies of your local CSS and JS so they download faster. Safe and free: already-minified, external and excluded files are left untouched, and it never runs alongside another optimizer.'=>'提供本地 CSS 和 JS 的压缩副本，使其下载更快。安全且免费：已压缩、外部和已排除的文件保持不变，且绝不会与其他优化工具同时运行。','Another asset optimizer is active (%s). WPOptimizing minification stays off to avoid conflicts.'=>'另一个资源优化工具正在运行（%s）。WPOptimizing 压缩将保持关闭以避免冲突。','Minify CSS'=>'压缩 CSS','Minify JavaScript'=>'压缩 JavaScript','Exclude these handles or URL fragments (one per line)'=>'排除这些句柄或网址片段（每行一个）','Defer JavaScript (load local scripts after the page renders; jQuery stays eager)'=>'推迟 JavaScript（在页面渲染后加载本地脚本；jQuery 保持立即加载）','Do not defer these handles or URL fragments (one per line)'=>'不要推迟这些句柄或网址片段（每行一个）','Load CSS asynchronously (non-blocking render; may briefly flash unstyled until you add critical CSS)'=>'异步加载 CSS（不阻塞渲染；在您添加关键 CSS 之前可能出现短暂的无样式闪烁）','Keep these stylesheets render-blocking (your critical/above-the-fold CSS; one per line)'=>'保持这些样式表为阻塞式（您的关键/首屏 CSS；每行一个）','Critical CSS (inlined in the head, before the async stylesheets, to remove the flash)'=>'关键 CSS（内联在头部，位于异步样式表之前，以消除闪烁）','Paste the above-the-fold CSS generated by your tool of choice. Leave empty to disable.'=>'粘贴由您所选工具生成的首屏 CSS。留空则停用。','Save minification settings'=>'保存压缩设置','JavaScript deferral, asynchronous CSS loading and inlined critical CSS are not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含 JavaScript 推迟加载、异步 CSS 加载和内联关键 CSS。','Pro adds JavaScript deferral (scripts load after the page renders), asynchronous CSS loading and inlined critical CSS on top of this free minification.'=>'Pro在此免费压缩之上增加了 JavaScript 推迟加载（脚本在页面渲染后加载）、异步 CSS 加载以及内联的关键 CSS。','Critical CSS per template'=>'按模板生成关键 CSS','Reads one representative page per template and works out which rules it could possibly use, then inlines that subset so the first paint does not wait for the full stylesheets. The originals keep loading in the background, so anything the extraction missed still arrives.'=>'读取每个模板的一个代表性页面，推断它可能用到哪些规则，再把这部分内联进去，让首次绘制不必等待完整样式表。原始样式表仍在后台继续加载，所以提取遗漏的规则照样会到达。','Generating critical CSS per template is a Pro feature.'=>'按模板生成关键 CSS 是 Pro 功能。','Inlining critical CSS only pays off with asynchronous CSS switched on above: otherwise the full stylesheets still block the first paint and the inlined copy is simply extra bytes.'=>'只有在上面启用了异步 CSS 时，内联关键 CSS 才划算：否则完整样式表依然阻塞首次绘制，内联的副本只是多出来的字节。','The theme or the active plugins have changed since this was generated, so the stored CSS no longer matches what the pages load. Generate it again before relying on it.'=>'自生成以来主题或已启用的插件发生了变化，保存的 CSS 已经和页面实际加载的内容对不上。依赖它之前请重新生成。','Nothing generated yet. Generating only reads pages and writes files; it changes nothing a visitor sees until you apply it.'=>'尚未生成任何内容。生成只会读取页面并写入文件；在你应用之前，访客看到的一切都不会改变。','Never reduce these stylesheets (one handle or URL fragment per line)'=>'永不精简这些样式表（每行一个句柄或网址片段）','Their rules are left out of the inlined copy entirely, so they arrive only with the original sheet.'=>'它们的规则完全不进入内联副本，只随原始样式表到达。','Generate'=>'生成','Apply to the site'=>'应用到站点','Stop applying'=>'停止应用','Delete and revert'=>'删除并还原','Any page loaded with %s ignores the inlined CSS, so a layout problem can be attributed or ruled out without changing a setting.'=>'任何带 %s 加载的页面都会忽略内联的 CSS，因此可以在不改动任何设置的情况下确认或排除版面问题。','Template'=>'模板','Stylesheets'=>'样式表','Original'=>'原始','Inlined'=>'已内联','%1$s (%2$s%%)'=>'%1$s（%2$s %%）','Critical CSS is a Pro feature.'=>'关键 CSS 是 Pro 功能。','Critical CSS deleted. The site is serving its stylesheets exactly as before.'=>'关键 CSS 已删除。站点提供样式表的方式与之前完全一致。','Critical CSS is now being inlined.'=>'关键 CSS 现已内联。','Critical CSS is stored but no longer inlined.'=>'关键 CSS 已保存，但不再内联。','Generated, with %s template(s) that could not be read. Check the table before applying.'=>'已生成，其中 %s 个模板无法读取。应用前请检查表格。','Generated. Nothing has changed for visitors yet — review the sizes and the preview, then apply.'=>'已生成。访客看到的内容尚未改变——查看大小与预览后再应用。','Delay JavaScript until the first interaction'=>'延迟 JavaScript 到首次交互','Holds scripts back until the visitor moves, taps, scrolls or types — the single biggest improvement to responsiveness, because that work leaves the load path entirely. Off by default, and conservative when on.'=>'在访客移动、触摸、滚动或输入之前一直扣住脚本——对响应速度提升最大的一项，因为这部分工作完全离开了加载路径。默认关闭，开启后也保持保守。','Another asset optimizer is active (%s). Delaying stays off: two plugins rewriting the same script tags is how a site ends up with scripts that never run.'=>'已有另一个资源优化插件在运行（%s）。延迟保持关闭：两个插件改写同一批脚本标签，正是站点出现脚本永不执行的原因。','Delaying JavaScript until the first interaction is a Pro feature.'=>'延迟 JavaScript 到首次交互是 Pro 功能。','What to delay'=>'延迟哪些','Known third parties only (recommended)'=>'仅限已知第三方（推荐）','Analytics, tag managers, pixels, chat widgets and social embeds. Your theme and plugins keep running exactly as they do now, so nothing that renders the page is affected.'=>'分析统计、代码管理器、像素、聊天挂件和社交嵌入。你的主题和插件与现在完全一样地运行，绘制页面的部分不受影响。','Every script except the exclusions'=>'除排除项外的所有脚本','Faster, and the option that can break things: a slider, a menu or a cart that needs its script to run before the visitor touches anything will look broken until they do. Test the site before leaving this on.'=>'更快，也是可能弄坏东西的选项：轮播、菜单或购物车如果需要在访客操作前就运行脚本，在那之前都会像是坏了。保持开启前请先测试站点。','Run anyway after'=>'无论如何在此秒数后执行','seconds'=>'秒','The safety timer. Without it a visit that never interacts would never load analytics, and every bounce would go uncounted — which is how a site owner stops trusting their numbers.'=>'安全定时器。没有它，没有任何交互的访问就永远不会加载分析统计，每一次跳出都不会被计入——站点所有者正是这样开始不再相信自己的数据。','jQuery'=>'jQuery','WooCommerce cart and checkout'=>'WooCommerce 购物车和结账','Elementor'=>'Elementor','Other page builders (Avada, Divi, Bricks, Oxygen, Breakdance)'=>'其他页面构建器（Avada、Divi、Bricks、Oxygen、Breakdance）','Sliders and carousels'=>'滑块和轮播','Maps'=>'地图','Forms'=>'表单','Never delay these kinds of script'=>'永不延迟这些类型的脚本','The usual suspects when something stops working after delaying "all scripts": tick the ones your site uses.'=>'延迟“所有脚本”后出问题时的常见元凶：勾选你的网站使用的那些。','Never delay these (one handle or URL fragment per line)'=>'绝不延迟这些（每行一个句柄或网址片段）','Also delay these (one handle or URL fragment per line)'=>'同时延迟这些（每行一个句柄或网址片段）','Adds to the recommended profile without switching to the aggressive one.'=>'在不切换到激进模式的前提下扩充推荐配置。','Never delayed, whatever is set above: consent and cookie banners, payment providers and captchas. Delaying a consent banner is a compliance problem, not a speed one, and a delayed payment or captcha script fails silently — the form looks fine and submits nothing.'=>'无论上面怎么设置都绝不延迟：同意与 Cookie 横幅、支付服务商和验证码。延迟同意横幅是合规问题而不是速度问题，而被延迟的支付或验证码脚本会悄无声息地失败——表单看起来正常，却什么也没提交。','To compare both versions of a page, add %s to any URL: that request loads every script immediately, without changing this setting.'=>'要对比页面的两个版本，在任意网址后加上 %s：该请求会立即加载全部脚本，且不改动此设置。','Save delay settings'=>'保存延迟设置','Delaying JavaScript is a Pro feature.'=>'延迟 JavaScript 是 Pro 功能。','Delay settings saved.'=>'延迟设置已保存。','Minification settings saved.'=>'压缩设置已保存。','Run a one-off, consented test that measures exactly where the server time goes — boot, plugin loading, routing, database and render. It does NOT affect your site in normal operation: nothing runs until you start a test, and it stops on its own after a few requests.'=>'运行一次性的、经你同意的测试，精确测量服务器时间花在哪里：启动、插件加载、路由、数据库和渲染。在正常运行时它不会影响你的网站：在你启动测试之前不会运行任何内容，并会在若干请求后自动停止。','Run diagnostic test'=>'运行诊断测试','The deep analysis test profiles your requests to pinpoint the exact culprit. The TTFB diagnosis, levers and trend above stay free.'=>'深度分析测试会对你的请求进行剖析，以精确定位罪魁祸首。上方的 TTFB 诊断、优化手段和趋势仍然免费。','Run profiling test'=>'运行性能分析测试','Profiles the next few front-end requests, then disarms automatically.'=>'分析接下来的若干前端请求，然后自动解除。','Diagnostic report'=>'诊断报告','The detailed breakdown of your last profiling test: where the server time went, which hooks and plugins cost the most, and what to do about it.'=>'上次诊断测试的详细分解：服务器时间花在哪里、哪些钩子和插件开销最大，以及该怎么办。','No profiling report yet. Run a diagnostic test from the assistant and it will appear here.'=>'尚无诊断报告。在助手中运行一次诊断测试，报告即会显示在此。','Back to the assistant'=>'返回助手','Boot — loading PHP, WordPress and plugins'=>'启动 — 加载 PHP、WordPress 和插件','Plugin startup (init) — plugins set themselves up'=>'插件启动（init）— 插件进行自身初始化','Everything loaded (wp_loaded)'=>'全部加载完成（wp_loaded）','Routing — choosing the page'=>'路由 — 选择页面','Main query — fetching the content'=>'主查询 — 获取内容','Render — building and sending the page'=>'渲染 — 构建并发送页面','Most of the time is spent just loading WordPress and the active plugins — usually a sign of too many or very heavy plugins.'=>'大部分时间仅花在加载 WordPress 和已启用的插件上——通常说明插件过多或过于沉重。','Most of the time is spent while plugins start up on every page load (the WordPress init step). The list below shows what ran and when — if the biggest entry is named after a plugin, that is the one to look at.'=>'大部分时间花在插件于每次页面加载时进行初始化的过程中（WordPress 的 init 步骤）。下面的列表显示了运行了什么以及何时运行——如果最大的一项以某个插件命名，那就是该看的那个。','Most of the time is spent right after everything loaded — see the list below to find which hook is responsible.'=>'大部分时间花在全部加载完成之后——请查看下方列表找出是哪个钩子导致的。','Most of the time is spent working out which page this is — permalink rules, redirects and anything hooked into routing.'=>'大部分时间花在判断这是哪个页面上：固定链接规则、重定向，以及任何挂到路由上的东西。','Most of the time is spent on the query that fetches the content of this page — often slow queries or a plugin filtering them.'=>'大部分时间花在获取本页内容的查询上——通常是慢查询，或者某个插件在过滤它们。','Most of the time is spent building and sending the page itself — this is the theme and, if you use one, the page builder.'=>'大部分时间花在构建并发送页面本身上：这就是主题，以及你若使用了页面构建器的话，还有它。','Slowest of the last %2$d profiled requests: %1$d ms · captured %3$s ago.'=>'最近 %2$d 次分析请求中最慢的一次：%1$d 毫秒 · 于 %3$s前捕获。','%1$d samples · median %2$d ms · p95 %3$d ms · range %4$d–%5$d ms.'=>'%1$d 次采样 · 中位数 %2$d ms · p95 %3$d ms · 区间 %4$d–%5$d ms。','One sample, so there is no spread to judge yet — run the test again to see whether this is typical.'=>'只有一次采样，还判断不出波动范围——再跑一次测试，看看这是否具有代表性。','The object cache was COLD for this request: it had to be filled from the database. A warm request is considerably faster.'=>'这次请求的对象缓存是冷的：它必须从数据库填充。缓存热起来之后的请求要快得多。','The object cache was warm for this request.'=>'这次请求的对象缓存是热的。','a visit that runs WP-Cron is much slower than one that does not'=>'触发 WP-Cron 的访问比未触发的慢得多','a request that misses the object cache is much slower than one that hits it'=>'未命中对象缓存的请求比命中的慢得多','This is one real request from the test. The TTFB shown in the Performance assistant above is instead a rolling average of recent visits, so the two numbers differ — front-end TTFB swings request to request (%s).'=>'这是测试中的一次真实请求。而上方性能助手显示的 TTFB 是近期访问的滑动平均值，因此两个数字不同——前端 TTFB 会因请求而异（%s）。','Here it is not one plugin: the biggest single step is WordPress itself (%s), which every plugin on the site shares.'=>'这里没有哪个插件该负责：最大的单个步骤是 WordPress 本身（%s），站点上所有插件都共用它。','Where the time went (top hooks)'=>'时间都花在哪了（主要钩子）','first use — warms up after this'=>'首次使用——之后就热了','fired by %s'=>'由 %s 触发','These are the actions/filters that consumed the most server time, each with the stage it ran in — they do not all belong to the biggest bar above. A hook named after a plugin (e.g. woocommerce_, elementor/) points straight at that plugin; a slow generic hook means several plugins share the cost.'=>'这些是消耗服务器时间最多的动作/过滤器，每一项都标注了它所处的阶段——它们并不都属于上面最大的那根柱子。以插件命名的钩子（例如 woocommerce_、elementor/）直接指向该插件；一个缓慢的通用钩子则意味着多个插件在分摊这份开销。','Database this request'=>'本次请求的数据库','%1$d queries · %2$d ms · %3$d slow (>50 ms)'=>'%1$d 次查询 · %2$d 毫秒 · %3$d 次慢查询（>50 毫秒）','Most repeated queries by source (plugin/theme):'=>'按来源（插件/主题）最常重复的查询：','Full table scan with no usable index'=>'全表扫描，没有可用的索引','Full table scan'=>'全表扫描','Sorting rows without an index (filesort)'=>'在没有索引的情况下排序（filesort）','Building a temporary table'=>'创建临时表','Slow queries that may be missing an index'=>'可能缺少索引的慢查询','(~%1$s rows scanned · %2$d ms)'=>'（扫描约 %1$s 行 · %2$d 毫秒）','Suggested index:'=>'建议的索引：','Create this index now? On a large table it can take a while and load the database meanwhile. You can remove it afterwards.'=>'现在创建此索引吗？对大表来说可能需要一些时间，并在此期间增加数据库负载。之后可以删除它。','Apply index'=>'应用索引','These SELECTs scanned a large table without a usable index. Adding the suggested index usually makes them much faster. WPOptimizing only creates one when you press its button and confirm, and you can remove it again below; on a large table it can take a while and load the database meanwhile, so do it at a quiet time. Queries with a compound or range condition are listed without a suggestion because the right index depends on the exact query.'=>'这些 SELECT 查询在没有可用索引的情况下扫描了一个大表。添加建议的索引通常能让它们快很多。只有在你点击按钮并确认后，WPOptimizing 才会创建索引，并且你可以在下方再次删除；对大表来说可能需要一些时间并增加数据库负载，请在空闲时进行。带有复合或范围条件的查询没有给出建议，因为合适的索引取决于具体查询。','Pro can create a suggested index for you with one click (and undo it just as easily).'=>'Pro可一键为您创建建议的索引（并同样轻松地撤销）。','Indexes WPOptimizing created'=>'WPOptimizing 创建的索引','on'=>'在','Remove this index?'=>'移除该索引？','What to do about it'=>'该怎么办','Nothing stands out: the server response time is healthy. The remaining time is your server/hosting (PHP version, OPcache, resources), which WPOptimizing cannot change.'=>'没有突出问题：服务器响应时间良好。其余时间属于你的服务器/主机（PHP 版本、OPcache、资源），这是 WPOptimizing 无法改变的。','Anything left after these is your server/hosting (PHP version, OPcache, hosting resources, a light theme), which WPOptimizing cannot change.'=>'在这些之后剩下的时间属于你的服务器/主机（PHP 版本、OPcache、主机资源、轻量主题），这是 WPOptimizing 无法改变的。','cold object cache or a visit that ran WP-Cron'=>'对象缓存未预热，或某次访问触发了 WP-Cron','cold object cache'=>'对象缓存未预热','Translation loading (~%d ms)'=>'加载翻译（约 %d 毫秒）','Plugins translate their text on every page load. Keep WordPress and your plugins up to date (6.5+ caches translations), and remove language files for locales you do not use.'=>'插件在每次页面加载时翻译其文本。请保持 WordPress 和插件更新（6.5+ 会缓存翻译），并删除你不使用的语言文件。','Loading the options table (~%1$d ms this request)'=>'加载选项表（本次请求约 %1$d 毫秒）','Your autoload payload is already healthy (%1$s), so this is a slow one-off request (%2$s), not a size problem. Typical requests are much faster; no action needed.'=>'你的自动加载体量已很健康（%1$s），所以这只是一次偶发的慢请求（%2$s），并非体量问题。正常请求要快得多，无需处理。','Loading the options table (~%d ms)'=>'加载选项表（约 %d 毫秒）','Too many autoloaded options are read on every request. Trim them from the Autoload tab (Smart Deactivation is reversible).'=>'每次请求都读取了过多的 autoload 选项。请在 Autoload 选项卡中精简它们（智能停用可撤销）。','Open Autoload'=>'打开 Autoload','Options that do not exist (~%d ms)'=>'不存在的选项（~%d ms）','These options are asked for on every request but are not stored, so each lookup returns nothing: %s. This is the plugin that owns them falling back to a default, not a fault of your site — it is worth reporting to its author.'=>'这些选项在每次请求时都会被查询，但并未存储，因此每次查找都返回空：%s。这是拥有它们的插件回退到了默认值，并不是你站点的故障——值得反馈给它的作者。','Your theme %1$s is doing heavy work (~%2$d ms)'=>'你的主题 %1$s 正在进行繁重的工作（~%2$d 毫秒）','The active theme runs real work on every page load. You cannot deactivate the active theme, but a lighter one would cut this — or review the theme / page-builder options and switch off elements and features you do not use.'=>'当前主题在每次页面加载时都会执行实际工作。你无法停用当前主题，但更轻量的主题能减少这一点——或检查主题/页面构建器的选项，关闭你不使用的元素和功能。','%1$s is doing heavy work (~%2$d ms)'=>'%1$s 正在做繁重的工作（~%2$d ms）','Your site depends on this one, so switching it off is not an option — but it rarely needs everything it loads. Check its own settings for features you do not use, and stop its CSS and JavaScript loading on the pages that do not need them from the Smart Assets tab.'=>'你的站点依赖它，关闭并不是选项——但它很少需要自己加载的全部内容。在它自己的设置里看看有没有你不用的功能，并在 Smart Assets 标签页里让它的 CSS 和 JavaScript 不要加载到不需要的页面上。','Open Smart Assets'=>'打开 Smart Assets','The plugin %1$s is doing heavy work (~%2$d ms)'=>'插件 %1$s 正在进行繁重的工作（~%2$d 毫秒）','This plugin spends real time on every page load. Deactivate it if you no longer need it, or look for a lighter alternative.'=>'该插件在每次页面加载时都消耗实际时间。若不再需要请停用它，或寻找更轻量的替代方案。','Database queries (%1$d queries · %2$d ms this request)'=>'数据库查询（%1$d 条查询 · 本次请求 %2$d 毫秒）','A persistent object cache is already active, so these are uncached queries on this specific request (often a %s outlier). If the query time stays high across requests, the heaviest plugin listed above is the place to look.'=>'持久对象缓存已启用，因此这些是本次特定请求中未缓存的查询（通常是%s导致的离群值）。若查询时间在所有请求中都居高不下，请查看上面列表中开销最大的插件。','Database queries (%1$d queries · %2$d ms)'=>'数据库查询（%1$d 次查询 · %2$d 毫秒）','A persistent object cache keeps expensive queries in memory and is the single biggest server-TTFB win. Enable it from the Cache tab.'=>'持久对象缓存将昂贵的查询保留在内存中，是提升服务器 TTFB 的最大手段。请在缓存选项卡中启用它。','Open Cache'=>'打开缓存','One file accounts for most of your CSS and JavaScript: %1$s (%2$s)'=>'一个文件就占了你大部分的 CSS 和 JavaScript：%1$s（%2$s）','Your pages ship %s of CSS and JavaScript'=>'你的页面会发送 %s 的 CSS 和 JavaScript','Measured across the %3$d assets this site enqueues: %1$s of CSS and %2$s of JavaScript. Every visitor downloads this before the page can finish. The biggest win is usually not making the files smaller but not sending them where they are not used — Smart Assets shows which plugin owns each one and lets you unload it per page.'=>'基于本站点加入队列的 %3$d 个资源测得：CSS %1$s，JavaScript %2$s。每位访客都要先下载这些，页面才能完成。最大的收益通常不是把文件变小，而是不要把它们发送到用不到的地方——Smart Assets 会显示每个文件属于哪个插件，并允许你按页面卸载它。','%1$d of the %2$d images on your home page have no width and height'=>'首页 %2$d 张图片中有 %1$d 张没有设置宽度和高度','Without those two attributes the browser cannot reserve the space, so everything below each image jumps down when it finally arrives. This is what Core Web Vitals measures as layout shift, and it is the single most irritating thing a page can do to a reader. Turn on content image optimization below, and for images printed by the theme rather than by the content, ask its author — or replace them with images from the media library, which carry their size.'=>'缺少这两个属性，浏览器就无法预留空间，于是每张图片下方的内容都会在图片终于加载出来时向下跳动。这正是 Core Web Vitals 所衡量的布局偏移，也是一个页面能对读者做的最恼人的事。请在下方开启内容图片优化；对于由主题而非内容输出的图片，请咨询主题作者——或者改用媒体库中的图片，它们自带尺寸信息。','%1$d of the %2$d images on your home page load immediately'=>'首页 %2$d 张图片中有 %1$d 张会立即加载','Images the visitor has not scrolled to yet are competing for bandwidth with the ones they can already see, so the visible part of the page finishes later than it needs to. Content image optimization adds the deferral automatically and leaves the first image eager, which is the one that should load first.'=>'访客还没有滚动到的图片，正在与他们已经看得见的图片争抢带宽，于是页面可见部分的加载比实际需要的更晚完成。内容图片优化会自动添加延迟加载，并让第一张图片保持立即加载——那正是应当最先到达的一张。','%1$d of the %2$d images on your home page offer only one size'=>'首页 %2$d 张图片中有 %1$d 张只提供一种尺寸','With no list of alternative sizes, a phone downloads the same file a desktop does — often several times larger than its screen can show. Images inserted from the media library get that list from WordPress automatically; ones hard-coded in a template or pasted as raw HTML do not.'=>'没有备选尺寸列表时，手机会下载与桌面端完全相同的文件——往往比屏幕能显示的大好几倍。从媒体库插入的图片会自动从 WordPress 获得这个列表；而写死在模板里或以原始 HTML 粘贴的图片则不会。','Your home page is built from %d HTML elements'=>'你的首页由 %d 个 HTML 元素构成','Past roughly 1,400 elements the browser spends real time on style and layout for every change on the page, and past 2,500 it is the dominant cost — whatever the server does. The usual cause is a page builder nesting rows inside columns inside containers, or a very long archive. Showing fewer items per page, or flattening the sections you build most often, does more here than any server-side setting.'=>'超过大约 1,400 个元素后，页面每次变化都会让浏览器在样式和布局上花费实实在在的时间；超过 2,500 个后，无论服务器多快，这都会成为主要开销。常见原因是页面构建器把行嵌进列、再嵌进容器，或者归档页过长。减少每页显示的条目数，或把你最常搭建的区块结构扁平化，比任何服务器端设置都更有效。','%d elements on your home page carry their own inline styles'=>'首页有 %d 个元素带有各自的内联样式','A style attribute cannot be cached, minified or reused between pages: it is re-sent in full with every request. At this volume a builder is writing a stylesheet one element at a time. Check whether it offers a “load CSS as a file” or “combine styles” option — that alone moves the weight into something the browser can cache.'=>'style 属性无法缓存、无法压缩，也无法在页面之间复用：每次请求都要完整重新传输。达到这个数量，说明构建器正在逐个元素地写样式表。请检查它是否提供「将 CSS 作为文件加载」或「合并样式」的选项——仅此一项就能把这部分重量转移到浏览器可以缓存的地方。','Open front-end settings'=>'打开前端设置','%1$d%% of this request went into one thing: %2$s'=>'这次请求有 %1$d%% 花在了一件事上：%2$s','Everything else on this page was faster than this single step (%s). Whatever is worth improving here, it is that — not the sum of the small things.'=>'这个页面上其他所有环节都比这一步（%s）更快。如果这里有什么值得改进的，就是它，而不是那些小事的总和。','Loading PHP, WordPress and plugins (~%d ms)'=>'加载 PHP、WordPress 和插件（约 %d 毫秒）','Every active plugin adds boot time. Deactivate the ones you no longer use; a high count here usually means too many plugins.'=>'每个启用的插件都会增加启动时间。停用你不再使用的插件；此处数值偏高通常意味着插件过多。','%1$s %2$d ms'=>'%1$s %2$d ms','the rest %d ms'=>'其余 %d ms','Made up of: %s.'=>'由以下组成：%s。','looking up an option that is not stored — %s'=>'查找一个未存储的选项 — %s','loading the options table (autoload)'=>'加载选项表（autoload）','reading an option'=>'读取某个选项','database queries'=>'数据库查询','registering blocks'=>'注册区块','sanitising/escaping data'=>'数据清理/转义','WordPress itself'=>'WordPress 本身','translation loading — %s'=>'加载翻译 — %s','translation loading'=>'加载翻译','The deep analysis test is a Pro feature.'=>'深度分析测试是 Pro 功能。','Could not start the test: the data folder is not writable.'=>'无法启动测试：数据文件夹不可写。','Profiling test completed — see the breakdown below.'=>'性能分析测试已完成——请查看下方明细。','Profiling test armed. Open the public side of your site once, then reload this page to see the breakdown.'=>'性能分析测试已就绪。请打开你网站的前台一次，然后重新加载此页面以查看明细。','Done'=>'完成','Manual step'=>'手动步骤','Heartbeat disabled.'=>'Heartbeat 已关闭。','Heartbeat updated.'=>'Heartbeat 已更新。','Stop a plugin from loading where it does nothing — a contact form everywhere but the contact page, a shop plugin on the blog. Its PHP, its queries and its CSS/JS all stay out. Only for visitors: logged-in users, the admin, AJAX, the REST API and cron always get every plugin.'=>'让插件不在它毫无作用的地方加载：联系表单除了联系页面外处处加载，商店插件出现在博客里。它的 PHP、查询和 CSS/JS 都不再加载。仅对访客生效：已登录用户、后台、AJAX、REST API 和 cron 始终加载全部插件。','Unloading plugins per URL is a Pro feature.'=>'按 URL 停用插件是 Pro 功能。','The rules were switched off by themselves: a visit to %1$s with plugins left out ended in a fatal error (%2$s). Review them, test again and save to turn them back on.'=>'规则已自动关闭：一次省略部分插件的 %1$s 访问以致命错误结束（%2$s）。请检查规则、重新测试并保存以再次开启。','%d rule active' . "\0" . '%d rules active'=>'%d 条规则生效','No rule is active.'=>'没有生效的规则。','Load'=>'加载','URLs (one per line; * for anything, / for the home page)'=>'URL（每行一个；* 表示任意内容，/ 表示首页）','Everywhere'=>'全站','Not on these URLs'=>'不在这些 URL','Only on these URLs'=>'仅在这些 URL','URLs for %s'=>'%s 的 URL','Pages to test'=>'要测试的页面','The home page is always tested. Add up to four more, ideally one of each kind the rules touch. Each is loaded twice as a visitor, with every plugin and with the rules, and compared.'=>'首页总会被测试。最多再添加四个，最好每种受规则影响的页面各一个。每个页面以访客身份加载两次——加载全部插件一次、应用规则一次——然后比较。','Test'=>'测试','Test and save'=>'测试并保存','Switch every rule off'=>'关闭所有规则','Saving only happens when no tested page breaks. If a visit with plugins left out ever ends in a fatal error, every rule switches itself off. Deactivating WPOptimizing, or define( \'WPOPT_DISABLE\', true ) in wp-config.php, undoes everything at once.'=>'只有在测试的页面都没有出问题时才会保存。如果某次省略插件的访问以致命错误结束，所有规则会自动关闭。停用 WPOptimizing，或在 wp-config.php 中加入 define( \'WPOPT_DISABLE\', true )，即可一次撤销全部。','Every rule is off: all plugins load everywhere again. The rules are kept for later.'=>'所有规则已关闭：所有插件重新在各处加载。规则会保留以便以后使用。','%1$s is needed by %2$s. Give them all the same rule, or leave %1$s loading everywhere. Nothing was tested or saved.'=>'%2$s 需要 %1$s。请给它们设置相同的规则，或让 %1$s 在各处加载。没有进行测试或保存。','There are no rules: every plugin loads everywhere.'=>'没有规则：所有插件在各处加载。','Not saved: at least one page breaks with these rules. The live rules are unchanged.'=>'未保存：至少有一个页面在这些规则下出错。生效的规则未改变。','Saved and active. The page cache was emptied so visitors get the pages without those plugins.'=>'已保存并生效。页面缓存已清空，访客将获得不含这些插件的页面。','The test could not start: the must-use folder (wp-content/mu-plugins) is not writable.'=>'测试无法开始：must-use 文件夹（wp-content/mu-plugins）不可写。','The page could not be loaded to compare it.'=>'无法加载该页面进行比较。','The page answers with an error.'=>'页面返回错误。','The page shows a PHP fatal error.'=>'页面显示 PHP 致命错误。','The page lost more than half of its HTML: check it looks right.'=>'页面丢失了一半以上的 HTML：请检查显示是否正常。','Same answer as with every plugin.'=>'与加载全部插件时的响应相同。','OK'=>'正常','Check'=>'需检查','Breaks'=>'出错','Result'=>'结果','Plugins left out'=>'省略的插件','HTML kept'=>'保留的 HTML','none'=>'无','Cleanup Report'=>'清理报告','Last analysis:'=>'上次分析：','Records analysed'=>'已分析记录数','Records cleaned'=>'已清理记录数','DB size analysed'=>'已分析数据库大小','Orphans found'=>'找到的孤立项','Analysis summary'=>'分析摘要','Pending review'=>'待审查','Includes both database and filesystem records. Status reflects raw scan results; the live panel applies additional real-time attribution that may reclassify some entries.'=>'包含数据库和文件系统记录。状态反映原始扫描结果；实时面板会应用额外的实时归因，可能会重新归类某些条目。','Extension breakdown (top 30 by record count)'=>'扩展细分（按记录数排名前 30）','Recent cleanup operations'=>'近期清理操作','User'=>'用户','No cleanup operations recorded yet. Run a cleanup to generate history.'=>'尚未记录任何清理操作。运行一次清理以生成历史记录。','Back to WPOptimizing'=>'返回 WPOptimizing','Configure cleanup options, scheduling, backups, license and integrations. Quick profiles below apply a recommended configuration with one click.'=>'配置清理选项、计划、备份、许可证和集成。下方的快速配置方案可一键应用推荐配置。','License is Active'=>'许可证已激活','License stored — not active'=>'许可证已存储 — 未激活','For security, the license key is hidden once stored. Deactivate it to enter a new one.'=>'出于安全考虑，许可证密钥一经存储即被隐藏。停用它以输入新的密钥。','Enter your license key to unlock deletion of attributed records. All other features work without a key.'=>'输入许可证密钥以解锁已归属记录的删除功能。其他所有功能无需密钥即可使用。','Expiration date: %s'=>'到期日期：%s','Deactivate / Change License'=>'停用 / 更换许可证','Click to activate or deactivate your license key.'=>'点击以激活或停用你的许可证密钥。','How many backups to keep for each operation type. Older ones are pruned automatically.'=>'每种操作类型保留多少个备份。较旧的会被自动清理。','Backups older than this many days are deleted automatically.'=>'超过此天数的备份将被自动删除。','Every change of your data is backed up first. When the backups would grow past this size, the change (or the cleanup) stops instead of filling the disk. 0 means no limit.'=>'对数据的每项改动都会先备份。当备份将超过此大小时，改动（或清理）会停止，而不是把磁盘写满。0 表示不限制。','Where WPOptimizing sends the periodic report. For agencies managing client sites: route it to the maintainer instead of the site owner. Separate several addresses with commas. Leave empty to use the site admin email. Network alerts go to the network administrator instead.'=>'WPOptimizing 发送定期报告的去向。对于管理客户站点的代理商：将其发送给维护者而非站点所有者。用逗号分隔多个地址。留空则使用站点管理员邮箱。网络提醒则发送给网络管理员。','Where WPOptimizing sends license notices and the periodic report. For agencies managing client sites: route them to the maintainer instead of the site owner. Separate several addresses with commas. Leave empty to use the site admin email. Network alerts go to the network administrator instead.'=>'WPOptimizing 发送许可证通知和定期报告的去向。对于管理客户站点的代理商：将其发送给维护者而非站点所有者。用逗号分隔多个地址。留空则使用站点管理员邮箱。网络提醒则发送给网络管理员。','Send a test now'=>'立即发送测试','Email a recurring summary to the notification address above: the Health Score and its trend, key database/media metrics, unusual table growth and the activity since the last report. Off by default. The test is sent immediately to check delivery and does not change the schedule.'=>'向上方的通知地址发送定期摘要：Health Score 及其趋势、数据库/媒体的关键指标、异常的表增长以及自上次报告以来的活动。默认关闭。测试会立即发送以检查投递，并且不会更改计划。','Continuously clear expired transients in the background'=>'在后台持续清除已过期的瞬态','Removes expired transients a small batch at a time on normal admin requests, so a site with a leaky transient producer never piles up thousands of dead rows between scans. Pure housekeeping — WordPress regenerates any transient on demand — and it does nothing when a persistent object cache is active. Off by default.'=>'在正常的后台请求中分小批移除已过期的瞬态，使得瞬态生成有泄漏的站点在两次扫描之间永远不会堆积成千上万条无用行。纯粹的日常维护——WordPress 会按需重新生成任何瞬态——并且当启用持久对象缓存时不执行任何操作。默认关闭。','Delete ALL plugin data when the plugin is deleted'=>'删除插件时清除该插件的所有数据','When you delete the plugin from Plugins, remove every trace it created: settings, transients, scheduled tasks, the object-cache and database drop-ins, all backups, scan data and the generated WebP/AVIF copies. Your already-optimized images are kept (only the extra next-gen copies and backups are removed). Leave this on to keep the site clean; turn it off only if you plan to reinstall and want to keep your settings and backups.'=>'当你在“插件”页面删除本插件时，会清除它创建的所有痕迹：设置、瞬态数据、计划任务、对象缓存和数据库 drop-in、所有备份、扫描数据以及生成的 WebP/AVIF 副本。已优化的图片会保留（仅删除额外的新一代副本和备份）。建议保持开启以保持站点干净；只有当你打算重新安装并希望保留设置和备份时才关闭。','Applies a recommended set of cleanup tasks for your site type. Performance tuning (object cache, query deduplication and Heartbeat) is configured automatically for each profile. You can still fine-tune the options below before saving.'=>'为您的站点类型应用推荐的清理任务集。性能调整（对象缓存、查询去重和 Heartbeat）会针对每个配置方案自动配置。您仍然可以在保存之前进一步调整下方选项。','Heartbeat: default'=>'Heartbeat：默认','Heartbeat: slow'=>'Heartbeat：慢速','Heartbeat: off'=>'Heartbeat：关闭','object cache'=>'对象缓存','query deduplication'=>'查询去重','cached comment counts'=>'缓存的评论计数','speculative loading'=>'推测式加载','General cleanup options'=>'常规清理选项','Delete revisions older than (days)'=>'删除早于以下天数的修订','Extra guard: revisions beyond the kept count are only deleted when older than this many days. Set 0 to disable (delete by count only).'=>'额外保护：超出保留数量的修订仅在早于此天数时才会被删除。设为 0 可禁用（仅按数量删除）。','If greater than 0, all auto-drafts except the latest N will be deleted.'=>'若大于0，除最新的N个之外，所有自动草稿都将被删除。','Delete auto-drafts older than (days)'=>'删除超过（天）的自动草稿','Used when "Auto-drafts to keep" is 0. Set 0 to disable age-based deletion.'=>'当“保留自动草稿数”为0时使用。设置为0可禁用按时间删除。','Posts and comments sent to the trash or marked as spam more recently than this are left alone, so a mistake can still be undone. 0 empties them whatever their age.'=>'在此期限内移入回收站或标记为垃圾的文章和评论不会被处理，以便还能撤销误操作。0 表示无论多久都清空。','Delete auto-drafts'=>'删除自动草稿','Delete trashed posts'=>'删除回收站文章','Delete spam comments'=>'删除垃圾评论','Delete trashed comments'=>'删除回收站评论','Delete unapproved comments (includes those awaiting moderation, not just spam)'=>'删除未批准的评论（包括等待审核的，不仅仅是垃圾评论）','Delete duplicate metadata (keeps the oldest copy)'=>'删除重复元数据（保留最旧的副本）','Delete finished Action Scheduler logs (completed/failed/cancelled, 30+ days)'=>'删除已完成的 Action Scheduler 日志（已完成/失败/已取消，30 天以上）','WooCommerce: delete expired customer sessions'=>'WooCommerce：删除过期的客户会话','WooCommerce: delete orphaned product variations (their product no longer exists)'=>'WooCommerce：删除孤立的商品变体（其商品已不存在）','Detailed cleanup log'=>'详细清理日志','Generate detailed log'=>'生成详细日志','Summary report is always stored. Enable this to include per-step event lines.'=>'摘要报告始终会保存。启用此选项可包含每个步骤的事件行。','Tables excluded from optimization'=>'排除优化的表','None'=>'无','Selected tables will be skipped during optimization.'=>'优化时将跳过所选数据表。','Off (manual only)'=>'关闭（仅手动）','Daily'=>'每天','Weekly'=>'每周','Low-traffic window'=>'低流量时段','Window start hour'=>'时段开始时间','Window end hour'=>'时段结束时间','WPOptimizing analyses your site automatically in the background, only during this low-traffic window (site timezone), so the lists stay fresh and you never wait on a manual scan. A manual scan always runs immediately, regardless of this window.'=>'WPOptimizing 会在后台自动分析你的网站，仅在此低流量时段内（网站时区）进行，从而让列表保持最新，你无需等待手动分析。手动分析始终立即执行，与此时段无关。','Manual only'=>'仅手动','Hourly'=>'每小时','Twice daily'=>'每天两次','Monthly'=>'每月','Sunday'=>'星期日','Monday'=>'星期一','Tuesday'=>'星期二','Wednesday'=>'星期三','Thursday'=>'星期四','Friday'=>'星期五','Saturday'=>'星期六','Start time'=>'开始时间','Uses the site timezone.'=>'使用站点时区。','Day of week'=>'星期几','Day of month'=>'每月几号','Maximum 28 to ensure compatibility with all months.'=>'最大 28，以确保与所有月份兼容。','When enabled, WordPress cron will run the General cleanup automatically.'=>'启用后，WordPress Cron 将自动运行常规清理。','Trashed posts'=>'回收站中的文章','Comments'=>'评论','oEmbed cache'=>'oEmbed 缓存','Optimize tables'=>'优化数据表','Every run'=>'每次运行','Optionally run some tasks less often than the main schedule. “Every run” follows the schedule above; “Never” skips the task on automatic runs (manual runs always run every enabled task).'=>'可选择让某些任务的执行频率低于主计划。“每次运行”遵循上面的计划；“从不”会在自动运行时跳过该任务（手动运行始终执行所有已启用的任务）。','Run the General cleanup automatically once the database grows by more than this many MB since the last cleanup. 0 disables it.'=>'当数据库自上次清理以来增长超过这么多 MB 时，自动运行常规清理。设为 0 可禁用。','Speculative loading, image loading, preload, lazy embeds, resource hints, Google Fonts, CDN and Server-Timing are now under Speed › Page & browser, next to minify, delay JavaScript and critical CSS.'=>'推测加载、图片加载、预加载、延迟嵌入、资源提示、Google Fonts、CDN 和 Server-Timing 现在位于「速度 › 页面与浏览器」，与压缩、延迟 JavaScript 和关键 CSS 放在一起。','Open Speed › Page & browser'=>'打开 速度 › 页面与浏览器','Turn off WordPress features you do not use to trim front-end weight and head/feed noise. Every option is off by default and fully reversible — nothing is deleted.'=>'关闭你用不到的 WordPress 功能，以减轻前端体积并减少页头与订阅源中的杂项。每个选项默认关闭且完全可逆——不会删除任何内容。','Branding'=>'品牌标识','White-label is managed from your account for this license (active brand: %s) and applies automatically to every activation.'=>'白标由你账户中此许可证管理（当前品牌：%s），并自动应用于每次激活。','Send a signed JSON POST to an external URL when WPOptimizing finishes a scan, a cleanup, a deletion or a dataset upload (e.g. Slack, Zapier, n8n or your own endpoint).'=>'当 WPOptimizing 完成扫描、清理、删除或数据集上传时，向外部网址发送签名的 JSON POST 请求（例如 Slack、Zapier、n8n 或你自己的端点）。','Leave empty to disable webhooks.'=>'留空以禁用 webhooks。','Optional. When set, each request carries an X-WPOptimizing-Signature header (HMAC-SHA256 of the body) so the receiver can verify authenticity.'=>'可选。设置后，每个请求都会携带 X-WPOptimizing-Signature 头（请求体的 HMAC-SHA256），以便接收方验证真实性。','Choose which events trigger the webhook. With none selected, all events are sent.'=>'选择触发 webhook 的事件。如未选择任何事件，则发送所有事件。','Shared attribution dataset'=>'共享归因数据集','WPOptimizing can contribute attribution metadata to a shared dataset that improves accuracy for everyone. Only names (of options, meta keys, tables and files), their sizes and how often they are seen are sent, together with your site’s domain, which authorises the exchange — never option values, post or user content, or any record contents. Sharing is opt-in and reciprocal: while it is off, the plugin keeps working with locally captured attribution but does not exchange data with the shared dataset.'=>'WPOptimizing 可以向共享数据集贡献归因元数据，从而为所有人提高准确性。仅发送名称（选项、元数据键、表和文件的名称）、它们的大小及其出现频率，以及用于授权交换的你的站点域名 — 绝不发送选项值、文章或用户内容或任何记录内容。共享需主动选择且为互惠：关闭时，插件会继续使用本地捕获的归因，但不会与共享数据集交换数据。','Share attribution metadata to improve and receive the shared dataset.'=>'共享归因元数据以改进并接收共享数据集。','You can turn this off at any time.'=>'你可以随时关闭它。','See exactly what is shared and what is never sent:'=>'查看究竟分享了什么，以及什么绝不会发送：','Up to date'=>'最新','A few days old'=>'已有几天','Outdated'=>'已过时','Not downloaded yet'=>'尚未下载','Knowledge base'=>'知识库','updated %s ago'=>'%s前更新','Your local copy of each layer of the shared dataset. They refresh automatically every day; use "Sync dataset now" to update them immediately. A layer that stays on "Not downloaded yet" is not reaching your site — tell us if you see one.'=>'共享数据集中每一层在你站点上的本地副本。它们每天自动更新；点击「立即同步数据集」可立刻更新。若某一层始终显示「尚未下载」，说明它没有到达你的站点——看到的话请告诉我们。','Sync now'=>'立即同步','Uploads your contributions and refreshes your local copy of the shared dataset now, instead of waiting for the daily schedule. Save any sharing change first.'=>'立即上传你的贡献并刷新你本地的共享数据集副本，而不必等待每日计划。请先保存任何共享设置的更改。','Off'=>'关闭','Conservative (prefetch on click)'=>'保守（点击时预取）','Eager (prerender on hover)'=>'积极（悬停时预渲染）','Uses the browser Speculation Rules API to prefetch or prerender the next page on hover/click, so navigation feels instant. Admin, login, cart/checkout/account and URLs with a query string are excluded automatically.'=>'使用浏览器的 Speculation Rules API 在悬停/点击时预取或预渲染下一页，使导航感觉即时。后台、登录、购物车/结账/账户以及带查询字符串的 URL 会被自动排除。','Optimize content image loading (prioritize the first image, lazy-load the rest)'=>'优化内容图片加载（优先加载第一张图片，其余延迟加载）','Also outside the content — header, sidebars, footer — on pages saved by the page cache (the first three images stay eager)'=>'也处理内容之外——页头、侧边栏、页脚——仅限页面缓存保存的页面（前三张图片立即加载）','Preload the featured image (likely LCP) on posts and pages so it starts downloading sooner'=>'在文章和页面上预加载特色图片（可能的 LCP），使其更早开始下载','Also preload these URLs (one per line): above-the-fold fonts or a hero image'=>'也预加载这些网址（每行一个）：首屏字体或主视觉图片','https://example.com/wp-content/themes/x/fonts/brand.woff2'=>'https://example.com/wp-content/themes/x/fonts/brand.woff2','The right type (image, font, style, script) is detected from the file extension; fonts get crossorigin automatically. Only preload what is actually above the fold — preloading too much slows the page down.'=>'正确的类型（图片、字体、样式、脚本）会根据文件扩展名自动检测；字体会自动添加 crossorigin。只预加载真正位于首屏的资源——预加载过多会拖慢页面。','Lazy-load iframes and replace YouTube embeds with a click-to-load thumbnail (loads the heavy player only on click)'=>'延迟加载 iframe，并将 YouTube 嵌入替换为点击加载的缩略图（仅在点击时才加载沉重的播放器）','A YouTube embed pulls in about a megabyte of scripts before the visitor even presses play. The facade shows the video thumbnail and loads the real player (cookie-less youtube-nocookie.com) only when clicked — a big win for LCP and privacy. Stands down when a caching/optimization plugin already handles embeds.'=>'一个 YouTube 嵌入在访客还没点击播放之前，就会加载约一兆字节的脚本。外观占位会显示视频缩略图，仅在点击时才加载真正的播放器（无 Cookie 的 youtube-nocookie.com）——对 LCP 和隐私都是巨大的提升。当缓存/优化插件已处理嵌入时会自动停用。','Send a Server-Timing header (DB queries, object-cache hit rate) for diagnostics'=>'发送 Server-Timing 标头（数据库查询、对象缓存命中率）以便诊断','Add preconnect / dns-prefetch hints for the external origins the page loads (fonts, CDNs), so the browser connects sooner'=>'为页面加载的外部来源（字体、CDN）添加 preconnect / dns-prefetch 提示，让浏览器更早建立连接','Self-host Google Fonts (serve the font CSS and files from this site, so the browser never contacts Google)'=>'自托管 Google Fonts（从本站点提供字体 CSS 和文件，使浏览器永不联系 Google）','Removes the third-party connection to fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com (a common GDPR concern). Save with this on, then use "Localize now" below to download the fonts detected on your site.'=>'移除到 fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com 的第三方连接（常见的 GDPR 顾虑）。在启用此项的情况下保存，然后使用下方的「立即本地化」下载站点上检测到的字体。','Serve static files (images, CSS, JS) from a CDN'=>'从 CDN 提供静态文件（图片、CSS、JS）','Uploads (media library)'=>'Uploads（媒体库）','wp-content (themes and plugins)'=>'wp-content（主题和插件）','wp-includes (WordPress core assets)'=>'wp-includes（WordPress 核心资源）','Enter the CDN hostname (no https://). URLs of local static files under the selected folders are rewritten to this host; dynamic PHP endpoints and external URLs are never touched. Point your CDN as a pull zone / origin at this site first, and make sure it serves fonts with the right CORS headers.'=>'输入 CDN 主机名（不含 https://）。所选文件夹下本地静态文件的 URL 会被重写到此主机；动态 PHP 端点和外部 URL 绝不会被触及。请先将你的 CDN 作为拉取区/源指向本站点，并确保它以正确的 CORS 响应头提供字体。','%s is already self-hosting Google Fonts, so WPOptimizing is standing aside to avoid conflicts. Disable it there if you want WPOptimizing to handle fonts instead.'=>'%s 已在自托管 Google Fonts，因此 WPOptimizing 会主动让位以避免冲突。如果你希望改由 WPOptimizing 处理字体，请在那里将其停用。','No Google Fonts detected yet. Save with self-hosting on, open your site once so the fonts are detected, then return here and click "Localize now".'=>'尚未检测到 Google Fonts。在启用自托管的情况下保存，打开你的站点一次以便检测到字体，然后返回此处并点击「立即本地化」。','%1$d stylesheet(s) localized (%2$d font files); %3$d pending.'=>'已本地化 %1$d 个样式表（%2$d 个字体文件）；%3$d 个待处理。','Local'=>'本地','Localize now'=>'立即本地化','Remove local fonts'=>'移除本地字体','WPOptimizing — Downloading Google Fonts'=>'WPOptimizing — 正在下载 Google Fonts','%1$s of %2$s stylesheets…'=>'第 %1$s 个，共 %2$s 个样式表…','Compatibility with other plugins'=>'与其他插件的兼容性','No other performance or optimization plugin was detected, so every WPOptimizing feature is free to run.'=>'未检测到其他性能或优化插件，因此 WPOptimizing 的所有功能都可以正常运行。','These plugins are active and already provide some of what WPOptimizing does. Where doing it twice would fight, our version is switched off. Tick a row to run ours anyway.'=>'这些插件已启用，并且已经承担了 WPOptimizing 的部分工作。在重复执行会相互干扰的地方，我们的版本已关闭。勾选某一行可强制使用我们的版本。','These plugins are active and already provide some of what WPOptimizing does. Where doing it twice would fight, our version is switched off — for delaying JavaScript and for critical CSS, doing it twice does not duplicate work, it breaks the page. Tick a row to run ours anyway.'=>'这些插件已启用，并且已经承担了 WPOptimizing 的部分工作。在重复执行会相互干扰的地方，我们的版本已关闭——延迟 JavaScript 和关键 CSS 做两遍不会加倍效果，而是会让页面出错。勾选某一行可强制使用我们的版本。','Also provided by %s. Both run: doing this twice is harmless, so WPOptimizing does not stand down and there is nothing to switch.'=>'%s 也提供此功能。两者并存：重复执行无害，因此 WPOptimizing 不会退让，也没有需要切换的选项。','Provided by %s.'=>'由 %s 提供。','WPOptimizing covers everything these plugins are used for, so you can manage it all from one place and deactivate them: %s. Check your settings here first.'=>'WPOptimizing 已涵盖这些插件的全部用途，你可以在一处统一管理并停用它们：%s。请先检查此处的设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Import / export settings'=>'导入 / 导出设置','Save this site’s configuration to a JSON file and restore it here or on another site — handy to replicate your setup across sites. It includes the settings for cleanup, scheduling, cache, media and images, Smart Assets, backups and attribution. Keys, passwords, the license, webhooks, data-sharing consent and measured runtime state (scan results, baselines, cached sizes) are never included.'=>'将本站点的配置保存为 JSON 文件，并在此处或其他站点恢复——便于在多个站点之间复制你的设置。它包含清理、计划、缓存、媒体和图片、Smart Assets、备份和归属的设置。密钥、密码、许可证、webhook、数据共享同意以及测得的运行时状态（扫描结果、基线、缓存大小）从不包含在内。','Export'=>'导出','Downloads a JSON file with the current configuration.'=>'下载包含当前配置的 JSON 文件。','Import'=>'导入','Select a file exported from WPOptimizing. Existing settings are overwritten; unknown keys are ignored.'=>'选择从 WPOptimizing 导出的文件。现有设置将被覆盖；未知的键将被忽略。','No file was uploaded, or the upload failed.'=>'未上传任何文件，或上传失败。','The uploaded file could not be read.'=>'无法读取上传的文件。','The file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，不像是设置导出文件。','The file is not valid JSON.'=>'该文件不是有效的 JSON。','That file was not exported from WPOptimizing.'=>'该文件不是从 WPOptimizing 导出的。','The file does not look like a WPOptimizing settings export.'=>'该文件看起来不像 WPOptimizing 的设置导出文件。','Nothing was imported: the file had no recognized settings.'=>'未导入任何内容：文件中没有可识别的设置。','%d settings group imported.' . "\0" . '%d settings groups imported.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置组。','%d unknown entry was ignored.' . "\0" . '%d unknown entries were ignored.'=>'已忽略 %d 个未知条目。','No assets recorded yet. WPOptimizing samples public page loads in the background (sharing must be enabled); check back after some front-end visits.'=>'尚未记录任何资源。WPOptimizing 在后台对公开页面加载进行抽样（必须启用共享）；在若干前端访问后再来查看。','Stop loading the ticked assets on the front-end (applies site-wide)'=>'在前端不再加载勾选的资源（应用于整个站点）','Only disable assets you recognize, and test your site afterwards. WordPress core and jQuery are protected. Each change is saved and applied immediately, and is fully reversible: untick to restore.'=>'只停用你认识的资源，并在之后测试你的站点。WordPress 核心和 jQuery 受保护。每次更改都会立即保存并应用，且完全可撤销：取消勾选即可恢复。','Automatically stop loading a plugin or theme\'s assets on pages where it is not used'=>'在未使用某插件或主题的页面上自动停止加载其资源','Knowledge-base driven and context-aware: e.g. Contact Form 7 is dropped on pages with no form, WooCommerce off the shop/cart. Conservative (only well-known plugins), core/jQuery always protected, fully reversible. Test your key pages after enabling.'=>'由知识库驱动并感知上下文：例如在没有表单的页面上移除 Contact Form 7，在商店/购物车之外移除 WooCommerce。保守（仅限知名插件），核心/jQuery 始终受保护，完全可逆。启用后请测试你的关键页面。','Suggested by the knowledge base — automatic mode would drop these where they are not used:'=>'由知识库建议——自动模式会在未使用它们的页面上将其卸载：','%1$d scripts, %2$d styles'=>'%1$d 个脚本，%2$d 个样式','Quick add:'=>'快速添加：','Save exceptions'=>'保存例外','One URL pattern per line. These pages keep every asset — no unloading rule runs on them, whether site-wide or per page. Use * as a wildcard (e.g. /checkout, /cart, */thank-you/*). Matching is by path, so leave out the domain. Ideal to protect the checkout, a landing page or any URL where every script must load.'=>'每行一个 URL 模式。这些页面会保留全部资源：任何卸载规则都不会在这些页面上运行，无论是全站规则还是按页规则。使用 * 作为通配符（例如 /checkout、/cart、*/thank-you/*）。匹配基于路径，因此省略域名。非常适合保护结账页、着陆页或任何必须加载全部脚本的 URL。','One URL pattern per line. These pages keep every asset — no manual, automatic or per-page unloading runs on them. Use * as a wildcard (e.g. /checkout, /cart, */thank-you/*). Matching is by path, so leave out the domain. Ideal to protect the checkout, a landing page or any URL where every script must load.'=>'每行一个 URL 模式。这些页面会保留全部资源：不会对它们执行任何卸载（手动、自动或按页）。使用 * 作为通配符（例如 /checkout、/cart、*/thank-you/*）。匹配基于路径，因此省略域名。非常适合保护结账页、着陆页或任何必须加载全部脚本的 URL。','%d rule(s) belong to an extension that is installed but switched off. They are kept: they will start working again the moment you reactivate it.'=>'有 %d 条规则属于已安装但已停用的扩展。它们会被保留：一旦你重新启用该扩展，它们就会再次生效。','%d rule(s) point at an asset nothing on this site enqueues any more — a renamed handle, or an extension that is gone. They can be removed safely.'=>'有 %d 条规则指向本站点已经不再加载的资源——被改名的 handle，或已经消失的扩展。可以安全移除。','Remove the rules that match nothing'=>'移除没有任何匹配的规则','Front page'=>'首页','Posts & pages'=>'文章和页面','Archives'=>'归档页','Each unloaded asset is dropped everywhere by default. Narrow a rule to a content type and/or only specific URLs (wildcard *). Leave "Only on URLs" empty to keep it site-wide.'=>'默认情况下，每个被卸载的资源会在全站移除。可将某条规则限定到某种内容类型和/或仅限特定 URL（通配符 *）。将“仅在这些 URL”留空则保持全站生效。','Asset'=>'资源','Where'=>'位置','Only on URLs'=>'仅在这些 URL','Type: %s'=>'类型：%s','Pages where this rule applies'=>'此规则适用的页面','Scripts'=>'脚本','Styles'=>'样式','Search assets'=>'搜索资源','Saved.'=>'已保存。','Could not save. Try again.'=>'无法保存，请重试。','option'=>'选项','transient'=>'瞬态','transient (expired)'=>'瞬态（已过期）','post type'=>'文章类型','post type content'=>'文章类型内容','taxonomy'=>'分类法','taxonomy terms'=>'分类法条目','role'=>'角色','capability'=>'权限','table'=>'数据表','post meta'=>'文章元数据','user meta'=>'用户元数据','term meta'=>'条目元数据','shortcode'=>'短代码','REST namespace'=>'REST 命名空间','widget'=>'小工具','plugin page'=>'插件页面','cron'=>'定时任务','Action Scheduler action'=>'Action Scheduler 操作','i18n'=>'国际化','post'=>'文章','revision'=>'修订版本','product variation'=>'产品变体','comment'=>'评论','comment meta'=>'评论元数据','term relationship'=>'条目关系','term taxonomy row'=>'条目分类法行','WooCommerce session'=>'WooCommerce 会话','autoload flag'=>'自动加载标记','%s (in a folder WordPress does not load)'=>'%s（位于 WordPress 不会加载的文件夹中）','not done from here: the table takes %s, and converting it would take minutes, as much free disk space, and block writes to it meanwhile. Your hosting provider can do it at a quiet time.'=>'未在此处执行：该表占用 %s，转换它需要几分钟和同等的可用磁盘空间，并在此期间阻止对它的写入。你的主机服务商可以在空闲时段完成。','conversion rejected by the database'=>'转换被数据库拒绝','%d table could not be processed' . "\0" . '%d tables could not be processed'=>'%d 个表无法处理','(compared with %s)'=>'（与 %s 相比）','+%1$s (+%2$s%%), %3$s rows added'=>'+%1$s（+%2$s%%），新增 %3$s 行','A table ballooning between scans is often a runaway log, transient/cache table or stuck background job. Review what writes to it before it keeps growing.'=>'两次扫描之间急剧膨胀的表通常是失控的日志、瞬态/缓存表或卡住的后台任务。在它继续增长之前，检查是什么在向其写入。','its owner is not active'=>'其所有者未启用','a large share of the whole database'=>'占整个数据库的很大比例','a very high row count'=>'行数极高','%1$s, %2$s rows — %3$s'=>'%1$s，%2$s 行 — %3$s','A table can belong to a plugin that is working perfectly and still be the largest thing in your database — caches, logs and tracking tables are the usual ones. Check the plugin\'s own settings for a retention limit before deleting anything here.'=>'一个数据表可能属于运行完全正常的插件，却仍是数据库中最大的部分：缓存、日志和追踪表最为常见。在此删除任何内容之前，先看看该插件自身的设置里有没有保留期限选项。','Database tables'=>'数据库表','Every table with its engine, row count, size and recoverable overhead. Optimizing reclaims the overhead; it never deletes data. Orphaned custom tables from uninstalled plugins appear in the Orphans tab.'=>'每个表及其引擎、行数、大小和可回收开销。优化可回收开销，绝不删除数据。已卸载插件遗留的孤立自定义表显示在“孤立”选项卡中。','Recoverable overhead'=>'可回收开销','MyISAM tables'=>'MyISAM 数据表','InnoDB tables also hold %s of internal free space. InnoDB reuses it for new rows, so OPTIMIZE does not hand it back to the operating system — that is normal and not recoverable.'=>'InnoDB 表还包含 %s 的内部可用空间。InnoDB 会将其重新用于新行，因此 OPTIMIZE 不会将其归还给操作系统——这是正常现象，不可回收。','Reclaim %s of overhead now'=>'立即回收 %s 开销','Optimizes only the tables with reclaimable overhead. Non-destructive — no data is deleted.'=>'仅优化带有可回收开销的表。非破坏性 — 不会删除任何数据。','Orphaned only'=>'仅孤立','All tables'=>'所有表','Search tables'=>'搜索表','Optimizing reclaims overhead and defragments the table. It does not delete data and is safe to run. On InnoDB tables it rebuilds and re-analyses the table, but the reported free space may not drop because InnoDB reuses that space internally instead of returning it to the operating system — that is normal, not a failure.'=>'优化会回收开销并对表进行碎片整理。它不会删除数据，运行安全。对于 InnoDB 表，它会重建并重新分析该表，但显示的可用空间可能不会减少，因为 InnoDB 会在内部重用该空间，而不是将其归还给操作系统——这是正常现象，并非故障。','Optimize the %d selected table(s)?'=>'优化选中的 %d 个表？','Optimize ALL %d filtered table(s)?'=>'优化全部 %d 个已筛选的表？','Converting to InnoDB enables row-level locking and crash recovery; it rebuilds the table in place and keeps all data.'=>'转换为 InnoDB 可启用行级锁定和崩溃恢复；它会就地重建表并保留所有数据。','Convert all MyISAM'=>'转换所有 MyISAM','Convert the %d selected table(s) to InnoDB? Only MyISAM tables are changed.'=>'将所选的 %d 个表转换为 InnoDB？仅更改 MyISAM 表。','Convert ALL %d MyISAM table(s) to InnoDB?'=>'将全部 %d 个 MyISAM 表转换为 InnoDB？','You are not allowed to access the WPOptimizing API.'=>'你无权访问 WPOptimizing API。','Cleanup engine unavailable.'=>'清理引擎不可用。','Media analyzer unavailable.'=>'媒体分析器不可用。','Scan completed'=>'扫描已完成','Cleanup completed'=>'清理已完成','Items deleted'=>'项目已删除','Dataset uploaded'=>'数据集已上传','Not done: the backups have reached their size limit. Delete old backups under Backups, or raise “Max backup size” in Settings, and try again.'=>'未执行：备份已达到大小上限。请在「备份」中删除旧备份，或在「设置」中调高“最大备份大小”，然后重试。','Not done: a backup could not be created first (check disk space and folder permissions). Please try again.'=>'未执行：无法先创建备份（请检查磁盘空间和文件夹权限）。请重试。','An SEO plugin is active. If it already serves your sitemap, you can turn on the “Disable the WordPress sitemap” core tweak — just confirm its sitemap is enabled first.'=>'已启用 SEO 插件。如果它已提供站点地图，你可以开启“停用 WordPress 站点地图”核心优化——但请先确认它的站点地图已启用。','A caching plugin was detected. WPOptimizing never touches another plugin’s object-cache.php / db.php drop-in, so keep managing page caching from that plugin.'=>'检测到缓存插件。WPOptimizing 绝不会触碰其他插件的 object-cache.php / db.php drop-in，因此请继续在该插件中管理页面缓存。','An image-optimization plugin is active. WPOptimizing’s image loading only adds attributes and yields to it, so you can leave image work to that plugin.'=>'已启用图片优化插件。WPOptimizing 的图片加载优化只会添加属性并让位于它，因此可以把图片处理交给该插件。','Safe'=>'安全','Conservative defaults: keeps 5 revisions and removes auto-drafts, trashed posts and comments, spam, expired transients and the oEmbed cache, then optimizes the tables.'=>'保守的默认设置：保留 5 个修订版本，删除自动草稿、回收站中的文章和评论、垃圾评论、过期瞬态和 oEmbed 缓存，然后优化数据表。','Blog'=>'博客','Like Safe, plus pingbacks/trackbacks; keeps tags and fewer revisions.'=>'与“安全”类似，外加 pingback/trackback；保留标签和较少的修订版本。','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Keeps 5 revisions and product tags; also removes pingbacks and trackbacks, orphan elements, old Action Scheduler logs, expired customer sessions and orphaned variations. Never touches non-expired transients (carts/sessions).'=>'保留 5 个修订版本和产品标签；同时删除 pingback 和 trackback、孤立项、旧的 Action Scheduler 日志、过期的客户会话和孤立的商品变体。绝不触碰未过期的瞬态（购物车/会话）。','Membership'=>'会员','Careful preset: keeps moderation queue, pingbacks and member metadata intact.'=>'谨慎预设：保持审核队列、pingback 和会员元数据完整。','Agency (maximum)'=>'代理机构（最大化）','Most thorough: also unapproved comments, unused tags and orphaned metadata. Still never deletes non-expired transients.'=>'最彻底：还包括未审核评论、未使用标签和孤立元数据。仍然绝不删除未过期的瞬态。','No cleanup report available.'=>'没有可用的清理报告。','You are not allowed to view this report.'=>'你无权查看此报告。','Spam & trashed comments'=>'垃圾评论和回收站评论','Records deleted'=>'已删除记录数','Space freed'=>'释放的空间','Duration'=>'耗时','Deleted by category'=>'按类别删除','Category'=>'类别','Total records deleted'=>'已删除记录总数','Size before'=>'之前大小','Size after'=>'之后大小','Generated by %1$s %2$s'=>'由 %1$s %2$s 生成','Cleanup skipped: another execution is running.'=>'已跳过清理：另一个执行正在进行中。','Retry scheduled due to lock.'=>'由于锁定，已安排重试。','Took over the lock of a previous cleanup that had stopped responding.'=>'已接管一个已停止响应的先前清理任务的锁。','Cleanup failed: %s'=>'清理失败：%s','Retry scheduled after failure.'=>'失败后已安排重试。','Everything deleted was backed up first: %s (listed under Backups).'=>'所有被删除的内容都已先备份：%s（列在「备份」中）。','Cleanup stopped: the backup folder reached its size limit, so nothing more was deleted. What was already deleted is in the backup listed under Backups.'=>'清理已停止：备份文件夹已达到大小上限，因此没有再删除任何内容。已删除的内容在「备份」中列出的备份里。','Cleanup stopped: its backup could not be written (check disk space and folder permissions), so nothing more was deleted. What was already deleted is in the backup listed under Backups.'=>'清理已停止：无法写入其备份（请检查磁盘空间和文件夹权限），因此没有再删除任何内容。已删除的内容在「备份」中列出的备份里。','Execution stopped due to time budget.'=>'由于时间预算限制，执行已停止。','Retry scheduled due to time limit.'=>'由于时间限制，已安排重试。','Database size: before %1$s, after %2$s, estimated deleted records %3$s.'=>'数据库大小：清理前 %1$s，清理后 %2$s，预计已删除记录大小 %3$s。','General cleanup completed. Revisions: %1$d, Posts: %2$d, Comments: %3$d, Transients: %4$d, Optimized tables: %5$d.'=>'常规清理完成。修订：%1$d，文章：%2$d，评论：%3$d，Transients：%4$d，优化的数据表：%5$d。','Revisions cleaned: %d'=>'已清理修订版本：%d','Auto-drafts cleaned.'=>'已清理自动草稿。','Trashed posts cleaned.'=>'已清理回收站文章。','Comments cleaned.'=>'已清理评论。','Transients cleaned.'=>'已清理 Transients。','oEmbed cache cleaned.'=>'已清理 oEmbed 缓存。','Unused tags cleaned.'=>'已清理未使用标签。','Orphan elements cleaned.'=>'已清理孤立元素。','Duplicate metadata not checked in %1$s: %2$s rows are too many to compare from here.'=>'未检查 %1$s 中的重复元数据：%2$s 行太多，无法在此比较。','Duplicate metadata in %s: the database stopped the search before it finished; run the cleanup again later.'=>'%s 中的重复元数据：数据库在完成前停止了搜索；请稍后再次运行清理。','Duplicate metadata removed: %d'=>'已移除重复元数据：%d','Action Scheduler: removed %d finished entries.'=>'Action Scheduler：已移除 %d 条已完成的条目。','WooCommerce: removed %d expired customer sessions.'=>'WooCommerce：已移除 %d 个过期的客户会话。','WooCommerce: removed %d orphaned product variations.'=>'WooCommerce：已移除 %d 个孤立的商品变体。','Table optimization finished.'=>'数据表优化完成。','Cloudflare is not configured.'=>'Cloudflare 尚未配置。','Cloudflare answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Cloudflare 返回了 HTTP %d。','Connect Cloudflare first (zone ID and API token).'=>'请先连接 Cloudflare（区域 ID 和 API 令牌）。','Turn on the page cache first: it is what decides, page by page, what Cloudflare may keep.'=>'请先开启页面缓存：由它逐页决定 Cloudflare 可以保存什么。','The page cache keeps a separate copy for mobile devices, and the edge would hand one copy to every device. Turn that off first.'=>'页面缓存为移动设备保留了单独的副本，而边缘缓存会把同一份副本给所有设备。请先关闭该选项。','WordPress lives in a subfolder of this domain, and the rule would also cover what lives beside it.'=>'WordPress 位于此域名的子文件夹中，该规则也会覆盖其旁边的内容。','%s also caches the pages and answers before WordPress starts, so the page cache never gets to tell Cloudflare which pages it may keep. Deactivate it first.'=>'%s 也会缓存页面，并在 WordPress 启动之前响应，因此页面缓存永远无法告诉 Cloudflare 哪些页面可以保留。请先停用它。','wp-content/advanced-cache.php belongs to another plugin, so the pages are not served by the page cache and it cannot tell Cloudflare which ones it may keep.'=>'wp-content/advanced-cache.php 属于另一个插件，因此页面并非由页面缓存提供，它无法告诉 Cloudflare 哪些页面可以保留。','CSS and JavaScript minification'=>'CSS 和 JavaScript 压缩','Deferred JavaScript'=>'推迟执行（defer）JavaScript','Asynchronous CSS'=>'异步 CSS','Delay JavaScript until interaction'=>'延迟 JavaScript 至首次交互','Lazy loading of images and embeds'=>'图片与嵌入内容的懒加载','Serving WebP/AVIF copies'=>'提供 WebP/AVIF 副本','Image compression'=>'图片压缩','Self-hosted Google Fonts'=>'本地托管 Google 字体','Browser cache headers'=>'浏览器缓存标头','Heartbeat control'=>'Heartbeat 控制','WP-Cron control'=>'WP-Cron 控制','Core tweaks (emojis, embeds, head cleanup)'=>'核心调整（表情符号、嵌入内容、head 清理）','Unused and orphaned media detection'=>'未使用及孤立媒体检测','Action Scheduler log cleanup'=>'Action Scheduler 日志清理','Post revision cleanup'=>'文章修订版本清理','Disable emojis'=>'停用表情符号','Removes the emoji detection script, inline styles and DNS prefetch. Modern browsers render emoji natively.'=>'移除表情符号检测脚本、内联样式和 DNS 预取。现代浏览器原生渲染表情符号。','Remove WordPress version meta'=>'移除 WordPress 版本元标签','Removes the generator meta tag that exposes your WordPress version in the page head and feeds.'=>'移除在页头和订阅源中暴露你 WordPress 版本的 generator 元标签。','Remove RSD link'=>'移除 RSD 链接','Removes the Really Simple Discovery link, used only by some legacy remote-publishing clients.'=>'移除 Really Simple Discovery 链接，仅由某些旧式远程发布客户端使用。','Remove WLW manifest link'=>'移除 WLW 清单链接','Removes the Windows Live Writer manifest link, for a long-discontinued desktop editor.'=>'移除 Windows Live Writer 清单链接，对应一个早已停止维护的桌面编辑器。','Remove shortlink tag'=>'移除 shortlink 标签','Removes the shortlink <link> in the head and its HTTP Link header.'=>'移除页头中的 shortlink「<link>」及其 HTTP Link 头。','Disable self-pingbacks'=>'停用自我 pingback','Stops WordPress from pinging your own site when you link to your own posts.'=>'当你链接到自己的文章时，阻止 WordPress ping 你自己的站点。','Remove jQuery Migrate'=>'移除 jQuery Migrate','Drops the jquery-migrate compatibility script on the front end. Disable if an old theme or plugin misbehaves.'=>'在前端移除 jquery-migrate 兼容脚本。如果旧主题或插件出现异常，请停用此项。','Remove Dashicons on the front end'=>'在前端移除 Dashicons','Dequeues the Dashicons icon font for logged-out visitors. Kept for logged-in users (admin bar needs it).'=>'为未登录访客移除 Dashicons 图标字体。已登录用户仍保留（管理工具栏需要它）。','Disable oEmbed extras'=>'停用 oEmbed 附加项','Removes oEmbed discovery links and the wp-embed.min.js script so others cannot embed your posts. Embedding external content still works.'=>'移除 oEmbed 发现链接和 wp-embed.min.js 脚本，使他人无法嵌入你的文章。嵌入外部内容仍可正常使用。','Disable remote block patterns'=>'停用远程区块样板','Stops the block editor from fetching the remote pattern directory from WordPress.org.'=>'阻止区块编辑器从 WordPress.org 获取远程样板目录。','Remove REST API head links'=>'移除页头中的 REST API 链接','Removes the REST API discovery <link> and Link header from the front end. The REST API keeps working.'=>'从前端移除 REST API 发现「<link>」和 Link 头。REST API 仍可正常工作。','Load WooCommerce cart fragments only with a cart'=>'仅在有购物车时加载 WooCommerce 购物车片段','Visitors with an empty cart no longer download the script that refreshes the cart in the header, nor make its request on every page. Adding a product still updates the header.'=>'购物车为空的访客不再下载刷新页头购物车的脚本，也不会在每个页面发出它的请求。添加商品后页头仍会更新。','No visible impact — head noise only.'=>'无可见影响——仅头部冗余。','Moderate'=>'中等','May affect a few setups — review each one.'=>'可能影响少数配置——请逐项检查。','Server cache (Nginx)'=>'服务器缓存（Nginx）','Page cache (WPOptimizing)'=>'页面缓存 (WPOptimizing)','Unidentified cache'=>'未识别的缓存','WooCommerce (cart, checkout, account)'=>'WooCommerce（购物车、结账、账户）','Easy Digital Downloads (checkout, account)'=>'Easy Digital Downloads（结账、账户）','Courses / LMS (course, lesson, quiz)'=>'课程 / LMS（课程、课时、测验）','Contact / booking pages'=>'联系 / 预订页面','Exclude this content from automatic asset unloading'=>'将此内容排除在自动卸载之外','Don\'t load these assets only on this page:'=>'仅在此页面上不加载这些资源：','No assets recorded yet. Open your site front-end first, then come back.'=>'尚未记录任何资源。请先打开你站点的前台，然后再回来。','WordPress core and jQuery are always protected.'=>'WordPress 核心和 jQuery 始终受保护。','Play video'=>'播放视频','Enable the persistent object cache — the single biggest server-TTFB win.'=>'启用持久对象缓存——这是对服务器 TTFB 最大的改善。','Object-cache hit rate is low: check the backend (Redis/Memcached/APCu) is healthy and not being flushed too often.'=>'对象缓存命中率偏低：检查后端（Redis/Memcached/APCu）是否正常，且未被过于频繁地清空。','Reduce the autoload weight loaded on every request.'=>'减少每次请求加载的 autoload 体积。','Move WP-Cron to a real system cron (define DISABLE_WP_CRON) so scheduled tasks do not run during visitor requests.'=>'将 WP-Cron 改为真正的系统 cron（定义 DISABLE_WP_CRON），使计划任务不在访客请求期间运行。','Database, object cache and autoload are already optimal — the remaining response time is your server/host. Check the PHP version, that OPcache is enabled, the hosting plan resources, and any theme or plugin doing heavy work on every load. WPOptimizing cannot lower this further.'=>'数据库、对象缓存和 autoload 都已处于最佳状态——剩余的响应时间来自你的服务器/主机。请检查 PHP 版本、是否启用 OPcache、主机套餐资源，以及任何在每次加载时执行繁重工作的主题或插件。WPOptimizing 无法进一步降低它。','Refused to fetch a non-Google font URL.'=>'已拒绝获取非 Google 的字体 URL。','The font request was redirected off Google; refusing the response.'=>'字体请求被重定向到 Google 之外；拒绝该响应。','Not a Google Fonts URL.'=>'不是 Google Fonts 的 URL。','The uploads directory is not writable.'=>'上传目录不可写。','No font files could be downloaded.'=>'未能下载任何字体文件。','Could not write the local stylesheet.'=>'无法写入本地样式表。','Localized %1$d Google Fonts stylesheet(s) with %2$d font files — they are now served from your site.'=>'已本地化 %1$d 个 Google Fonts 样式表，包含 %2$d 个字体文件 — 现在由你的站点提供。','Could not localize the detected Google Fonts. Check that the site can reach fonts.googleapis.com and that the uploads directory is writable.'=>'无法本地化检测到的 Google Fonts。请检查站点能否访问 fonts.googleapis.com，以及上传目录是否可写。','No Google Fonts were detected yet. Open your site once with self-hosting enabled, then try again.'=>'尚未检测到 Google Fonts。请在启用自托管的情况下打开你的站点一次，然后重试。','Object cache (WPOptimizing)'=>'对象缓存（WPOptimizing）','Object cache (host/plugin)'=>'对象缓存（主机/插件）','Settings for '=>'设置：','Keep all revisions (exclude from WPOptimizing cleanup)'=>'保留所有修订版本（从 WPOptimizing 清理中排除）','Fortnightly'=>'每两周','Database orphans'=>'数据库孤立项','File orphans'=>'文件孤立项','%1$s report for %2$s — health %3$d/100'=>'%2$s 的 %1$s报告 — 健康度 %3$d/100','⚠️ Unusual table growth'=>'⚠️ 异常的表增长','These tables grew abnormally between scans — often a runaway log or cache table.'=>'这些表在两次扫描之间异常增长——通常是失控的日志或缓存表。','%1$d scans and %2$d cleanups since the last report.'=>'自上次报告以来进行了 %1$d 次扫描和 %2$d 次清理。','Space freed: %s.'=>'释放空间：%s。','%s vs baseline'=>'%s（相对基线）','Key metrics'=>'关键指标','Sent by %1$s. Change the frequency or turn this off in %2$s.'=>'由 %1$s 发送。可在 %2$s 中更改频率或将其关闭。','WPOptimizing → Settings'=>'WPOptimizing → 设置','%s report'=>'%s报告','Open the dashboard'=>'打开仪表板','PHP OPcache is switched off'=>'PHP OPcache 已关闭','Without OPcache, PHP compiles every file of WordPress, your theme and every plugin on every single request. Enabling it is the single largest server-side improvement available, and it is a one-line change your host can make: opcache.enable=1.'=>'没有 OPcache，PHP 会在每一次请求中编译 WordPress、你的主题和每个插件的每一个文件。启用它是服务器端能做的最大改进，而且只是主机可以修改的一行配置：opcache.enable=1。','OPcache is being rebuilt constantly'=>'OPcache 在被反复重建','The compiled-code cache has started over on several page loads in a row. On this kind of server it lives inside the PHP worker processes, so when the last one is closed for being idle it is thrown away and rebuilt from nothing for the next visitor. More memory will not help. Ask your host to stop PHP workers being recycled while idle — on LiteSpeed that is the external application\'s “Max Idle Time” (set it to -1) and PHP_LSAPI_MAX_REQUESTS.'=>'编译代码缓存在连续多次页面加载中从头开始。在这类服务器上它存在于 PHP 工作进程内，最后一个进程因空闲被关闭时它就被丢弃，并为下一位访客从零重建。增加内存没有用。请主机不要在空闲时回收 PHP 工作进程——在 LiteSpeed 上就是外部应用的“Max Idle Time”（设为 -1）和 PHP_LSAPI_MAX_REQUESTS。','OPcache keeps running out of memory'=>'OPcache 反复耗尽内存','OPcache has restarted itself because it filled up, which throws away every compiled file and recompiles them from scratch. This is the one number that says so directly, and the fix is exact: raise opcache.memory_consumption (256M or more on a site with many plugins).'=>'OPcache 因为装满而自行重启，这会丢弃所有已编译文件并从头重新编译。这是唯一直接说明该问题的数值，修复也很明确：调高 opcache.memory_consumption（插件很多的站点用 256M 或更高）。','OPcache has run out of file slots'=>'OPcache 的文件槽位已用尽','It is not short of memory — it is short of places to put files, so the ones that do not fit are recompiled on every request. Raise opcache.max_accelerated_files above the number of PHP files on the site (30000 or more is normal for WordPress with a page builder and a few dozen plugins).'=>'缺的不是内存，而是放文件的位置，装不下的文件在每次请求时都会被重新编译。把 opcache.max_accelerated_files 调到高于站点 PHP 文件总数（WordPress 加页面构建器和几十个插件时，30000 或更高很常见）。','OPcache\'s string buffer is full'=>'OPcache 的字符串缓冲区已满','Repeated strings are shared between compiled files to save memory, and that buffer is full, so the saving stops. Raise opcache.interned_strings_buffer (16 to 32 MB).'=>'重复的字符串会在已编译文件之间共享以节省内存，而该缓冲区已满，节省也就停止了。调高 opcache.interned_strings_buffer（16 到 32 MB）。','OPcache memory is fragmenting'=>'OPcache 内存正在碎片化','A large share of the cache is taken up by versions of files that have since changed. This is normal right after an update and clears itself on the next restart; if it stays high, files are being modified on every request — a plugin writing PHP, or a cache directory inside the site.'=>'缓存中很大一部分被此后已经改变的文件版本占据。刚更新完出现这种情况很正常，下次重启就会消失；如果持续偏高，说明每次请求都有文件被修改——某个写入 PHP 的插件，或站点内部的缓存目录。','OPcache is recompiling more than it should'=>'OPcache 重新编译的次数偏多','Nothing is obviously misconfigured — the cache is not full, has not restarted and has been running long enough to judge — so this is worth watching rather than acting on immediately. If it stays low, the usual cause is files changing on disk during normal traffic.'=>'没有明显的配置错误——缓存没满、没有重启过，运行时间也足够长可以判断——所以这件事值得观察，而不是立刻动手。如果持续偏低，通常的原因是正常流量期间磁盘上的文件在发生变化。','The Chrome UX Report history needs a Google API key.'=>'Chrome UX Report 历史需要 Google API 密钥。','Google has no Chrome UX Report data for this site yet: it needs enough real visits from Chrome.'=>'Google 尚无此网站的 Chrome UX Report 数据：需要足够多的真实 Chrome 访问。','The Chrome UX Report API returned HTTP %d.'=>'Chrome UX Report API 返回了 HTTP %d。','No URL to test.'=>'没有可测试的网址。','PageSpeed Insights returned HTTP %d.'=>'PageSpeed Insights 返回了 HTTP %d。','PageSpeed Insights returned an unreadable response.'=>'PageSpeed Insights 返回了无法读取的响应。','Shared library: %s'=>'共享库：%s','Manual: you attributed this item by hand. A human assertion outranks every automatic one.'=>'手动：这是你亲自指定的归属。人工判断优先于任何自动来源。','Sure: captured live on this site at the moment the item was registered, by a plugin whose own namespace the item belongs to.'=>'确定：在本站该项目注册的那一刻实时捕获，且捕获者正是该项目所属命名空间的插件。','Likely: recorded by comparing what your site registered before and after activating the extension.'=>'很可能：通过比较启用扩展前后本站注册的内容得出。','Possible: found by reading the extension\'s own code, or confirmed by several sites in the shared dataset. Not verified while running.'=>'可能：读取扩展自身代码得出，或由共享数据集中的多个站点确认。未在运行时验证。','Doubtful: one claim only, and the item does not belong to the claimant\'s namespace — or few sites have reported it. Review before deleting.'=>'存疑：只有一条归属记录，且该项目不在声明者的命名空间内；或报告过它的站点很少。删除前请先核对。','Estimated: inferred from a prefix or slug pattern. An educated guess, not evidence.'=>'推测：根据前缀或 slug 模式推断。属于有依据的猜测，不是证据。','Undetermined: no owner found. Never delete without reviewing it yourself.'=>'未确定：未找到归属。请务必自行核对后再删除。','Database attribution'=>'数据库归属','File attribution'=>'文件归属','Known extensions'=>'已知扩展','Runtime evidence'=>'运行时证据','Asset owners'=>'资源所有者','Unload rules'=>'卸载规则','WordPress core inventory'=>'WordPress 核心清单','this site shares nothing, so it receives nothing'=>'本站不共享任何数据，因此也不会收到任何数据','this layer has no entry in the download map (a bug: please report it)'=>'下载映射中没有这一层（这是个缺陷：请告诉我们）','the server could not be reached'=>'无法连接到服务器','the server sent an empty file'=>'服务器返回了空文件','the server sent a web page instead of data'=>'服务器返回的是网页而不是数据','the file could not be written to disk'=>'文件无法写入磁盘','the server has not built this layer yet (HTTP 404)'=>'服务器尚未生成这一层（HTTP 404）','the server answered HTTP %d'=>'服务器返回 HTTP %d','it downloaded and then disappeared — something is deleting it after the download'=>'已下载但随后消失了：有什么东西在下载后把它删掉了','manual'=>'手动','activation'=>'激活','plugin change'=>'插件变更','theme change'=>'主题切换','upgrade'=>'升级','after cleanup'=>'清理后','API'=>'API','network'=>'网络','Preparing scan…'=>'正在准备扫描…','Scanning plugin code…'=>'正在扫描插件代码…','Scanning must-use plugin code…'=>'正在扫描必用插件代码…','Scanning theme code…'=>'正在扫描主题代码…','Analysing database records…'=>'正在分析数据库记录…','Listing empty database records…'=>'正在列出数据库空记录…','Skipping file-orphan detection (too heavy on this server)…'=>'已跳过孤立文件检测（在此服务器上过于繁重）…','Detecting orphaned files…'=>'正在检测孤立文件…','Analysing media & uploads…'=>'正在分析媒体和上传内容…','Analysis complete.'=>'分析完成。','Media analysis complete.'=>'媒体分析完成。','Indexing the media library… %1$s / %2$s'=>'正在为媒体库建立索引… %1$s / %2$s','Scanning uploads… %s files'=>'正在扫描上传内容… %s 个文件','Comparing duplicate images…'=>'正在比较重复图片…','Checking for unused attachments…'=>'正在检查未使用的附件…','Looking for where each attachment is used… step %1$d of %2$d'=>'正在查找每个附件的使用位置… 第 %1$d 步，共 %2$d 步','Blog index'=>'博客首页','Single: %s'=>'单篇：%s','Archive: %s'=>'归档：%s','Archive: taxonomy'=>'归档：分类法','The page could not be fetched.'=>'无法获取该页面。','The page links no local stylesheets.'=>'该页面没有链接任何本地样式表。','No stylesheet could be read.'=>'无法读取任何样式表。','The generated file could not be written.'=>'无法写入生成的文件。','Redis is almost full (%1$s of %2$s)'=>'Redis 快满了（%2$s 中已用 %1$s）','When it fills up it starts throwing away keys or refusing writes. Raise maxmemory, or ask your host for a bigger Redis.'=>'满了以后它会开始丢弃键或拒绝写入。调大 maxmemory，或请主机商提供更大的 Redis。','Redis is set to refuse writes when it fills up'=>'Redis 被设置为满时拒绝写入','With maxmemory-policy noeviction, a full Redis rejects every write and WordPress quietly works without its cache. For a cache, allkeys-lru is the right policy.'=>'使用 maxmemory-policy noeviction 时，满了的 Redis 会拒绝所有写入，WordPress 会悄悄地在没有缓存的情况下运行。对缓存而言，正确的策略是 allkeys-lru。','Redis throws away about %d keys an hour to make room'=>'Redis 每小时丢弃约 %d 个键来腾出空间','Every evicted key is a query that runs again. More memory for Redis makes the cache keep what it already computed.'=>'每个被淘汰的键都是一次要重新执行的查询。给 Redis 更多内存，缓存就能保留已经算好的结果。','Only %d%% of Redis lookups are hits'=>'Redis 查找中只有 %d%% 命中','Something is flushing the cache often or keys expire too soon. Check for plugins that flush the whole cache on every save, and that Redis has enough memory.'=>'有东西频繁清空缓存，或键过期太早。检查是否有插件在每次保存时清空整个缓存，并确认 Redis 有足够内存。','Redis has refused %d connections'=>'Redis 拒绝了 %d 个连接','It hit maxclients: on those requests the site ran without a cache. Raise maxclients or ask your host.'=>'它达到了 maxclients：这些请求中站点在没有缓存的情况下运行。调大 maxclients 或咨询主机商。','Redis memory is fragmented (%s×)'=>'Redis 内存碎片化（%s×）','It holds more memory than its data needs. activedefrag yes, or a restart in a quiet hour, gives it back.'=>'它占用的内存超过数据所需。activedefrag yes，或在空闲时段重启，可以把内存还回来。','The InnoDB buffer pool (%1$s) is smaller than your data (%2$s)'=>'InnoDB 缓冲池（%1$s）小于你的数据（%2$s）','MySQL cannot keep the tables in memory and reads them from disk. Raise innodb_buffer_pool_size to at least the size of your data, or ask your host.'=>'MySQL 无法把表保存在内存中，只能从磁盘读取。把 innodb_buffer_pool_size 至少调到你的数据大小，或咨询主机商。','%d%% of MySQL temporary tables go to disk'=>'%d%% 的 MySQL 临时表写到了磁盘','Sorting and grouping that does not fit in memory is written to disk. Raise tmp_table_size and max_heap_table_size together.'=>'放不进内存的排序和分组会写到磁盘。同时调大 tmp_table_size 和 max_heap_table_size。','MySQL has used %1$d of its %2$d connections'=>'MySQL 已使用 %2$d 个连接中的 %1$d 个','At the limit, new visits get "Error establishing a database connection". Raise max_connections or find what holds connections open.'=>'达到上限时，新访客会看到“建立数据库连接时出错”。调大 max_connections，或找出是什么一直占着连接。','MySQL opens about %d tables an hour'=>'MySQL 每小时打开约 %d 张表','Its table cache is too small for the number of tables, so it keeps closing and reopening them. Raise table_open_cache.'=>'它的表缓存相对于表的数量太小，所以不断关闭又重新打开它们。调大 table_open_cache。','Your database server (%s) is out of support'=>'你的数据库服务器（%s）已不再受支持','It no longer receives security fixes and is slower than current versions. Ask your host to move you to MySQL 8 or MariaDB 10.6 or later.'=>'它不再获得安全修复，而且比当前版本更慢。请主机商把你迁移到 MySQL 8 或 MariaDB 10.6 及以上。','Your license key is invalid!'=>'你的许可证密钥无效！','The API key is invalid.'=>'API 密钥无效。','That license key is already in use!'=>'该许可证密钥已在使用中！','The license key is already inactive.'=>'许可证密钥已处于停用状态。','Your license key has expired!'=>'你的许可证密钥已过期！','Invalid parameters for the license request.'=>'许可证请求的参数无效。','That license key was activated on another website!'=>'该许可证密钥已在另一个网站上激活！','Missing or invalid site identifier for the license.'=>'许可证的站点标识缺失或无效。','An error has occurred, please retry!'=>'发生错误，请重试！','%s: License Key Expired'=>'%s：许可证密钥已过期','Your license key has expired and has been deactivated!'=>'你的许可证密钥已过期并被停用！','Please enter and activate your license key if you want to use this plugin!'=>'如果要使用此插件，请输入并激活你的许可证密钥！','%s: License Expiring Soon'=>'%s：许可证密钥即将过期','Your license key will expire in %d days.'=>'你的许可证密钥将在 %d 天后到期。','Please renew your license to avoid service interruption.'=>'请续订许可证以避免服务中断。','Open license settings'=>'打开许可证设置','Sent by WPOptimizing.'=>'由 WPOptimizing 发送。','WPOptimizing — performance & cleanup'=>'WPOptimizing — 性能与清理','Run a full analysis of code, files and database'=>'运行对代码、文件和数据库的完整分析','Run general cleanup'=>'运行常规清理','Run the general database cleanup with your saved settings'=>'使用已保存的设置运行常规数据库清理','Flush all caches'=>'清除所有缓存','Flush the object cache and any detected host/plugin page cache'=>'清除对象缓存以及检测到的任何主机/插件页面缓存','Go to dashboard'=>'前往仪表盘','Working…'=>'正在处理…','Cache flushed ✓'=>'缓存已清空 ✓','Cleanup done ✓'=>'清理完成 ✓','Run a general cleanup now with your saved settings?'=>'立即使用已保存的设置运行常规清理？','Once Weekly'=>'每周一次','Once Monthly'=>'每月一次','Read more in the documentation'=>'在文档中了解更多','Smart Assets needs an active Pro license.'=>'Smart Assets 需要有效的 Pro 许可证。','This plugin deletes one item at a time, backing it up first. Pro deletes as many as you select, or all of them at once.'=>'本插件一次删除一项，并先进行备份。Pro 可删除所选的任意数量，或一次全部删除。','This plugin deletes one item at a time. Select just one; Pro deletes as many as you select.'=>'本插件一次只删除一项。请只选择一项；Pro 可删除所选的任意数量。','This plugin uninstalls one extension at a time: if you tick several, only the first is uninstalled. Pro uninstalls every one you select.'=>'本插件一次只卸载一个扩展：如果勾选多个，只会卸载第一个。Pro 会卸载你选择的所有扩展。','Smart Assets, which stops the CSS and JavaScript a page does not need, is not included in this plugin.'=>'Smart Assets（用于停止页面不需要的 CSS 和 JavaScript）不包含在本插件中。','The library audit is not included in this plugin.'=>'媒体库审计不包含在本插件中。','deletes the record you ticked, after a backup: this plugin deletes one at a time. The notice that follows offers Undo for one day.'=>'备份后删除你勾选的记录：本插件一次删除一项。随后出现的通知会在一天内提供“撤销”。','Webhooks are not included in this plugin.'=>'Webhooks 不包含在本插件中。','WPOptimizing — Network'=>'WPOptimizing — 网络','The network dashboard (every site at a glance, network-wide profiles and scans, CSV export and email alerts) is part of Pro and needs an active license.'=>'网络仪表盘（一览所有站点、全网配置方案与分析、CSV 导出和邮件提醒）属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。','See Pro'=>'了解 Pro','See where the time goes and fix it: object cache, CSS and JavaScript, images and delivery, each one switched on separately.'=>'找出时间花在哪里并加以解决：对象缓存、CSS 与 JavaScript、图片，以及加载与交付，每项都可单独开启。','Scale down oversized uploads.'=>'缩小过大的上传。','Uploads above the max size are scaled down; the full-size original is preserved.'=>'超过最大尺寸的上传会被缩小；保留全尺寸原图。','Max size'=>'最大尺寸','0 on an axis disables resizing.'=>'某一轴为 0 表示不缩放。','Pro also caches your pages at Cloudflare\'s edge, for anonymous visitors, with a Cache Rule it checks before leaving on.'=>'Pro 还会为匿名访客在 Cloudflare 边缘缓存你的页面，并在保持开启前检查所用的缓存规则。','Caching the pages at Cloudflare needs an active Pro license.'=>'在 Cloudflare 缓存页面需要有效的 Pro 许可证。','The page cache needs an active Pro license.'=>'页面缓存需要有效的 Pro 许可证。','Speed up the admin and the front end with a persistent object cache and per-request query deduplication — safe and reversible.'=>'通过持久化对象缓存和每次请求的查询去重来加速后台和前台——安全且可撤销。','WPOptimizing detects your host or plugin page cache and purges it automatically after a cleanup (and from the toolbar “Flush all caches”), so visitors never see stale content.'=>'WPOptimizing 会检测你的主机或插件的页面缓存，并在清理后（以及通过工具栏的“清除所有缓存”按钮）自动清除，使访客永远不会看到过期内容。','A page cache serves a static HTML copy of each page to anonymous visitors, so most requests never boot WordPress.'=>'页面缓存会向匿名访客提供每个页面的静态 HTML 副本，因此大多数请求根本不会启动 WordPress。','A page cache, with background preload and page caching at Cloudflare\'s edge, is not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含页面缓存及其后台预加载和 Cloudflare 边缘页面缓存。','The page cache, its background preload and page caching at Cloudflare\'s edge are part of Pro and need an active license.'=>'页面缓存、其后台预加载以及 Cloudflare 边缘页面缓存属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。','CSS and JavaScript minification (opt-in, off by default): under Speed › Page & browser › Minification WPOptimizing can serve minified copies of your own local CSS and JS, stripping comments and whitespace so they download faster. It is deliberately conservative: files that are already minified, hosted on another domain, or listed in your exclusions are left untouched; the minified copies live in wp-content/uploads/wpopt-assets/ and are rebuilt automatically when the source changes or a cache is flushed. A test mode lets administrators preview the result before exposing it to visitors, and it refuses to run alongside another asset optimizer (Autoptimize, WP Rocket, Perfmatters, LiteSpeed) to avoid double-processing.'=>'CSS 与 JavaScript 压缩（可选，默认关闭）：在「速度 › 页面与浏览器 › 压缩」中，WPOptimizing 可以提供您本地 CSS 和 JS 的压缩副本，去除注释和空白以加快下载。它有意保持保守：已压缩、托管于其他域名或列入排除项的文件保持不变；压缩副本存放在 wp-content/uploads/wpopt-assets/，并在源文件更改或清空缓存时自动重建。测试模式允许管理员在向访客展示前预览结果，并且它拒绝与其他资源优化工具（Autoptimize、WP Rocket、Perfmatters、LiteSpeed）同时运行，以避免重复处理。','Optional speed features for the public site, configured in Speed › Page & browser: speculative loading (prefetch/prerender the next page), content image loading optimization, resource hints and a Server-Timing diagnostic header. All opt-in and reversible; none cache full HTML pages.'=>'面向公开站点的可选速度功能，在「速度 › 页面与浏览器」中配置：推测性加载（预取/预渲染下一页）、内容图片加载优化、资源提示以及用于诊断的 Server-Timing 响应头。全部为可选且可逆；均不缓存完整的 HTML 页面。','Settings: Max dimensions set separate width and height limits (0 on an axis disables it). Scale down oversized uploads applies them to new uploads through WordPress\' native handling, which keeps the full-size original.'=>'设置：最大尺寸分别设置宽度和高度上限（某一轴为 0 表示禁用）。“缩小过大的上传”会通过 WordPress 原生处理把它们应用到新上传，并保留全尺寸原图。','Removes database clutter: post revisions, auto-drafts, trashed posts, spam comments, and expired transients. Runs from a single button. A detailed log is saved after every run.'=>'删除数据库垃圾：文章修订版、自动草稿、已删除文章、垃圾评论和过期的临时数据。通过单个按钮运行。每次运行后保存详细日志。','Every batch the cleanup deletes is backed up first, into one Backups entry per run. If that backup cannot be written, the run stops with the status “Stopped: backup failed” and deletes nothing more. Table optimization changes no data and needs no backup.'=>'清理删除的每一批数据都会先备份，每次运行对应「备份」中的一条条目。如果无法写入该备份，本次运行会以状态“已停止：备份失败”停止，不再删除任何内容。表优化不会改动数据，因此无需备份。','Scans your uploads for files with no database attachment record, orphaned thumbnail sizes and potentially unused attachments, and counts the exact-content duplicates.'=>'扫描您的上传内容，查找没有数据库附件记录的文件、孤立的缩略图尺寸和可能未使用的附件，并统计内容完全相同的重复文件。','Every change WPOptimizing makes to your data is backed up first: deletions (orphans, empty rows, media and the general cleanup) and changes (autoload flags, scheduled tasks, .htaccess and wp-config.php edits). Backups are grouped by operation so you can find and restore exactly what a specific action changed. Manual backups can also be created at any time.'=>'WPOptimizing 对你的数据所做的每项改动都会先备份：删除（孤立项、空行、媒体和常规清理）和修改（自动加载标记、计划任务、.htaccess 和 wp-config.php 的编辑）。备份按操作分组，因此你能准确找到并恢复某次操作所改动的内容。你也可以随时手动创建备份。','Uploads larger than this (width × height) are scaled down when they are uploaded; the full-size original is kept. 0 on an axis disables it.'=>'大于此尺寸（宽 × 高）的上传会在上传时缩小；保留全尺寸原图。某一轴为 0 表示禁用。','Scale down oversized uploads to the max dimensions — the full-size original is preserved'=>'将过大的上传缩小到最大尺寸——保留全尺寸原图','The media library audit (stranded and competing files, leftover sizes, downloadable dumps and logs, and the uploads protection) is not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含媒体库审计（零散与冲突的文件、遗留尺寸、可被下载的转储和日志，以及 uploads 保护）。','The media library audit is part of Pro and needs an active license.'=>'媒体库审计属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。','Listing duplicate images and merging them (one copy kept, its references reassigned) is not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含列出重复图片并合并它们（保留一份副本并重新分配其引用）。','How the page reaches the visitor: speculative loading, image loading, resource hints and a Server-Timing diagnostic. All optional and reversible; none of them cache whole pages.'=>'页面如何到达访客：推测性加载、图片加载、资源提示和 Server-Timing 诊断。全部可选且可逆；都不会缓存整个页面。','Scheduled cleanup (hourly to monthly, with a frequency per task) and automatic cleanup when the database grows are not included in this plugin. Run the cleanup from General cleanup whenever you need it.'=>'本插件不包含计划清理（从每小时到每月，可按任务设置频率）以及数据库增长时的自动清理。需要时请在「常规清理」中运行清理。','Scheduled cleanup and automatic cleanup when the database grows are part of Pro and need an active license. Your schedule is kept and comes back with the license.'=>'计划清理以及数据库增长时的自动清理属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。你的计划会被保留，并随许可证一起恢复。','Webhooks are part of Pro and need an active license. The endpoint you saved is kept.'=>'Webhooks 属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。你保存的端点会被保留。','Preloading key resources, lazy YouTube embeds, self-hosted Google Fonts and CDN rewriting are not included in this plugin.'=>'本插件不包含预加载关键资源、延迟加载 YouTube 嵌入、自托管 Google Fonts 和 CDN 重写。','Preloading key resources, lazy YouTube embeds, self-hosted Google Fonts and CDN rewriting are part of Pro and need an active license.'=>'预加载关键资源、延迟加载 YouTube 嵌入、自托管 Google Fonts 和 CDN 重写属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。','More delivery options'=>'更多交付选项','Smart Assets stops the CSS and JavaScript a page does not need — site-wide, on chosen URLs or on a single page — with a test mode that applies it to administrators first.'=>'Smart Assets 会停止页面不需要的 CSS 和 JavaScript——可作用于整站、所选 URL 或单个页面——并提供先仅对管理员生效的测试模式。','Smart Assets is not included in this plugin.'=>'Smart Assets 不包含在本插件中。','Smart Assets is part of Pro and needs an active license.'=>'Smart Assets 属于 Pro，需要有效的许可证。','The CSS and JavaScript actually loaded on your public pages. You can stop specific assets from loading, on the whole site or only where you choose, and let the knowledge base unload them automatically where they are not needed.'=>'你的公开页面上实际加载的 CSS 和 JavaScript。你可以在整站或仅在所选位置停止加载特定资源，并让知识库在不需要的地方自动卸载它们。','The WPOptimizing API needs an active Pro license.'=>'WPOptimizing API 需要有效的 Pro 许可证。','The WPOptimizing commands need an active Pro license.'=>'WPOptimizing 命令需要有效的 Pro 许可证。','Import / export: download the whole configuration as a JSON file and restore it here or on another site — handy to replicate your setup across a fleet. The export covers the settings for cleanup, cache, media and images, backups and attribution. For safety it never includes keys, passwords, the data-sharing consent, branding or measured runtime state (scan results, baselines, cached sizes), so importing onto another site only carries configuration. On import, existing settings are overwritten and any unrecognized keys are ignored.'=>'导入 / 导出：将整个配置下载为 JSON 文件，并在此处或其他站点恢复——便于在多个站点之间复制你的设置。导出涵盖清理、缓存、媒体和图片、备份和归属的设置。出于安全考虑，它从不包含密钥、密码、数据共享许可、品牌设置或测得的运行时状态（扫描结果、基线、缓存大小），因此导入到其他站点时只会携带配置。导入时，现有设置将被覆盖，未识别的键将被忽略。','Every media deletion is backed up first, so it is reversible: WPOptimizing copies each file before removing anything. If you ever need to undo a deletion, the Media tab shows how many file backups are available and links straight to the Backups tab, where you restore a whole operation in one click. Nothing is deleted that was not fully backed up.'=>'每次删除媒体都会先进行备份，因此可逆：WPOptimizing 会在移除任何内容之前复制每个文件。如果你需要撤销某次删除，“媒体”选项卡会显示有多少个文件备份可用，并直接链接到“备份”选项卡，你可以在那里一键恢复整个操作。凡是没有完整备份的内容都不会被删除。','Image optimization (front-end WebP/AVIF serving, scaling down oversized uploads and the analysis of the library) has its own sub-section, documented separately under Image optimization.'=>'图片优化（前端提供 WebP/AVIF、缩小过大的上传以及媒体库分析）有自己的子部分，单独记录在“图片优化”下。','Media has six entries: Orphans (with a filter for orphan files, orphan thumbnails and other files), Duplicate sets, Unused attachments, Image optimization (Summary and Heaviest images), Trash and Library audit. Merging duplicates and the library audit are not included in this plugin: their entries only say so.'=>'媒体有六个条目：孤立文件（可按孤立文件、孤立缩略图和其他文件筛选）、重复文件组、未使用的附件、图片优化（摘要和最重的图片）、回收站和媒体库审计。本插件不包含合并重复文件和媒体库审计：这两个条目只会说明这一点。','Finds files in /uploads with no record in the database, orphaned thumbnails and unused attachments, and counts the duplicate media. Media deletions are backed up first and can be restored from the Backups tab.'=>'查找 /uploads 中在数据库里没有记录的文件、孤立缩略图和未使用的附件，并统计重复媒体。媒体删除会先创建备份，可从「备份」标签页恢复。','Configure cleanup options and backups. Quick profiles below apply a recommended configuration with one click.'=>'配置清理选项和备份。下方的快速配置方案可一键应用推荐配置。','Speculative loading, image loading, resource hints and Server-Timing are now under Speed › Page & browser, next to minify.'=>'推测加载、图片加载、资源提示和 Server-Timing 现在位于「速度 › 页面与浏览器」，与压缩放在一起。','Save this site’s configuration to a JSON file and restore it here or on another site — handy to replicate your setup across sites. It includes the settings for cleanup, cache, media and images, backups and attribution. Keys, passwords, data-sharing consent and measured runtime state (scan results, baselines, cached sizes) are never included.'=>'将本站点的配置保存为 JSON 文件，并在此处或其他站点恢复——便于在多个站点之间复制你的设置。它包含清理、缓存、媒体和图片、备份和归属的设置。密钥、密码、数据共享同意以及测得的运行时状态（扫描结果、基线、缓存大小）从不包含在内。','All the WPO your WordPress needs in a single plugin, with the only cleanup that knows who owns each leftover before you delete anything.'=>'你的 WordPress 所需的全部 WPO，尽在一个插件，并且是唯一一款在你删除任何内容之前就清楚每项残留归属于谁的清理工具。','WPOptimizing'=>'WPOptimizing','Analyze the images in your uploads — total weight, formats, large files and how many lack a WebP/AVIF copy. Oversized new uploads are scaled down as they arrive, and serving the next-gen copies on the front-end is built in.'=>'分析你上传目录中的图片：总大小、格式、大文件，以及有多少缺少 WebP/AVIF 副本。过大的新上传会在上传时自动缩小，前端提供新一代副本的功能也已内置。','Files removed from the media sections (unused attachments, orphan files and thumbnails) are backed up first and can be restored here. Restoring puts the files back on disk; deleting permanently frees the backup space. This is the same set of copies as the Backups tab.'=>'从媒体各部分删除的文件（未使用的附件、孤立文件和缩略图）会先备份，可在此还原。还原会将文件放回磁盘；永久删除会释放备份空间。这与“备份”标签中的副本集相同。','Deleting records and uninstalling extensions requires an active license. Without one you can scan, review, deactivate, run general cleanup and create backups.'=>'删除记录和卸载扩展需要有效的许可证。没有许可证时，你可以扫描、审查、停用、运行常规清理和创建备份。','<strong>Without a license:</strong> showing %1$s of %2$s records found.'=>'<strong>未激活许可证：</strong>显示 %2$s 条中的 %1$s 条记录。','<strong>Without a license:</strong> all %s records found are shown. Deleting them needs an active license.'=>'<strong>未激活许可证：</strong>已显示找到的全部 %s 条记录。删除它们需要有效的许可证。','Without a license'=>'未激活许可证','Without a license you can analyse and review your site and run the general cleanup. Activate your license to delete what the analysis attributes and to use the other Pro features.'=>'没有许可证时，你可以分析和审查你的网站，并运行常规清理。激活你的许可证即可删除分析所归属的内容，并使用其他 Pro 功能。','The license has not been verified for over a week, so Pro features are off until the store can be reached again. The rest keeps working: scanning and review are unaffected.'=>'许可证已超过一周未验证，因此专业版功能已关闭，直到可以重新连接商店为止。其余功能仍可使用：扫描和查看不受影响。','Your license has expired. The plugin keeps working without it — activate a license to enable deletion and the other Pro features.'=>'你的许可证已过期。插件在没有许可证时仍可继续使用 — 激活许可证以启用删除和其他 Pro 功能。','Activate your license to unlock the Pro features (deleting attributed records, automatic asset unloading and uninstalling extensions). You can also do this later in Settings — without a license the plugin already scans, reviews, cleans and backs up.'=>'激活你的许可证以解锁 Pro 功能（删除已归属记录、自动卸载资源以及卸载扩展）。你也可以稍后在「设置」中完成：没有许可证时，插件已经可以扫描、审查、清理和备份。','Enter your key and click Activate. No key yet? Continue — everything here works without a license, and you can add it anytime.'=>'输入你的密钥并点击「激活」。还没有密钥？继续即可：这里的一切在没有许可证时也能运行，你可以随时添加。','Without a license you can see your autoload weight and every option. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get a license</a> to disable the ones slowing your site down and run Smart Deactivation.'=>'没有许可证时，你可以查看 autoload 权重和所有选项。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">获取许可证</a>即可停用拖慢网站的选项并运行智能停用。','The "Heaviest images" view of Image optimization turns the aggregate numbers into a concrete, per-image to-do list: a table with a thumbnail, dimensions, weight, a plain-language tag of what would help each image (Oversized, No WebP, No AVIF — only ever suggesting formats your server can actually create) and an estimated saving, with search, a format filter and pagination. Tick the images you want and click "Optimize selected" to recompress/resize them (backup-first) and generate their missing WebP/AVIF copies in one pass; "Optimize all" does the whole filtered list. Without a license the table is read-only. On very large libraries the scan is time-bounded, so the list shows the worst offenders it reached.'=>'“图片优化”中的“最重的图片”视图将汇总数字转化为按图片列出的具体待办清单：一个包含缩略图、尺寸、大小、以通俗语言标注每张图片改进方式（尺寸过大、无 WebP、无 AVIF——仅建议你的服务器确实能创建的格式）以及预计节省的表格，并带有搜索、格式筛选和分页。勾选所需图片并点击“优化所选”，即可对它们重新压缩/调整尺寸（先行备份）并一次性生成缺失的 WebP/AVIF 副本；“优化全部”会处理整个筛选后的列表。未激活许可证时该表格为只读。在超大媒体库中扫描有时间限制，因此列表显示的是它所处理到的最严重的情况。','File deletion needs an active license; without one you can review all findings without risk. Always run a full site backup before bulk-deleting media files.'=>'删除文件需要有效的许可证；没有许可证时，您可以无风险地查看所有发现。在批量删除媒体文件之前，请务必先执行完整的网站备份。','Deleting files requires an active license.'=>'删除文件需要有效许可证。','Without a license you can see the full media analysis. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get a license</a> to delete orphaned and duplicate images (with an automatic backup).'=>'没有许可证时，你可以查看完整的媒体分析。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">获取许可证</a>以删除孤立和重复图片（含自动备份）。','Without a license the leftovers are only listed. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get a license</a> to delete them (with an automatic backup).'=>'没有许可证时，这些残留文件只会被列出。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">获取许可证</a>即可删除它们（含自动备份）。','%d suggestion accepted. The records were re-evaluated.' . "\0" . '%d suggestions accepted. The records were re-evaluated.'=>'已接受 %d 条建议。记录已重新评估。','Accept all sure suggestions (%d)'=>'接受所有确定的建议（%d）','Library'=>'库','Extension names'=>'扩展名称','Action Scheduler entries are backed up. Their log rows (trace lines such as «action started») are deleted without a backup, and so is any other log row older than %d days.'=>'Action Scheduler 条目会先备份。其日志行（如“action started”之类的跟踪信息）将直接删除，不做备份；任何超过 %d 天的其他日志行也是如此。','Action Scheduler: %s log rows deleted without a backup.'=>'Action Scheduler：已删除 %s 行日志，未做备份。','The cleanup continues by itself in the background in about a minute, until it is done.'=>'清理将在大约一分钟后在后台自动继续，直到完成。','The cleanup reached its time limit and continues by itself in the background until it is done. You can leave this page.'=>'清理已达到时间上限，将在后台自动继续直到完成。你可以离开此页面。','The cleanup reached its time limit and is continuing by itself in the background since %2$s (passes so far: %1$s). You can leave this page, or follow it here until it is done.'=>'清理已达到时间上限，自 %2$s 起正在后台自动继续（目前已运行 %1$s 轮）。你可以离开此页面，也可以在这里跟进直到完成。','Action Scheduler entries removed'=>'已删除的 Action Scheduler 条目','Action Scheduler log rows removed (no backup)'=>'已删除的 Action Scheduler 日志行（无备份）','Continue now'=>'立即继续','Removed %s rows so far…'=>'目前已删除 %s 行…','Waiting for the background pass to finish…'=>'正在等待后台这一轮完成…','%s: AUTO_INCREMENT restored.'=>'%s：已恢复 AUTO_INCREMENT。','%1$s was not changed: %2$s.'=>'%1$s 未更改：%2$s。','WordPress tables without AUTO_INCREMENT'=>'缺少 AUTO_INCREMENT 的 WordPress 数据表','Their id column no longer numbers new rows by itself, usually after a migration that copied the tables without their attributes. New rows go in with id 0 and the next one collides: saving, updating plugins or creating users and terms fails with errors that do not point here.'=>'它们的 ID 列不再自动为新行编号，通常发生在复制数据表时未带上其属性的迁移之后。新行以 ID 0 写入，下一行就会冲突：保存、更新插件或创建用户和分类项都会失败，而报错并不会指向这里。','— it has also lost its primary key, so it may hold duplicate ids. Fix it with your host or a developer, from a backup; it is not changed from here.'=>'— 它还丢失了主键，因此可能存在重复的 ID。请让主机商或开发者基于备份进行修复；此处不会改动它。','— it has a row with %s 0, and other tables and plugins point at that id. Moving it to another id would break those links, so it is not done automatically: give that row a new id, update what refers to it, and come back.'=>'— 它有一行的 %s 为 0，其他数据表和插件都指向这个 ID。把它移到其他 ID 会破坏这些关联，因此不会自动处理：请为这一行分配新 ID，更新引用它的内容，然后再回来。','— the table takes %s, and the change rebuilds it and blocks writes to it meanwhile, so it is not done from here. Your hosting provider can do it at a quiet time.'=>'— 该表占用 %s，此更改会重建它并在此期间阻止对它的写入，因此不在此处执行。你的主机服务商可以在空闲时段完成。','The table is rebuilt and writes to it wait until it finishes, usually a few seconds. Continue?'=>'数据表会被重建，写入会等待其完成，通常只需几秒。是否继续？','Fix'=>'修复','Its row with id 0 moves to the next free id first; nothing refers to it.'=>'它的 ID 为 0 的行会先移到下一个可用 ID；没有任何内容引用它。','the table no longer needs it, or is not a WordPress table of this site'=>'该表已不需要，或不是本站的 WordPress 数据表','it cannot be fixed from here; follow the instructions in the notice'=>'无法在此修复；请按提示中的说明操作','the database accepted the change but the column still has no AUTO_INCREMENT'=>'数据库接受了更改，但该列仍没有 AUTO_INCREMENT','rejected by the database'=>'被数据库拒绝','the server stopped the rebuild before it finished; the table was left as it was'=>'服务器在重建完成前将其中止；数据表保持原样','the table no longer exists'=>'该数据表已不存在','nothing worth recovering any more; skipped'=>'已没有值得回收的空间；已跳过','only InnoDB tables are rebuilt in the background, because others would be locked meanwhile'=>'只有 InnoDB 数据表会在后台重建，因为其他引擎的表在此期间会被锁定','%1$d large table had almost no free space to recover and was skipped: %2$s.' . "\0" . '%1$d large tables had almost no free space to recover and were skipped: %2$s.'=>'%1$d 个大型数据表几乎没有可回收的空闲空间，已跳过：%2$s。','%1$d large table will be rebuilt in the background, one at a time and without stopping the site: %2$s. You can leave this page.' . "\0" . '%1$d large tables will be rebuilt in the background, one at a time and without stopping the site: %2$s. You can leave this page.'=>'%1$d 个大型数据表将在后台逐个重建，不会中断网站：%2$s。你可以离开此页面。','%1$s is being rebuilt in the background (started %2$s ago). The site keeps working meanwhile.'=>'%1$s 正在后台重建（%2$s前开始）。在此期间网站照常运行。','Waiting to be rebuilt: %s.'=>'等待重建：%s。','%1$s was not rebuilt: %2$s.'=>'%1$s 未重建：%2$s。','%1$s rebuilt: %2$s recovered.'=>'%1$s 已重建：回收了 %2$s。','Large tables rebuilt in the background'=>'在后台重建的大型数据表','A page cache you no longer use left things behind'=>'你已不再使用的页面缓存留下了残留','Rules from %s in .htaccess, which keep serving old pages before WordPress runs.'=>'%s 在 .htaccess 中的规则，会在 WordPress 运行之前继续提供旧页面。','wp-content/advanced-cache.php from %s, which is no longer active but still loads on every visit.'=>'来自 %s 的 wp-content/advanced-cache.php：该插件已停用，但每次访问仍会加载此文件。','wp-content/advanced-cache.php from a plugin that is no longer active, which still loads on every visit.'=>'来自一个已停用插件的 wp-content/advanced-cache.php，每次访问仍会加载。','A second WP_CACHE line in wp-config.php, which makes PHP warn on every visit.'=>'wp-config.php 中的第二行 WP_CACHE，会让 PHP 在每次访问时发出警告。','Each file is copied to Backups before it is changed, so this can be undone.'=>'每个文件在修改前都会复制到“备份”中，因此可以撤销。','Remove what was left behind'=>'清除残留','You do not have permission to change these files.'=>'你没有修改这些文件的权限。','Removed what the old page cache left behind. The previous files are in Backups.'=>'已清除旧页面缓存留下的残留。之前的文件保存在“备份”中。','Some of it could not be removed: the file is not writable or could not be backed up first, so it was left as it was.'=>'有一部分无法清除：文件不可写，或无法事先备份，因此保持原样。','Your hosting already keeps a copy of every page (%s), and WPOptimizing cannot clear it. A second page cache would leave visitors seeing old pages after each change, so it was not enabled. The object cache and the other speed-ups still work alongside it.'=>'你的主机已经保存了每个页面的副本（%s），而 WPOptimizing 无法清除它。第二个页面缓存会让访客在每次修改后看到旧页面，因此没有启用。对象缓存和其他加速功能仍可与之共存。','%s replaced WPOptimizing\'s page cache file, so pages are now cached by it. WPOptimizing\'s page cache has been switched off so the two do not get in each other\'s way.'=>'%s 替换了 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存文件，现在由它来缓存页面。WPOptimizing 的页面缓存已关闭，以免两者互相干扰。','%1$s: these patterns use regular expressions, which WPOptimizing does not read, so they were not imported. Add them again as plain text: %2$s'=>'%1$s：这些模式使用了正则表达式，WPOptimizing 不读取正则表达式，因此未导入。请以纯文本形式重新添加：%2$s','Page lifetime: the other plugin kept pages for longer than 12 hours (or for ever). Forms and «add to cart» buttons stop working on pages that old, so it was set to 10 hours.'=>'页面有效期：另一个插件将页面保留超过 12 小时（或永久）。在这么旧的页面上，表单和“加入购物车”按钮会失效，因此已设置为 10 小时。','Cache lifespan'=>'缓存有效期','Never cache URL(s)'=>'永不缓存的 URL','Never cache cookies'=>'永不缓存的 Cookie','Cache query string(s)'=>'缓存的查询字符串','Separate cache files for mobile devices'=>'为移动设备单独缓存','Activate preloading'=>'启用预加载','Enable caching for logged-in WordPress users: WPOptimizing never serves cached pages to logged-in users.'=>'为已登录的 WordPress 用户启用缓存：WPOptimizing 从不向已登录用户提供缓存页面。','Never cache user agent(s): not imported; WPOptimizing keeps its own fixed list.'=>'永不缓存的用户代理：未导入；WPOptimizing 使用自己的固定列表。','Always purge URL(s): not imported; WPOptimizing purges the pages a change affects on its own.'=>'始终清除的 URL：未导入；WPOptimizing 会自行清除受更改影响的页面。','Minify CSS files'=>'压缩 CSS 文件','Minify JavaScript files'=>'压缩 JavaScript 文件','Excluded CSS and JavaScript files'=>'排除的 CSS 和 JavaScript 文件','Load JavaScript deferred'=>'推迟加载 JavaScript','Excluded JavaScript files (deferred)'=>'排除的 JavaScript 文件（推迟）','Load CSS asynchronously'=>'异步加载 CSS','Fallback critical CSS'=>'备用关键 CSS','Delay JavaScript execution'=>'延迟执行 JavaScript','Excluded JavaScript files (delayed)'=>'排除的 JavaScript 文件（延迟执行）','Combine JavaScript files: not imported. Combining files makes HTTP/2 sites slower and breaks scripts, so WPOptimizing does not do it.'=>'合并 JavaScript 文件：未导入。合并文件会使 HTTP/2 网站变慢并破坏脚本，因此 WPOptimizing 不这样做。','Remove Unused CSS: WP Rocket\'s own online service, not imported. WPOptimizing generates critical CSS on your server instead.'=>'移除未使用的 CSS：这是 WP Rocket 自己的在线服务，未导入。WPOptimizing 会在你的服务器上生成关键 CSS。','LazyLoad for images and iframes'=>'图片和 iframe 延迟加载','Replace YouTube iframe with preview image'=>'用预览图替换 YouTube iframe','Self-host Google Fonts'=>'本地托管 Google Fonts','Preload fonts'=>'预加载字体','Prefetch DNS requests'=>'预解析 DNS 请求','Prefetch DNS requests: WPOptimizing finds the hosts to connect to early on its own, so the list itself was not copied.'=>'预解析 DNS 请求：WPOptimizing 会自行判断需要提前连接的主机，因此未复制该列表。','Excluded images or iframes (LazyLoad): not imported.'=>'排除的图片或 iframe（延迟加载）：未导入。','Disable WordPress emoji'=>'禁用 WordPress 表情符号','Enable Content Delivery Network'=>'启用内容分发网络 (CDN)','CDN CNAME(s)'=>'CDN CNAME','CDN CNAME(s): WPOptimizing uses one CDN host, so only the first one was imported.'=>'CDN CNAME：WPOptimizing 只使用一个 CDN 主机，因此只导入了第一个。','Auto drafts'=>'自动草稿','Spam comments'=>'垃圾评论','Trashed comments'=>'回收站中的评论','All transients'=>'所有临时数据','Revisions: WP Rocket deletes all of them; WPOptimizing keeps the last two of each post, which you can change in General cleanup.'=>'修订版本：WP Rocket 会全部删除；WPOptimizing 为每篇文章保留最近两个，你可以在“常规清理”中更改。','Schedule automatic cleanup'=>'计划自动清理','Control Heartbeat'=>'控制 Heartbeat','Cloudflare: WP Rocket uses your account\'s Global API Key, which WPOptimizing does not copy. Connect Cloudflare in Cache › Cloudflare with an API token.'=>'Cloudflare：WP Rocket 使用你账户的 Global API Key，WPOptimizing 不会复制它。请在“缓存 › Cloudflare”中使用 API 令牌连接 Cloudflare。','Varnish: switch on its purge in Cache › Browser & server once WPOptimizing has checked that Varnish is in front of the site.'=>'Varnish：待 WPOptimizing 确认 Varnish 位于网站前端后，在“缓存 › 浏览器与服务器”中启用其清除功能。','Import from another plugin'=>'从其他插件导入','Moving from another cache or performance plugin? WPOptimizing reads the settings it left on this site, even if it is deactivated, and brings over what has an equivalent here. Passwords, licence and API keys are never copied, and nothing that changes files (the page cache, the object cache) is switched on by an import.'=>'要从其他缓存或性能插件迁移过来？WPOptimizing 会读取该插件留在本站的设置（即使已停用），并导入在这里有对应项的设置。密码、许可证和 API 密钥从不复制，导入也不会启用任何会修改文件的功能（页面缓存、对象缓存）。','On'=>'开','No settings from another cache or performance plugin were found on this site.'=>'本站未找到其他缓存或性能插件的设置。','Its settings have nothing WPOptimizing can bring over.'=>'其设置中没有 WPOptimizing 可以导入的内容。','Import from %s'=>'从 %s 导入','Undo the import from %1$s (%2$s)'=>'撤销从 %1$s 的导入（%2$s）','The settings are back to how they were before the import.'=>'设置已恢复到导入之前的状态。','There is no import to undo.'=>'没有可撤销的导入。','That plugin cannot be imported from.'=>'无法从该插件导入。','Nothing was imported: none of its settings could be brought over.'=>'未导入任何内容：其设置都无法导入。','Settings imported from %s. Check the pages they belong to, and switch the page cache or the object cache on yourself when the other plugin is deactivated. You can undo the import below.'=>'已从 %s 导入设置。请检查对应的设置页面，并在停用另一个插件后自行启用页面缓存或对象缓存。你可以在下方撤销导入。','%d setting would be imported' . "\0" . '%d settings would be imported'=>'将导入 %d 项设置','Purge this page'=>'清除此页面','Delete the cached copy of this page here, at Cloudflare and in Varnish'=>'删除此页面在本站、Cloudflare 和 Varnish 中的缓存副本','Also ignore these tracking parameters (the page is cached as if they were not there)'=>'同时忽略这些跟踪参数（缓存页面时视同不存在）','parameter name, e.g. ref'=>'参数名，例如 ref','Never cache for these browsers or bots'=>'永不为这些浏览器或机器人缓存','part of the user agent, e.g. Lighthouse'=>'用户代理的一部分，例如 Lighthouse','Serve without PHP'=>'不经 PHP 直接提供','The web server answers from the cached file directly, without starting PHP: faster pages and far more visitors at once on the same server. Only pages that need nothing from PHP are served this way (no separate mobile copy, currency, query string or security headers sent from PHP); the rest keep going through PHP as now.'=>'Web 服务器直接从缓存文件响应，无需启动 PHP：页面更快，同一台服务器可同时承载更多访客。只有不需要 PHP 处理的页面才会这样提供（没有单独的移动版副本、货币、查询字符串或由 PHP 发送的安全标头）；其余页面仍像现在一样经过 PHP。','Serve cached pages straight from the web server (adds rules to .htaccess, backed up first)'=>'直接由 Web 服务器提供缓存页面（向 .htaccess 添加规则，事先备份）','This server does not read .htaccess (it is probably Nginx), so WordPress cannot add the rules itself. Whoever manages the server can add these lines to the site\'s configuration:'=>'此服务器不读取 .htaccess（可能是 Nginx），因此 WordPress 无法自行添加规则。服务器管理员可以将以下几行添加到站点配置中：','Never cache user agent(s)'=>'永不缓存的用户代理','URLs to exclude from caching'=>'不缓存的 URL','Cookies which, if present, will prevent caching'=>'存在时阻止缓存的 Cookie','Generate separate files for mobile devices'=>'为移动设备生成单独的文件','Automatically preload content after it is purged'=>'清除后自动预加载内容','%s: WPOptimizing never serves cached pages to logged-in users.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 从不向已登录用户提供缓存页面。','Serve cached pages to logged in users'=>'向已登录用户提供缓存页面','List of browser agent strings which, if detected, will prevent caching'=>'检测到时阻止缓存的浏览器代理字符串列表','Ignore these query variables when caching'=>'缓存时忽略这些查询变量','%s: not imported.'=>'%s：未导入。','Conditional tags to exclude from caching'=>'不缓存的条件标签','Cache Specific URLs Only'=>'仅缓存特定 URL','Cloudflare: the credentials %s keeps are not copied. Connect Cloudflare in Cache › Cloudflare with an API token.'=>'Cloudflare：%s 保存的凭据不会被复制。请在“缓存 › Cloudflare”中使用 API 令牌连接 Cloudflare。','Enable minification of CSS files'=>'启用 CSS 文件压缩','Enable minification of JavaScript files'=>'启用 JavaScript 文件压缩','Exclude JavaScript from processing'=>'从处理中排除 JavaScript','Defer all the JavaScript files'=>'推迟所有 JavaScript 文件','%s: WPOptimizing defers every script except the ones you exclude, not a chosen few, so this list was not imported.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 会推迟除排除项外的所有脚本，而不是挑选的少数几个，因此未导入此列表。','Asynchronously load selected JavaScript files'=>'异步加载所选 JavaScript 文件','Load all CSS files asynchronously'=>'异步加载所有 CSS 文件','Fallback CSS'=>'后备 CSS','Delay JS'=>'延迟 JS','Remove default WordPress and TinyMCE icons'=>'移除 WordPress 和 TinyMCE 默认图标','Host Google Fonts locally'=>'本地托管 Google Fonts','Preconnect Headers'=>'预连接标头','%s: WPOptimizing finds the hosts to connect to early on its own, so the list itself was not copied.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 会自行找出需要提前连接的主机，因此没有复制该列表。','Enable merging of CSS files'=>'启用 CSS 文件合并','Enable merging of JavaScript files'=>'启用 JavaScript 文件合并','%s: not imported. Combining files makes HTTP/2 sites slower and breaks scripts, so WPOptimizing does not do it.'=>'%s：未导入。合并文件会让使用 HTTP/2 的网站变慢并破坏脚本，因此 WPOptimizing 不这样做。','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing does not minify HTML.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 不压缩 HTML。','Process HTML'=>'处理 HTML','%s: not imported. WPOptimizing generates critical CSS on your server instead.'=>'%s：未导入。WPOptimizing 改为在你的服务器上生成关键 CSS。','Enable removal of unused rules from CSS files (Experimental)'=>'启用移除 CSS 文件中未使用的规则（实验性）','%s: not imported. It only applied to the files the other plugin optimized, while WPOptimizing\'s CDN rewrites every static file; set it up yourself if your CDN serves them all.'=>'%s：未导入。它只作用于另一个插件优化过的文件，而 WPOptimizing 的 CDN 会重写所有静态文件；如果你的 CDN 能提供所有这些文件，请自行设置。','Your CDN domain'=>'你的 CDN 域名','Lazy-load images'=>'图片延迟加载','Replace YouTube iframe with thumbnail image'=>'用缩略图替换 YouTube iframe','Skip image classes'=>'跳过的图片类','Clean all auto-draft posts'=>'清理所有自动草稿','Clean all trashed posts'=>'清理回收站中的所有文章','Remove spam and trashed comments'=>'移除垃圾评论和回收站中的评论','Remove pingbacks'=>'移除 Pingback','Remove trackbacks'=>'移除 Trackback','Remove expired transient options'=>'移除过期的瞬态选项','Clean post metadata'=>'清理文章元数据','Revisions: %s deletes all of them; WPOptimizing keeps the last two of each post, which you can change in General cleanup.'=>'修订版本：%s 会全部删除；WPOptimizing 会保留每篇文章的最后两个，你可以在“常规清理”中更改。','Enable scheduled clean-up and optimization'=>'启用计划清理和优化','%s: WPOptimizing has no fortnightly schedule, so it was set to weekly.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 没有每两周一次的计划，因此设为每周。','Select schedule type (default is Weekly)'=>'选择计划类型（默认为每周）','%s: not imported. Set the minimum age of what is cleaned in General cleanup.'=>'%s：未导入。请在“常规清理”中设置被清理内容的最短保留时间。','Keep last X weeks data'=>'保留最近 X 周的数据','Cache Lifespan'=>'缓存有效期','Gzip Compression'=>'Gzip 压缩','Separate Mobile Cache'=>'单独的移动端缓存','Cache Preload'=>'缓存预加载','Never Cache URLs'=>'从不缓存的 URL','Rejected Cookies'=>'拒绝的 Cookie','Rejected User Agents'=>'拒绝的用户代理','Ignored Query Strings'=>'忽略的查询字符串','Cache Query Strings'=>'缓存查询字符串','Logged-in User Cache'=>'已登录用户缓存','Rejected Referrers'=>'拒绝的来源页','Vary Cookies'=>'区分缓存的 Cookie','Purge Additional Pages'=>'清除额外页面','Object Cache: not imported. Set up the object cache in WPOptimizing once Powered Cache is deactivated, because both use the same drop-in file.'=>'对象缓存：未导入。请在停用 Powered Cache 后于 WPOptimizing 中设置对象缓存，因为两者使用同一个 drop-in 文件。','Excluded CSS Files'=>'排除的 CSS 文件','Excluded JavaScript Files'=>'排除的 JavaScript 文件','Defer JavaScript'=>'推迟 JavaScript','Defer JavaScript Exclusions'=>'推迟 JavaScript 排除项','Delay JavaScript Exclusions'=>'延迟 JavaScript 排除项','Delay Timeout'=>'延迟超时','Fallback Critical CSS'=>'后备关键 CSS','Combine CSS'=>'合并 CSS','Combine JavaScript'=>'合并 JavaScript','Minify HTML'=>'压缩 HTML','Remove Unused CSS'=>'移除未使用的 CSS','Lazy Load'=>'延迟加载','YouTube Embeds'=>'YouTube 嵌入','Lazy Load Exclusions'=>'延迟加载排除项','Emoji Scripts'=>'表情符号脚本','WordPress Embeds'=>'WordPress 嵌入','Preload Fonts'=>'预加载字体','Preconnect'=>'预连接','DNS Prefetch'=>'DNS 预解析','CDN Delivery'=>'CDN 分发','CDN Hostnames'=>'CDN 主机名','CDN Hostnames: WPOptimizing uses one CDN host for every static file, so only the first one was imported, without its zone or excluded files.'=>'CDN 主机名：WPOptimizing 对所有静态文件只使用一个 CDN 主机，因此只导入了第一个，不含其区域和排除的文件。','Auto Drafts'=>'自动草稿','Trashed Posts'=>'回收站中的文章','Spam Comments'=>'垃圾评论','Trashed Comments'=>'回收站中的评论','Expired Transients'=>'过期的瞬态数据','All Transients'=>'所有瞬态数据','Optimize Tables'=>'优化数据表','Database Cleanup Frequency'=>'数据库清理频率','Heartbeat Control'=>'Heartbeat 控制','Clear cache at set intervals'=>'按设定间隔清除缓存','Serve compressed cached files'=>'提供压缩的缓存文件','Preload cache'=>'预加载缓存','Exclude URL strings'=>'排除 URL 字符串','Exclude cookies'=>'排除 Cookie','Exclude user agent'=>'排除用户代理','Cache for logged-in users'=>'为已登录用户缓存','Cache URL queries'=>'缓存带查询参数的 URL','Cache 404 requests'=>'缓存 404 请求','Compress assets'=>'压缩资源','Combine & Compress'=>'合并与压缩','Defer'=>'推迟','Delay JavaScript exclusions'=>'延迟 JavaScript 的排除项','Delay JavaScript post type exclusions'=>'延迟 JavaScript 的文章类型排除项','Delay JavaScript URL exclusions'=>'延迟 JavaScript 的 URL 排除项','Delay JavaScript plugin and theme exclusions'=>'延迟 JavaScript 的插件和主题排除项','Delay JavaScript ad and tracker exclusions'=>'延迟 JavaScript 的广告和跟踪器排除项','%s: generated by an online service, not imported. WPOptimizing generates critical CSS on your server instead.'=>'%s：由在线服务生成，未导入。WPOptimizing 改为在你的服务器上生成关键 CSS。','Font Optimization'=>'字体优化','Remove default emoji files'=>'移除默认表情符号文件','Disable WooCommerce cart fragments'=>'禁用 WooCommerce 购物车片段','Disable WooCommerce cart fragments: Hummingbird removed them by type of page; WPOptimizing loads them only for visitors with something in the cart.'=>'禁用 WooCommerce 购物车片段：Hummingbird 按页面类型移除它们；WPOptimizing 只为购物车中有商品的访客加载它们。','DNS prefetch'=>'DNS 预解析','%s: not imported. Removing the version from file URLs does not make pages faster and can serve outdated files after an update.'=>'%s：未导入。从文件 URL 中移除版本号不会让页面更快，还可能在更新后提供过时的文件。','Remove URL query strings'=>'移除 URL 查询字符串','%s: Hummingbird limits how many revisions WordPress keeps; WPOptimizing cleans old ones instead, keeping the last two of each post, which you can change in General cleanup.'=>'%s：Hummingbird 限制 WordPress 保留的修订版本数量；WPOptimizing 则清理旧的修订版本，保留每篇文章的最后两个，你可以在“常规清理”中更改。','Gravatar Caching'=>'Gravatar 缓存','%s: WPMU DEV\'s own CDN, not imported.'=>'%s：WPMU DEV 自有的 CDN，未导入。','Optimize JavaScript Code?'=>'优化 JavaScript 代码？','Aggregate JS-files?'=>'聚合 JS 文件？','Do not aggregate but defer?'=>'不聚合但推迟？','Exclude scripts from Autoptimize:'=>'从 Autoptimize 中排除脚本：','Optimize CSS Code?'=>'优化 CSS 代码？','Aggregate CSS-files?'=>'聚合 CSS 文件？','Eliminate render-blocking CSS?'=>'消除阻塞渲染的 CSS？','Inline all CSS?'=>'内联所有 CSS？','Exclude CSS from Autoptimize:'=>'从 Autoptimize 中排除 CSS：','Optimize HTML Code?'=>'优化 HTML 代码？','CDN Base URL'=>'CDN 基础 URL','Remove emojis'=>'移除表情符号','Preload specific requests (advanced users)'=>'预加载特定请求（高级用户）','Preconnect to 3rd party domains (advanced users)'=>'预连接第三方域名（高级用户）','Google Fonts: not imported. Autoptimize removed or combined them; WPOptimizing can host them on your server instead (Self-host Google Fonts), which you can switch on yourself.'=>'Google Fonts：未导入。Autoptimize 会移除或合并它们；WPOptimizing 可以改为在你的服务器上托管它们（自托管 Google Fonts），你可以自行开启。','Remove query strings from static resources'=>'从静态资源中移除查询字符串','Async Javascript-files (advanced users)'=>'异步 JavaScript 文件（高级用户）','Remove WordPress block CSS'=>'移除 WordPress 区块 CSS','Lazy-load images?'=>'延迟加载图片？','Lazy-load exclusions'=>'延迟加载排除项','Image optimization & CDN: ShortPixel\'s online service, not imported. WPOptimizing optimizes images on your server.'=>'图片优化和 CDN：ShortPixel 的在线服务，未导入。WPOptimizing 在你的服务器上优化图片。','%1$s: these patterns use wildcards or regular expressions in the middle, which WPOptimizing does not read, so they were not imported. Add them again as plain text: %2$s'=>'%1$s：这些模式中间包含通配符或正则表达式，WPOptimizing 不读取这些内容，因此未导入。请以纯文本形式重新添加：%2$s','Dynamic Caching: this is SiteGround\'s own server cache and only works on their hosting, so it was not turned into WPOptimizing\'s page cache. If the site is hosted at SiteGround, keep it on in their Site Tools.'=>'Dynamic Caching：这是 SiteGround 自己的服务器缓存，只能在其主机上使用，因此没有转换为 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存。如果网站托管在 SiteGround，请在其 Site Tools 中保持开启。','Memcached: it runs on SiteGround\'s own Memcached service, so it was not turned into WPOptimizing\'s object cache. If the site is hosted at SiteGround, keep it on in their Site Tools.'=>'Memcached：它运行在 SiteGround 自己的 Memcached 服务上，因此没有转换为 WPOptimizing 的对象缓存。如果网站托管在 SiteGround，请在其 Site Tools 中保持开启。','%s: the import does not switch on WPOptimizing\'s page cache. Deactivate the other plugin first, then switch it on in Cache › Page cache.'=>'%s：导入不会开启 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存。请先停用另一个插件，然后在“缓存 › 页面缓存”中开启。','File-Based Caching'=>'基于文件的缓存','Scheduled cache cleanup'=>'定时清理缓存','Browser-Specific Caching'=>'按浏览器区分缓存','Preheat Cache'=>'预热缓存','Exclude URLs from Caching'=>'从缓存中排除 URL','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing never serves cached pages to logged-in users.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 从不向已登录用户提供缓存页面。','Logged-in Users Cache'=>'已登录用户缓存','%s: not imported. Switch on the browser cache and compression in Cache › Browser & server once the other plugin is deactivated, because deactivating it can remove those rules from .htaccess.'=>'%s：未导入。停用另一个插件后，请在“缓存 › 浏览器与服务器”中开启浏览器缓存和压缩，因为停用它可能会从 .htaccess 中删除这些规则。','GZIP Compression, Browser Caching'=>'GZIP 压缩、浏览器缓存','Minify CSS Files'=>'压缩 CSS 文件','Minify JavaScript Files'=>'压缩 JavaScript 文件','Exclude from CSS and JavaScript Minification'=>'从 CSS 和 JavaScript 压缩中排除','Defer Render-blocking JS'=>'推迟阻塞渲染的 JS','Exclude from Loading JS Files Asynchronously'=>'从异步加载 JS 文件中排除','Combine CSS Files'=>'合并 CSS 文件','Combine JavaScript Files'=>'合并 JavaScript 文件','Minify the HTML Output'=>'压缩 HTML 输出','Remove Query Strings From Static Resources'=>'从静态资源中移除查询字符串','Exclude Post Types'=>'排除文章类型','Disable Emojis'=>'禁用表情符号','Lazy Load Media'=>'媒体延迟加载','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing\'s lazy loading has no exclusion list.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 