ress 保留更多修订版本；WPOptimizing 会在每次运行“常规清理”时删除多余的修订版本。','Defer Javascript'=>'推迟 JavaScript','Excluded from Deferral'=>'不推迟的脚本','Delay Behavior'=>'延迟方式','Delayed Scripts'=>'延迟的脚本','Excluded from Delay'=>'不延迟执行的脚本','%s: imported with «Test mode: apply only for logged-in administrators» on, because delaying every script can break menus, sliders and carts. Check your key pages, then switch test mode off in Delay JavaScript.'=>'%s：导入时开启了“测试模式：仅对已登录的管理员生效”，因为延迟所有脚本可能会破坏菜单、轮播和购物车。请检查关键页面，然后在“延迟 JavaScript”中关闭测试模式。','Delay All Scripts'=>'延迟所有脚本','Excluded from Minification'=>'不压缩的文件','%s: not imported. WPOptimizing generates critical CSS on your server instead of removing unused CSS.'=>'%s：未导入。WPOptimizing 会在你的服务器上生成关键 CSS，而不是移除未使用的 CSS。','Add Header Code, Add Body Code, Add Footer Code: code snippets are not imported. If you still need them, move them to your theme or to a code snippets plugin before deactivating Perfmatters.'=>'添加页眉、正文和页脚代码：代码片段不会导入。如果仍需要它们，请在停用 Perfmatters 之前将其移到主题或代码片段插件中。','Speculative Loading'=>'推测加载','Enable Instant Page'=>'启用 Instant Page','Preconnect, DNS Prefetch'=>'预连接、DNS 预解析','Lazy Loading: Images, iFrames and Videos'=>'延迟加载：图片、iFrame 和视频','YouTube Preview Thumbnails'=>'YouTube 预览缩略图','Exclude from Lazy Loading'=>'从延迟加载中排除','Background Images'=>'背景图片','Add Image Dimensions'=>'添加图片尺寸','Lazy Load Elements'=>'元素延迟加载','Local Google Fonts'=>'本地 Google 字体','Enable CDN Rewrite'=>'启用 CDN 重写','CDN URL'=>'CDN URL','Included Directories'=>'包含的目录','Enable Local Analytics'=>'启用本地 Analytics','Post Auto-Drafts'=>'自动草稿','Scheduled Optimization'=>'定时优化','Post Revisions'=>'文章修订版本','Script Manager: its rules are not imported. Use Smart Assets in WPOptimizing to unload files page by page; it tells you which plugin each file belongs to.'=>'Script Manager：其规则不会导入。请使用 WPOptimizing 的“智能资源”逐页卸载文件；它会告诉你每个文件属于哪个插件。','Auto-refresh Cache'=>'自动刷新缓存','Separate Mobile Cache & Optimizations'=>'独立的移动端缓存与优化','Exclude Pages from Cache'=>'从缓存中排除页面','Bypass Cache for Cookies'=>'根据 Cookie 绕过缓存','Query Strings to Cache'=>'需缓存的查询字符串','Cache for Logged-in Users by Role'=>'按角色为已登录用户缓存','Preload Links on Hover'=>'悬停时预加载链接','Minify CSS and JavaScript'=>'压缩 CSS 和 JavaScript','Delay All JavaScript'=>'延迟所有 JavaScript','Delay Specific Scripts on Interaction'=>'在交互前延迟指定脚本','Lazy Load Images, Videos, and Iframes'=>'图片、视频和 Iframe 延迟加载','Lightweight YouTube Previews'=>'轻量 YouTube 预览','Image optimization: FlyingPress compresses images on its own servers, so it was not imported. WPOptimizing converts images to WebP and AVIF on your server; set it up in Media.'=>'图片优化：FlyingPress 在自己的服务器上压缩图片，因此未导入。WPOptimizing 会在你的服务器上将图片转换为 WebP 和 AVIF；请在“媒体”中设置。','Lazy Render Elements'=>'元素延迟渲染','Properly size images'=>'正确调整图片尺寸','Self-host Gravatar Images'=>'本地托管 Gravatar 图片','Self-host third-party CSS and JavaScript'=>'本地托管第三方 CSS 和 JavaScript','Disable Block Editor CSS'=>'禁用区块编辑器 CSS','Disable RSS Feed'=>'禁用 RSS 订阅源','Remove Dashicons'=>'移除 Dashicons','Disable jQuery Migrate'=>'禁用 jQuery Migrate','Disable oEmbeds'=>'禁用 oEmbed','Throttle Heartbeat API'=>'限制 Heartbeat API','Enable CDN'=>'启用 CDN','FlyingCDN: FlyingPress\'s own paid CDN, not imported. If you keep it, enter its address as the CDN host in WPOptimizing.'=>'FlyingCDN：FlyingPress 自己的付费 CDN，未导入。如果继续使用，请在 WPOptimizing 中将其地址填写为 CDN 主机。','%s: the other plugin connects with your Cloudflare account\'s Global API Key, which WPOptimizing does not copy. Connect Cloudflare in Cache › Cloudflare with an API token.'=>'%s：另一个插件使用你 Cloudflare 账户的 Global API Key 进行连接，WPOptimizing 不会复制它。请在“缓存 › Cloudflare”中使用 API 令牌连接 Cloudflare。','Automatic Cleaning'=>'自动清理','Delete Post Revisions'=>'删除文章修订版本','%s: not switched on by the import. Deactivate the other plugin first, then switch it on in Cache › Object cache.'=>'%s：导入不会开启它。请先停用另一个插件，然后在“缓存 › 对象缓存”中开启。','Object Cache'=>'对象缓存','Cache System'=>'缓存系统','Purge Cache After'=>'缓存清除间隔','Mobile Cache'=>'移动端缓存','Never Cache URL(s)'=>'永不缓存的 URL','Cache Logged-in Users'=>'缓存已登录用户','Cache Warmup'=>'缓存预热','Cache Warmup: WPOptimizing warms up the home page and your latest content on its own, so the list of URLs was not copied.'=>'缓存预热：WPOptimizing 会自行预热首页和你最新的内容，因此没有复制 URL 列表。','Gzip Compression, Browser Cache'=>'Gzip 压缩、浏览器缓存','CSS Minify'=>'压缩 CSS','JS Minify'=>'压缩 JS','Exclude CSS, Exclude JS'=>'排除 CSS、排除 JS','Combine JS'=>'合并 JS','JS Files With Deferred Loading: Breeze defers only the files you list, while WPOptimizing defers every script except the ones you exclude, so it was not switched on. Try «Load JavaScript deferred» in WPOptimizing and check the site.'=>'推迟加载的 JS 文件：Breeze 只推迟你列出的文件，而 WPOptimizing 会推迟除排除项以外的所有脚本，因此未开启。请在 WPOptimizing 中试用“推迟加载 JavaScript”并检查网站。','HTML Minify'=>'压缩 HTML','Move JS Files to Footer'=>'将 JS 文件移至页脚','Font remain visible during load'=>'字体加载时保持文字可见','Delay JS Inline Scripts'=>'延迟内联脚本','List of scripts not to delay'=>'不延迟的脚本列表','Lazy Load Images'=>'图片延迟加载','Preload Webfont'=>'预加载 Web 字体','Preload Links'=>'预加载链接','Prefetch of DNS Request'=>'DNS 请求预解析','Host Files Locally'=>'本地托管文件','Host Files Locally: Gravatars'=>'本地托管文件：Gravatar','Disable Emoji'=>'禁用表情符号','Activate CDN'=>'启用 CDN','CDN CNAME'=>'CDN CNAME','CDN Content'=>'CDN 内容','This site runs on a LiteSpeed web server, which serves LiteSpeed Cache\'s page cache before WordPress even loads. Its page cache settings were not imported: keep using it, or switch it off before you turn on the WPOptimizing page cache.'=>'此网站运行在 LiteSpeed Web 服务器上，它会在 WordPress 加载之前就提供 LiteSpeed Cache 的页面缓存。其页面缓存设置未导入：请继续使用它，或在启用 WPOptimizing 页面缓存之前将其关闭。','Default Public Cache TTL'=>'默认公共缓存 TTL','Do Not Cache URIs'=>'不缓存的 URI','Do Not Cache Cookies'=>'不缓存的 Cookie','Cache Mobile'=>'缓存移动端','Crawler'=>'爬虫','Do Not Cache User Agents'=>'不缓存的用户代理','Drop Query String'=>'丢弃查询字符串','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing has no equivalent.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 中没有对应功能。','Guest Mode'=>'访客模式','CSS Excludes / JS Excludes'=>'CSS 排除项 / JS 排除项','Load JS Deferred'=>'推迟加载 JS','JS Deferred / Delayed Excludes'=>'推迟/延迟 JS 排除项','JS Delayed Includes'=>'延迟 JS 包含项','Load CSS Asynchronously'=>'异步加载 CSS','Critical CSS Rules'=>'关键 CSS 规则','Load CSS Asynchronously: LiteSpeed Cache gets its critical CSS from QUIC.cloud, which is not imported. Generate the critical CSS in WPOptimizing before relying on this setting, or pages will flash unstyled.'=>'异步加载 CSS：LiteSpeed Cache 的关键 CSS 来自 QUIC.cloud，这部分不会导入。请先在 WPOptimizing 中生成关键 CSS 再依赖此设置，否则页面会短暂显示为无样式。','CSS Combine'=>'合并 CSS','JS Combine'=>'合并 JS','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing does not minify HTML. Compression already removes most of what minifying would save.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 不压缩 HTML。传输压缩已经去掉了压缩 HTML 能节省的大部分内容。','%s: not imported; it is an online service of the other plugin. WPOptimizing generates critical CSS on your own server instead.'=>'%s：未导入；这是另一个插件的在线服务。WPOptimizing 会在你自己的服务器上生成关键 CSS。','Generate UCSS'=>'生成 UCSS','Lazy Load Iframes'=>'iframe 延迟加载','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing has no exclusion list for lazy loading.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 没有延迟加载的排除列表。','Lazy Load Image Excludes'=>'图片延迟加载排除项','Next-Gen Image Format'=>'新一代图片格式','Remove WordPress Emoji'=>'移除 WordPress 表情符号','Load Google Fonts Asynchronously'=>'异步加载 Google Fonts','%s: WPOptimizing does not load Google Fonts asynchronously; it serves them from your own server instead, which is faster and sends nothing to Google.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 不会异步加载 Google Fonts，而是从你自己的服务器提供，这样更快，也不会向 Google 发送任何数据。','Remove Google Fonts'=>'移除 Google Fonts','DNS Prefetch / DNS Preconnect'=>'DNS 预获取 / DNS 预连接','Instant Click'=>'即时点击','Use CDN Mapping'=>'使用 CDN 映射','Original Directories'=>'源目录','%s: WPOptimizing uses one CDN host, so only the first one was imported.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 只使用一个 CDN 主机，因此只导入了第一个。','%s: the other plugin connects to Cloudflare with your account\'s credentials, which WPOptimizing does not copy. Connect Cloudflare in Cache › Cloudflare with an API token.'=>'%s：另一个插件使用你账户的凭据连接 Cloudflare，WPOptimizing 不会复制这些凭据。请在“缓存 › Cloudflare”中使用 API 令牌连接 Cloudflare。','Cloudflare API'=>'Cloudflare API','Revisions Max Number'=>'修订版本最大数量','Revisions Max Age'=>'修订版本最长保留时间','%s: the other plugin set the Heartbeat separately for each place; WPOptimizing uses one value for the whole site, so the strictest one was kept.'=>'%s：另一个插件为每个位置分别设置 Heartbeat；WPOptimizing 对整个网站使用同一个值，因此保留了最严格的那个。','Host'=>'主机','Port'=>'端口','Redis Database ID'=>'Redis 数据库 ID','%s: the connection was imported, but not switched on and without any password. If the server needs one, type it again in Cache › Object cache.'=>'%s：连接信息已导入，但未启用，也不含任何密码。如果服务器需要密码，请在“缓存 › 对象缓存”中重新输入。','Maximum lifetime of cache objects'=>'缓存对象的最长有效期','Never cache the following pages'=>'从不缓存以下页面','Rejected cookies'=>'拒绝的 Cookie','Rejected user agents'=>'拒绝的用户代理','Accepted query strings'=>'接受的查询字符串','User Agent Groups'=>'用户代理组','User Agent Groups: WPOptimizing keeps one separate copy for all mobile devices, without groups, themes or redirects of its own.'=>'用户代理组：WPOptimizing 为所有移动设备保留一份单独的副本，不区分分组，也没有各自的主题或重定向。','Automatically prime the page cache'=>'自动预热页面缓存','Don\'t cache pages for logged in users'=>'不为已登录用户缓存页面','Page Cache Method: W3 Total Cache kept pages in memory (Memcached, Redis or APC); WPOptimizing keeps them on disk.'=>'页面缓存方式：W3 Total Cache 将页面保存在内存中（Memcached、Redis 或 APC）；WPOptimizing 将其保存在磁盘上。','Minify › CSS'=>'压缩 › CSS','Minify › JS'=>'压缩 › JS','Never minify the following JS / CSS files'=>'从不压缩以下 JS / CSS 文件','Embed type'=>'嵌入类型','%s: WPOptimizing defers every script except the ones you exclude, wherever it sits in the page. Check the exclusions after importing.'=>'%s：WPOptimizing 会推迟页面中所有位置的脚本，你排除的除外。导入后请检查排除项。','Minify › JS › Combine only'=>'压缩 › JS › 仅合并','Minify › HTML & XML'=>'压缩 › HTML 与 XML','Delay Scripts and Preload Requests: they are W3 Total Cache Pro features and this site has no Pro licence, so they were not acting and were not imported.'=>'延迟脚本和预加载请求：它们是 W3 Total Cache Pro 的功能，而此网站没有 Pro 许可证，因此它们并未生效，也未导入。','Delay Scripts'=>'延迟脚本','Delay Scripts › Timeout'=>'延迟脚本 › 超时','Preload Requests'=>'预加载请求','DNS Prefetch / Preconnect'=>'DNS 预获取 / 预连接','Disable wp-embed script'=>'禁用 wp-embed 脚本','Disable jquery-migrate on the front-end'=>'在前台禁用 jquery-migrate','CDN'=>'CDN','CDN host name'=>'CDN 主机名','CDN: W3 Total Cache uploads your files to the CDN; WPOptimizing only points file addresses at a CDN host. Set the host in WPOptimizing\'s CDN settings.'=>'CDN：W3 Total Cache 会把你的文件上传到 CDN；WPOptimizing 只是把文件地址指向 CDN 主机。请在 WPOptimizing 的 CDN 设置中填写主机。','Object Cache: W3 Total Cache kept it in files on disk, which WPOptimizing does not offer. Choose Redis, Memcached or APCu in Cache › Object cache if the server has one.'=>'对象缓存：W3 Total Cache 将其保存在磁盘文件中，而 WPOptimizing 不提供这种方式。如果服务器支持，请在“缓存 › 对象缓存”中选择 Redis、Memcached 或 APCu。','Database Cache'=>'数据库缓存','Cache Timeout'=>'缓存超时','Rejected URL Strings'=>'拒绝的 URL 字符串','Tracking Parameters'=>'跟踪参数','Compress pages so they’re served more quickly to visitors.'=>'压缩页面，以便更快地提供给访客。','Mobile device support'=>'移动设备支持','Preload mode'=>'预加载模式','Enable caching for all visitors.'=>'为所有访客启用缓存。','Disable caching for visitors who have a cookie set in their browser: WPOptimizing does cache visitors with ordinary cookies, and skips only logged-in users and the cookies you list.'=>'为浏览器中设有 Cookie 的访客禁用缓存：WPOptimizing 会正常缓存带有普通 Cookie 的访客，只排除已登录用户和你列出的 Cookie。','Do not cache the following page types (%s): not imported; WPOptimizing cannot leave out whole page types. Add their addresses to the URLs that are never cached if you need to.'=>'不缓存以下页面类型（%s）：未导入；WPOptimizing 无法排除整类页面。如有需要，请把它们的地址加入从不缓存的 URL。','Cache Delivery Method «Expert»: WP Super Cache serves pages straight from rules in .htaccess. After deactivating it, check that the block between «BEGIN WPSuperCache» and «END WPSuperCache» is gone, or visitors will keep getting its old pages.'=>'缓存提供方式“专家”：WP Super Cache 直接通过 .htaccess 中的规则提供页面。停用后，请确认“BEGIN WPSuperCache”与“END WPSuperCache”之间的代码块已被删除，否则访客会继续看到它的旧页面。','Enable CDN Support'=>'启用 CDN 支持','Off-site URL'=>'站外 URL','Include directories'=>'包含的目录','Additional CNAMES'=>'附加 CNAME','Timeout Rules: a rule for some pages only, or at a fixed time of day, was not imported. WPOptimizing has one lifetime for every page.'=>'超时规则：仅针对部分页面或在每天固定时间执行的规则未导入。WPOptimizing 对所有页面使用同一个有效期。','Timeout Rules'=>'超时规则','Mobile'=>'移动端','Mobile: WP Fastest Cache did not cache pages for phones at all; WPOptimizing caches them, in a copy of their own.'=>'移动端：WP Fastest Cache 完全不为手机缓存页面；WPOptimizing 会缓存它们，并单独保存一份副本。','Logged-in Users'=>'已登录用户','Gzip'=>'Gzip','Widget Cache'=>'小工具缓存','Exclude Pages'=>'排除页面','Exclude Cookies'=>'排除 Cookie','Exclude User-Agents'=>'排除用户代理','Exclude CSS / Exclude JS'=>'排除 CSS / 排除 JS','Exclude Pages (Google Analytics, Google Ads, Facebook and Yandex click IDs): not imported on purpose. WPOptimizing ignores those parameters and serves the cached page, which is faster and does not affect tracking.'=>'排除页面（Google Analytics、Google Ads、Facebook 和 Yandex 的点击 ID）：有意未导入。WPOptimizing 会忽略这些参数并提供缓存页面，这样更快，也不影响跟踪。','Exclude Pages (home page, categories, tags, posts, pages, archives, attachments): not imported; WPOptimizing cannot leave out whole page types. Add their addresses to the URLs that are never cached if you need to.'=>'排除页面（首页、分类、标签、文章、页面、归档、附件）：未导入；WPOptimizing 无法排除整类页面。如有需要，请把它们的地址加入从不缓存的 URL。','Minify Css'=>'压缩 CSS','Minify Js'=>'压缩 JS','Render Blocking Js'=>'阻塞渲染的 JS','Delay Js'=>'延迟 JS','%s: they need WP Fastest Cache Premium, which is not installed here, so they were not acting and were not imported.'=>'%s：它们需要 WP Fastest Cache Premium，而此处未安装，因此并未生效，也未导入。','Lazy Load Exclude Sources'=>'延迟加载 › 排除来源','Render Blocking Js › CSS: not imported. If you want it, switch on «Load CSS asynchronously» in WPOptimizing once its critical CSS is generated.'=>'阻塞渲染的 JS › CSS：未导入。如有需要，请在生成关键 CSS 后于 WPOptimizing 中开启“异步加载 CSS”。','Combine Css'=>'合并 CSS','Combine Js'=>'合并 JS','Combine Js Plus'=>'合并 JS Plus','CDN Url'=>'CDN 网址','CDN: the file types and keywords that chose which files go to the CDN were not imported; WPOptimizing sends the uploads, theme, plugin and WordPress files.'=>'CDN：用于选择哪些文件走 CDN 的文件类型和关键字未导入；WPOptimizing 会处理上传文件以及主题、插件和 WordPress 文件。','Database Cleanup › Auto Cleanup'=>'数据库清理 › 自动清理','Database Cleanup: WP Fastest Cache deleted every revision and every transient. WPOptimizing keeps the last two revisions of each post and deletes only expired transients; you can change both in General cleanup.'=>'数据库清理：WP Fastest Cache 会删除所有修订版本和所有 transient。WPOptimizing 为每篇文章保留最近两个修订版本，只删除已过期的 transient；两者都可以在“常规清理”中更改。','The web server did not answer from the cache, so pages keep being served through PHP. Check that the rules are in place and that the site can reach itself.'=>'Web 服务器没有从缓存响应，因此页面仍通过 PHP 提供。请检查规则是否已添加，以及站点能否访问自身。','These lines are in the server\'s configuration: serve cached pages straight from the web server'=>'这些行已加入服务器配置：直接由 Web 服务器提供缓存页面','Only the scripts in my list'=>'仅限我列表中的脚本','Nothing is delayed except the scripts you list in "Also delay these" below. Useful to keep the list you used with another plugin.'=>'除了你在下方“同时延迟这些”中列出的脚本外，不延迟任何内容。便于保留你在其他插件中使用的列表。','The page cache settings changed and the lines in the server\'s configuration no longer match them, so pages are served through PHP again. Replace them with these and tick the box below.'=>'页面缓存设置已更改，服务器配置中的这些行已不再匹配，因此页面重新通过 PHP 提供。请用以下内容替换它们，然后勾选下面的复选框。','%1$s: not switched on. The other plugin sent only some files to %2$s (by folder, file type or exclusion list), and WPOptimizing\'s CDN cannot be limited that way. If that host can serve every static file of the site, set it up in WPOptimizing\'s CDN settings.'=>'%1$s：未启用。另一个插件只将部分文件发送到 %2$s（按文件夹、文件类型或排除列表），而 WPOptimizing 的 CDN 无法这样限制。如果该主机能够提供站点的所有静态文件，请在 WPOptimizing 的 CDN 设置中进行配置。','Page types'=>'页面类型','Pages of the kinds ticked here are never cached. Saving empties the whole cache, so copies already stored stop being served at once.'=>'此处勾选类型的页面永不缓存。保存时会清空整个缓存，已存储的副本会立即停止提供。','Posts page (the blog listing, when it is not the front page)'=>'文章页（博客列表，当它不是首页时）','Archives: categories, tags, authors, dates, custom taxonomies and content type listings'=>'归档：分类、标签、作者、日期、自定义分类法和内容类型列表','Second and later pages of any listing'=>'任何列表的第二页及之后的页面','Never cache single pages of these content types'=>'永不缓存这些内容类型的单个页面','HTML minification'=>'HTML 压缩','Removes ordinary HTML comments, spaces at the end of lines and repeated empty lines from the cached copy. The spaces between tags, attributes, scripts, styles and preformatted text are never touched, and the page is stored as it was if anything looks unusual.'=>'从缓存副本中删除普通 HTML 注释、行尾空格和重复的空行。标签之间的空格、属性、脚本、样式和预格式化文本从不改动；如有任何异常，页面将按原样存储。','Minify the HTML of cached pages'=>'压缩缓存页面的 HTML','Keep HTML comments containing'=>'保留包含以下内容的 HTML 注释','part of the comment, e.g. ko foreach'=>'注释的一部分，例如 ko foreach','Conditional comments, comments starting with <code>&lt;!--!</code> and anything between <code>&lt;!--noptimize--&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;!--/noptimize--&gt;</code> are always kept. One entry per line.'=>'条件注释、以 <code>&lt;!--!</code> 开头的注释，以及 <code>&lt;!--noptimize--&gt;</code> 与 <code>&lt;!--/noptimize--&gt;</code> 之间的所有内容始终保留。每行一项。','Heartbeat by area'=>'按区域设置 Heartbeat','How often the browser calls admin-ajax.php in each area. In the editor it is autosave and the edit lock, so it can be slowed (up to 120 seconds, before locks expire) but not switched off.'=>'浏览器在各区域调用 admin-ajax.php 的频率。在编辑器中它负责自动保存和编辑锁定，因此可以放慢（最多 120 秒，以免锁定过期），但不能关闭。','Admin screens'=>'后台页面','Editor (posts, pages and Site Editor)'=>'编辑器（文章、页面和站点编辑器）','Front end (logged-in users)'=>'前端（已登录用户）','Every %d seconds'=>'每 %d 秒','Also outside the content — header, sidebars, footer — on pages saved by the page cache'=>'在页面缓存保存的页面上，也处理内容以外的部分——页眉、侧边栏、页脚','Give the first image of the content high fetch priority (the likely LCP image); it is never lazy-loaded'=>'为内容中的第一张图片设置高获取优先级（很可能是 LCP 图片）；它永远不会延迟加载','Images never lazy-loaded at the top of the page'=>'页面顶部永不延迟加载的图片','Automatic (the first image of the content; the first three of the whole page)'=>'自动（内容中的第一张图片；整个页面的前三张）','Never lazy-load images whose class or file name contains (one per line)'=>'类名或文件名包含以下内容的图片永不延迟加载（每行一个）','A fixed number counts the images of the whole page from the top, header included. Images with the <code>skip-lazy</code> or <code>no-lazy</code> class, or the <code>data-skip-lazy</code> or <code>data-no-lazy</code> attribute, are never lazy-loaded either; an image already marked <code>loading="lazy"</code> keeps it and is not given priority.'=>'固定数字从页面顶部开始计算整个页面的图片，包括页眉。带有 <code>skip-lazy</code> 或 <code>no-lazy</code> 类，或带有 <code>data-skip-lazy</code> 或 <code>data-no-lazy</code> 属性的图片也永远不会延迟加载；已标记 <code>loading="lazy"</code> 的图片会保留该属性，且不会获得优先级。','%s: one area could not be copied as it was. WPOptimizing never switches the Heartbeat off in the editor, where it autosaves drafts and keeps the edit lock, and keeps intervals between 15 seconds and 120 (editor) or 300 (elsewhere); the nearest of those was set. Check Performance › Server.'=>'%s：有一个区域无法原样复制。WPOptimizing 在编辑器中从不关闭 Heartbeat（它在那里自动保存草稿并维持编辑锁定），并将间隔保持在 15 秒到 120 秒（编辑器）或 300 秒（其他区域）之间；已设为其中最接近的值。请检查“性能 › 服务器”。','%1$s: WPOptimizing excludes images by a part of their class or file name; these entries name another attribute and were not imported: %2$s'=>'%1$s：WPOptimizing 按类名或文件名的一部分来排除图片；这些条目指向其他属性，未导入：%2$s','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing excludes an image by its own class or file name, not by the element around it. Add the images\' class or file name to its lazy-load exclusions.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 按图片自身的类名或文件名排除图片，而不是按其外层元素。请将这些图片的类名或文件名添加到它的延迟加载排除项中。','Exclude Leading Images'=>'Exclude Leading Images','Exclude by Parent Selector'=>'Exclude by Parent Selector','%s: the excluded images are not deferred, but they no longer all get high fetch priority; WPOptimizing gives it only to the likely LCP image.'=>'%s：被排除的图片不会延迟加载，但不再全部获得高获取优先级；WPOptimizing 只将其给予很可能是 LCP 的图片。','Media Exclusions'=>'Media Exclusions','%s: not imported; WPOptimizing excludes images by their own class or file name only.'=>'%s：未导入；WPOptimizing 仅按图片自身的类名或文件名排除图片。','Excluded images or iframes'=>'Excluded images or iframes','Lazy Load Image Class Name Excludes'=>'Lazy Load Image Class Name Excludes','Lazy Load Image Parent Class Name Excludes'=>'Lazy Load Image Parent Class Name Excludes','Lazy Load URI Excludes'=>'Lazy Load URI Excludes','Hit diagnostics'=>'命中诊断','Counts how each request was answered and, when a page was not served from the cache, why. Off by default: while it is on, every request PHP handles adds one byte to a counter file.'=>'统计每个请求是如何响应的；当页面未从缓存提供时，记录原因。默认关闭：开启期间，PHP 处理的每个请求都会向计数文件写入一个字节。','Count cache hits and the reasons for misses'=>'统计缓存命中及未命中的原因','Hits seen by PHP: pages the web server sends without PHP and pages served by a CDN never reach these counters, so the real share of hits is higher. The share is hits, stale copies and 304 answers over the requests a page cache can answer: the preload\'s own visits, logged-in users, the admin, files that are not pages and methods other than GET are counted apart.'=>'PHP 统计到的命中：Web 服务器不经 PHP 直接发送的页面以及由 CDN 提供的页面永远不会进入这些计数器，因此实际命中比例更高。该比例为命中、过期副本和 304 响应占页面缓存能够应答的请求的比例：预加载自身的访问、已登录用户、后台、非页面文件以及 GET 以外的方法单独计数。','No requests counted yet.'=>'尚未统计到任何请求。','Hit rate, last 24 hours'=>'命中率（过去 24 小时）','Hit rate, last 7 days'=>'命中率（过去 7 天）','Outcome'=>'结果','Last 24 hours'=>'过去 24 小时','Last 7 days'=>'过去 7 天','Paths that miss most (estimate)'=>'未命中最多的路径（估算）','Estimated from one miss in every 20, so small numbers are rough. Only the path is recorded, never the query string.'=>'按每 20 次未命中记录 1 次来估算，因此较小的数字只是粗略值。只记录路径，从不记录查询参数。','Path'=>'路径','Estimated misses'=>'估算未命中数','Served from the cache (HIT)'=>'从缓存提供（HIT）','Served an expired copy while it was rebuilt (STALE)'=>'重建期间提供了过期副本（STALE）','Browser copy still valid (304)'=>'浏览器副本仍然有效（304）','Rendered and stored (MISS)'=>'已生成并保存（MISS）','HEAD request with no copy yet'=>'HEAD 请求，尚无副本','Preload visits (not part of the share)'=>'预加载访问（不计入比例）','Not cached: method other than GET or HEAD'=>'未缓存：GET 或 HEAD 以外的方法','Not cached: logged-in user'=>'未缓存：已登录用户','Not cached: cookie that prevents caching (cart, password, commenter or your own list)'=>'未缓存：阻止缓存的 Cookie（购物车、密码、评论者或你自己的列表）','Not cached: excluded browser or bot'=>'未缓存：已排除的浏览器或机器人','Not cached: dynamic file (wp-cron.php, admin-ajax.php, sitemaps…)'=>'未缓存：动态文件（wp-cron.php、admin-ajax.php、站点地图…）','Not cached: excluded URL (feeds, REST API or your own list)'=>'未缓存：已排除的 URL（订阅源、REST API 或你自己的列表）','Not cached: query string not allowed'=>'未缓存：不允许的查询参数','Not cached: host name this site does not answer to'=>'未缓存：本站点不响应的主机名','Not cached: currency or country cookie with an unknown value'=>'未缓存：值未知的货币或国家 Cookie','Not cached: the page was sent in pieces before it ended'=>'未缓存：页面在结束前已分段发送','Not cached: admin screen'=>'未缓存：后台页面','Not cached: page not found'=>'未缓存：页面未找到','Not cached: search results'=>'未缓存：搜索结果','Not cached: feed'=>'未缓存：订阅源','Not cached: the page asked not to be cached (DONOTCACHEPAGE)'=>'未缓存：页面要求不缓存（DONOTCACHEPAGE）','Not cached: excluded page'=>'未缓存：已排除的页面','Not cached: excluded page type'=>'未缓存：已排除的页面类型','Not cached: the response sets a cookie'=>'未缓存：响应设置了 Cookie','Not cached: the response forbids shared caches (private or no-store)'=>'未缓存：响应禁止共享缓存（private 或 no-store）','Not cached: HTTP status other than 200'=>'未缓存：HTTP 状态码不是 200','Not cached: not a complete HTML page'=>'未缓存：不是完整的 HTML 页面','Not cached: the settings changed while the page was rendered'=>'未缓存：页面生成期间设置发生了变化','Not cached: too many currency copies of the same URL'=>'未缓存：同一 URL 的货币副本过多','Not cached: other reason'=>'未缓存：其他原因','Pages found in the sitemap'=>'站点地图中找到的页面','Pages that could not be preloaded'=>'无法预加载的页面','%1$s (HTTP %2$s)'=>'%1$s（HTTP %2$s）','Also preload the pages listed in the site\'s sitemap'=>'同时预加载站点地图中列出的页面','%s request' . "\0" . '%s requests'=>'%s 个请求','The web server did not answer from the cache, so pages keep being served through PHP. Check that the rules are in place, that Apache has mod_headers (it is needed to tell browsers not to keep the pages) and that the site can reach itself.'=>'Web 服务器没有从缓存响应，因此页面仍通过 PHP 提供。请检查规则是否已添加、Apache 是否启用了 mod_headers（需要它来告知浏览器不要保存页面），以及站点能否访问自身。','The web server answers from the cached file directly, without starting PHP: faster pages and far more visitors at once on the same server. Only pages that need nothing from PHP are served this way (no currency, query string or security headers sent from PHP; phones get their own copy when it is on); the rest keep going through PHP as now.'=>'Web 服务器直接从缓存文件响应，无需启动 PHP：页面更快，同一台服务器可同时承载多得多的访问者。只有不需要 PHP 处理的页面才会这样提供（没有货币、查询参数或由 PHP 发送的安全标头；启用后手机会获得自己的副本）；其余页面仍像现在一样通过 PHP 提供。','Not cached: the page was purged while it was rendered'=>'未缓存：页面在生成过程中被清除','WP-Cron is running late: a scheduled task has been waiting for more than 10 minutes. WP-Cron depends on visits that reach WordPress, and most visits are now answered from the cache. Set a system cron that calls wp-cron.php every minute.'=>'WP-Cron 已延迟：有一个计划任务已等待超过 10 分钟。WP-Cron 依赖于到达 WordPress 的访问，而现在大多数访问都由缓存响应。请设置一个每分钟调用 wp-cron.php 的系统 cron。','Hosting cache'=>'主机缓存','WPOptimizing purges your host’s page cache when content changes and when the whole site does (theme, menus, updates, “Flush all caches”), even with its own page cache off. Hosts that can only empty everything are emptied only for site-wide changes.'=>'当内容变化以及整个站点变化（主题、菜单、更新、“清空所有缓存”）时，即使自身的页面缓存已关闭，WPOptimizing 也会清除你的主机页面缓存。只能全部清空的主机仅在整站变化时清空。','Page lifetime'=>'页面有效期','How long a cached page is served before it is built again. Forms, «add to cart» and many buttons carry WordPress security tokens that stop working after 12 to 24 hours, so pages are never kept longer than 12 hours: older copies would show forms and buttons that fail. Saving empties the cache.'=>'缓存页面在重新生成之前可提供多长时间。表单、“加入购物车”按钮和许多其他按钮都带有 WordPress 安全令牌，这些令牌会在 12 到 24 小时后失效，因此页面的保留时间绝不超过 12 小时：更旧的副本会显示无法使用的表单和按钮。保存时会清空缓存。','Rebuild cached pages after'=>'缓存页面重新生成间隔','%d hour' . "\0" . '%d hours'=>'%d 小时','Code on this site changes it through the %1$s filter: pages are kept for %2$s hours (0 means they never expire).'=>'本站有代码通过 %1$s 过滤器修改了此值：页面保留 %2$s 小时（0 表示永不过期）。','Compression'=>'压缩','A compressed copy of each page is stored next to the normal one and sent to every browser that accepts it: smaller pages, sent faster, at no cost per visit. Turn it off only if the server already compresses pages on its own and something looks wrong.'=>'每个页面的普通副本旁会另存一份压缩副本，并发送给所有支持它的浏览器：页面更小、传输更快，且每次访问都没有额外开销。只有当服务器本身已压缩页面且出现异常时，才关闭此项。','Store compressed copies (gzip)'=>'存储压缩副本（gzip）','Purge also these pages'=>'同时清除这些页面','Pages purged every time any page is purged, for example a page that lists the latest posts or products in a way WPOptimizing cannot see. They go to Cloudflare, Varnish and the hosting\'s cache too, also with the page cache off. One per line: a path or a full address of this site.'=>'每次清除任何页面时都会一并清除的页面，例如以 WPOptimizing 无法察觉的方式列出最新文章或产品的页面。即使页面缓存已关闭，它们也会在 Cloudflare、Varnish 和主机缓存中被清除。每行一个：本站的路径或完整地址。','Purge also these URLs every time any page is purged'=>'每次清除任何页面时同时清除这些 URL','e.g. /latest-news/'=>'例如 /latest-news/','Page cache settings saved, except these addresses to purge too, which are not pages of this site: %s'=>'页面缓存设置已保存，但以下同时清除的地址除外，因为它们不是本站页面：%s','Page lifetime: WPOptimizing keeps pages for whole hours, from 1 to 12, so the other plugin\'s %2$d minutes became %1$d hour.' . "\0" . 'Page lifetime: WPOptimizing keeps pages for whole hours, from 1 to 12, so the other plugin\'s %2$d minutes became %1$d hours.'=>'页面有效期：WPOptimizing 按整小时（1 到 12 小时）保留页面，因此另一个插件的 %2$d 分钟已改为 %1$d 小时。','Always Purge URL(s)'=>'始终清除的 URL','Always Purge URL(s): these entries are patterns (or not pages of this site), which WPOptimizing does not purge, so they were not imported. Add the pages they meant one by one: %s'=>'始终清除的 URL：这些条目是模式（或不是本站页面），WPOptimizing 不会清除它们，因此未导入。请逐个添加它们所指的页面：%s','Also store Brotli copies (about 10–15% smaller than gzip)'=>'同时保存 Brotli 副本（比 gzip 小约 10–15%）','Sent to browsers that accept Brotli. Serving them without PHP on Nginx needs its brotli module.'=>'发送给支持 Brotli 的浏览器。在 Nginx 上不经 PHP 提供这些副本需要其 brotli 模块。','The web server cannot write to %s: no page is stored there until they belong to its user again.'=>'Web 服务器无法写入 %s：在它们重新归其用户所有之前，那里不会存储任何页面。','Preload hints (experimental)'=>'预加载提示（实验性）','Each cached page is stored with up to three preload hints: its main image and up to two stylesheets from its head, so the browser can start downloading them before it reads the page. Cloudflare can turn them into 103 Early Hints if you switch Early Hints on there; other servers just send them with the page. Pages the web server sends without PHP go without them.'=>'每个缓存页面在保存时最多附带三个预加载提示：其主图片，以及头部中最多两个样式表，这样浏览器可以在读取页面之前就开始下载它们。如果你在 Cloudflare 中开启 Early Hints，它可以将这些提示转换为 103 Early Hints；其他服务器只是随页面一起发送。Web 服务器不经 PHP 发送的页面不带这些提示。','Send preload hints for the main image and stylesheets of cached pages'=>'为缓存页面的主图片和样式表发送预加载提示','The page cache is not available for this site: its address cannot be used to name its cache files.'=>'此站点无法使用页面缓存：其地址无法用于命名缓存文件。','Not available on a multisite network yet: every site shares the same server rules, and each site has its own exclusions. Pages are served through PHP, from the cache.'=>'多站点网络中暂不可用：所有站点共用同一套服务器规则，而每个站点都有自己的排除项。页面仍通过 PHP 从缓存提供。','HTML at Cloudflare\'s edge is not available on a multisite network yet: its sites can share a Cloudflare zone, and one rule would cover them all.'=>'多站点网络中暂不支持在 Cloudflare 边缘缓存 HTML：其站点可能共用一个 Cloudflare 区域，一条规则会覆盖所有站点。','WordPress security tokens on this site are only guaranteed for %s hours, less than pages are kept: forms and buttons on older pages may fail. Choose a shorter lifetime.'=>'此站点的 WordPress 安全令牌只能保证 %s 小时有效，短于页面的保留时间：较旧页面上的表单和按钮可能失效。请选择更短的有效期。','Visits from campaigns (utm_*, gclid, fbclid and the other parameters the page cache ignores) are served from the edge too: a Transform Rule takes those parameters off before Cloudflare looks for the page, only when they are the only ones. Analytics still sees them, because it reads the address in the browser. For this the token needs Zone › Transform Rules › Edit; without it, the edge works as before.'=>'来自营销活动的访问（utm_*、gclid、fbclid 以及页面缓存忽略的其他参数）也会从边缘提供：一条 Transform Rule 会在 Cloudflare 查找页面之前去掉这些参数，但仅当查询中只有这些参数时。统计工具仍能看到它们，因为它读取的是浏览器中的地址。为此，令牌需要 Zone › Transform Rules › Edit 权限；没有该权限时，边缘缓存照常工作。','Visits with campaign parameters are served from the edge too.'=>'带有营销活动参数的访问也会从边缘提供。','Campaign parameters are taken off at the edge, but a visit with one was not served from the edge yet. That is normal while it fills.'=>'营销活动参数会在边缘被去掉，但带有此类参数的访问尚未从边缘提供。在边缘缓存填充期间这很正常。','Visits with campaign parameters still reach your server: Cloudflare refused the Transform Rule (%s). Add Zone › Transform Rules › Edit to the token and press «Check now».'=>'带有营销活动参数的访问仍会到达你的服务器：Cloudflare 拒绝了 Transform Rule（%s）。请为令牌添加 Zone › Transform Rules › Edit 权限，然后点击“立即检查”。','Never on the front end'=>'从不在前台加载','Stop a plugin from loading where it does nothing — a contact form everywhere but the contact page, a shop plugin on the blog, an editor plugin (Classic Editor, Advanced Editor Tools) on every page with "Never on the front end". Its PHP, its queries and its CSS/JS all stay out. Only for visitors: logged-in users, the admin, AJAX, the REST API and cron always get every plugin.'=>'让插件不在它毫无作用的地方加载：联系表单除了联系页面外处处加载，商店插件出现在博客里，编辑器插件（Classic Editor、Advanced Editor Tools）可用「从不在前台加载」从所有页面移除。它的 PHP、查询和 CSS/JS 都不再加载。仅对访客生效：已登录用户、后台、AJAX、REST API 和 cron 始终加载全部插件。','Load CSS asynchronously (non-blocking render; only on pages that have critical CSS, so they never paint unstyled)'=>'异步加载 CSS（不阻塞渲染；仅用于有关键 CSS 的页面，因此页面不会在无样式状态下显示）','The generated critical CSS files are no longer on the disk, so nothing is being inlined and asynchronous CSS stays off. Generate it again.'=>'生成的关键 CSS 文件已不在磁盘上，因此不会内联任何内容，异步 CSS 保持关闭。请重新生成。','Pages keep being served through PHP, from the cache, as before.'=>'页面仍像以前一样通过 PHP 从缓存提供。','The web server does not have the mod_headers module enabled, and it is needed to tell browsers not to keep the pages. In cPanel: Software › EasyApache 4 › Apache Modules › mod_headers. In Plesk: Tools & Settings › Apache Web Server › headers. Or ask your host: «Please enable the Apache module mod_headers for my site».'=>'Web 服务器未启用 mod_headers 模块，而告诉浏览器不要保存页面需要它。cPanel：Software › EasyApache 4 › Apache Modules › mod_headers。Plesk：工具与设置 › Apache Web 服务器 › headers。或请主机商：「请为我的网站启用 Apache 模块 mod_headers」。','The web server refuses to read the cache folder (wp-content/cache/wpopt-page): a rule in the server\'s configuration or a security plugin closes it. Ask your host to allow reading the .html files in that folder.'=>'Web 服务器无法读取缓存文件夹（wp-content/cache/wpopt-page）：服务器配置中的规则或安全插件将其关闭。请主机商允许读取该文件夹中的 .html 文件。','The site could not reach itself to check the rules (a firewall, a security plugin or the hosting blocks it). Ask your host to allow the site to make requests to its own address.'=>'网站无法访问自身来检查规则（被防火墙、安全插件或主机商阻止）。请主机商允许网站向自己的地址发送请求。','The web server is not applying the rules added to .htaccess (the hosting may not allow .htaccess overrides, or another rule answers first). Ask your host whether .htaccess rewrite rules are allowed for the site.'=>'Web 服务器没有应用添加到 .htaccess 的规则（主机可能不允许使用 .htaccess，或其他规则先响应）。请询问主机商网站能否在 .htaccess 中使用重写规则。','Too many sites of this network serve their pages without PHP: the shared .htaccess would grow too long. This site keeps being served through PHP, from the cache.'=>'此网络中不经 PHP 提供页面的站点太多：共享的 .htaccess 会变得过长。本站点仍通过 PHP 从缓存提供。','On a multisite network this is only available with Apache or LiteSpeed. Pages keep being served through PHP, from the cache.'=>'在多站点网络中，此功能仅适用于 Apache 或 LiteSpeed。页面仍通过 PHP 从缓存提供。','On a multisite network this is only available with Apache or LiteSpeed. Pages are served through PHP, from the cache.'=>'在多站点网络中，此功能仅适用于 Apache 或 LiteSpeed。页面通过 PHP 从缓存提供。','On: the web server serves this site\'s cached pages. Only a network administrator can switch it off, because the rules are in the .htaccess shared by every site of the network.'=>'已开启：Web 服务器直接提供本站点的缓存页面。只有网络管理员可以关闭，因为规则位于网络中所有站点共享的 .htaccess 中。','Off. Only a network administrator can switch it on, because the rules go into the .htaccess shared by every site of the network.'=>'已关闭。只有网络管理员可以开启，因为规则会写入网络中所有站点共享的 .htaccess。','The .htaccess is shared by every site of the network: each site that switches this on gets its own block of rules, for its own address and with its own exclusions.'=>'网络中所有站点共享同一个 .htaccess：每个开启此功能的站点都有自己的规则块，针对自己的地址并使用自己的排除项。','This site runs on a LiteSpeed web server, which serves LiteSpeed Cache\'s page cache before WordPress even loads. Its page cache settings were imported, but the WPOptimizing page cache stays off: switch LiteSpeed Cache\'s page cache off before you turn it on.'=>'此站点运行在 LiteSpeed Web 服务器上，它会在 WordPress 加载之前就提供 LiteSpeed Cache 的页面缓存。其页面缓存设置已导入，但 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存保持关闭：请先关闭 LiteSpeed Cache 的页面缓存，再开启它。','Load CSS Asynchronously: LiteSpeed Cache gets its critical CSS from QUIC.cloud, which is not imported. WPOptimizing only loads CSS asynchronously on pages that have their own critical CSS, so generate it in WPOptimizing for this setting to take effect.'=>'异步加载 CSS：LiteSpeed Cache 的关键 CSS 来自 QUIC.cloud，不会被导入。WPOptimizing 只在拥有自身关键 CSS 的页面上异步加载 CSS，因此请在 WPOptimizing 中生成关键 CSS，此设置才会生效。','The web server answers from the cached file directly, without starting PHP: faster pages and far more visitors at once on the same server. Only pages that need nothing else from PHP are served this way (no currency or query string; security headers sent from PHP go with them when every page sends the same; phones get their own copy when it is on); the rest keep going through PHP as now.'=>'Web 服务器直接用缓存文件响应，无需启动 PHP：页面更快，同一台服务器能同时承载更多访客。只有不再需要 PHP 做其他处理的页面才以这种方式提供（不涉及货币或地址参数；当所有页面发送相同的安全标头时，PHP 发送的安全标头会随页面一起发送；开启后手机有自己的副本）；其余页面仍像现在一样通过 PHP 提供。','Defer jQuery too (the inline code that uses it runs right after it; only with «Defer JavaScript» on)'=>'也推迟加载 jQuery（使用它的内联代码会紧随其后执行；仅在开启“推迟 JavaScript”时有效）','jQuery is in the list of scripts not to defer, so it stays eager. Remove it from that list for this setting to take effect.'=>'jQuery 在“不推迟的脚本”列表中，因此仍会立即加载。请将其从该列表中移除，此设置才会生效。','Also cache these REST API routes, for visitors who are not logged in (only routes whose answer is the same for everybody)'=>'也为未登录的访客缓存这些 REST API 路由（仅限对所有人返回相同结果的路由）','route after /wp-json/, e.g. my-plugin/v1/settings'=>'/wp-json/ 之后的路由，例如 my-plugin/v1/settings','%s has been deactivated (not deleted): its page cache no longer serves your pages. Switch on the WPOptimizing page cache in Speed › Cache; an import never switches it on by itself.'=>'%s 已停用（未删除）：其页面缓存不再提供你的页面。请在“速度 › 缓存”中开启 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存；导入永远不会自动开启它。','LiteSpeed Cache cleans up after itself when it is deactivated: its rules in .htaccess, its object-cache.php and the WP_CACHE line in wp-config.php (WPOptimizing writes its own back if its page cache is installed). On a network it only does so when no other site still has it active.'=>'LiteSpeed Cache 停用时会自行清理：它在 .htaccess 中的规则、它的 object-cache.php 以及 wp-config.php 中的 WP_CACHE 行（如果安装了 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存，WPOptimizing 会写回自己的那一行）。在多站点网络中，只有在没有其他站点仍启用它时才会清理。','Settings imported from %s. You can undo the import in Settings.'=>'已从 %s 导入设置。你可以在“设置”中撤销此次导入。','%s was not deactivated: only a network administrator can do it, because it is active for the whole network.'=>'%s 未被停用：它在整个网络中处于启用状态，只有网络管理员才能停用它。','Import your current settings'=>'导入你当前的设置','Another cache or performance plugin left its settings on this site. WPOptimizing can bring over what has an equivalent here, so you do not have to set it up again. The import is applied when the analysis starts, after the choices of the next steps, so what you bring over wins over their defaults. Passwords and API keys are never copied, the page cache and the object cache are never switched on by an import, and you can undo it in Settings.'=>'另一个缓存或性能插件在本站点留下了它的设置。WPOptimizing 可以迁移在这里有对应项的设置，免得你重新配置。导入会在分析开始时应用，位于后续步骤的选择之后，因此你迁移的内容优先于这些步骤的默认值。密码和 API 密钥永远不会被复制，导入永远不会开启页面缓存或对象缓存，你可以在“设置”中撤销导入。','Deactivate %s on the whole network after importing (it is not deleted)'=>'导入后在整个网络中停用 %s（不会删除）','Deactivate %s after importing (it is not deleted)'=>'导入后停用 %s（不会删除）','%s is active for the whole network: only a network administrator can deactivate it.'=>'%s 在整个网络中启用：只有网络管理员才能停用它。','Do not import anything'=>'不导入任何内容','Import the settings another cache or performance plugin left on each chosen site (after the profile, so they win over it; undo it in each site\'s Settings)'=>'导入另一个缓存或性能插件在每个所选站点留下的设置（在配置方案之后应用，因此优先；可在各站点的“设置”中撤销）','Then deactivate that plugin (not deleted): on its site, or on the whole network when it is network-active'=>'然后停用该插件（不删除）：在其站点上停用；若它在网络中启用，则在整个网络中停用','Settings of another cache plugin imported on %d site; you can undo it in that site\'s Settings.' . "\0" . 'Settings of another cache plugin imported on %d sites; you can undo it in each site\'s Settings.'=>'已在 %d 个站点导入另一个缓存插件的设置；可在各站点的“设置”中撤销。','%d plugin deactivated (not deleted): its page cache no longer serves pages, so switch on the WPOptimizing page cache in each site\'s Speed › Cache; an import never switches it on by itself.' . "\0" . '%d plugins deactivated (not deleted): their page cache no longer serves pages, so switch on the WPOptimizing page cache in each site\'s Speed › Cache; an import never switches it on by itself.'=>'已停用 %d 个插件（未删除）：其页面缓存不再提供页面，请在各站点的“速度 › 缓存”中开启 WPOptimizing 的页面缓存；导入永远不会自动开启它。','Also cache llms.txt, robots.txt, the XML sitemaps and Markdown copies generated by WordPress or a plugin (only kept when the answer is text or XML and the same for everybody, and purged with any content change)'=>'同时缓存由 WordPress 或插件生成的 llms.txt、robots.txt、XML 站点地图和 Markdown 副本（仅当响应为文本或 XML 且对所有人相同时才保存，任何内容变更时都会清除）','Also cache these text files generated by WordPress (only kept when the answer is text or XML and the same for everybody)'=>'同时缓存这些由 WordPress 生成的文本文件（仅当响应为文本或 XML 且对所有人相同时才保存）','file name from the site\'s address, * for any characters, e.g. ai.txt'=>'从站点地址起的文件名，* 代表任意字符，例如 ai.txt','Analytics never receives cookie consent'=>'Analytics 从未收到 Cookie 同意','%2$s only learns that visitors accepted cookies in %1$s through the WP Consent API plugin, which is not installed: Google receives every visit as without consent and they do not appear in Realtime.'=>'%2$s 只能通过 WP Consent API 插件得知访客已在 %1$s 中接受 Cookie，而该插件未安装：Google 将每次访问都视为未同意，这些访问不会出现在“实时”报告中。','Install WP Consent API'=>'安装 WP Consent API','The design has changed: the critical CSS will be regenerated on its own in a few minutes, and the cached pages emptied.'=>'设计已更改：关键 CSS 将在几分钟内自动重新生成，并清空缓存的页面。','Once applied, it is regenerated on its own when the theme, its options, the Customizer, the global styles, the theme builder\'s layouts or the pages it was generated from change.'=>'应用后，当主题、其选项、定制器、全局样式、主题构建器的布局或生成时所用的页面发生变化时，它会自动重新生成。','Last done %s ago.'=>'上次是 %s 前。','The zone ID belongs to %s, not to this site.'=>'区域 ID 属于 %s，而不是本站点。','That zone ID belongs to %1$s, not to %2$s. Nothing will be purged until you enter the zone ID of this domain.'=>'该区域 ID 属于 %1$s，而不是 %2$s。在你填入本域名的区域 ID 之前，不会清除任何内容。','The zone ID belongs to %s, not to this site, so nothing of this site is being purged. Enter the zone ID of this domain.'=>'区域 ID 属于 %s，而不是本站点，因此本站点的内容都没有被清除。请填入本域名的区域 ID。','This zone ID is also saved on %s. A Cloudflare zone is one domain, so one of the sites is purging the other\'s cache and not its own: check the zone ID on each.'=>'此区域 ID 也保存在 %s 上。一个 Cloudflare 区域只对应一个域名，因此其中一个站点清除的是另一个站点的缓存而不是自己的：请检查每个站点的区域 ID。','In %s'=>'在 %s 中','In the other plugin'=>'在另一个插件中','In WPOptimizing'=>'在 WPOptimizing 中','%d px'=>'%d 像素','%d second' . "\0" . '%d seconds'=>'%d 秒','Clean all post revisions'=>'清理所有文章修订版本','Regenerate critical CSS'=>'重新生成关键 CSS','Regenerate the critical CSS of every template in the background, then purge the page cache'=>'在后台重新生成所有模板的关键 CSS，然后清空页面缓存','Regenerating in the background ✓'=>'正在后台重新生成 ✓','Regenerate the critical CSS of every template now? The current one stays in use until the new one is ready.'=>'现在重新生成所有模板的关键 CSS？在新的准备好之前，继续使用当前的。','The critical CSS is being regenerated in the background; the cached pages will be emptied when it is ready.'=>'关键 CSS 正在后台重新生成；完成后将清空已缓存的页面。','To regenerate it without any change, use “Regenerate critical CSS” in the WPOptimizing toolbar menu.'=>'如需在没有任何更改的情况下重新生成，请使用工具栏 WPOptimizing 菜单中的“重新生成关键 CSS”。','Not cached: the page was cut short (the visitor left, the time limit or a fatal error)'=>'未缓存：页面中途中断（访客离开、超时或致命错误）','For campaign visits (utm_*, gclid…) to be served from there too, a third line:'=>'若要让带推广参数（utm_*、gclid…）的访问也从那里提供，添加第三行：','Transform Rules'=>'Transform Rules']];
